window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101 - Kneel And Apologize","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Threatening her with Second Uncle?","All these years, Second Uncle was the only person in the Qiao family who had been good to her. Qiao Xi had mentioned a few times to Second Uncle to quickly leave this dirty place called the Qiao family, but he was unwilling to do so. Although she did not understand why, she knew that Second Uncle had special feelings for the Qiao family.","If he was chased out by Qiao Zhenguo...","Qiao Xi’s voice gradually became cold. “Alright, I’ll be there in half an hour.”","Half an hour later, Qiao Xi arrived at the door of Qiao Zhenguo’s office. Qiao Zhenguo’s flattering voice came from inside.","“President Meng, it’s a misunderstanding. It’s all a misunderstanding. I’ll get Qiao Xi to apologize to you immediately. Do you want tea or coffee? I’ll get my secretary to prepare it.”","Meng Xingzhou sneered and waved his hand to interrupt Qiao Zhenguo. “I don’t dare to drink your tea. President Qiao, you raised a daughter who dares to plot against the Meng family. There’s no room for discussion about this collaboration.”","Qiao Zhenguo was anxious. “President Meng, Qiao Xi ran away from home a long time ago. What she did has nothing to do with our Qiao family. You can’t do this to us. Didn’t you want Qiao Xi to apologize to you? She’ll be here soon.”","Meng Xingzhou was quite satisfied with Qiao Zhenguo’s humble attitude. He knocked on the table and said, “Didn’t you say that Qiao Xi has nothing to do with the Qiao family? Then why did you ask her to apologize to me?”","Qiao Zhenguo straightened his back. “Qiao Xi’s surname is Qiao, and I’m her father. She has to listen to me for the rest of her life! So don’t worry, President Meng. When Qiao Xi arrives later, you can deal with her as you please. Whether she lives or dies depends on you, President Meng. As long as you can vent your anger, you can do anything you want.”","Meng Xingzhou nodded slightly and asked meaningfully, “President Qiao, do you also think that Qiao Xi was wrong this time? That it’s only right for her to be punished?”","Before Qiao Zhenguo could speak, Xu Mei, who was standing at the side, leaned forward. “President Meng, it’s Qiao Xi’s fault in this matter. Qiao Xi has always been like this. She’s single-minded and doesn’t know how to adapt. Miss Meng was clearly joking with her and didn’t really want to push the blame on her. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi didn’t know how to restrain herself and turned a small joke into this. She blew up such a small matter. Sigh... She’s really too insensible!”","Meng Xingzhou agreed with Xu Mei’s words. “Yes, Madam Qiao is right.”","When Xu Mei heard him calling her ‘Madam Qiao’, she could not hide her excitement. She had gotten to where she was today by being a mistress, and many people in the circle looked down on her. They all called her ‘Madam Xu’. She knew that true noblewomen only acknowledged the first wife as Madam Qiao. Meng Xingzhou calling her ‘Madam Qiao’ could be said to be confirming her identity as Madam Qiao.","“Since all of you think Qiao Xi did the wrong thing, then a senior like me won’t go against a junior. How about this? I don’t have high expectations. You can just send Qiao Xi overseas and this matter will end here. Our cooperation can continue.”","Xu Mei wished for nothing more than for Qiao Xi to get lost. Ever since the incident last time, Qiao Xi’s character had changed drastically. This caused Xu Mei to have a bad feeling. She had the premonition that Qiao Xi was becoming more and more out of control. Now that Meng Xingzhou had taken the initiative to ask them to send Qiao Xi overseas, it was exactly what she wanted. “President Meng, you’re right. Qiao Xi has been spoiled rotten by us and doesn’t know how high the sky is or how deep the earth is. Don’t worry, we’ll definitely send her overseas to be educated.”","Right at this moment, Qiao Xi pushed the door open and entered. Xu Mei had a flattering smile on her face when she heard the sound behind her. She turned around and the smile on her face quickly vanished. “Qiao Xi, you’re here.”","Meng Xingzhou saw Qiao Xi and snorted. “President Qiao and Madam Qiao, you both should know what to do, right?”","Qiao Zhenguo nodded. “Qiao Xi, you’ve offended Miss Meng and caused trouble for the Qiao family. I’ve already discussed it with your mother. We’ll send you overseas tomorrow.”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the door frame. “You talked to my mother? When did you discuss it? My mother died so many years ago. Could it be that she visited you in your dreams? Or did you go to heaven to look for her?”","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression changed. “Qiao Xi! Stop looking so carefree. Is this how the Qiao family has educated you? As a member of the Qiao family, it’s fine that you don’t know how to contribute to the company, but you even go around causing trouble. You don’t know how to repent!”","Qiao Xi dug her ears and asked casually, “Causing trouble? What trouble have I caused?”","“Are you still playing dumb here? Do you think we don’t know that you’ve offended Miss Meng?! You caused trouble at the Meng family’s banquet and embarrassed Miss Meng. This is the big trouble you caused! Since President Meng is here, quickly kneel down and apologize to him!”"]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102 - Your Daughter Is Stupid Like A Pig","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi laughed lightly in an unhurried manner. “Is it my fault that Meng Wan is shameless? She schemed against others, so it was clearly her fault. What does it have to do with me? I won’t take the blame for this.”","The air froze instantly.","Meng Xingzhou’s expression was dark as he warned, “Qiao Xi, don’t refuse others’ goodwill only to end up worse off. By being here today, I’m already showing your Qiao family enough respect. As long as you obediently kneel down and apologize before going overseas, I’ll let your Qiao family off. However, if you don’t cooperate...”","In an instant, a row of black-dressed bodyguards broke in and surrounded Qiao Xi. It seemed that if Qiao Xi did so much as shake her head, they would instantly send her to hell.","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression changed when he saw this scene. Of course, he was not worried about Qiao Xi’s safety. He was worried that if they were to fight here, they would definitely damage the items in the office and might even bleed all over the floor... That would be too inauspicious.","It was fine if they beat Qiao Xi to death, but they could not destroy his office. Every decoration here was made of real gold and silver. The placement was also decided by a master. His office could not be destroyed!","At the thought of this, Qiao Zhenguo suddenly frowned. “Qiao Xi, what are you still standing there for? Didn’t you hear President Meng? Quickly kneel down!”","Qiao Xi stood there without moving.","Meng Xingzhou sneered. “President Qiao, it seems that the situation is different from what you said. Your daughter doesn’t seem to listen to you. In that case... President Qiao, do you mind if I help you educate her?”","Qiao Zhenguo quickly bent down and replied, “President Meng, please go ahead. Even if Qiao Xi is beaten to death, she deserves it.”","Upon hearing Qiao Zhenguo’s words, Meng Xingzhou’s expression turned even colder. How could a daughter who had been abandoned by the Qiao family have the guts to snatch the position of Mrs. Gu position from Wan Wan?","He raised his hand and said to the bodyguards, “Didn’t you hear President Qiao? Eldest Miss Qiao is too stubborn. President Qiao, since you can’t teach her a lesson, I’ll help you.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the bodyguards all walked toward Qiao Xi.","At this moment, a leisurely male voice sounded from outside the door. “President Meng, you sure are ostentatious.”","Everyone was stunned as they looked out the door.","Song Shiyu and Qin An walked in. Song Shiyu’s smile did not reach his eyes. “It seems that you don’t take President Gu’s words seriously, President Meng.”","Meng Xingzhou’s expression changed abruptly. He recalled Old Master Meng’s reaction when he heard Gu Zheng’s words. Suddenly, he did not know what to do.","The employees were peeping outside the door and talking softly. “Who are these two? They seem to be very arrogant.”","“That frivolous-looking man in a white suit is called Qin An. I heard that he’s the disciple of a certain big shot. He’s also the owner and designer of a top luxury brand. At the same time, he’s also the heir of the Qin family. He’s someone who has to go home to inherit billions of assets if he doesn’t work hard outside.”","“The man wearing silver-framed glasses is called Song Shiyu. Although he’s just an assistant, he’s the special assistant of the current head of the Gu family, Gu Zheng. Rumor has it that he’s Gu Zheng’s right-hand man and is in charge of most of the Gu family’s assets. He’s really second to only one person. Many big shots in Li City have to listen to him. To a certain extent, he represents Gu Zheng himself.”","Gu Zheng’s status in Li City was extremely high, and almost everyone knew him. Hearing his name, the people around him instantly fell silent. At the same time, they knew that today’s matter had been blown up. Even Gu Zheng’s representative had come...","Qiao Zhenguo’s eyes twitched. He was considered a person of status in Li City and had dealt with Song Shiyu before. He knew Song Shiyu’s identity and status better than ordinary people. Although he did not know why he was here, it definitely had something to do with Qiao Xi!","He glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and wished for nothing more than to strangle this jinx to death!","His expression changed again and again. In the end, Qiao Zhenguo could only walk over to Song Shiyu and Qin An with trembling legs. He asked humbly, “President Qin, Special Assistant Song, what brings the two of you here today?”","“We came over to take a look.”","Song Shiyu’s gaze went past Qiao Zhenguo to Meng Xingzhou. “After all, if we hadn’t come to take a look, I wouldn’t know that President Meng is secretly going against President Gu’s wishes... President Meng, am I mistaken? I clearly remember that President Gu told Old Master Meng to get Miss Meng to apologize to Miss Qiao within a day?”","With that, Song Shiyu winked at Qiao Xi but no one else could see it. He was signaling the president’s wife to rest assured and leave the rest to him.","Qiao Xi silently curled her lips.","Song Shiyu’s expression changed in a second and he became serious again. “Can you tell me what’s going on, President Meng? Why are you trying to get Miss Qiao to apologize? Are you trying to use force? Miss Meng failed to frame Miss Qiao and got slapped in the face. I can only say that the daughter of the Meng family is as stupid as a pig.. Miss Qiao is just an innocent victim. How can the victim apologize to the culprit?”"]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103 - Crazy Dog","paragraphs":["The people outside were stunned.","Under the brainwashing of Qiao Zhenguo, Xu Mei, and Qiao Rou, the employees all thought that the Qiao family’s eldest daughter, who returned from the countryside, was a piece of trash. She always caused trouble everywhere and got Qiao Zhenguo and the others to clean up the mess for her. Therefore, when they found out that the people from Meng Corporation wanted to terminate their collaboration with their company because of Qiao Xi, all of them cursed Qiao Xi as a jinx.","What did Song Shiyu mean by that? Qiao Xi was innocent? She was the victim? The eldest daughter of the Meng family did something wrong and was playing the blame game?","If that was the truth... The employees looked at the bodyguards who surrounded Qiao Xi. They remembered that Meng Xingzhou had just said with a righteous expression that he would help the Qiao family teach his daughter a lesson... He failed at raising his own daughter, yet he was helping another family educate theirs?","Meng Xingzhou corrected him with a cold face. “Special Assistant Song, you can’t say that. Qiao Xi ruined our banquet.”","Song Shiyu nodded understandingly. “I get it. That stupid banquet of the Meng family was organized to frame Miss Qiao. It may look like a banquet on the surface, but it’s actually a trap. If your plan failed, you’d say that Miss Qiao ruined your banquet. If your plan succeeded, she’d be sent to prison. In any case, you’re the one taking advantage of her.","“Now that Miss Meng failed to set up and frame Miss Qiao Xi, you’re saying that she ruined your Meng family’s banquet. Hence, you’re forcing Miss Qiao Xi to kneel before you while thinking of sending her overseas. After taking such a big detour, it’s essentially the same. You want to get rid of Miss Qiao Xi, am I right?”","“Special Assistant Song!” Meng Xingzhou could not help but raise his voice. “Please pay attention to your words!”","“Heh.” Song Shiyu chuckled. “What? Did I hit the nail on the head? Are you embarrassed?”","Meng Xingzhou was so angered that he started breathing heavily. Yes, was it wrong for him to think like that? It was Qiao Xi’s fault for shamelessly stealing a position that belonged to his Wan Wan! His daughter was the noblest woman in the world, so she should marry the most outstanding man in the world. She took action to frame Qiao Xi because she thought highly of her, so this shameless woman, Qiao Xi, should obediently be framed!","Wan Wan was never wrong!","The atmosphere was tense.","Qiao Zhenguo watched the confrontation between the two sides and was very anxious. He could not afford to offend either side. Whether it was Meng Xingzhou or Song Shiyu, their small Qiao Corporation could not handle their anger.","Why did Qiao Xi, this jinx, provoke one person after another? How was he going to clean up the mess now?!","Damn it! If he had known that things would turn out this way, he would never have brought Qiao Xi back. He would have just let her die outside!","Qiao Zhenguo gritted his teeth and revealed a flattering smile. “Special Assistant Song, you... You’ve misunderstood. President Meng isn’t here to look for trouble. He’s here to apologize. I’ve already accepted President Meng’s apology on Qiao Xi’s behalf. Moreover, I think that it wasn’t all Miss Meng’s fault this time. If Qiao Xi hadn’t done anything to anger Miss Meng, she wouldn’t have done this to her... So when you entered, it was Qiao Xi who wanted to apologize to President Meng. She said that she was too rash on the day of the banquet and didn’t take into consideration the Meng family’s reputation... We were very harmonious...”","“President Qiao, don’t you know how to think first before spouting lies?” Song Shiyu sneered. Was his boss’ wife someone who would apologize to others? Moreover, the boss’ wife had done nothing wrong in this matter.","“President Qiao, although you’ve lived for a long time and are older than me, you probably haven’t heard of this logic. Mad dogs bite people for no reason,” Song Shiyu said with a smile, “Eldest Miss Meng framed Miss Qiao Xi not because Qiao Xi offended her, but because she herself is a lunatic.”","She was like a mad dog that bit everyone she saw.","“Also, after what happened, you never bothered to learn the truth. You did not ask if your daughter was wronged but listened to others and forced your daughter to apologize. You even watched as others wanted to attack your daughter. President Qiao, you’re such a good father.”","Song Shiyu paused for a moment before he came to a realization. “Oh, I forgot that Miss Qiao Xi, your legitimate daughter, must be a stumbling block for your illegitimate daughter. You can’t wait to get rid of Qiao Xi because you want to inherit Miss Qiao Xi’s mother’s inheritance, right? As long as Miss Qiao Xi is dead, Qiao Corporation will completely belong to you.”","With every word he said, Qiao Zhenguo’s expression turned uglier. At the end of Song Shiyu’s speech, Qiao Zhenguo’s face was livid, but he did not dare retort loudly. Even so, his eyes seemed to be spitting fire."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104 - Our Cooperation Ends Here","paragraphs":["The employees outside the door were listening to the gossip. When they heard this, they were whispering to each other. The news spread like wildfire in the office. Soon, everyone in the company knew about it.","Xu Mei’s expression changed. She was not a fool. Although she did not know what the Meng and Qiao families had to do with the Gu family, Song Shiyu was defending Qiao Xi with every word he said. Why would he help Qiao Xi?","That made no sense. How could someone like Qiao Xi be related to Song Shiyu?","“Special Assistant Song, you might not know this, but Qiao Xi has a bad character and has done many wrong things. So this time, it must be her fault...”","Song Shiyu’s eyes were calm. “Although I’m not a big shot, I’m not someone just anyone can talk to. Madam Xu, you’re just a lowly mistress. You’d better keep a distance. I don’t want the air around me to be polluted.”","Xu Mei’s face alternated between shades of green and white. The words ‘lowly mistress’ were simply a humiliation.","Song Shiyu took a step back as if Xu Mei was a plague. His actions made Xu Mei break down. She could not even maintain the smile on her face anymore. Qiao Zhenguo had to remind her to calm her down. She should not say anything inappropriate.","Song Shiyu turned to look at Meng Xingzhou. “President Meng, since you didn’t keep your promise, I’m sorry to inform you that the collaboration between President Gu and the Meng family ends here.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Meng Xingzhou’s phone rang. It was unknown what the other party on the other end of the line said, but Meng Xingzhou’s expression changed drastically. He glared fiercely at Qiao Xi before leaving in a hurry.","Qiao Zhenguo raised his hand and wanted to stop him, but Meng Xingzhou had no time to care. As he watched Meng Xingzhou leave, Qiao Zhenguo’s body swayed.","The reason why Qin An was here was that he heard that Qiao Zhenguo had called Qiao Xi to come over. He was afraid that their family’s sixth sister would be bullied. He did not expect to meet Song Shiyu downstairs...","Now that everything was settled, he smiled slightly. “President Qiao, forgive me for not agreeing with your attitude when it comes to handling things. Hence, there’s no need for our collaboration to continue.”","Qiao Zhenguo panicked. “President Qin, you—”","Qin An interrupted him. “There’s no need to explain. I have some grudges with the Meng family. This time, you helped the Meng family frame your daughter, making me suspect that if there are any conflicts between me and the Meng family in the future, you’ll not hesitate to help the Meng family deal with me. We’re all businessmen, so benefits are everything. President Qiao, I’ll take my leave first.”","“President Qin, it’s a misunderstanding. This is all a misunderstanding!” Qiao Zhenguo did not expect Qin An to have a grudge with the Meng family. What was going on?! He staggered as he chased after Qin An. Earlier, the Meng family had threatened him that if he did not get Qiao Xi to apologize, they would revoke their important collaboration. Now that the Meng family had lost so much of their dignity, their collaboration was certainly doomed.","Just as the Meng family was in trouble, Qin An wanted to withdraw his investment and cut off all ties with them. Why? Why was all of this happening?! Qiao Zhenguo could not understand. As he watched Qin An walk farther and farther away, Qiao Zhenguo could only blame everything on Qiao Xi.","It was all Qiao Xi’s fault! It was all Qiao Xi’s fault!","If Qiao Xi had just gotten framed by Miss Meng and shouldered the blame during the banquet, there would not be so many terrible things happening now. Xu Mei had the same thoughts as him. Everything started because of Qiao Xi.","When she thought about this, she could not help but look at Qiao Xi.","Ever since Qin An and Song Shiyu appeared, Qiao Xi had been standing there silently. Her face was the same as before, so beautiful that it made others envious. However, for some reason, Xu Mei felt that something was different.","The current Qiao Xi was not someone they could control anymore.","No... How was this possible?! Qiao Xi, this country bumpkin, was deliberately raised to be a good-for-nothing. How could she possibly have the ability to toy everyone around?!","Her impression must be wrong. Qiao Xi was still the same Qiao Xi, the Qiao Xi who was under her control!","After Song Shiyu left with Qiao Xi, Qiao Zhenguo slammed the table in anger. “This damned jinx! She’s a jinx!”","Xu Mei pretended to wipe her tears. “Zhenguo... I’ve been struggling to understand something. You said that Qiao Xi’s reputation in high society is not too good and she has never been liked by others, but why is Special Assistant Song on Qiao Xi’s side this time? And President Qin too. They seem to be quite close to Qiao Xi...”","Qiao Zhenguo slowly calmed down. “Yes, you’re right. We know Qiao Xi’s reputation very well. Song Shiyu and Qin An are both dragons and phoenixes among men, so why would they help Qiao Xi?”"]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105 - Its Good Enough That Madam Doesnt Bully Them","paragraphs":["Xu Mei sighed. “I don’t know. I can’t figure it out either, but I know that if it were Rou Rou instead of Qiao Xi, she definitely wouldn’t cause trouble. Our Rou Rou is so obedient. When she was the Qiao family’s eldest daughter, she never caused us any trouble. She also has a good reputation.”","At the mention of Qiao Rou, Qiao Zhenguo’s eyes lit up. “I got it!","“Those two people know that the eldest daughter of the Qiao family is an upright person, but they don’t know that the current eldest daughter is no longer the eldest daughter. They must have mistaken Qiao Xi for Rou Rou! Otherwise, why would these two help Qiao Xi? Special Assistant Song is from the Gu family, and Rou Rou is the future granddaughter-in-law of the Gu family. Song Shiyu must have thought that Rou Rou was the one who was in trouble this time, so he rushed to help her!","“All of this is Qiao Xi’s scheme. Qiao Xi must have told Special Assistant Song that she’s Gu Moling’s fiance. In name, she’s indeed Gu Moling’s fiance. The marriage candidate between the two families has not been changed. After Special Assistant Song investigated, he realized that what Qiao Xi said was true, so he spared no effort to help Qiao Xi. This rebellious daughter actually dares to take advantage of Rou Rou! She stole her position!”","Xu Mei did not expect that Qiao Zhenguo would think of this as soon as she nudged him. She lowered her eyes and said in a bitter tone, “I’m not asking for anything now. I just hope that Qiao Xi can let Gu Moling off. I can give up the Qiao family and Rou Rou, but without Gu Moling, Rou Rou probably won’t be able to live!”","Qiao Zhenguo hugged her with heartache. “Don’t worry. Rou Rou is our daughter. Everything she has won’t be snatched away by others. I’ll get Rou Rou to meet these two big shots in a few days and make things clear. In the future, our Qiao family’s resources will only get better and better. We won’t be trampled by others again!”","The marriage between the Qiao family and the Gu family was set in stone. It would absolutely not be canceled. Although all of this was done by Qiao Xi’s mother, Qiao Xi’s mother was already dead. What was left behind by the dead belonged to them, so they naturally could deal with it as they pleased.","Now, they wanted Qiao Rou to marry into the Gu family in Qiao Xi’s place and marry Gu Moling. Gu Moling and Qiao Rou had a good relationship. If he had to marry Qiao Xi, Gu Moling might feel disgusted. Therefore, in order not to let the Qiao family and the Gu family become enemies, they could only marry off Qiao Rou.","...","Qiao Xi left with Song Shiyu when she suddenly thought of something. “You’re quite an impressive assistant in front of others, aren’t you?”","An assistant could actually scare the president of Qiao Corporation to such an extent.","Song Shiyu touched his nose. “Madam, you might not know this, but I retired from the army. Many people called me ‘Deputy Song’ before, but after I worked with President Gu, they started calling me ‘Deputy Song’ again. However, I thought that it wouldn’t be good to call me that since I’ve already retired, so they started calling me ‘Special Assistant Song’.”","Of course, although the titles were different, they had not forgotten Song Shiyu’s previous identity and were very respectful to him. Coupled with his relationship with Gu Zheng, they did not dare to act rashly.","Qiao Xi’s brows raised. “So that’s how it is.”","Song Shiyu could not tell what Qiao Xi’s expression meant, so he could only ask carefully, “Madam, are we going home now?”","Qiao Xi nodded.","After getting the chauffeur to send Qiao Xi to the car, Song Shiyu called Gu Zheng in a shaky voice. “President Gu, Madam thought that my status as a special assistant garnered me too much respect, so I casually told her about my previous identity. However, Madam’s reaction was so strange... She won’t notice anything, right?”","He had only said that he was an adjutant. It was normal for a soldier to become an adjutant, right? But why did Madam have such a look on her face? It was as if she had seen through everything but refused to say anything. It made him panic.","Gu Zheng tapped his fingers lightly. “She wasn’t bullied in Qiao Corporation, right?”","Song Shiyu: “???”","‘Boss, I’m talking about serious matters!’","Gu Zheng frowned and repeated impatiently, “I’m asking you if she was bullied.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","His silence was mistaken as an affirmative answer. Gu Zheng’s voice suddenly rose. “You actually let her be bullied by the Qiao family? Has your ability deteriorated after such a long time? Are you too old to work anymore and want to go home to retire?”","Song Shiyu, who was called old even before he turned 30: “...”","He was just a little late in answering. Why was President Gu so sarcastic?! Now that he thought about it, Madam was so smart. The identity that President Gu wanted to hide would probably be exposed soon. He had called to remind President Gu so that his little identity would not be exposed, but it seemed that he did not take it to heart at all!"]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106 - Please Let Me Go","paragraphs":["In that case, he would not poke his nose into other people’s business. After all, he would not be the one who would feel awkward if President Gu’s identity was exposed. Song Shiyu snorted angrily. “No, Madam was never bullied.”","It was already good enough that Madam did not bully the Qiao family.","Gu Zheng paused for a moment before asking, “Did she say anything after you went over to help her settle the matter?”","Song Shiyu nodded. “Yes, Madam was very polite. She even thanked me.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. “Thank you? Only you?”","Song Shiyu: “?”","Otherwise? He was the one who did everything. Who else could she thank but him? Should she thank the Qiao family for taking the initiative to look for trouble?","“I asked you to help her. Shouldn’t she be thanking me? Or did you not tell her that I asked you to back her up? Song Shiyu, do you want your salary to be deducted again?”","Song Shiyu: “...”","Salary deduction? He only knew how to deduct his salary every day! It seemed that Madam was right. President Gu was a wretched man!","“By the way, President Gu, I heard that there’s a teacher in the university who was expelled and doesn’t like Madam. They want to create trouble for her. Do you want me to go over and handle it?”","Gu Zheng paused and looked at his schedule. He was busy with work and had asked Song Shiyu to support Qiao Xi, but she was only thanking Song Shiyu.","“I don’t want to help someone who doesn’t want to thank me,” Gu Zheng slowly said, “But I saw on my schedule that I’m going to Li City University for an inspection. Report to me when that person attacks Qiao Xi.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","‘If you want to support Madam, just say it. Who are you kidding?","‘As the director of Li City University, it’s rare for you to appear even once a year. Now that Madam is teaching in Li City University, you’ve been to Li City University more often than you work.’","Hmph!","...","A few days later, the two collaboration projects with the Qiao family were withdrawn. The family was in a difficult period. Qiao Zhenguo was pleading for help everywhere. Gu Moling, as the future son-in-law of the Qiao family, was also helping out.","However, no matter what the two of them did, it was useless.","Qiao Xi touched the pistol in her bag and recalled what Song Shiyu said about him being the adjutant. She then hacked into a system but found no one named Song Shiyu on the list of retired adjutants.","Song Shiyu had probably told her that he was an adjutant because he thought she did not understand and it did not matter if he told her. However, he would not have expected that she not only understood but also knew a lot about it. If even she could not find out Song Shiyu’s identity, it meant that his identity was mysterious enough. However, such a mysterious person was willing to stay by Gu Zheng’s side as his assistant...","It was very difficult for ordinary noble families to obtain a pistol, much less a modified pistol. Gu Zheng casually gave the modified pistol to her as if he was giving her cabbage... In that case, it could only be said that this modified pistol was not important to Gu Zheng, or perhaps it was not worth mentioning.","Hence, Gu Zheng’s identity was worth investigating. Who was a man who could casually give a pistol to someone?","Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes and suddenly felt that the marriage partner she found on the spot was very interesting.","At this moment, a panicked voice sounded not far away.","“Ah? Who is this? Why are you covered in injuries?”","Qiao Xi had just walked to the entrance of the university and was about to turn around when she heard a voice. She saw a crazy woman covered in blood suddenly pouncing toward her.","“Teacher Qiao, please let me go! I’m still young! I don’t want to lose my job! I have my elders and children. You can’t do this to me!”","Qiao Xi frowned. Who was this person?","A student in the distance scratched his head in confusion. “This person looks like a teacher from the design department. Why has she become like this?”","“I don’t know. Why is she begging Qiao Xi to let her off? Could it be that Qiao Xi did something to her?”","The surrounding students instantly became excited. Ever since Qiao Xi came to Li City University, there had been a lot of things going on in Li City University. The group of people watched the show with interest. It added a lot of fun to their boring university life.","Qiao Xi was stopped. She looked at this woman whose face was covered in blood and could not be seen clearly. She tried her best to search for information related to this woman in her mind, but unfortunately, she was unable to find anything.","“Teacher Qiao, I was wrong. I was really wrong. I shouldn’t have listened to those things on the forums that were saying bad things about you. I apologize. I can apologize for all the bad things I’ve done to you. Please be kind and let me off, okay? I really can’t lose this job.”"]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107 - I Have Everyone On My Side","paragraphs":["“Tell me who you are first. Do I know you?”","Qiao Xi took a step back to distance herself from the woman. “A student just said that you’re a teacher in the design department. What’s your name?”","“I... I’m Wang Fengxia,” the woman said with a stammer. “It’s about the post on the forum saying you were a kept woman. When the situation was still unknown, I casually lampooned. The university then said I wasn’t qualified to be a teacher and wanted to fire me... Teacher Qiao, I know you’re from a good family and don’t understand the hardships of ordinary people like us, but I really can’t live without this job. If I lose this job, I’ll have to die!”","The matter on the forum involved many people, and Wang Fengxia was one of them. However, Zhou Guanjin and Gu Zheng were the ones handling this matter, so Qiao Xi did not know about it.","Hearing Wang Fengxia’s words, Qiao Xi was even more puzzled. It had already been so long but this person only came to look for trouble with her now?","When Wang Fengxia saw that Qiao Xi was silent, she suddenly staggered and knelt on the floor. She covered her face and cried loudly. “Qiao Xi, I’m already begging you like this. Aren’t you going to forgive me? What exactly do you want? Do you want to force me to death just over a few words?","“I have my elders and children. I’m different from you, a pampered young lady. I really need this job. I promise I won’t spout nonsense again. Let me go. As long as you let me live, I’ll do anything to repay you...”","The students looked at each other in dismay. “What’s going on? A teacher who can teach at Li City University must be very capable, right? Even if she was fired by Li City University, she should still be able to find a job.”","“Unless Qiao Xi deliberately took revenge and refused to let her get another job? Did she go so far as to attack her? Psychological torture and physical torture? It’s no wonder that this Teacher Wang looks so miserable. She probably couldn’t take the revenge anymore and came to plead with Qiao Xi.”","When Wang Fengxia heard the students’ words, she cried even harder. She knelt down and crawled to Qiao Xi’s feet, kowtowing to her. “Teacher Qiao, saving a life is better than building a seven-storied pagoda. I’ll kowtow to you. Please let me go... Let me go, okay?”","In this situation, the students did not know what to do.","They had never experienced the trials and tribulations of life. The simple campus environment made their hearts remain pure. Wang Fengxia was in the wrong first, so it was understandable for Qiao Xi to make a move against her, but they felt that Qiao Xi’s punishment was a little too much.","After all, the incident on the forum back then did not cause too much trouble for Qiao Xi, but Qiao Xi wanted Wang Fengxia’s life.","At this moment, someone hurried over from outside the crowd. Everyone turned their heads and saw Qiao Rou’s tears slowly flowing down her face. The tears of a beauty caused countless people’s hearts to ache.","Qiao Rou squatted next to Wang Fengxia and bit her lip to plead. “Sister, it’s been so long since the incident on the forum. Please forgive Teacher Wang... She didn’t know the truth and only casually said a few words. You don’t have to kill her like this.","“Now, she has no job, no house, and even her safety can’t be guaranteed. Sister, she has already apologized to you. Can you let her go? The people you sent have already taught her a big lesson. She won’t make the same mistake again. Just withdraw your people.”","Although Qiao Rou had caused a lot of trouble in the past, people were very tolerant of beautiful things. They quickly forgot about the bad things Qiao Rou had done and only saw her beautiful side.","Now that Qiao Rou was standing on Wang Fengxia’s side, saying in a pleading voice how difficult Wang Fengxia’s life was and even revealing that she had been beaten up, everyone instantly stood on Qiao Rou’s side. They felt that Qiao Xi’s methods were too vicious.","Everyone sympathized with the weak. Wang Fengxia’s actions were not equal to the punishment she was receiving. Hence, they thought that it was unfair.","“Qiao Xi, just let Teacher Wang off. She’s quite pitiful now.”","“That’s right. Look at you, you didn’t even recognize her when she first appeared. She didn’t even say those words straight to your face and just complained behind your back. She just said a few words but lost her job, her house, and was even threatened and beaten up. She’s too pitiful.”","“Now that she has apologized to you, will you withdraw the people you sent over to beat her up? Do you think you can ignore the lives of ordinary people just because you’re the high and mighty eldest daughter of a wealthy family? If you still insist on doing this, I’ll call the police even if you’re a teacher.”"]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108 - Kneel, Then","paragraphs":["Qiao Rou helped Wang Fengxia up and gently tried to enlighten her. “Teacher Wang, please get up first. I’ll persuade my sister to forgive you. Let’s go to the infirmary to treat your wounds, okay?”","Wang Fengxia broke free from Qiao Rou’s hand and looked determined. “If Qiao Xi doesn’t forgive me, I won’t get up.”","Qiao Xi finally understood the situation. These two people were working together to set her up.","She laughed, her voice calm and cold. “Since you don’t want to get up, continue to kneel, then.”","There was dead silence at the university gate.","No one expected Qiao Xi to say such words...","After a brief shock, Wang Fengxia cried and shouted, “You really want to force me to my death, don’t you? You’re cold-blooded and a demon. The life of others is worthless in your eyes, right?”","Qiao Xi frowned. “In a lawful society, evidence is important when making claims. Go look for trouble with whoever is forcing you to death. If you were beaten up, so why didn’t you look for the police? Why did you come looking for me instead? What’s the reason?”","Wang Fengxia was so angry that her face and neck were red. “Of course, I’m looking for you because you caused all of this. If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t be in such a sorry state!”","The surrounding students also reacted, then joined Wang Fengxia in denouncing Qiao Xi. “Are you indifferent to a living person kneeling in front of you? You just have to say you forgive her. What’s so hard?”","“That’s right. Is your ego more important than human life? You can save a life with just one sentence. Could it be that in your eyes, human life is less important than a single sentence? I’ve learned something today. Is this the worldview of rich people? Can you kill others just because they offended you?”","Qiao Rou also covered her mouth and looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. “Sister, how did you become like this? Teacher Wang was wrong, but she has already realized her mistake... Why can’t you be more magnanimous and forgive her? Dad and Mom told us that nothing is more important than the lives of others. Could it be that you’ve forgotten their teachings?”","Qiao Xi coldly raised her eyes. “Then did your parents teach you not to poke your nose into other people’s business? Especially when it comes to matters that you don’t know anything about?” Her gaze swept past the surrounding students before she spoke once more. “The university taught you knowledge so that you would know shame and kindness, not so that you can judge others just because you have a mouth.”","The surrounding students glared at her.","Qiao Xi suddenly smiled. “Why am I talking nonsense with you people? How about this...” She raised her hand and pointed at a girl who was quite good-looking in the crowd. “Looking at your clothes, your family background should be quite ordinary but I just saw you get out of a black Mercedes-Benz. With your family background, you probably can’t afford that kind of Mercedes-Benz. Hence, you’re a mistress, right?”","The students suddenly turned around and looked at the girl. The girl’s face was red. “Bullsh*t, you’re slandering me! You’re spreading rumors!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were indifferent. “Oh, then I was wrong. I’m sorry.”","“What’s the use of apologizing? Do you know how powerful rumors are?! Do you know that a casual sentence from you might make me unable to stay at the university anymore? Do you know how the surrounding students will look at me? Do you know that a casual sentence from you will ruin me?! How could you be a specially-recruited teacher? What right do you have to be a teacher?!” The girl was exasperated.","After she finished speaking, Qiao Xi said with a surprised expression, “I’ve already apologized, yet you still won’t forgive me? Moreover, the situation you mentioned hasn’t happened yet. Why are you so angry? Shouldn’t you be a little more magnanimous?”","“You...” The girl wanted to retort, but she suddenly found the words a little familiar. Weren’t these the words they had just said to persuade Qiao Xi?","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and smiled. “Look, when something happens to you, you don’t want to forgive either. It’s just like how you won’t know pain until you’re hit. Since you’re not the ones involved, all of you can freely judge. Once it happens to you, you wish for nothing more than to curse the other party. Alas... all of you are a bunch of people who say one thing but mean another.”","After dealing with the students who were watching the commotion, Qiao Xi looked at Qiao Rou. “I forgot that you’re here too. My good sister, you’re pretending to be a kind person so that I can forgive Teacher Wang. Did you forget that you posted that thread on your alternate account? You were the one who started the discussion and made the teachers and students scold me. You’re the culprit. What right do you have to criticize me?”"]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109 - Look For The Police If You Have Problems","paragraphs":["The students who were able to enter Li City University were all smart. Although Qiao Xi’s words were harsh and her methods were too brutal, they finally realized the truth and knew that Qiao Xi was right.","The incident on the forum was caused by Qiao Rou, but because Qiao Rou had a strong background, she was not expelled. She was only given a warning on the public announcement board. The culprit was still in university while the teacher who had casually complained was expelled. She was even in such a miserable state... What was the meaning of this?","What was even funnier was that Qiao Rou did not have the slightest bit of self-awareness that she pleaded along with Wang Fengxia. She should be the one apologizing to Wang Fengxia instead!","“I...”","Qiao Rou did not expect the gun to be pointed at her so soon. Faced with the scrutinizing and critical gazes of the students around her, she staggered and burst into tears. “Sister, how can you say that about me... I know you’ve never liked me. You think that I occupied your position and stole your identity. I’ve always wanted to get along with you, but you never gave me a chance. I was wrong about this matter, but I had already apologized earlier on... The authenticity of the contents on that post hasn’t been confirmed yet. You...”","Hearing this, Wang Fengxia suddenly stood up. “That’s right! Qiao Xi, what’s there to be proud of? I don’t think I said anything wrong back then. You’re a mistress! You found your sugar daddy and forced the university to deal with Qiao Rou and forced the chancellor to expel me. You even stopped me from telling the truth! I listened to you and kept it a secret to the public, but what about you? You didn’t keep your word and were ruthless enough to silence me!","“When you sent people over to deal with me, you admitted that you’re just a mistress. Apart from that old man, you have many other financiers. Even after those people kill me, they can still roll around in bed with you! You’re so disgusting. You’re utterly shameless!”","The venue fell silent.","Everyone widened their eyes as they listened to Wang Fengxia’s hoarse voice. “You’re a mistress! Otherwise, how do you explain a young miss from the countryside who isn’t favored by the Qiao family like you having such powerful means?”","At the end of the day, the conclusion was that Qiao Xi was a mistress!","Qiao Rou wiped the tears from her eyes. “Sister, I know you’re not that kind of person. Don’t take Teacher Wang’s words to heart... But there are too many rumors outside. You haven’t been home for so long. Dad and Mom are very worried about you. They don’t know where you live or what you do every day... Sister, quickly go back home.”","With Wang Fengxia saying that Qiao Xi was a mistress and Qiao Rou saying that Qiao Xi had not returned home for a long time, their words quickly caused the surrounding people to misunderstand.","A few students muttered softly, “What should we do? I also suspect that Qiao Xi is a mistress. After all, to disregard the law and get people to beat up Teacher Wang to such a state is not something that ordinary people can do.”","“Also, about what Qiao Rou said, she said that Qiao Xi has not been coming home. What can a woman from the countryside like her do in Li City? I don’t think Qiao Xi has any close friends, so it’s impossible for her to stay at a friend’s house... In that case, she might really be living with her sugar daddy to accompany the old man...”","Seeing that the students were on her side again, Wang Fengxia berated Qiao Xi even more loudly, “Qiao Xi, you’re a teacher in Li City University but you have to rely on an old man to support you. You bully the teachers in the university and act like a tyrant. You won’t have a good ending in the future! I’m reminding you out of goodwill now that when you’re old and weak, the old man won’t hesitate to abandon you!","“My words are a little harsh, but what I said is the truth. You can punish me, and I’ll accept it. However, if you want to kill me, I’ll absolutely not agree.”","The surrounding students all said, “Teacher Wang, you did nothing wrong. Qiao Xi is in the wrong. Being a mistress is not a glorious thing, so she found people to deal with you and wanted to keep it a secret. Little did she know that her actions only prove that she’s a mistress!”","“Don’t be afraid, Teacher Wang. Qiao Xi wants to suppress the matter, but we won’t let her. We have to tell everyone that Qiao Xi is a mistress who’s being kept by an old man! She’s a shameless and vicious mistress!”","Someone even said to Qiao Rou, “Qiao Rou, quickly go home and discuss with your parents. Don’t acknowledge Qiao Xi as the Qiao family’s daughter anymore. It’ll affect your reputation. You’re clearly so good, so why is your sister like this... It’s really unreasonable.”","Qiao Rou pursed her lips and said in a difficult tone, “Don’t say that...”","Qiao Xi looked at her pretentious behavior and snorted. She took out her phone and made a call. “Hello, this is Li City University. Someone’s causing trouble and spreading rumors.”"]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110 - Qiao Xi Is Ignorant And Idiotic","paragraphs":["When Wang Fengxia saw her actions, her heart inexplicably jumped. “Qiao Xi, what did you do?”","“It’s nothing, I just called the police.” Qiao Xi smiled as she said, “After all, I’m different from some people. When I encounter a dangerous situation, I won’t take the initiative to seek death. I’ll look for the police to protect me.”","After that, she looked at Wang Fengxia with a faint smile. “Before the police arrive, go online and find out what kind of punishment you’ll receive for deliberately spreading rumors. That way, you can be mentally prepared.”","She scanned the crowd and memorized everyone’s faces. She was about to leave when—","“Qiao Xi!”","Gu Moling ran over when he heard the news. When he saw Wang Fengxia’s appearance, he immediately frowned. “Qiao Xi, what do you want? It was wrong for Wang Fengxia to spout nonsense, but she’s already so pitiful. Can’t you forgive her? Do you want to drive her to her death? But have you thought about what the people in the university will think of you if Wang Fengxia really dies because of you? Your hands will be stained with blood. Will you be able to sleep peacefully?”","When Qiao Xi heard his voice, she did not even stop in her tracks and continued walking forward.","She did not have time to chat with this bunch of idiots.","Qiao Rou sighed. “Brother Moling, my sister is becoming more and more stubborn. I really don’t know if it’s a good thing...”","Gu Moling thought that this would definitely make things worse, but he knew that Qiao Rou had always treated Qiao Xi as her biological sister. She would be very sad if he said what he wanted to, so he patted Qiao Rou’s shoulder and comforted her. “Forget it, she won’t listen to us. When she suffers in the future, she’ll know that we’re right.”","Someone who recognized Gu Moling’s identity echoed obsequiously, “Yes, Young Master Gu and Miss Qiao Rou are clearly doing this for Qiao Xi’s sake, but she doesn’t appreciate it at all. As expected of someone from the countryside. She’s too lacking in manners.”","“Right, she even dared to call the police just now. What a joke. She doesn’t even know what she has done and still has the cheek to call the police. Is she waiting for the police to send her to jail?”","Qiao Rou leaned against Gu Moling’s shoulder and said gently, “I didn’t expect my sister to dare to call the police. Maybe it’s because Teacher Wang’s words were too harsh. She couldn’t take the shock and called the police.”","Gu Moling nodded in agreement.","That was right, Qiao Xi must be a mistress. That was why she was so vicious to Wang Fengxia, who was telling the truth.","Qiao Xi was truly too vicious. In order to make others not be able to reveal her secrets, she wanted to kill them. It was even to the extent that when others exposed her lies in public, she wanted to call the police to arrest them.","How ignorant and stupid.","When the crowd dispersed, Wang Fengxia heaved a sigh of relief. After taking the money as agreed, she grinned. Although her body hurt, it was worth it.","Many of the wounds on her body were done by makeup, but some were real to make them look realistic. After being a tyrant in university for so many years, Wang Fengxia’s body was still very tender. It was horrible to suffer so many injuries. She bent down and slowly moved forward.","Just as she was about to leave the university, she saw a few pairs of leather shoes in front of her. Then, these people suddenly separated to the left and right. A tall man slowly walked toward her.","The man exuded a strong sense of oppression. Wang Fengxia had a bad feeling. She took a step back and asked cautiously, “Who are you?”","It was raining cats and dogs. Song Shiyu took the umbrella from the bodyguard and held it above Gu Zheng’s head.","Gu Zheng stopped three steps away from Wang Fengxia, who could not retreat anymore. She fell to the ground in a sorry state. She looked up at this handsome man with a terrifying aura. Her lips trembled as she wanted to say something, but she was suppressed by Gu Zheng’s aura and could not say anything.","Gu Zheng glanced at the woman on the ground with disdain as if he was looking at trash. “Are you Wang Fengxia?” His voice was very cold, as cold as the wind in the North Pole.","Wang Fengxia subconsciously gulped. She was scared. “W-Who are you...”","“You don’t have to know who I am.”","Gu Zheng took the pistol from Song Shiyu and pressed the black muzzle of the pistol against Wang Fengxia’s forehead. “Did you know that from the moment you spoke ill of Qiao Xi back then, I had already wanted to shoot you.”","After that, he admired Wang Fengxia’s frightened expression for a while before shaking his head regretfully. “Unfortunately, that woman is quite good-tempered in private. She’s pure and kind, so I reluctantly spared your life... But why don’t you know how to cherish your life?”","Wang Fengxia was shocked. Her black pupils dilated with fear, and the expression on her face froze. She looked extremely silly.","Song Shiyu walked forward, adjusted his glasses, and looked at the box in Wang Fengxia’s arms with a smile. “This is the money you took, right? Xu Mei gave it to you? 100,000 yuan for your life... I have to say, your life is quite expensive.”"]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111 - An Exciting Time Together","paragraphs":["With that, his tone turned cold. He raised his hand and gestured to the bodyguards. “Take her away.”","Wang Fengxia finally could not take it anymore and fainted. Gu Zheng clicked his tongue when he saw her like this. “How boring.” She was too scared. It was not worth his trip here.","Song Shiyu glanced at his expression and suggested, “I heard that Qiao Rou and Gu Moling were also at the entrance of the university at that time. They even helped Wang Fengxia ask Madam to apologize.”","“Oh?” Gu Zheng pinched his fingers and pretended to casually say, “Then bring them over to join in the fun.”","...","On the other side, when Qiao Xi returned to the classroom to prepare for class, Qiao Rou and Gu Moling received an invitation from the head of the Gu family.","Qiao Rou was delighted. Gu Zheng? Why would he send her a message?","At the same time, Gu Moling was also looking at the message with surprise. He was a junior of the Gu family and had heard about the current head of the Gu family a long time ago. He knew that Gu Zheng was extremely powerful in the Gu family, and no one dared to provoke him. Everyone said that Gu Zheng was only so powerful because of the Gu family, but only the Gu family knew that the Gu family relied on Gu Zheng to get to where they were today. In other words, the Gu family was nothing without Gu Zheng.","“Rou Rou, I didn’t expect that the head of the family would invite us over as guests. You don’t know this, but I’m only a member of the side family in the Gu family. It’s extremely difficult for me to meet the head of the family. Even my father has to ask for permission before he can meet the head of the family. I didn’t expect that we would actually receive an invitation today...”","Gu Moling excitedly informed his parents about this news. Gu Moling’s mother’s excited voice came from the phone. “That’s great. If we can get in touch with the head of the family, our status in the Gu family can rise. We don’t have to be wary of others. Mo Ling, you and Rou Rou must perform well! Right, pass the phone to Rou Rou. I’ll talk to her personally.”","Qiao Rou took the phone and greeted obediently, “Hello, Aunt.”","“Rou Rou, such a good girl you are.” Gu Moling’s mother’s voice was gentle and loving. “Our Rou Rou is still the best. You’re simply the lucky star of the Gu family. Look... Not long after you got together with our Moling, the patriarch saw our Moling’s good side. Fortunately, you’re the one marrying into the Gu family. If it were your elder sister, Qiao Xi, I would definitely be angry.”","Qiao Rou smiled gently. “Aunt, you’re flattering me. Brother Moling is outstanding, which is why the family head likes him. As for my sister... Although she has a lot of problems, I believe that time can change everything. She’ll definitely change.”","“No matter how much a good-for-nothing changes, she’s still a good-for-nothing.” Gu Moling’s mother had a very bad impression of Qiao Xi. “If that kind of good-for-nothing really marries into our Gu family, our Moling will never enter the eyes of the patriarch in his life. She’s just a piece of trash who will only drag us down.”","She was extremely glad that she did not adhere to the marriage contract back then. She was thankful that she supported Gu Moling and Qiao Rou to be together instead. Now, it seemed that her decision was a wise one! Qiao Rou was simply the lucky star of the Gu family!","As for that good-for-nothing, Qiao Xi, she could forget about occupying the position of Mo Ling’s fiance. The reason they agreed to that marriage back then was for the sake of the shares in Qiao Xi’s hands. Now that the Qiao family had promised that all of Qiao Xi’s shares would be transferred to Qiao Rou in the future, it was even more unnecessary for them to choose Qiao Xi.","Gu Moling’s mother would occasionally hear some news about Qiao Xi and knew that she seemed to be an old man’s mistress... She was even more glad about her choice. Fortunately, their future daughter-in-law was Qiao Rou. Otherwise, it would really be embarrassing.","After hanging up the phone, Qiao Rou excitedly grabbed Gu Moling’s sleeve. “Brother Moling, what Aunt said just now... I felt a little upset when I heard that. Why don’t we bring Sister to see the head of the Gu family too? I think the reason why Sister became like this is because she’s too short-sighted. She doesn’t know what true high society is.”","Qiao Rou shook Gu Moling’s arm and said softly, “Alright?”","Gu Moling subconsciously wanted to refuse. He felt that bringing an outsider to see the patriarch would easily make the patriarch angry. However, on second thought, Qiao Xi was Qiao Rou’s elder sister, not an outsider... Moreover, Qiao Rou was so gentle and kind. Bringing Qiao Xi along would highlight Qiao Rou’s beauty, so he nodded in agreement after thinking for a moment.","He liked Qiao Rou’s kindness. He believed that the head of the family, who was also a man, would have a good impression of the gentle and kind Rou Rou.","Perhaps when the patriarch was satisfied with Qiao Rou, he would even casually arrange jobs for them..."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112 - Sister Did Not Do it On Purpose","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi had just finished class when her phone vibrated. She took it out to take a look... Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. This scumbag, Gu Zheng, had actually taken the initiative to contact her and said that he would give her a surprise tomorrow?","For some reason, Qiao Xi felt that it might not be a surprise but a shock. She was about to leave the classroom when she saw a few figures standing outside.","“Qiao Rou, what’s wrong? Don’t cry. Did someone bully you?”","The few girls outside the door took turns to comfort Qiao Rou. Qiao Rou leaned against the wall and weakly shed tears. “I didn’t do anything. My sister was wronged. I want to apologize to her.”","Wang Qing supported her angrily. “Why are you always thinking about that b*tch, Qiao Xi? You treat her as your sister, but she doesn’t treat you as her sister! I heard that something happened to Qiao Corporation recently because of that b*tch, Qiao Xi? She offended the partner the company was working with and refused to apologize, causing Qiao Corporation to clean up her mess.”","Everyone on campus had long heard that Qiao Corporation was not doing financially well recently, and it seemed that they had offended someone... They did not expect that Qiao Xi was the one who caused this trouble. She did not even live with the Qiao family anymore. Even though she sounded like she was cutting ties with the Qiao family, she still had to get the Qiao family to clean up the mess when she got into trouble. It was really unlucky for the Qiao family to have such a daughter!","Speaking of the company, Qiao Rou sighed and explained, “My sister didn’t do it on purpose. She has been playing around outside all these years. She’s the eldest daughter of the Qiao family now, but she’s a little lawless and doesn’t know what’s right and wrong... But it doesn’t matter. Our company is fine. No matter what trouble my sister has caused, Dad will take responsibility for her. In the future, when Dad is tired and retires, there’s still me.”","Her words instantly touched the surrounding students. They were all asking why they did not have such a kind and cute sister themselves! They even complained that Qiao Xi had such a good sister but she did not know how to cherish her.","Qiao Xi: “...”","She really wanted to tell them, ‘Come, I’ll give this younger sister to you. Hurry up and take her away. Why would I want to cherish a younger sister who occasionally has strange thoughts about me and even wants to kill me? Do I not wish to live?’","The instant Qiao Rou raised her head and saw Qiao Xi, she hurriedly walked through the crowd to Qiao Xi’s side. “Sister, I’m sorry. It was my fault just now. Can you forgive me?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, not knowing what tricks Qiao Rou was going to play this time. Logically speaking, Qiao Rou’s reputation in the university was good enough. Whenever any student mentioned her, they would say that she was a gentle goddess, she had a good attitude, and she was good-looking... Hence, she really did not need to step on her to improve her own status.","Qiao Rou noticed Qiao Xi’s impatience and hurriedly explained, “Sister, don’t worry. I’m not forcing you to forgive me. I just want to express my apology. It’s fine if you don’t accept it, but I want to compensate you. I wonder if you’ll agree?” She looked at Qiao Xi carefully with a gaze that was as innocent as a deer’s. This caused the surrounding people to wish for nothing more than to open Qiao Xi’s mouth and force her to forgive Qiao Rou.","Unfortunately, they were only thinking about it in their hearts. Qiao Xi’s imposing aura was too strong, and every time they met her gaze, they would be terrified to the point of shrinking back. Hence, it was impossible for them to grab Qiao Xi’s mouth and make her speak. They didn’t have the courage to do it.","They could only sigh at how kind Qiao Rou was compared to Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi shook her head in amusement. Earlier, it was clearly Qiao Rou’s fault and it was normal for her to apologize. However, it seemed that if she did not nod and agree to Qiao Rou’s request now, it would be as if she had committed an unforgivable mistake. She kept saying that she would not force Qiao Xi to forgive her, but in reality, she was forcing Qiao Xi to forgive her.","Her younger sister was really awesome at manipulating people.","“Tell me, what kind of compensation is it? Is it money or the shop?” Qiao Xi crossed her arms and asked in a bored tone. Of course, she was purely saying this to disgust Qiao Rou. Qiao Rou was like her mother and felt that everything in the Qiao family belonged to them. They thought of themselves as the rightful owners of the Qiao family’s assets, so it was best if she could not get anything.","Hence, she did not think that Qiao Rou could give her any good compensation. She absolutely did not expect that the compensation Qiao Rou wanted to give her was this!","“Sister... The head of the Gu family invited me and Brother Ling to Longwan Residential as guests. You also know that Brother Ling and I are getting married soon. I think the head of the family wants to see me. Can I bring you along? I’m afraid I’ll be too shy if I go alone...” Qiao Rou said this pretentiously.","The surrounding people widened their eyes and thought they had misheard. Longwan Residential?! The head of the Gu family?! He invited Qiao Rou over as a guest?! Oh my God!","Qiao Xi: “...”","She just wanted to curse out loud!"]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113 - Sister Likes The Gu Family A Lot","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou was actually going to Longwan Residential. Gu Zheng had personally invited her... At this moment, Gu Zheng’s message appeared in her mind. He said that he wanted to give her a surprise. Was Qiao Rou the surprise he was talking about?","If that was the case, she would twist his head off!","The others also recovered from their shock and sighed. “Qiao Rou was actually invited to Longwan Residential as a guest. She’s too lucky!”","“It can’t be helped. Qiao Rou is Gu Moling’s fiance. They’re all from the Gu family. It’s not strange for them to go over and meet Gu Zheng, but I’m still so envious!”","“They’re certainly a match made in heaven! Even that big shot thinks they’re a good match. Ahhh, what kind of immortal love is this?!”","“Hahaha, look at Qiao Xi’s silly appearance. She’s probably jealous of Qiao Rou again. Unfortunately, everyone is born with different fates, so it’s useless even if she’s jealous.”","Wang Qing came back to her senses from the initial shock. She pulled Qiao Rou’s arm and said unhappily, “Rou Rou, why are you bringing her to Longwan Residential? With her character, if she accidentally provokes that person, won’t she cause you trouble?”","Qiao Rou shook her head. “No, although my sister is competitive and has a stubborn temper, she’s still quite sensible. I think she went astray because Dad cut off her card... I want to bring her to see the true high society. She’ll know that old men are not good...”","In other words, Qiao Xi was being kept by an old man for money.","Wang Qing quickly understood and said sarcastically, “Oh, I see. But I think your plan will probably fall through, Rou Rou. How can a truly capable man fall for someone like Qiao Xi? She’s a stupid woman who only knows to sleep with nouveau riches.”","“I reckon that the person from Longwan Residential will get someone to chase Qiao Xi out the moment she sees her. Rou Rou, don’t bring her along. Having her go to Longwan Residential is an insult to Longwan Residential.”","Qiao Rou gently pushed Wang Qing and said angrily, “Don’t say that about my sister. Although you’re mostly right, I still want to work hard. My sister likes the Gu family a lot... She previously treated Brother Moling...” Speaking of this, she suddenly covered her mouth, and her almond eyes were full of conflict as if she realized that she had let slip something she should not have.","Wang Qing quickly understood and sneered. “Yes, she does really like the Gu family. She even tried to snatch her younger sister’s partner and marry him. She even physically hurt you. If you weren’t so kind and chose not to hold it against her, she would’ve gone to the police station for her crimes.”","Qiao Rou bit her lip and lowered her head without saying anything.","Other than a few close classmates who knew about this, the news was not spread widely in university. Hence, the students who heard this news for the first time were shocked. “What?! Qiao Xi even tried to snatch Qiao Rou’s fiance? She even hit Qiao Rou? Damn, why is this woman so vicious?!”","Wang Qing snorted. “Yes, it’s because she didn’t succeed in seducing Young Master Gu and angered the Qiao family that Qiao Rou’s father cut off Qiao Xi’s bank card. Then...” She deliberately dragged out her voice and waited for all the students’ attention to be on her before continuing, “Then, this eldest daughter of the Qiao family became an old man’s mistress to earn money. ”","As she spoke, Qiao Xi silently walked up to her and raised her hand...","Smack!","Her slap was merciless. Wang Qing’s face instantly turned to the side. Five red and swollen finger marks appeared on her fair face.","“Other than talking nonsense, what else does this mouth of yours know? Hmm? If you don’t know how to speak, then shut up. If you can’t close your mouth, then let me teach you how, alright?” Qiao Xi pinched her chin and smiled as she threatened.","“You!” Wang Qing widened her eyes and stared at Qiao Xi in disbelief. She did not expect that Qiao Xi would dare to hit her in front of so many students.","Qiao Rou was also shocked by Qiao Xi’s sudden actions. After she reacted, she quickly separated the two of them and advised, “Alright Sister, I know that you have a bad temper, but even if you have a bad temper, you can’t just hit someone like that. Qing Qing won’t fuss about it with you this time, right, Qing Qing?”","Wang Qing’s face alternated between green and white. Finally, under Qiao Rou’s tearful gaze, she turned her head to the side. “I’ll be magnanimous and not bicker with her this time, but it might not be the same next time.”","Qiao Rou looked at her, touched. “Thank you, Qing Qing.. Qing Qing, you’re the best.”"]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114 - I Want to Stand Here For A While","paragraphs":["After appeasing Wang Qing, Qiao Rou pulled Qiao Xi’s hand and shook it gently. “Sister, don’t worry. No matter what others say, I’ll always be on your side. I know you really want to see the head of the Gu family. No matter how much others object, I won’t listen. I want to fulfill your wish, so come with me to Longwan Residential.”","Qiao Xi sneered. Her good sister was really belittling her. She wanted so badly to bring her to Longwan Residential, but she would not fulfill her wish.","She smiled slightly. “I’m sorry, but I don’t want to go to Longwan Residential with you. You can see the head of the Gu family yourself. Sorry, I won’t be accompanying you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and left.","Qiao Rou’s face could not help but reveal a trace of anger. She did not know what Qiao Xi was being arrogant about. She was clearly hundreds—no, thousands—of times more outstanding than Qiao Xi. She had obtained the favor of the Gu family’s patriarch, who even personally invited her to be a guest in Longwan Residential. How glorious was this? Everyone was envious of her, but what about Qiao Xi? She actually did not react at all. This was abnormal!","Qiao Xi was a woman who could only sleep with old men and sell her body for money. What right did she have to ignore her and look down on her?!","Yes, every time Qiao Rou met Qiao Xi’s gaze, she felt that Qiao Xi was looking down on her. Her gaze was like she was looking at trash. It infuriated her each time.","Wang Qing mocked her sarcastically. “Rou Rou, since she doesn’t know what’s good for her, just let her be. She’s just a peasant from the countryside and doesn’t have much knowledge. How can such a person be worthy to be the Qiao family’s eldest daughter? What a joke.”","Qiao Rou gathered her thoughts and composed her expression.","That’s right. Wang Qing was right. Qiao Xi and she were not from the same world. One was kept as a mistress by an old man, while the other was thought highly of by the head of the Gu family. She was even personally invited by him. The gap between her and Qiao Xi was growing wider and wider, so she did not need to take a loser seriously.","In the future, when she married into the Gu family, she could casually arrange for a chauffeur or servant for Qiao Xi to marry. That was good enough considering their years of sisterhood.","...","When Qiao Xi returned to the Gu family, it was exactly five in the evening. The sun was setting in the west, and golden rays of light shone on the floor. Everything in the world was covered in a layer of golden light.","Qiao Xi pushed open the door and found that the villa was strangely quiet today. The butler was not around, and the servants were not around either... Qiao Xi shrugged her shoulders. Then, under the evening sunlight, she changed her shoes at the door. Although the light was a little dim, it did not affect her movements. She hung her jacket on the clothes rack and was about to walk upstairs when she suddenly heard a muffled groan not far away.","Qiao Xi said, “... Who is it?”","She asked as she walked in the direction of the sound. A blurry figure was standing at the kitchen door, bowing slightly as if he was in pain.","“Qiao Xi.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was slightly hoarse. He did not expect that Qiao Xi would come back at this time.","“Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi recognized his voice and stopped in her tracks before muttering, “You’re at home, so why didn’t you switch on the lights? I thought there was no one in the villa.”","After she finished speaking, she seemed to have noticed that something was wrong. Gu Zheng was standing there without moving. When she thought of the muffled groan earlier, Qiao Xi probed. “You’re not injured, are you?”","Gu Zheng Adam’s apple bobbed. “No.”","Qiao Xi was silent. ‘If you’re not injured, why are you standing at the kitchen door? Could it be that you want to cook something?’","“Uh... Do you need my help?” Qiao Xi asked very considerately, “If there’s anything you need my help with, you can let me know.”","A look of unnaturalness flashed past Gu Zheng’s face, but it was concealed by the dim light, so Qiao Xi did not notice it.","“That’s alright. Go upstairs first.”","Qiao Xi instinctively asked, “What about you?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","After a long silence, he said helplessly, “I want to stand here for a while. Don’t worry about me.”","He wanted to stand outside the kitchen for a while? Was there something wrong with him?","Qiao Xi looked at him speechlessly. She felt that Gu Zheng was a little strange today. She wanted to continue asking, but when she thought about it, she realized that she did not have the right to ask too much about Gu Zheng’s matter. Hence, she shrugged. “Alright, I’ll go upstairs first. Be careful.”","Gu Zheng’s expression froze for a moment. His thin lips parted slightly as if he wanted to explain, but in the end, he did not say anything. “Alright.”","She could not detect anything wrong with his voice. Qiao Xi scratched her head and went upstairs. She was not someone who liked to probe into other people’s secrets. She dealt with the documents in her hands upstairs. As time went by, she suddenly recalled something. The butler and servants were not around today, so what about dinner?"]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115 - Gu Zheng Is Demolishing The House","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As soon as she thought of this, there was another series of clanging sounds downstairs as if a vase had been smashed to the floor.","Qiao Xi: “...”","Was Gu Zheng demolishing the house downstairs?","After waiting for a while and realizing that there were no more noises coming from downstairs, Qiao Xi massaged her temples. In the end, she was still worried and decided to go out to take a look.","She had just walked past the corner of the stairs when she saw Gu Zheng standing motionlessly amid the pile of broken shards. Qiao Xi could not help but ask, “What are you doing?”","Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes to look at her, and Qiao Xi abruptly paused.","Gu Zheng’s eyes seemed to be covered by a layer of gray. Although he was looking at her, his gaze did not land on her... This feeling was...","Qiao Xi quietly approached his side to avoid the broken shards on the floor and carefully waved her hand in front of him. Gu Zheng’s gaze did not waver in the slightest.","He... He could not see!","Qiao Xi’s mind was muddled for a moment. Gu Zheng was a scumbag, but he was undoubtedly powerful. For such a powerful person to suddenly become blind... When she thought of the muffled groan she heard when she first entered the house and now looking at the broken shards that were all over the floor below her feet, Qiao Xi could not describe what she was feeling in her heart.","She held Gu Zheng’s hand and said nonchalantly, “You’re so clumsy. No matter how rich you are, you can’t smash all the vases. Come, follow me to the living room.”","Gu Zheng’s fingers paused slightly as he refused in a clear voice. “No.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Why was he being so stubborn?!","She leaned over and turned on the wall lamp in the kitchen. Under the bright light, she secretly sized up Gu Zheng to see if he had been scratched by the shards.","“Come with me to the living room first.”","Qiao Xi tugged at him again. Right at this moment, she sensed his gaze locking onto her. She reflexively raised her eyes and met a pair of dark but sharp eyes.","Qiao Xi was shocked. Wait... He could see?","“What are you doing, Mrs. Gu? Ordering me around?” Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows and stared at Qiao Xi for a while. His eyes seemed to contain deep meaning. Then, he strode forward and walked past the broken shards on the floor and headed toward the living room. “The way Mrs. Gu looked at me just now makes me suspect that you care about me.”","Qiao Xi’s expression constantly changed.","If it were anyone else, they might have been fooled by Gu Zheng’s acting skills. However, she had learned medicine from her third brother for a period of time. She was sure that she had not seen wrongly just now. Just now, Gu Zheng really could not see.","However, when the lights were turned on, he could see again... What was this? Night-blindness?","Gu Zheng glanced at Qiao Xi’s confused appearance and sighed lightly in his heart. The butler had applied for leave today and was not around. When he returned, he forgot to switch on the lights. The sky had darkened, causing the toxins in his body to act up and making him lose his sight. Others could still see even with the dim light of dusk, but for him, everything was dark.","He wanted to fumble around and turn on the lights, but he accidentally bumped into Qiao Xi when he entered the kitchen. Coincidentally, Qiao Xi had just returned home at that moment. He did not want Qiao Xi to know about his problem, so he pretended to be fine and sent her away. He wanted to turn on the lights as soon as possible, but he did not expect to make such a loud noise.","He knew that the situation was too abnormal and he could not hide from Qiao Xi’s eyes. What would Qiao Xi think if she knew that he had a problem with his vision? Would she think of him as a monster like the others? A strange person who would turn blind at night?","While he was thinking about this, Qiao Xi had already walked out of the kitchen. She did not know what was wrong with Gu Zheng that he suddenly could not see, but she had previously said that everyone had their own little secrets. If Gu Zheng was unwilling to tell her, she would not take the initiative to investigate.","However, with Gu Zheng’s identity, it would be dangerous if he did not treat his illness as soon as possible. It would be better if she found time to talk to Third Brother and get him to come over to take a look at Gu Zheng. At the thought of this, she subconsciously looked up at him but forgot that there was a small step between the kitchen and the living room. She accidentally fell.","“Be careful.”","Gu Zheng took a few steps forward and firmly protected Qiao Xi in his arms before she fell. Qiao Xi’s face was red as she struggled to get up. She heard Gu Zheng berate her in a very strict tone, “Walk properly. What were you thinking about?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","If she were not worrying about his health, would she have let her thoughts run wild and forgotten to look where she was going?! He was really biting the hand that fed her!","Qiao Xi struggled to break free, but Gu Zheng’s arm was like an iron rod that firmly bound her. Qiao Xi raised her head hatefully. “What are you doing? Quickly let go of me.”","“Don’t move.”","Gu Zheng frowned and seemed to think that she was too disobedient. He raised his hand and patted her head lightly. “You seem to have sprained your leg.. Let me take a look at it for you.”"]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116 - Let Me Straighten Your Bone","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The man’s warm and dry palm gently touched her ankle. A layer of redness covered Qiao Xi’s face. She subconsciously wanted to retract her foot but was firmly grabbed by the man and could not move.","Qiao Xi: “...”","This was the first time she felt the difference in strength between a man and a woman.","Qiao Xi wanted to say something but just as she opened her mouth, she heard a cracking sound. Her brows were instantly furrowed as she stared at Gu Zheng with resentment. The latter released his hand as if nothing had happened. “Didn’t I say that you twisted your ankle? I straightened your bones.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘Why didn’t you say anything before you straightened my bones?! Are you mute?! It hurt when you suddenly did that!’","“Can you walk? I don’t think you can. Then I have no choice but to carry you.” Gu Zheng answered himself and bent down to carry Qiao Xi before she could react.","After settling Qiao Xi down, Gu Zheng called the family doctor to ask about where the ointment was. Later when Qiao Xi saw the ointment in Gu Zheng’s hand, she did not wait for Gu Zheng to speak and directly stretched out her hand. “I can do it myself.”","Her ankle seemed to still have the warmth of Gu Zheng’s palm. At this moment, she would not let him touch her even if she had to die. Fortunately, Gu Zheng did not fight with her over this. After putting the ointment in her hand, he sat at the side and watched silently.","Qiao Xi: “...”","It was very stressful.","She poured the oil into her palms, rubbed them together, and heated it up before applying it to her ankle. After she was done, the clock on the wall showed that it was already 11 o’clock. Qiao Xi looked upstairs, then at Gu Zheng. She thought that it would be a little embarrassing if she jumped up to the third floor on one leg in front of Gu Zheng, so she kept sitting on the sofa and waited for Gu Zheng to return to his room before returning.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng, that scumbag, was just sitting there. He had no intention of moving at all! He endured until Qiao Xi finally could not take it anymore. Her body that was leaning against the sofa was continually leaning to the side. In the end, she simply collapsed on the sofa and slept.","Gu Zheng, who was looking at his phone and handling some documents, heard the sound of steady breathing beside him. He raised his head and saw Qiao Xi sleeping. His thin lips curled slightly.","As he observed Qiao Xi’s sleeping face, he wondered if she had discovered his secret today. Apart from Song Shiyu and some close friends, no one else knew about his problem of not being able to see at night.","It was only because what had happened today was a coincidence, which was how Qiao Xi found out. It was fine if she did not discover the truth behind it, but if she did... it would really be quite troublesome.","...","The next day, Qiao Xi woke up in the bedroom on the third floor.","She widened her eyes and looked at the ceiling of the bedroom in a daze. She remembered that she had fallen asleep on the sofa yesterday. Was it Gu Zheng who carried her back to the master bedroom?","A trace of redness involuntarily crept onto her face, but she quickly calmed down. She remembered that today was the day Qiao Rou and Gu Moling would come to Longwan Residential. After thinking for a while, she struggled to get up, found a dress from the wardrobe, and put it on. This style was vastly different from her usual attire. She then put on exquisite makeup, sunglasses, and went downstairs gracefully.","She moved her ankle. Perhaps because she was promptly treated yesterday, so the pain in her ankle was less intense. She could walk normally.","Song Shiyu was in the living room reporting today’s work to Gu Zheng. When he heard the noise upstairs, he looked up. “Huh?! President Gu, there’s another woman in your villa?! Damn, where’s Madam? She’ll divorce you if she finds out!”","Gu Zheng’s fingers froze as he raised his head to look at the stairs. His gaze landed on Qiao Xi as he scoffed. “Your ankle has recovered?”","Song Shiyu: “...” He looked at Gu Zheng with an accusing glare. It was bad enough that President Gu had brought another woman back behind Madam’s back, but he was also so concerned about this woman. Was he not afraid that Madam would be angry? Had President Gu decided not to like Madam and wanted to change his taste?","What should he do? He liked Madam’s character very much. If it were someone else who was not easy to get along with... He felt that his life would be very difficult in the future.","Qiao Xi touched the curls of her hair and lazily leaned against the stairs. She curled her finger at Gu Zheng, beckoning him.","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Song Shiyu, stay outside for a while.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","‘Don’t you think you’re going a little too far? Aren’t you afraid that I’ll call Madam and complain if you flirt with another woman in front of me?’","Qiao Xi was wearing a black dress that emphasized her curves. It perfectly displayed her voluptuous figure. Before she left, she had looked in the mirror.. Her appearance could be said to be that of a seductive demoness."]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117 - Dont Always Be So Kind","paragraphs":["She raised an eyebrow at Gu Zheng and pursed her lips with a smile. “How is it? Am I pretty today?”","Gu Zheng frowned. “Speak properly and don’t deliberately do that with your voice. You sound like a male duck. It’s horrible.”","Qiao Xi: “???”","‘I’m deliberately trying to seduce you by lowering my voice!’","This unromantic scumbag!","Qiao Xi was now sure that Gu Zheng was a block of wood. He was not even swayed by the presence of such a beautiful and peerless beauty like herself when she was standing in front of him. This man was definitely sick!","Gu Zheng’s gaze vaguely swept past Qiao Xi before he curled his lips and said nothing else.","In the afternoon, Qiao Rou changed her clothes in front of the mirror. She wanted to choose the most beautiful and elegant dress to grab Gu Zheng’s attention. After carefully dressing herself up, she carefully lifted her skirt and got into the car.","It was a great honor for the Qiao family and Gu Moling’s family to be able to meet Gu Zheng. Hence, the two families were gathered in the Qiao family’s villa early in the morning. The parents shared their concerns.","As they did not have any experience interacting with Gu Zheng, Gu Moling’s mother specially instructed them before they left. “Although the head of the family is not easy to approach, since he’s willing to meet you, it means that he still has a good impression of you. As long as you don’t do anything to make the head of the family unhappy, it won’t be a big problem. You must remember to seize this opportunity. As long as the head of the family is happy, there’s nothing you can’t get.”","Qiao Rou nodded obediently. “I understand.”","Gu Moling was wearing a smart suit. “Mom, we’re leaving now. You should go back too.”","Before they left, Qiao Rou sighed lightly. “I initially wanted Sister to go with us, but Sister... Sigh, forget it. Let’s talk about it next time. After we get married, we’ll have more chances to see the head of the family. At that time, I’ll bring Sister over.”","Xu Mei knew that her daughter was kind, but no matter how kind she was, she had to look at the occasion. Was this occasion something that b*tch Qiao Xi could attend?","“Rou Rou, you can’t always think of your sister. You treat her as your sister, but she doesn’t treat you as her sister. Today is such an important matter. If you bring Qiao Xi along, won’t everything be ruined? If the head of the Gu family is unhappy, not only will our Qiao family be doomed but even Moling’s family will suffer. So, you shouldn’t always be so kind.”","Xu Mei’s words were spoken with emotions, but it sounded like a reprimand to Qiao Rou. She pursed her lips as a trace of displeasure flashed past her eyes.","Xu Mei also realized that she had said too much and quickly added, “Rou Rou, don’t think too much. It’s not that I’m being mean, but I just don’t think that Qiao Xi is worthy of your kind treatment. She first stole your fiance, then tried to ruin your reputation. She even caused Qiao Corporation to be in a mess. Keep an appropriate distance with her in the future. Otherwise, not only will it not be good for you but you’ll also get yourself into trouble.”","Qiao Rou composed her expression and nodded lightly. “I know, Mom. It’s just that I think everyone says that my sister doesn’t know her own limits. They say that my sister is shameless. Although my sister is a little... She’s my sister, after all. If I don’t help her, what should she do? We’re family, after all. Families should be more tolerant of each other.”","Gu Moling was originally slightly disapproving of Xu Mei’s words, but he nodded in satisfaction when he heard Qiao Rou’s words. It seemed that Rou Rou was sensible and knew that the good of a family would always come with the bad. No matter how bad Qiao Xi’s reputation was, she would not abandon her.","His Rou Rou was always so kind.","...","The car arrived at Longwan Residential. Although Longwan Residential was in the city, the environment was very quiet. The woods made people think that they had arrived at a utopia.","Qiao Rou looked at the scenery outside through the car window and had a new understanding of Gu Zheng’s strength. This was the first time she came to Longwan Residential. In the past, she had always heard from others how luxurious Gu Zheng’s house was. She heard from others that Gu Zheng’s power was so great but nothing could compare to finally seeing it with her own eyes.","Gu Moling and his family were just a branch of the Gu family. Qiao Rou was already very satisfied with where they lived. Unexpectedly, compared to Gu Zheng, the difference was like night and day!","She could not help but think about how good it would be if Gu Zheng took a liking to her. In the future, she would be the mistress of his house... Although she would be letting Brother Moling down if she thought about it this way, after she got together with Gu Zheng, she would definitely tell him to take care of Brother Moling and his family. This way, the guilt in her heart would decrease by a lot."]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118 - You Wont Get Your Salary This Month","paragraphs":["She felt that she would definitely succeed. No man could refuse her, and she believed that the head of the Gu family was the same. Once she became the madam of the Gu family, the people outside would be even more envious of her. As for Qiao Xi... she was just a dog under her feet. Would she not be at her mercy as well?","“Rou Rou, what are you thinking? Why are you smiling so happily?”","Gu Moling’s words made Qiao Rou come back to her senses. She gathered her thoughts and smiled gently at Gu Moling. “I’m a little surprised to see such a beautiful villa. Brother Moling, what did you say to me just now?”","“I said that I’ll talk to the head of the household later. You know that the head of the household doesn’t like women. You can speak when he asks about you. Otherwise, don’t interrupt.” Gu Moling repeated what he had just said. “This villa was built by the head of the household’s top designer. Of course, it’s very beautiful.”","This villa represented status and money.","A trace of light flashed through Qiao Rou’s eyes before they were calm again. She sighed lightly. “It’s a pity. If only Sister could come. Sister especially likes such good-looking villas. Perhaps because she lived a hard life when she was young, Sister values money very much and likes a life of luxury. That’s why she...”","After a pause, she continued, “If my sister could see this villa, she probably wouldn’t admire those old and ugly men.”","Gu Moling did not want to hear Qiao Xi’s name at this time. He patted Qiao Rou’s shoulder. “Don’t think too much. Her degrading herself has nothing to do with you. You’ve already done everything that you can. In the end, she failed to live up to expectations and chose to take a path of no return.”","Qiao Rou pursed her lips and looked down.","Yes, Qiao Xi had taken a path of no return, but her future was a straight path to heaven. She would be the future madam of the Gu family, second only to one person and above everyone else.","Thinking of the future, Qiao Rou’s smile grew wider. Looking at the beautiful and elegant surroundings, her eyes burst with a determined light.","...","In the villa, Qiao Xi sat in the tearoom and drank the tea that Song Shiyu had personally brewed. She sighed comfortably. “I didn’t expect you to have such skills, Song Shiyu. It’s such a waste of your talent to be Gu Zheng’s special assistant.”","Song Shiyu scratched his head in embarrassment. “Madam, you’re too kind. My tea brewing skills are just barely passable. You’re too kind, Madam.”","Qiao Xi waved her hand. “No, no, no. I’m serious. I don’t usually praise others.”","She had been drinking tea brewed by a master since she was young. Her tastebuds were extraordinarily sharp, and ordinary people would not receive a single praise from her. Hence, Song Shiyu’s skills were exceptional.","Gu Zheng watched the two of them sit on the tatami mat in the tearoom. One was praising the other while the other was smiling. His eyes darkened. Did these two people think he was dead?","Usually, Song Shiyu was very sensitive to Gu Zheng’s emotions. Unfortunately, he was too surprised today. He realized that the sexy and beautiful woman who came down from the stairs this morning was Madam herself. Madam was too awesome! She had so many sides to her!","On a whim, he suggested brewing tea for Madam. Unexpectedly, Madam agreed and even praised him for brewing tea well.","“Madam, have you drunk many teas brewed by masters?”","“Yes. I often drank tea brewed by the tea master, Master Du. The tea he makes is very good. It’s also my favorite.”","Master Du?","He was an internationally renowned tea master!","“If Master Du comes to Li City next time, I’ll arrange for you to meet him. He has a special interest in brewing tea and likes teaching others how to brew tea. If they don’t want to learn, he’ll shake his head and sigh about how our ancestors’ craftsmanship is going to be lost. How annoying.” Qiao Xi complained as she drank the tea. “If it weren’t because the tea he brews tastes really good, I wouldn’t listen to him. However, I think he and you will speak the same language.”","Song Shiyu was a little excited. “Really? Isn’t Master Du a very cold man? I heard that he’s passionate about tea and rarely goes out or talks.”","Qiao Xi looked at him with a complicated expression. “Young man, rumors can’t be trusted.”","Song Shiyu scratched his head in embarrassment. “Really? I’ve never seen Master Du but I occasionally see news about him.”","“If Old Du knows that someone admires him so much, he’ll be so arrogant.” Qiao Xi rolled her eyes and reached out to Song Shiyu. “Give me your phone. I’ll give you Old Du’s WeChat number.”","Seeing that the two of them were getting closer and closer to each other, Gu Zheng said sinisterly, “Song Shiyu, you won’t get your salary for this month.”"]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119 - My Sister Is The Third Party","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu: “???”","What was wrong with him? Was this what it meant to have gains and losses? He had just received Master Du’s WeChat ID when his salary for this month was gone?","He was about to explain himself and try to save his salary when he heard the butler say at the door, “Young Master, Young Master Moling and Miss Qiao Rou are here.”","Song Shiyu could only swallow his words. President Gu had always been volatile. He would deduct one’s salary one second and give out a bonus the next second. He had better perform well!","A servant opened the door for them. “Young Master Moling, Miss Qiao Rou, please come in.”","On the way here, Qiao Rou had already seen how luxurious Longwan Residential was. She did not expect that when she saw the interior of the villa, she would still open her mouth in surprise.","Such a villa... Such wealth. Only such a man was worthy of her!","Qiao Rou silently prayed in her heart that she could seize the opportunity to win over Gu Zheng today and make him kneel before her beauty.","The butler had heard of the matter between Gu Moling, Qiao Rou, and Qiao Xi a long time ago. Although he maintained a polite smile on his face, he did not have a good impression of Gu Moling and Qiao Rou at all.","He clearly saw the greed in Qiao Rou’s eyes when she saw the villa. He was about to sneer when he saw Qiao Rou’s eyes turn red and she sighed.","The butler: “...”","As a qualified housekeeper, he should ask the guests what was wrong with a smile. Hence, he maintained the smile on his face and asked gently, “What’s wrong, Miss Qiao Rou? Are you feeling unwell? Or are you dissatisfied with something?”","Gu Moling was about to open his mouth to deny it when he saw Qiao Rou wipe the tears from the corners of her eyes. “It’s nothing. I just thought of something and felt a little sad.”","The butler wanted to say, ‘Why are you crying at the door of our young master’s house?’ He wanted to ask someone to throw Qiao Rou, this eyesore, out. However, as a professional butler, no matter how impatient he was, he would not show it on his face. Instead, he continued to ask very professionally, “What exactly made you unhappy? If there’s anything I can help with, please let me know.”","There were countless servants and bodyguards in Longwan Residential. Qiao Rou’s eyes shifted. It was human nature to gossip. If these people heard what she said and spread it, then it would be spread in high society as well...","None of the people around Gu Zheng were simple people. There was also this butler in front of her. She heard that he was a butler transferred from the old residence. He had a high status in the Gu family. If this butler felt sorry for her and liked her, wouldn’t it be much easier for her to do what she wanted?","At the thought of this, her eyes turned red as she smiled bitterly. “I just thought of my sister. She has always been looking forward to life in the upper class society...”","Gu Moling frowned. He did not expect that Qiao Rou would actually tell the butler of Gu Zheng’s villa about this. He was just about to stop her when he heard the butler suddenly realize something. “The elder sister you’re talking about is Qiao Xi, the daughter of the Qiao family who came back from the countryside?”","Gu Moling did not expect the butler to know Qiao Xi’s name. Could it be that her reputation was so bad that even the villa’s butler had heard of her?","Qiao Rou was surprised. “Butler, you know my sister?”","The butler adjusted his expression and tried to show a look of disdain. “Of course I do, but I only know a little bit. I know that Miss Qiao Xi and Young Master Gu Moling...”","Qiao Rou was delighted in her heart. This was indeed something she had not expected. She had not expected that Qiao Xi’s reputation would be so bad that even the butler would know about her. However, she did not mind adding fuel to the fire to worsen the butler’s impression of Qiao Xi.","Hence, she pretended to be flustered and waved her hands. “No, no, no. It isn’t like that. My sister and Brother Moling don’t have that kind of relationship.”","The butler said, “But I heard that you were supposed to marry Young Master Moling. It was Qiao Xi who caused trouble at home and insisted on marrying Young Master Moling. She even attacked and injured you, so your marriage with Young Master Moling was delayed until now. I heard that in order to cling to the Gu family, Qiao Xi wanted to take your place and marry Young Master Moling. Isn’t this true?”","Before Qiao Rou spoke, she carefully glanced at Gu Moling. Gu Moling knew that if anything bad about Qiao Xi was said in front of the butler today, it would be equivalent to indirectly telling Gu Zheng. In this way, Qiao Xi could forget about joining the high society.","He was slightly unable to take it, but since the matter had already developed to this point, he could only continue tacitly. As for Qiao Xi, he would compensate her in the future if he had the chance. A few tens of thousands of yuan would probably suffice."]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120 - The Strongest Opponent","paragraphs":["His tacit agreement made Qiao Rou feel more confident. She said softly, “Sister indeed did such a thing, but Brother Moling likes me very much, so Sister’s plan didn’t succeed. Although I’m very angry about what she did, she’s my sister after all. Hence, no one knows about this. Uncle Butler, please don’t tell others about this, okay? Otherwise, my sister’s life will be made difficult.”","The butler showed a surprised expression. “So Qiao Xi really became the third party and wanted to interfere in your relationship with Young Master Ling? Tsk tsk, one really can’t judge a book by its cover. It’s too terrifying. Previously, I chanced upon Qiao Xi and Young Master Moling walking together and thought that the two of them were a couple. Unexpectedly...”","Qiao Rou tilted her head and explained in a slightly aggrieved tone, “Sister used to like to go to Brother Moling’s side when I wasn’t around. She wanted to take advantage of the situation.”","The butler looked at her as if he understood what she meant. “I know. She wanted to snatch your man.”","Qiao Rou did not expect the butler to be so sensible. She could not hide her excitement as she said, “Yes, Sister is the third party. I’m Brother Moling’s fiance!”","When she said this, she could not help but raise her voice so that many people around her could hear.","After hearing the gossip, the butler said with a smile, “I see. Our young master has always wanted to meet Young Master Moling’s fiance, so he specially invited you over today. Please come in. Young Master is already waiting for you inside.”","Qiao Rou’s heart was thumping.","Ever since she stepped into the villa, she had been determined to become the madam of this villa. She would definitely think of ways to get what she wanted. She had already settled the butler, she just had to work a little harder to deal with Gu Zheng...","Thinking about this, Qiao Rou suppressed the excitement in her heart and walked in while lifting her skirt. However, she did not expect to see a woman wearing sunglasses on the sofa. The woman’s face was very small, and the large sunglasses covered most of her face. However, it could still be seen that the woman’s appearance was very outstanding.","Qiao Rou’s heart trembled. Why? Why was there a woman in Longwan Residential? Didn’t Gu Zheng hate women? Why was this woman sitting on the sofa so openly?","Qiao Rou instantly thought of this woman as her biggest competitor.","Gu Moling was also very surprised by the appearance of a woman, but his thoughts were different from Qiao Rou’s. A woman who could sit here was definitely not ordinary. The outside world knew that Gu Zheng did not like women being too close to him. A woman who could appear here was definitely not someone he could offend.","He was just about to ignore the woman’s presence and talk to Gu Zheng. He knew that there were some things that should not be asked, but he did not expect Qiao Rou to suddenly open her mouth and ask with a dumbfounded look, “Huh, why is there someone else here? Didn’t Uncle Butler say that the head of the family only invited us today?”","Instantly, everyone’s eyes were on her.","As if she did not feel it, Qiao Rou asked gently, “Miss, may I know who you are? Why are you here? If you’re here uninvited, you have to leave quickly. The owner of the villa doesn’t like other women appearing in his home.”","It seemed to be a reminder, but it was actually a warning as though she was already the madam of the house. Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. This younger sister of hers was always so self-righteous no matter where she was.","Qiao Rou thought that the woman would react after she heard what she said. Unexpectedly, she continued sitting on the sofa and did not move. This determination made Qiao Rou feel even more threatened.","She rolled her eyes and thought that this woman was a sl*t who came uninvited to deliver herself to Gu Zheng. She heard that the patriarch hated women who took the initiative to deliver themselves to his door. If she could help him chase this woman away, Gu Zheng would definitely see her in a new light!","Thinking about this, she sighed and put on a posture that made it look like she was doing this for the woman’s own good. Qiao Rou advised earnestly, “Miss, let me remind you again that this is Longwan Residential. It’s not a place you should be at. The owner of the villa doesn’t like women who are too aggressive. Even if you want to suck up to him, you have to pay attention to the time and place, right?”","Qiao Xi’s brows moved while her red lips curled up lightly. Every single move she made was flirtatious.","Qiao Rou pinched her fingers in jealousy. Damn it, this woman was dressed so coquettishly. She must be trying to seduce the head of the family and use her body to win him over! A vixen who only knew how to seduce people with her body was different from a noble and elegant rich miss like her. The head of the family would definitely not like such a woman who had no substance!","Thinking about this, she confidently straightened her back. “Miss, while the head of the household isn’t here, please leave quickly. I’ll get the servants in the villa to shut up and not tell the head about your visit.”","Qiao Xi did not know where Qiao Rou’s confidence came from that she felt like she could order the servants in the villa. The servants in Gu Zheng’s villa were all trained and would not listen to anyone but their master."]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121 - Fight For Gu Zheng!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi changed her posture and sat on the sofa, then slowly picked up the teacup to take a sip. She did not take Qiao Rou’s words to heart in the slightest.","Gu Moling frowned. Although he felt that Qiao Rou’s words were a little wrong, Qiao Rou had always been gentle and kind in his heart. He thought that Qiao Rou said those words for the sake of this woman, but this woman clearly did not appreciate her gesture.","Qiao Rou took the risk of offending the head of the Gu family to remind this woman, but what about this woman? She was arrogant and did not put Qiao Rou in her eyes at all. This behavior made Gu Moling angry. He said coldly, “Who exactly are you? I’m the young master of the Gu family. Why haven’t I seen you before? Let me remind you one last time. The head of the family hates it when others come uninvited, so you have to leave quickly. Otherwise, you have to bear the consequences!”","This time, Qiao Xi finally reacted. She supported her chin with one hand and her red lips parted slightly. “Bear the consequences? What consequences will there be?”","Her fair and tender fingers picked up a beautiful pastry on the coffee table, and her gaze carried a hint of seduction. As she ate the pastry, she looked at Gu Moling as if she was waiting for his answer.","Gu Moling was stunned by her sudden demeanor and forgot to answer for a moment. Qiao Rou stood at the side and grabbed her skirt tightly. Her Brother Moling was actually dazed by this woman. Damn it!","The tip of Qiao Xi’s pink tongue licked away the trace of dessert on her finger. Her eyes curved lightly as clear laughter escaped her mouth. “Hmm? Gu Zheng, tell me what the consequences are for coming uninvited, will you?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm. His simple black shirt made his eyebrows look even colder. Gu Moling and Qiao Rou both turned their heads. Qiao Rou’s heart was beating like a drum. Was this the head of the Gu family? A trace of redness appeared on her cheeks. The head of the Gu family, who had such a shocking amount of wealth, actually had such good looks. He was indeed blessed by the heavens.","The head of the Gu family was too good-looking. He was more good-looking than all the men she had ever seen! In her eyes, Gu Moling’s looks were considered top-notch, but she did not expect him to pale in comparison to Gu Zheng. She originally treated Gu Moling as a treasure, but she regretted it now. She felt that only a man like Gu Zheng was worthy of her. Only Gu Zheng was worthy of standing beside her.","However... Before laying her hands on Gu Zheng, she had to get rid of this irksome woman!","Although she did not know where this woman in sunglasses came from, it did not matter. No matter what her background was, she dared to speak to Gu Zheng in this manner and even dared to address him by his name. She would just have to wait for the call of death.","Thinking about this, she took a step forward and smiled gently at Gu Zheng. “Master, don’t be angry. I wanted to remind this woman to leave the villa, but she didn’t listen to my suggestion. Although she’s a little rash and entered this villa without your permission, can we give her another chance? Don’t throw her out...”","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks when he saw Qiao Rou and raised his eyebrows.","Sensing his gaze, Qiao Rou lowered her head shyly. She sneaked a glance at his perfect side profile. “Master, I’m being troublesome. You’ve always hated women who take the initiative to look for you, but as a woman, I really can’t bear to see her be treated rudely by the servants. So can I ask you to let her off this time?”","The living room was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","From the first time Qiao Rou opened her mouth, the butler had looked at her with a complicated gaze. Was this person’s brain not working well? She was also from the Qiao family like Madam, but why was her IQ so different from her elder sister’s?","Qiao Rou did not know that the butler was cursing her for being stupid in his heart. She thought that she was performing very well this time and was looking forward to Gu Zheng praising her. However, after waiting for a long time, no one said anything. She finally realized that something was wrong. Why was the master not getting this woman to scram? Could it be that her performance earlier was too beautiful and the master did not think it was good to be too rough with a woman? No way...","If that was the case, Qiao Rou would vomit out blood. She could not wait for Gu Zheng to quickly kick this woman out!","Qiao Rou tried to raise her head but did not expect to meet Gu Zheng’s eyes. Her heart skipped a beat. Why were the master’s eyes so cold and impatient as if he hated her very much? No, that was impossible. She was such a weak, generous, and beautiful woman. No man would hate her. What was wrong? Could it be that the master did not like her speaking on behalf of other women? However, only by doing this could she show her kindness."]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122 - This Woman Is A Little Hypocritical","paragraphs":["Before Qiao Rou could figure it out, Qiao Xi’s fair fingers tapped on the coffee table. Her full lips were slightly parted, and her tone carried a trace of a complaint. “Is this the gentle and kind fiance you were talking about, Gu Moling? She doesn’t seem like much. She’s a little hypocritical...”","Qiao Rou was infuriated!","How could this woman say such things? What did she mean by ‘doesn’t seem like much’? What did she mean by ‘a little hypocritical’? Who did she think she was?!","Gu Moling frowned and pulled Qiao Rou to his side. He reminded her, “Miss, Rou Rou is kind enough to help you. It’s fine that you don’t appreciate her help, but there’s no need to step on her, right?”","Qiao Xi looked at him with a smile that was not a smile.","“You’re lecturing my people in my territory, yet you claim to be helping me out of goodwill?” Gu Zheng sneered, his gaze cold and dangerous. “I didn’t know that the two of you had the right to interfere in my matters? Gu Moling, have you forgotten about the Gu family’s upbringing?”","Gu Moling shuddered and stammered as he explained, “I-I didn’t do anything... Rou Rou, she... She just reminded this woman out of kindness. She knows that you don’t like women, so she...”","“I don’t like women?” Gu Zheng chuckled. “No matter how much I don’t like women, I can’t possibly not like my wife, right? The woman you brought is someone who was invited here as a guest. She doesn’t know anything but made the decision to kick my wife out. She’s really impressive.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was cold as the words he said hit Gu Moling and Qiao Rou’s hearts. “Butler, see the guests out.”","Gu Moling and Qiao Rou were stunned.","What did he mean by wife? That woman was actually Gu Zheng’s wife? Mrs. Gu?! How was that possible?!","He subconsciously wanted to deny it because he had not heard any news of Gu Zheng’s marriage at all. However, reason made him shut his mouth. The position of the head of the Gu family was unparalleled. No one could tell him what he wanted to do, including his marriage.","A woman who could live in Longwan Residential and be acknowledged by Gu Zheng himself, even if she had not registered her marriage with Gu Zheng and had not received the acknowledgment of the other members of the Gu family, meant that her status was not something someone from the branch family like him could compare to.","Qiao Rou was not as calm as Gu Moling. Rather, she had long been spoiled and did not know her limits. She retorted with a pale face, “How is that possible? How can she be Mrs. Gu?!”","Qiao Xi raised her head to look at her. “Why not?”","“Of course...”","Qiao Rou was about to say that it was impossible for Gu Zheng to like a woman like her. If he had to like anyone, it would be someone like her. However, before she could say anything, Gu Moling grabbed her hand. He was so strong that it hurt Qiao Rou and made her shut up.","Qiao Xi clicked her tongue, propped up her chin with one hand, and said lazily, “Miss Qiao Rou, you’re really interesting. Gu Zheng has already told you that I’m Mrs. Gu, yet you still said that it’s impossible. I’m quite curious about your thoughts? As soon as you entered, you reminded me to leave as though you’re the madam of the house... Are you coveting my position?”","Qiao Rou’s entire body trembled as cold sweat ceaselessly slid down her forehead. Every word Qiao Xi said hit the nail on the head. It was as if this woman could read minds and had completely revealed the thoughts in her heart. This woman was too terrifying!","This kind of woman was not suitable for Gu Zheng. She was the only one worthy of standing beside him!","Gu Moling was afraid that Gu Zheng would get angry and did not dare to provoke this woman with an unknown identity. He hurriedly explained, “Mrs. Gu, don’t be angry. Rou Rou did not mean that. She’s very kind. She really wanted to help you and was afraid that you’d be punished by the head of the family.”","“Wanted to help me?”","Qiao Xi giggled as if she had heard a joke. She wiped the tears of laughter from the corners of her eyes and raised her voice slightly. “It’s your greatest honor that Gu Zheng invited all of you here. Do the two of you even remember that you’re merely guests? And Miss Qiao Rou, the greed in your eyes has already exposed everything when you came in. You want to take over my position, right? You’re really quite awesome.”","Qiao Rou’s expression kept changing. She did not expect this woman to be so observant, but was it wrong for her to want to get promoted? People always wanted to climb higher. So what if she wanted to kick Gu Moling away after seeing Gu Zheng? This was all human nature!","Since she was able to snatch Gu Moling from Qiao Xi, she would definitely be able to snatch Gu Zheng from this woman! Therefore, this woman should not be smug for too long!","Gu Zheng was annoyed by their chatter. He sat beside Qiao Xi and rested his arm on the back of the sofa behind her. In a possessive manner, he said, “Why are you wasting time talking to them? If you don’t like them, get the butler to throw them out.”"]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123 - Of Course, Ill Listen To Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["Gu Moling was instantly anxious when he heard that. He had not forgotten that before he came, his parents had told him not to provoke the head of the family. If he was really chased out at this moment, it would implicate his parents and the rest of the family would laugh at him. He could not accept this outcome. It was too embarrassing!","The culprit behind all this was Qiao Rou. If she had not spouted nonsense, she would not have offended Mrs. Gu!","At the thought of this, he suddenly turned around and berated, “Qiao Rou, quickly apologize to Mrs. Gu!”","Qiao Rou’s face alternated between red and white. She bit her lower lip and was extremely unwilling. Why should she apologize to that woman?! However, she also knew that if she was really chased out by Gu Zheng, the consequences would be unimaginable.","If she was chased out of Longwan Residential by Gu Zheng... Brother Moling would definitely despise her. Even Gu Moling’s mother would have reservations about her. If others heard the news, they would also laugh at her...","Qiao Rou comforted herself in her heart. It was okay. She would just submit this once. She would repay this humiliation sooner or later!","Her face was ashen as she gritted her teeth and said, “I’m sorry.”","Qiao Xi did not react and continued eating the grapes on the plate.","At this moment, the butler walked forward. “Madam, don’t blame Miss Qiao Rou. She was betrayed by her sister not long ago. I heard that her sister wanted to snatch her fiance. Once bitten, twice shy. She was probably afraid when she saw your beautiful appearance, so she chased you away.”","Qiao Xi blinked. Was the butler taking this opportunity to praise her beauty? Wow... The butler’s move was brilliant!","Gu Zheng raised his head and glanced at the butler as if he did not know about this side of the butler...","The butler’s expression did not change under their gazes. It could be said that he was very professional.","Qiao Xi tossed the grape skin in her hand and elegantly grabbed a piece of tissue to clean the grape juice on her fingertips. “So Miss Qiao Rou, you mean that your sister seduced your fiance?”","Qiao Rou looked at Gu Moling pitifully as tears flowed down her cheeks. “Yes, but these things are in the past now. I don’t think my sister snatched my fiance on purpose. It’s just that her living environment has made her greedy for money, so she did something wrong to try and seduce Brother Moling. She even became an old man’s mistress...”","At this point, she suddenly covered her mouth. After realizing that she had said something she should not have, she quickly added, “No, no, my sister didn’t become a mistress.”","She made it seem that she was just talking nonsense instead of deliberately exposing her sister’s shortcomings.","Qiao Xi sighed and looked at Qiao Rou with great sympathy. “So that’s how it is. You’re really pitiful. Brother Gu Zheng, let’s not bicker with her, alright?”","Gu Zheng raised his brows slightly as he picked up a grape and slowly peeled it before placing it by Qiao Xi’s mouth. He said in a low voice, “Alright. Since Mrs. Gu has spoken, of course, I’ll listen.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","The grape was still in her mouth. She did not know whether to eat it or not. At an angle where no one could see, she glared fiercely at Gu Zheng. Then, after swallowing the grape, she pretended to be curious and looked at Qiao Rou. “Brother Gu Zheng, I remember you told me that Gu Moling’s fiancee is called Qiao Xi. Did I remember wrongly? Or did that person change her name to Qiao Rou?”","Qiao Rou was shocked, and her face turned pale!","The living room instantly fell into a dead silence. No one said anything. Qiao Rou’s body was trembling. The people who sympathized with her for getting her fiance snatched by her sister earlier were now looking at her with curious looks, wanting to know what was going on.","Qiao Xi looked around her in confusion. “What’s wrong? Did I say something wrong? But I remember that this is what I heard before. At that time, I even said that the name Qiao Xi is very pleasant to the ears.”","Gu Zheng: “...” ‘You shouldn’t be flattering yourself like this.’","Despite his complaints, the couple still stood united against outsiders. Gu Zheng’s eyes were indifferent. “You did remember it correctly. She’s called Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Rou subconsciously wanted to say something but she did not expect Qiao Xi to beat her to it. She adjusted her sunglasses and said, “Ah, so I didn’t remember wrongly. Then did you change your name? Qiao Xi is such a nice name, so why did you change your name to Qiao Rou? The sound of it makes one uncomfortable.”","Qiao Rou: “...” Her face was contorted, but she did not dare to say anything. She could only clench her fists.","Qiao Xi propped up her chin and sighed. “I remember seeing Qiao Xi from afar. I was shocked when I saw her, but why do you seem different to me? You’re not as good-looking as Qiao Xi whom I saw that day, and your temperament isn’t as good either... Could it be that you underwent plastic surgery? You had such a good-looking face, yet you underwent plastic surgery to look like this. You’re really wasting the heavens’ blessings.”"]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124 - Exposed In Public","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng could not help but tilt his head. He wanted to witness this woman praising herself without batting an eyelid.","Qiao Rou’s expression was very awkward. She felt that everything Mrs. Gu said was like a knife stabbing into her! She took a step back sadly, and her thin body was shaking. “I-I’m not Qiao Xi... I’m Qiao Rou.”","How could she not be as pretty as that b*tch, Qiao Xi?! Was this Mrs. Gu blind? She actually praised Qiao Xi for being pretty!","The living room fell silent again.","Gu Moling had no choice but to step forward to save the situation. “Master, Madam, my fiance has always been Qiao Rou. I have nothing to do with Qiao Xi.”","“Huh?” Qiao Xi turned around to look at Gu Zheng with dissatisfaction, and her pink fist lightly smacked his body. “Look at you, you even got the name of someone else’s fiance wrong. You made me look so bad. You’re so annoying.”","Qiao Xi said corny words while cringing in her heart. She felt that she was really sacrificing too much to punish Qiao Rou!","Gu Zheng grabbed her hand and held it tightly. His low and pleasant voice was filled with absolute confidence. “The Gu family’s intelligence network has never been wrong. Gu Moling’s fiancee is indeed Qiao Xi, and Qiao Rou is Qiao Xi’s younger sister... As for what happened between them, I have no idea. After all, the Gu family’s intelligence network doesn’t investigate such trivial matters.”","Gu Zheng did not seem to have said anything, but he also seemed to have exposed everything.","“Huh?”","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised and opened her mouth wide. “So Qiao Xi is Gu Moling’s fiancee? Then why did he get together with Qiao Rou in the end? Qiao Rou, you even said that your sister stole your man... But you’re clearly the one stealing your sister’s man, right?”","The younger sister of the fiancee got together with the sister’s fiance. It did not sound right no matter what.","Gu Moling clenched his fists and was in an awkward, helpless state. He did not know what to say to save his image in the eyes of the head of the family. “Master, I...”","“Actually, if she wants to snatch someone else’s fiance, so be it. I think this must be a problem with her character. Some people are just cheap and like to snatch someone else’s fiance. However, she did such a thing yet pushed the blame away from her. She said it was her sister who stole her fiance and is a shameless mistress. Isn’t this a little too much?”","Qiao Xi shook her head, feeling disappointed in Qiao Rou and Gu Moling. “What should I do? I feel a little sorry for Qiao Xi. After her younger sister stole her fiance, she’s now being framed for something she didn’t do. It’s already bad enough that she lost her fiance. Now, even her reputation has been ruined to such an extent. This young lady is really too pitiful.”","Gu Moling’s body stiffened. Was it sad? Did Qiao Xi feel sad when she lost him?","Qiao Rou almost fainted when she heard Qiao Xi’s words! She put in so much effort to scheme against Qiao Xi to get rid of her label as the third party but in less than an hour after coming to Longwan Residential, the label was returned to her!","She stole her sister’s fiance and shamelessly accused her sister of being a mistress... But she was not the third party! The person Brother Moling loved had always been her, while the person who was not loved was the mistress!","The butler had a face full of disappointment. “So you’re the third party. To think that I actually sympathized with you when I heard what you said just now. Right, you said Qiao Xi came back from the countryside. If I remember correctly, Qiao Xi is the Qiao family’s legitimate eldest daughter, right? As for you... I remember you’re the illegitimate daughter from the time Qiao Xi’s father had an affair. How can an illegitimate daughter have the cheek to slander the Qiao family’s eldest daughter? How shameless.”","The servants around them also nodded. “That’s right, she’s too shameless.”","“She’s indeed the daughter of a mistress. She’s just like her mother who was a mistress. When she grows up, she’ll be a mistress too. She’ll interfere with other people’s relationships.”","Hearing their words, Qiao Rou was so angry that she almost fainted! She came to Longwan Residential to elevate her status, not to be mocked by these servants. What right did a bunch of low-class people who served others have to point fingers at her?! And this Mrs. Gu, she looked completely like a vixen. She probably earned Gu Zheng’s favor by selling herself. Gu Zheng would kick her out sooner or later!","No matter how hopping mad she was, Qiao Rou still maintained her innocent image and said softly, “Mrs. Gu, may I know how I’ve offended you? Why are you humiliating me like this...”","“Offend? You’ve never offended me.”","Qiao Xi shook her finger. “It’s just that I’m a very righteous person. I innately hate third parties and illegitimate children, yet you’re both of those things. Sigh, I think I might have been spoiled by Brother Gu Zheng. He usually likes it when I speak the truth. He thinks I’m so naive and cute... So you won’t take issue with me, right? I didn’t say those words on purpose to target you, okay?”"]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125 - Cant Afford To Provoke","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou was about to go crazy. How could this woman be so hypocritical?!","She even said that she was not deliberately targeting her. Which part of her speech just now was not sarcastically mocking her? Did she think that she could not tell?","Her expression was ferocious as she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “You...!”","“Qiao Rou!","Gu Moling suddenly raised his voice to cut off the words Qiao Rou was about to say. They had already left a bad impression on the head of the family and Mrs. Gu. If they continued to offend Mrs. Gu, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Thinking of this, he grabbed Qiao Rou’s hand tightly. “Master, Madam, Rou Rou isn’t able to think clearly today. She’s not herself when she speaks. Please don’t blame her. I’ll bring her to see a doctor now. Master, I’ll take my leave first.”","As he spoke, he ignored Qiao Rou’s struggles and dragged her out of the door.","Qiao Xi watched this scene with interest and clicked her tongue twice. “This Gu Moling is quite smart. He knew how to interrupt Qiao Rou. If he leaves now, even though he won’t be able to give his family an explanation, it’s still better than completely offending the two of us.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Smart? You call this smart?”","How was it smart for a blind man to treat Qiao Rou as a treasure and abandon Qiao Xi? However, he had to thank Gu Moling for his stupidity since it was because of him that he had the chance to marry Qiao Xi.","At the thought of this, he lowered his eyebrows. “Mrs. Gu, you performed very well today. You’re finally acting like a madam.”","Qiao Xi curled her finger. “Since that’s the case, Brother Gu Zheng, do you want to give me a reward?”","For example, she wanted to kiss him and enjoy a delicious dinner. Of course, she was just thinking about it. This scumbag was not too willing to be touched by her. Unexpectedly, after she finished speaking, Gu Zheng actually nodded. “Okay.”","Qiao Xi: “?”","Had the sun risen from the west?","...","On the other side, Qiao Rou was stuffed into the car by Gu Moling.","Qiao Rou wiped her tears pitifully. Gu Moling was annoyed but he had to comfort her. “Don’t cry. That’s Mrs. Gu. She’s an existence we can’t provoke.”","His tone was a little harsh. Before entering the villa, he had clearly told Qiao Rou not to speak carelessly, but she did not take his words to heart at all. Not only did she take the initiative to speak, but she also offended Mrs. Gu. For the first time, Gu Moling felt that Qiao Rou’s character was rather annoying.","Qiao Rou realized that Gu Moling’s tone when he spoke to her was not quite right. She sniffled twice and quickly tried to salvage the situation. “Brother Moling, why does Mrs. Gu hate me so much? I spoke up for her own good in the beginning. Why did she treat me so...”","Gu Moling recounted what had happened today from beginning to end. Just as Qiao Rou had said, she did not do anything wrong. She was just too kind-hearted and wanted to remind the woman to leave as soon as possible. At that time, she did not know the woman’s identity. Most importantly, they did not know about the head of the family’s marriage.","Thinking of it like this, Qiao Rou had not done anything wrong at all. If the matter had not happened to Qiao Rou, then he would have been the target instead. When he thought of how the head of the family and Mrs. Gu had mentioned his fiancee... Could it be because of Qiao Xi? Could it be that Mrs. Gu knew Qiao Xi and wanted to suppress Qiao Rou to help Qiao Xi vent her anger?","That shouldn’t be the case. How could a vicious woman like Qiao Xi know Mrs. Gu? Moreover, he had never heard of Qiao Xi having any friends in Li City.","Qiao Rou carefully tugged at the corner of his shirt. “Brother Moling, do you think Mrs. Gu knows my sister? When she spoke, she kept talking about my sister and belittling me...” When this was mentioned, Qiao Rou felt angry, but she could not show it now. She could only suppress her anger and look at Gu Moling aggrievedly to get the man’s sympathy.","Gu Moling thought for a moment and shook his head. “I don’t think it’s possible. Qiao Xi would have no chance of getting to know Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Rou also thought so. How could her good-for-nothing sister know a big shot like Mrs. Gu? They were not on the same level at all.","Thinking about this, her eyes shifted. “Brother Ling, why do you think Mrs. Gu hates me so much? She also said that I’m an illegitimate daughter and that my mother is a mistress, but my mother and father are truly in love. How could she be a mistress? Boo-hoo... Is it wrong to love someone?”","Gu Moling’s eyes lit up. Normally, a woman who could catch the eye of the head of the family had to be from a noble family and was a proper eldest daughter. It was normal for the eldest daughter to look down on an illegitimate daughter. However, it was also as Qiao Rou had said. What was wrong with true love? Uncle Qiao and Aunt Xu were truly in love, so Aunt Xu should not be labeled as a mistress.. Qiao Rou should not be called an illegitimate daughter either."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126 - Invitation To The Competition","paragraphs":["“How about this? In a few days, I’ll talk to Uncle Qiao about his marriage with your mother and get them to quickly hold the wedding. This way, you’ll be the true Qiao family’s eldest daughter in the public’s eyes.”","Qiao Zhenguo had not mentioned his marriage with Xu Mei all these years because of Qiao Xi’s mother’s will. It stated that if Qiao Zhenguo got a new wife before Qiao Xi took over the company, he would lose his current position and all the shares he held in the company. Hence, Xu Mei had been by Qiao Zhenguo’s side for the past few years without a proper title. Even Qiao Rou’s identity was a gray area.","Although they had announced to the public that Qiao Rou was the Qiao family’s eldest daughter before Qiao Xi returned, it was only nominal.","Gu Moling thought that his suggestion was very good. Qiao Xi was a piece of trash now. Qiao Corporation was also in Qiao Zhenguo’s control, so it was time for him and Aunt Xu to hold a wedding.","Qiao Rou smiled and leaned weakly against Gu Moling’s chest as she said gratefully, “Brother Ling, you’re too good to me. I don’t even know how to repay you.”","Gu Moling stroked her head. “Silly, isn’t it my duty to be good to you?”","Qiao Rou smiled shyly. When she lowered her head, a trace of light flashed past her eyes. There would be plenty of chances in the future to get Gu Zheng, but the chance to make her mother an official wife was rare. Her father would definitely listen to Gu Moling’s suggestion. She would be able to take this opportunity to officially become the Qiao family’s eldest daughter and take away the inheritance left behind by Qiao Xi’s late mother. Just thinking about it made her feel carefree.","...","On the other side, Qiao Xi followed Gu Zheng upstairs. She was very curious about what gift Gu Zheng was talking about.","Gu Zheng was a little too much at times, but since he had called it a reward, it should not be too bad. His reward was definitely something that others could not even ask for and something that countless people would covet.","Hence, Qiao Xi was quite looking forward to it.","Gu Zheng withdrew a document from the table and casually handed it to Qiao Xi who was following behind him. “Take a look at this. It’s your reward.”","Qiao Xi excitedly opened the leather cover and took out the contents. After glancing at the document, she immediately choked. “Cough cough, are you joking?”","It was an invitation letter for an international real-time translation competition. This was an internal competition. All the participants were recommended by various big shots. The people recommended by the big shots represented the big shots’ reputation to a certain extent.","In the eyes of others, Qiao Xi came from the countryside. She probably did not even know English, so how could she participate in a competition for real-time translation like this.","“You don’t want to go?”","Qiao Xi’s expression was extremely complicated. “I don’t think this is a matter of whether I want to go or not.”","Although she was not afraid of trouble, she hated trouble. Once the news that she was participating in the competition got out, she could imagine how the public would mock her. It would definitely be unprecedented.","Gu Zheng tilted his head to look at her and chuckled. “What’s the problem, then? Strength? If even the champion of the previous competition is not qualified to participate, then there’s no need to hold this competition anymore.”","Qiao Xi’s heart thumped. Damn, how did this scumbag know that she participated in the previous competition and even became the champion?!","Unfortunately, before she could ask, Gu Zheng’s phone rang. He pulled open the balcony door of the study to take the call, leaving Qiao Xi alone in the study with a conflicted expression.","Even Third Brother and the rest did not know that she was the champion of the translation competition last year. How did Gu Zheng know? Last year, she participated in the real-time translation competition on a whim. She originally wanted to kill some time and just casually chose to participate. Unexpectedly, because she was too young, she was looked down upon by many people. They said that she was here to play and was not qualified to stand next to the other participants.","Qiao Xi’s temper flared up. Since they said that she did not have the ability, she wanted to show them what true ability was! After that, she accidentally became the champion and was also the most powerful dark horse in history. Many people still remembered last year’s real-time translation competition vividly.","Countless people used her attainment that time to motivate themselves. Even if they were looked down upon or mocked by countless people, true ability was everything! By relying on one’s ability, one could make all the haters shut up!","Qiao Xi scratched her head. She wondered if she had misheard earlier. Perhaps Gu Zheng was not saying that she was the champion of last year’s competition but brought it up to encourage her?","She thought that it had to be the case. After all, it was impossible for Gu Zheng to know that she had participated in the competition last year!"]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127 - Kowtow And Call Me Daddy","paragraphs":["On Monday, Qiao Xi went to class as usual. She did not expect to hear that Qiao Rou had applied for leave. Could it be because the impact from yesterday was too big?","Tsk tsk, this person’s psychological endurance was too poor.","“Teacher, the English test is in the afternoon. Don’t you want to say something to encourage us?” The class monitor of Class 3 looked at Qiao Xi with a helpless expression.","“Ah,” Qiao Xi said. Only then did she remember that there was an English test this afternoon. The English test this time would test the students’ level of translation on foreign literature. Normal universities would not have this test, but Li City University supported the students’ comprehensive development and fought for international connections. Hence, there were quite a number of strange tests.","Translating foreign languages was not difficult. The difficult part was how to express the contents of the sentence clearly. With a large number of unfamiliar terms, this would also increase the difficulty of translation. Many of the words were in local dialects too. If one did not have a detailed understanding of foreign cultures, it would be difficult to translate.","Li City University probably only had the exam at this time because they wanted to elect a suitable student to participate in the upcoming International Real-time Translation Competition.","When she thought of the invitation, Qiao Xi’s enthusiasm dissipated. She waved her hand lazily at the class monitor. “It’s fine, just take the test.”","The class monitor was even more speechless now. “Teacher, have you forgotten our bet with Wang Qing? Although we know that the possibility of winning is very low, we don’t want to just give up straight away.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Who told you that the possibility of winning is very low?” Did they think that she, the champion of the previous competition, carried the title just for show? The homework she usually assigned to these students was all the basics to help them prepare for the competition. They looked simple but were actually useful. Would they need to be afraid once a solid foundation was set?","The class monitor did not know that Qiao Xi had already taught them the topics important for the competition. When he heard Qiao Xi’s confident words, he wanted to say, ‘Master, you think too highly of us.’","Just as he was about to analyze the strengths of their class for Qiao Xi, a strange voice suddenly came from the door. “I’ll definitely get full marks in this test. Qiao Xi, just wait to lose. I can’t wait to see you kneel and kowtow to me!”","Qiao Xi turned around to look at the person. “What if we get full marks? You should kneel down and kowtow to me twice while calling me ‘Daddy’.”","Wang Qing was silent for a while, then suddenly laughed out loud. “Full marks? Hahahaha, Qiao Xi, is there something wrong with your head? Do you know that I’ve always ranked first place in English in the cohort? What right do a piece of trash like you have to snatch first place from me?”","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at her. “How would I know if I don’t try?”","Wang Qing stopped laughing and observed Qiao Xi seriously. Seeing that Qiao Xi’s expression was serious, she nodded and said, “Okay, but if you lose, you’ll kneel down in front of the university gate on behalf of your students and admit that you’re a piece of trash in front of everyone. You’ll admit that you can’t compare to Qiao Rou at all!”","The surrounding students could not stand it anymore. They knew Class 3’s ability too well. They were always last place in every examination. How could they compare to Wang Qing, who was first in her cohort? Was Qiao Xi asking to be humiliated?","“Why don’t we forget about it? It’s just an exam. There’s no need to make such a big deal out of it.”","“Yeah, why should she kneel? Whoever loses has to buy something for the other party. Girls like makeup and bags, so just buy some luxury goods.”","Wang Qing sneered. “Buy luxury goods? Have you forgotten how Qiao Xi gets her money? I don’t want her to buy me things with that kind of dirty money. Just compete according to the terms we set. Qiao Xi, do you dare to take on the challenge? Tell me.”","Qiao Xi nodded indifferently. “Of course. Didn’t I say that if you lose, you’ll kneel down and kowtow to me while calling me ‘Daddy’? Let’s make it clear in advance that we won’t go back on our words. I’m different from all of you. I’ll admit my loss, but all of you will keep playing tricks on me. If I lose, you’ll want to go back on your word. You’ll probably even make yourself appear pitiful and disgusting to get the ignorant audience to plead for you. Just thinking of that scene makes me feel annoyed.”","They could make a bet, but they had to make things clear beforehand. They could not go back on their words!","Wang Qing was extremely confident in her own strength, so she agreed to Qiao Xi’s request without the slightest hesitation.","The class monitor was dumbfounded when he saw the situation developing into this. Was their test also going to be a gamble on their teacher’s dignity? Wasn’t this too much pressure?","He was extremely anxious, but Qiao Xi, the person involved, was extremely relaxed. She even patted his shoulder and said to him, “It’s okay, just take the test normally. Don’t be nervous.”","The class monitor: “...”","‘It would be strange if I weren’t nervous!’"]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128 - Sister Has Good English","paragraphs":["Wang Qing only dared to say that she would take first place because Qiao Rou would not be participating in the English test this time.","In the past, Qiao Rou always came in first while Wang Qing came in second.","At the Academic Affairs Bureau, Qiao Rou was applying for leave with Xu Mei. The dean said with a smile, “It’s alright if you don’t take the test this one time. You’ve always been doing very well. It’s just a pity that you won’t be able to take it due to your health issues. The winner this time will be recommended for the International Real-time Translation Competition.”","Qiao Rou’s face froze for a moment, and she sighed. “I can’t help it. It’s my fault that my body is too weak.” She only chose to take leave and not participate in the test because she heard that the winner this time would be selected to go for the competition. In the past, the English tests were always conducted by others, so she could maintain her rank of first place. However, due to the selection for the competition, the test this time would be very strict. She would not have a chance to cheat, so she gave up on the idea and pretended to be sick.","However...","She smiled lightly. “Even though I can’t take the test, my sister should be able to. Do you remember Qiao Xi?”","The dean nodded. “Of course. She’s Teacher Qiao from the fashion design department. I remember that she became a special teacher in the university at a young age. It’s just that she appears and disappears unpredictably in the university and doesn’t have much time to interact with others.”","Qiao Rou said, “Yes, my sister’s results are very good. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have become a teacher in the university even though we’re the same age. If there are no outstanding students from the test this time around, you can consider recommending my sister, Dean. She’s so outstanding, so she’ll definitely be able to bring back honor for the university during the international competition.”","The dean’s eyes lit up. That was right! He was worried about what to do since Qiao Rou was applying for leave and would not be going to the international competition. Qiao Xi and Qiao Rou were about the same age. If Qiao Xi could participate in the competition...","Seeing that the dean was interested, Qiao Rou added, “But we can’t give her special treatment just because she’s a teacher. Why don’t we do this instead? You can have her take the test...”","The dean hesitated for a moment. “I have to discuss this with Teacher Qiao Xi and see if she’s willing.” Teachers were different from students. If Qiao Xi did not agree, he could not force her to agree.","After saying that, he thought of something else. “However, I just heard that Qiao Xi’s students want to compete with Wang Qing on the English test. The stakes are quite high. Something about kneeling, kowtowing, and calling out ‘Daddy’. Sigh, this is why the university doesn’t want to hire teachers who are too young. They’re rash and don’t consider the consequences when they do things.”","“What?!”","Xu Mei widened her eyes in shock. “You’re saying that b*tch Qiao Xi wants to compete with Wang Qing in English?!”","The dean had a good impression of Xu Mei and thought that she was an elegant noblewoman. However, her yell surprised him. He looked at Xu Mei in a daze, not knowing how to react. Was... she really a noblewoman? How was she noble? She was simply like a tigress who wanted to eat someone.","He was stunned by Xu Mei’s sudden change. He stammered, “Y-Yes, I think it’s true that they’re competing on the English test.”","“That piece of trash! It’s fine that she wants to compete with others, but the penalty if she loses is that she’ll have to kowtow. If that happens, won’t it be embarrassing for our Qiao family? The Qiao family has already been implicated by her. This b*tch!” Xu Mei gnashed her teeth in anger. “If I had known she was so troublesome, I would’ve married her off long ago. Things wouldn’t have turned out this way!”","The dean: “...”","What was going on? Didn’t Qiao Rou just say that Teacher Qiao Xi’s results were good? Why was Madam Xu talking about Qiao Xi like she was a good-for-nothing? Who was right here?","The dean opened his mouth and was about to say something to ease the atmosphere when he heard Xu Mei say sinisterly, “Why isn’t this b*tch dead yet? Why is she always getting in the way? Doesn’t she feel guilty that the Qiao family has been implicated by her? She even has the cheek to swagger to university. If I were her, I would’ve killed myself to apologize!”","Xu Mei was extremely irritable today. When she thought about how Qiao Rou’s visit to Longwan Residential was ruined by Qiao Xi, she wished for nothing more than to skin Qiao Xi alive. If it were not for Qiao Xi, Qiao Rou would be the Qiao family’s true eldest daughter. She would not be called an illegitimate daughter by others, much less offend Mrs. Gu!","She pushed all the blame to Qiao Xi.","Qiao Rou knew that her mother was angry, but she did not expect her to suddenly flare up. Seeing that the dean’s expression was not good, she quickly pulled Xu Mei’s arm. “Mom, I know you’re worried about my sister.”"]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129 - Do You Want To Take The Test Too?","paragraphs":["She raised her voice slightly. “However, there are many things about Sister that we don’t know. Just like how we thought that she would lead a miserable life after leaving the Qiao family and would quickly be unable to take it anymore and come back to look for us. Not only did Sister not come back in the end but she even found a very rich man...”","After she finished speaking, she realized that this did not seem to be appropriate to talk about, so she quickly continued, “So don’t be so strict with Sister. Sister has been hiding her talents well and will definitely achieve good results in this examination. Give her a chance and let her compete with Qing Qing, alright?”","Xu Mei instantly calmed down. She knew that she had lost her composure just now. What she said did not match Qiao Rou’s words. Fortunately, Rou Rou was smart and quick-witted. She was able to salvage the situation instantly.","“That’s right. I was so worried about Qiao Xi losing the competition that I forgot it’s impossible for her to lose with her strength.” Xu Mei looked at the dean with an embarrassed expression. “Dean, you can understand, right? As parents, we always think of worst-case scenarios. We’re afraid that our child will be hurt in the slightest. I only spoke nonsense because I was too worried about Qiao Xi. I hope you don’t mind.”","Although the dean found it strange, he also knew that rich people had a lot of messy situations to deal with. He did not want to get involved, so he nodded perfunctorily. “Yes, yes, yes, I understand.”","Qiao Rou shifted her eyes and said to Xu Mei in a low voice, “Mom, don’t worry about my sister. I’m good friends with Wang Qing. If my sister really loses the bet, I’ll tell Wang Qing to let the matter go. So don’t worry, my sister won’t really kneel down and apologize. Of course, I’m talking about the possibility of her losing. If my sister really loses the bet, that’s a good thing too. My sister is too arrogant. It’ll be good for her to lose the bet and learn a lesson. That way, she’ll know that there’s always someone better than her.”","Xu Mei patted Qiao Rou’s hand. “Rou Rou, you’re so thoughtful.”","Of course, even though she agreed, she still felt that Qiao Xi was an idiot looking for trouble. She was really a good-for-nothing who could only bring shame to the Qiao family!","The dean sent the two of them away with a complicated expression. Before he left, he could even hear Xu Mei say to Qiao Rou, “After this matter is over, have Qiao Xi leave Li City University. Is someone like her worthy of teaching at Li City University? Don’t lead her astray! That useless piece of trash will only bring shame to the Qiao family.”","The dean was speechless. For the first time, he wondered if there was something wrong with the mother and daughter’s brains. Qiao Xi was a teacher specially recruited by their university. She obviously had the ability, so how could she not be qualified to teach at Li City University? Moreover, Class 3, which was the class she taught, had been very obedient recently. Many teachers gave him feedback, saying that the students in Class 3 were a lot more responsive now. They listened well in class and even took the initiative to ask them questions.","This obviously showed that Qiao Xi was absolutely skilled in teaching students.","...","When Qiao Xi heard from the dean, she was quite surprised. She had always been carefree in the university, and the dean had always turned a blind eye to her. She did not know why he called her over this time.","After hearing the dean’s question, Qiao Xi touched her chin. “So, it was my younger sister who told you that my English results are very good and suggested that I take the test as well?”","The dean nodded. Of course, after the incident with Qiao Rou and Xu Mei, he did not believe what the two of them said anymore.","“Teacher Qiao, don’t be too nervous. It’s okay if you don’t agree. I’m just casually asking.”","“It’s fine. It’s just a test anyway. Maybe if they know that I’m taking the test, the students in my class can relax. Otherwise, they’ll all have tense expressions as though the sky is collapsing.”","The dean did not expect Qiao Xi to really agree. He confirmed in disbelief, asking, “Teacher Qiao, have you thought it through? You really want to take the test?” He was just short of telling Qiao Xi that her younger sister and stepmother wanted to dig a hole for her. He wanted to warn her not to fall for their tricks.","Qiao Xi thought it was funny and laughed out loud. “Yes, I’ve thought it through. Dean, you can go ahead and make the arrangements. I’ll be taking the test this afternoon.”","Qiao Rou had taken the initiative to make a move on her. There was no reason why she should not play along.","...","The test began at two in the afternoon and ended at four.","Qiao Xi glanced at the paper and finished it as soon as possible. She glanced at the time and noticed that there was still over an hour left. She did not want to continue wasting time here, so she handed in the paper in advance.","The students in the same venue as her instantly broke into an uproar."]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130 - She Doesnt Dare To Come, Does She?","paragraphs":["As a teacher, it was already shocking enough for Qiao Xi to take the test with the students, yet she even handed in her paper so soon after the test began? Could it be that she was here to put on a show?","When some of them heard about the bet between Qiao Xi and Wang Qing, they all felt that Qiao Xi was under too much pressure and was mentally unstable. Qiao Xi did not know what the students in the hall were talking about behind her back. After she left the hall, she went straight to the materials room of Li City University. Previously, Gu Zheng had agreed to let her read the materials, but she never had the time. Now that she was finally free, she would go there.","She mainly wanted to look up information from 20 years ago, but she did not expect there to be zero information from 20 years...","How strange. Were that person and organization so mysterious? They could even erase such confidential information? Qiao Xi looked at the empty file box and pondered for a moment before turning to leave.","The news that she had gone to the materials room was immediately relayed to Gu Zheng. He looked at the news on his phone and his handsome face darkened slightly. Why was Qiao Xi looking up information from 20 years ago?","...","The next morning, Qiao Xi walked into the classroom while holding the breakfast the chef had handed her before he left.","Before she stepped into the classroom, she heard Wang Qing’s arrogant laughter. “Hahaha, where’s Qiao Xi? Why isn’t she here yet? She’s too embarrassed to come, right?”","After the test yesterday, she found out that Qiao Xi had taken the test as well and even handed in her paper before time was up. This was truly too delightful. Even though it would feel good to win a bet with Qiao Xi’s students, how could it be as satisfying as stepping on Qiao Xi’s toes?","“Qing Qing, don’t be like this. My sister must be quite sad now. Let’s leave first, okay?” This voice belonged to Qiao Rou, that two-faced b*tch.","“Yeah, she really should be sad. She must have had a hard time pretending, right? I don’t know who gave her the confidence to dare take the test. Could it be that she didn’t know the university had adjusted the difficulty of the test for the sake of the international competition this time? A piece of trash like Qiao Xi probably can’t even understand the questions, right?”","Qiao Rou sighed and looked troubled. “Qing Qing, I know that my sister is bound to lose this time, but can you not have her kneel down to you on my account? She’s my sister, after all...”","Wang Qing was just about to ask why, but before she could say anything, she saw Qiao Xi lazily leaning against the door and occasionally taking a bite of the sandwich in her hand. Her posture was very leisurely. She did not look nervous at all.","Wang Qing felt that something was wrong, but when she thought about it carefully, Qiao Xi was probably forcing herself. She wanted to save her dignity. The test this time was very difficult, and there were some things that even she did not know. After the test ended, she even felt that there was not enough time.","Qiao Xi must have failed to finish the paper before handing it in. She probably gave up after glancing at it. When Wang Qing thought about it, she laughed mockingly. “Oh, you still dare to come? I thought you ran away.”","Qiao Xi did not even look at her as she tossed the sandwich bag into the trash can. She clapped her hands and walked into the classroom. A clever student stood up to give up her seat.","Qiao Rou walked over with a gentle smile. “Sister, I took leave yesterday and didn’t come to university. I missed the test and didn’t stop you from competing with Qing Qing in time. The results are out now... It’s okay, it doesn’t matter whether you win or lose. I’ll always support you.”","The students watching all thought that Qiao Rou was the best sister in the world.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Didn’t you know about the competition? Wasn’t it all thanks to you that I was able to take the test?”","Qiao Rou’s expression froze. How did Qiao Xi know... Could it be that the dean had let it slip? However, it did not matter. She just had to deny it. After all, her classmates would believe her.","Thinking about this, Qiao Rou’s expression returned to normal. She bit her lip and felt a little aggrieved. “Sister, how can you say that? How would I have pushed you into a fire pit? I admit that I did tell the dean that you’re the same age as me and can try to take the test, but it was just a recommendation. If you hadn’t overestimated yourself and agreed, my recommendation would have been useless.","“I know that you didn’t do well in the test this time and you’re upset, but you can’t vent your anger out on me. I’ve always supported your decision. And because Qing Qing and I are good friends, I told her that she shouldn’t ask you to kneel and apologize even if you lost...”","Wang Qing quickly said, “Wait, I didn’t agree to that.”","After she finished speaking, she turned to look at Qiao Xi. “You were the one who said that we have to admit our loss. You can’t go back on your word because of Qiao Rou. Let me tell you, if you lose, you have to kneel and apologize. Do you hear me?!”"]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131 - Results Are Out","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi yawned and lazily leaned against the chair. “So what you’re saying is that no matter who loses, we can’t look for Qiao Rou and plead with her to intercede?”","Wang Qing nodded heavily. “Yes!”","Qiao Xi lightly tapped the table with her fingers, then raised her head to look at Qiao Rou. “My good younger sister, did you hear that? You can’t plead on my behalf, so don’t even think about being a saint today.”","Qiao Rou bit her lip and was about to cry. Unfortunately, before anyone could speak up for her, someone shouted from outside, “The results are out! The results are out!”","A representative of an unknown class was holding his phone and shouting, “Come, come, come. Students, quickly log into the university’s website to check your results. I heard that the scores for this year’s test are very different. The good ones are especially good, while the bad ones consist of a variety of grades. There are all kinds of scores, and there are even those who got single digits.”","Wang Qing laughed. “Qiao Xi is probably one of those who got a single digit. How embarrassing.”","With that, she logged into Li City University’s website, entered her student number, and began checking her results. The test this time was indeed very difficult. Those who had good English and some understanding of translation would naturally get good grades. Those who did not know how to translate would probably not even be able to understand the terms.","Hence, there were some who scored above 90 and others who scored about 20. Their scores were not even as high as their age, making them look very pitiful.","Wang Qing saw her score. 98.","The class representative stood on tiptoes to look at the score displayed on her phone screen with an envious look. “F*ck, Wang Qing, you actually got 98 marks? Oh my God, you’re only two marks away from getting full marks!”","Wang Qing revealed a proud smile. “Yes, it has exceeded my usual results. I didn’t expect to obtain such a result either.” After she finished speaking, she glanced sideways at Qiao Xi, who was playing with her phone at the side. She said sarcastically, “I’m guessing you don’t dare to check your results, right? Who was the one who said that one must accept one’s loss again? How did you get slapped in the face so quickly after saying those words?”","The students of Class 3 looked at Wang Qing angrily.","They only found out later that Qiao Xi had also taken part in the English test. Although they did not understand why Qiao Xi had to take the test as a teacher, it did not affect their desire to protect Qiao Xi.","“We don’t know the results yet. Wang Qing, don’t be too arrogant!”","“Back then, you made a bet to compare grades with us. Our teacher joined in midway. As long as one of us got a better score than you, you’ll still be the loser!”","“Better score than me?” Wang Qing laughed out loud. “I’d like to see who has better results than me. Could it be that you scored 99 out of 100? Do you have that ability?”","The students of Class 3 were livid. Although they did not want to admit it, they had to acknowledge that Wang Qing was right. Their classmates were all checking their results. Although everyone had seen improvements in their results, no one did better than Wang Qing.","Someone said bitterly, “I heard that one person scored 100 marks in this test.” They were thinking that if only this person was in their class, Wang Qing would not be so arrogant anymore.","Wang Qing also knew that there was someone who scored 100 marks in this test. It was also because of this person that she did not get first place. Who was this person who got 100 marks?","“I don’t know who this person is. We can’t find any information about this person on the student administration system, but they’re really awesome! The questions were so difficult this time, yet they still got 100 marks.”","“Why didn’t I know that our university has such gods?”","“Ah! Students, what are you guys doing? Hurry up and find the Almighty’s name. In the future when there’s another English test, I’ll worship the Almighty. Maybe I’ll be able to score as well next time.”","Their words were filled with admiration for the god who scored 100. Wang Qing gritted her teeth angrily. A bunch of fence-sitters. They were just praising her for doing well earlier, but now, they were praising the person who scored a higher mark!","In order to attract their attention, Wang Qing walked to Qiao Xi’s side and slammed the table with all her might. “I’m asking you a question. Didn’t you hear me? Are your results out? If they are, quickly fulfill the bet.”","Qiao Xi crossed her legs and tossed her phone onto the table. “I don’t know.”","Wang Qing thought that Qiao Xi was stalling for time, but she forgot that Qiao Xi was a teacher and not a student. The administration system could not check her results.","Someone smacked their forehead. “Right, Qiao Xi can’t check her results!”"]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132 - The Only One Who Got Full Marks","paragraphs":["Right at this moment, someone shouted from outside the door, “She’s out, she’s out! Qiao Xi’s results are out.”","A boy ran over with a test paper in hand. His face was red from excitement. “Guess what Qiao Xi got?!”","“How many marks could she get? It can’t be a single digit, right?” Wang Qing took a few steps forward, grabbed the paper from the boy’s hand, and lowered her head to take a look. Cold sweat instantly appeared on her forehead.","How could this be?! Didn’t Qiao Xi not know English? Wasn’t she a good-for-nothing? How could she have such good results?!","The surrounding people were waiting for Wang Qing to speak. They did not expect that she would actually hold onto the test paper and not let go. How many marks did Qiao Xi get? The students could not suppress their eagerness to take the test paper from her. Someone finally snatched the paper from Wang Qing’s hand boldly and looked down. Her expression was similar to Wang Qing’s as if she had seen a ghost.","The other students were even more curious now, but before they could ask, they saw Wang Qing shout excitedly, “One point! Qiao Xi scored one point! Hahahaha, admit your defeat and quickly kneel down!”","When Qiao Rou saw Wang Qing’s expression just now, she thought that something big had happened. Now that she heard Wang Qing say that Qiao Xi had only scored one point, she silently heaved a sigh of relief. She did not even look at the test paper and said to Qiao Xi gently and weakly, “Sister, I wanted to help you resolve your bet with Wang Qing, but you were too stubborn and refused to let me interfere. What should I do now?”","Qiao Xi casually tossed her phone in a carefree manner. “So what do you want? You want me to kneel before Wang Qing now, right?”","Qiao Rou’s eyes flashed. “After all, you agreed to the bet. I wanted to interfere, but you didn’t give me the chance. Now that things have come to this, I can’t help you even if I wanted to. After all, you have to admit defeat. This is the most basic rule in life, right? We have to be honest, don’t we?”","A student who did not know the situation tried to persuade Qiao Rou. “Qiao Rou, you’ve done enough. Qiao Xi doesn’t appreciate your efforts. Don’t be sad because of her. It’s not worth it.”","“That’s right. Everyone has to be responsible for their own actions. Since you know that you’re a good-for-nothing, you shouldn’t have made a bet with others. In the end, you lost and don’t want to fulfill the bet. You’re going back on your word. How is such a person worthy to be a teacher in our university?”","“Qiao Xi, if you don’t fulfill the bet today, I’ll definitely report you to the chancellor. I’ll say that you’re unqualified and not worthy to be our teacher!”","Qiao Xi sighed. She only joined Li City University as a substitute teacher because she could not stand Zhou Guanjin’s dawdling. Why were these people always threatening her with reports and complaints?","Qiao Rou looked at the students who voiced out with a look of gratitude, then she frowned and said with a troubled expression, “Sister, now that things have come to this, you should quickly fulfill the bet. Since there aren’t many people at the university gate now, quickly kneel down and apologize. Otherwise, when there are more people at the university gate, you’ll be even more embarrassed.”","Wang Qing rubbed her hands excitedly. She could not wait to see Qiao Xi make a fool of herself. When she thought about how Qiao Xi was about to kneel before her, she was so excited that her entire body trembled. “You lost the bet today, so you have to kneel and apologize to me at the university gate. Qiao Xi, you won’t back down, will you? If I had lost today, I’d definitely kneel at the university gate without saying anything. I wouldn’t be such a sore loser like you.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Oh? Is that so?”","Not everyone in the university knew about the bet between the two of them. Later on, the students who were there to watch the show realized that there was a bet between them. The person with the lower score would have to kneel to the person with the higher score.","Now that Wang Qing’s score was obviously higher, Qiao Xi had to kneel at the university gate to apologize.","Wang Qing was proud of herself. “Qiao Xi, stop wasting time. You’ve talked so much. You won’t run away at the last minute, right?”","Qiao Rou also said, “Sister, we have to be honest. You have to keep your promise to Qing Qing. Our Qiao family has never been sore losers.”","“No... Wait a minute, what are you guys talking about?” The student who was looking at the paper earlier finally came back to her senses. She pointed at the score on the paper and said, “Teacher Qiao Xi clearly scored 100 marks. She scored two more marks than Wang Qing. She’s the only one who scored full marks on our English test!”","The entire classroom seemed to fall silent.","Qiao Rou’s pupils dilated with shock. That student’s words kept repeating in her ears like a recorder. 100 marks... The only perfect score... Qiao Xi..."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133 - Like A Standard Examination Answer","paragraphs":["Wang Qing subconsciously retorted, “Impossible. How could that piece of trash, Qiao Xi, get full marks? You must have seen it wrongly. It isn’t 100 marks, it’s one!”","The student handed the paper to the person next to her. “I’m not wrong. It’s clearly 100 marks. If you don’t believe me, look at it yourself.”","At this moment, Qiao Rou also came back to her senses and said tentatively, “Sister, you scored 100 marks? Don’t tell me you cheated? I remember that in the countryside, schools don’t really care about English. Also, you’ve never been overseas, so how could you know how to translate English?”","Wang Qing seemed to have found an excuse and echoed loudly, “That’s right, that must be it! Qiao Xi is a useless woman who came from the countryside. How could she possibly know how to translate?!”","Qiao Rou took a deep breath as if she found it hard to take. She apologized to everyone with a pale face. “I’m sorry, everyone. I really didn’t expect my sister to do this. Cheating is such a bad habit. My sister can’t be counted as the winner of this bet. The winner is still Wang Qing.”","After she finished speaking, she looked at Qiao Xi with a sorrowful expression as if she had just made a tough decision.","Qiao Xi raised her brows. These two are just amazing, weren’t they? They were trying to accuse her of cheating now.","However... Cheating? They were really brainless.","Qiao Xi knocked on the table and reminded them, “You’re saying that I cheated? I want to ask if you’ve lost your memory? I’m the only one in the entire university who scored full marks. Whose test paper did I copy, then?”","Wang Qing’s face flushed. “You must have copied from here and there to get full marks!”","“Wang Qing, don’t spout nonsense.”","Someone could not stand it anymore and stood out to uphold justice. “Translating foreign languages is very tough and subjective. If Qiao Xi had really copied others’ answers, the teachers grading the papers would’ve discovered it even without you saying anything.”","Everyone had different translation habits. It was understandable for someone to copy one person’s work, but it was unreasonable to say that someone copied multiple people’s work. This was because it was equivalent to sewing a few pieces of cloth of different colors together and saying that they were the same color.","They were all university students, so they had their own judgments about whether the writing and style of the paper were the same as others. A few students took Qiao Xi’s paper and looked at it, saying, “She really scored full marks. Moreover, the words used here are so witty. I never thought that this sentence could be translated in such a way!”","“Damn, the Almighty is the Almighty. I think this could be the standard examination answer.”","“I don’t know why, but I think the standard answers given by the university teachers might not be as good as Qiao Xi’s translation. Look at her sentence composition. It perfectly expresses what the author originally wanted to say. This is something that ordinary translators can’t do.”","A group of students who were thirsty for knowledge immediately gathered around Qiao Xi’s paper. They analyzed it while sighing at the gap between her and them.","After sighing, they looked up at Wang Qing. “The Almighty is different from certain people. The Almighty speaks with her ability, unlike some who claim that the Almighty cheated upon realizing she got a better result.”","“Cheating? With the standard of this paper, unless the original author was around to help Qiao Xi cheat, I can’t imagine any other student in our university who can express the author’s intentions so accurately and sharply.”","“Yeah. Copying? Hahaha! What right do we have to ask Qiao Xi to copy our answers? Our translation skills are so shoddy!”","“Anyone who has read Qiao Xi’s paper wouldn’t say that she cheated. People who say that might have had their brains eaten by zombies.”","Wang Qing’s face was livid. Unwillingness, anger, and other emotions surged in her heart.","Qiao Rou bit her lip. She was unwilling to give up as well. The opportunity to make Qiao Xi lose her reputation was right before her eyes, yet she could only watch as the opportunity slipped away. How could she be willing?!","However, she knew that it would not end well if they continued arguing. This group of students thought that Qiao Xi’s results were real, and they refused to admit that she cheated. If Qiao Rou confronted the students, she would only create trouble for herself and even have the students think that she was acting abnormally.","Hence, she could only pretend to be magnanimous and pull Wang Qing’s arm. “Qing Qing, let’s go. Sister scored full marks this time. I’m going home to tell Dad and Mom. They’ll definitely be very happy to hear about it.”","Wang Qing originally wanted to say something, but when she heard Qiao Rou’s words, she remembered that she had a bet with Qiao Xi. Now that Qiao Xi had scored 100 marks, wouldn’t she be the one who had to kneel?","She did not want to kneel in front of this b*tch!"]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134 - Sister, You Have Double Standards","paragraphs":["Wang Qing stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, then turned to Qiao Rou and said, “Rou Rou is right. Let’s go.”","“Wait—”","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “The two of you are leaving just like that? Have you forgotten something?”","Wang Qing’s back stiffened.","Qiao Xi reminded her indifferently, “The loser has to kneel at the university gate and apologize. Right, you have to call me ‘Daddy’ too. Earlier, you thought that I was the one who lost, so you kept nagging me to hurry up. You even said that if you were the loser, you’d definitely not dawdle and immediately admit defeat. Now, your chance to admit defeat has arrived.”","Wang Qing was furious. What right did this b*tch have to ask her to kneel?!","Qiao Rou’s eyes shifted. Actually, the person who needed to kneel was Wang Qing, and it had nothing to do with her. However, she did not want Qiao Xi to be too proud of herself. She could imagine that if news of Wang Qing kneeling down got out, Qiao Xi’s reputation would rise greatly.","She would not give Qiao Xi any chance to make a move.","At the thought of this, she gently went forward as if she was a good sister who was thinking for her sister’s sake. She said, “Sister, Qing Qing was just joking with you. She wouldn’t have really asked you to kneel at the university gate. Can you not be so overbearing? You won the bet and scored full marks. Don’t be calculative with Qing Qing, okay?”","Many boys who had been brainwashed by Qiao Rou also thought that Qiao Rou’s words made sense. Qiao Xi was already the top student in the university and had embarrassed Wang Qing. If she forced Wang Qing to kneel at the university gate, it would be too cold-blooded.","As the saying went, ‘Where it’s possible to forgive, one should forgive.’ Qiao Xi should take a step back and not force Wang Qing to kneel at the university gate.","Hearing Qiao Rou’s words, Qiao Xi sneered. “Sister, are you suffering from dementia at such a young age? Have you forgotten what you said just now when Wang Qing thought she won the bet?","“You kept saying that someone who lost has to admit defeat and kneel. You even said that honesty and keeping a promise are the most basic principles in life. Sister, why are you so biased? I had to abide by the rules when you thought I lost, but now that Wang Qing is the one who lost, you want me to be magnanimous and let her off?","“Sister, didn’t I warn you? This is my bet with Wang Qing. Don’t be a hypocrite and interfere. Scram as far away as you can.”","Qiao Rou’s expression changed drastically.","The surrounding students finally realized that Qiao Rou’s words were different from what she had just said.","“What’s wrong with Qiao Rou? When her sister lost, she kept asking Qiao Xi to kneel at the university gate. Now that Wang Qing is the one who lost, she wants her sister to be magnanimous and let Wang Qing off?”","“F*ck, did I discover something I shouldn’t have? Qiao Rou keeps saying that she likes her sister the most. She always said she believed in Qiao Xi and supported her, but in truth, Qiao Rou is forcing her sister to a dead end?”","“So Qiao Rou is jealous, right? I knew it! How could there be such an innocent and cute sister in the world? After Qiao Xi returned, she got back her position as the Qiao family’s eldest daughter. Even so, Qiao Rou disregarded everything and treated Qiao Xi well... Now that I think about it, this is all just on the surface! They’re plastic sisters! Qiao Rou treats Qiao Xi well in front of others, but behind everyone’s back, she can’t wait for Qiao Xi to humiliate herself!”","“She’s doomed. After thinking about it carefully, I’m getting goosebumps.”","The surrounding students’ discussion seemed to pierce through her eardrums. Qiao Rou’s expression changed again and again. Her tears came streaming down as she cried miserably. “I didn’t... Sister, don’t misunderstand me. I just think that since you’re a teacher, forcing the student to apologize might affect your reputation... I really didn’t mean to speak up for Qing Qing. I was just thinking about you.”","She asked Qiao Xi to give up the bet because she was thinking about it from Qiao Xi’s perspective!","Her retort was quite reasonable. All the students who had just spoken shut their mouths, but they also felt that something was wrong. They felt that Qiao Rou’s words did not seem to be the truth...","“What are you guys doing?”","At this moment, an angry roar broke the silence in the classroom.","Old Madam Qiao was standing outside the door with her walking cane. Her turbid gaze swept across everyone in the classroom as she said in a low voice, “Why are you surrounding our Rou Rou?!”","Qiao Rou sobbed aggrievedly. “Grandma... Boo-hoo, why are you here?”","Old Madam Qiao’s heart ached. “Don’t cry. You’re the most obedient girl, so don’t cry.”","Her gaze swept around before finally landing on Qiao Xi as she said in disgust, “Damn it, didn’t I warn you not to bully your sister?!”"]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135 - Cut Off Your Allowance","paragraphs":["“It’s one thing that you bully your sister at home, but now, you even dare to bully your sister in front of so many people in the university. You b*tch! You’re a jinx! How did such a scourge like you appear in our Qiao family?!”","Qiao Xi moved her eyes and stared at the old madam faintly.","The surrounding students were dumbfounded. Was this old woman Qiao Rou’s grandmother? Why was she like a shrew? Her words were so harsh.","Qiao Rou was still sobbing aggrievedly. “Grandma, don’t be angry. It was all my fault. Sister made a bet with Qing Qing. Since Sister won, she’s forcing Qing Qing to kneel down to her. However, I think it won’t do Sister any good if she does that. I wanted to persuade Sister to be more magnanimous and not be calculative with Qing Qing. Then, Sister got a little angry...”","After finding out the truth, Old Madam Qiao’s face turned red with anger. Her wrinkled face was filled with anger as she slammed her walking cane with all her might. “Qiao Xi, why aren’t you quickly getting over here to apologize to Rou Rou?! She’s so kind and thinks for your sake all the time, yet you didn’t listen to her and even made her cry! Quickly get over here! Otherwise, don’t blame me for not acknowledging you as my granddaughter!”","The student next to her subconsciously explained, “Grandma, have you made a mistake? Qiao Rou is a two-faced woman and doesn’t want Wang Qing to fulfill the bet. She says she’s doing this for Qiao Xi’s sake, but everything she does is harmful to Qiao Xi.”","“What?! What’s wrong with you? Why are you talking bad about my Rou Rou?!” Old Madam Qiao was instantly angry. “Our Rou Rou is the most gentle and kind-hearted. What do you mean two-faced? Everything is Qiao Xi’s fault! What has it got to do with our Rou Rou?! And you, who are you? You even dare to talk to me?”","Qiao Zhenguo was originally from a rural family. Later on, Qiao Xi’s mother took a liking to him. He then relied on Qiao Xi’s mother to gradually leave the countryside. He also brought Old Madam Qiao to the city to let her enjoy life.","However, after so many years, Old Madam Qiao’s boorish habits had not changed. She would scold people every now and then, even feeling superior because of her identity. She looked down on everyone.","When she heard someone talking bad about Qiao Rou, she exploded and started scolding that student.","The student’s face turned red from anger, but his upbringing made him unable to scold an old lady. He could only say, “Qiao Xi got such good results. Not only is Qiao Rou not happy for her but she also said that she cheated... Is this what a good sister should do?”","“Cheating? You b*tch, you actually dare to cheat?! Why don’t you just scram?! I shouldn’t have brought you back from the countryside back then. How good would it have been if I had let you fend for yourself in the countryside?! Since you came here, you’ve only brought shame to our Qiao family. You even dare to cheat now! You’re really embarrassing!” Old Madam Qiao did not even finish listening and directly cursed at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Rou jumped in shock and quickly stopped her. “Grandma!”","Her grandmother was not very intelligent, but no matter what happened, she would always protect her. Qiao Rou originally thought that this was good, but to scold Qiao Xi in front of so many students... Did this old lady have a brain? Did she know how much trouble she would cause by doing this?!","As expected, one of the students’ expressions darkened. “What the heck is this? Is this the grandmother of a rich family? She doesn’t even finish listening to others before beginning to curse. She’s even cursing so harshly. If I were to have such a grandmother who can’t differentiate right from wrong, I’d be angered to death.”","“This old lady is too biased. I don’t even dare to imagine what Qiao Xi’s life in the Qiao family is like. Qiao Rou pretended to like her sister very much, but she secretly urged the Qiao family to curse and suppress Qiao Xi. Listen to what they’re saying. They keep calling Qiao Xi a little b*tch and a jinx. How many times have they cursed at her?”","“Oh my God, it’s too scary. Is this what it means to be from a rich family? This is the first time I’m glad that I’m poor. Otherwise... Living in such a family would cause me to be depressed, right?”","Unfortunately, their words did not affect Old Madam Qiao at all. Madam Qiao was used to being high and mighty all these years. She did not take these ordinary students’ words seriously at all.","Old Madam Qiao had a proud expression. “Rou Rou, let’s go. Don’t pay attention to this piece of trash who can only be jealous of others!” After she finished speaking, she even shot a warning glance at Qiao Xi. “And you, you little sl*t. Don’t create trouble for me in the future. If you ever see Rou Rou in university, stay far away from her. Otherwise, I’ll cut off your allowance and have you live a life worse than pigs and dogs!”"]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136 - Kneel Down","paragraphs":["At this point, Qiao Rou knew that she could not stop her grandmother, so she could only push the blame to Qiao Xi. “I’m sorry, everyone. My grandmother might be too angry, so her words are a little harsh. Actually, there’s a reason for all of this. My sister doesn’t really respect my grandmother at home and even curses at her every now and then. She always asks why my grandmother hasn’t died yet, so my grandmother gets very angry when she sees her...”","In the past, her classmates might have believed her words but only a few did now.","Perhaps there were a few students who thought that Qiao Rou was very kind, but this did not make them think that Old Madam Qiao was also kind. Their impression of Old Madam Qiao was that she was a very vicious old woman.","Qiao Rou did not know that this farce had caused her image as a kind and gentle person to crumble. It was destroyed with just a light touch.","...","After Old Madam Qiao and Qiao Rou left, the students in the class were still a little indignant. They could not figure out how such a grandmother could exist. She spoke nasty words and indiscriminately thought that Qiao Xi was in the wrong.","“Qiao Xi, don’t you want to explain it to her?” A student could not help but complain. “You can’t keep silent like this. At the very least, you have to tell the truth to your family.”","Qiao Xi smiled and shook her head. “There’s nothing to explain. I’m already used to it.”","This sentence made all the students present fall silent. They were already so angry after seeing it once, but what about Qiao Xi? The people who were scolding her were her blood relatives. Every word they said was like a knife that stabbed into her heart. How many times did she go through that torture and how many times had she collapsed before she could smile and say that it was fine? She had already gotten used to it.","The classroom was silent.","They seemed to understand why Qiao Xi left the Qiao family and never returned again. Was such a home still considered a home?","Someone could not stand the silence in the classroom and took the initiative to break the heavy atmosphere. “Where’s Wang Qing? Did she secretly run away? Hurry up and get her back. She already said that she’d admit defeat. I definitely won’t allow her to go back on her word today!”","“That’s right, quickly find her. She must kneel and apologize!”","There were some students who were unable to bear it earlier, and their hearts ached for Qiao Xi. However, at this moment, they disregarded the ache in their hearts. Qiao Xi had already experienced too much unfairness, so they had to uphold justice for her this time.","Why was it that when Wang Qing thought she won, she could force Qiao Xi to kneel but now that Qiao Xi had won, she had to let her off? This did not make sense at all.","At this moment, a student shouted from downstairs, “Hey, hurry up and take a look at the university gate. Wang Qing is kneeling at the gate!”","“What?” Some students were shocked. Could it be that Wang Qing had taken the initiative to kneel at the university gate? Did she have such an awareness? Many students did not believe that Wang Qing would take the initiative to kneel at the university gate and apologize to Qiao Xi.","At this moment, some students had already contacted the students at the university gate. In the video call, Wang Qing was seen kneeling and struggling at the university gate. A person in a suit was standing behind her, pressing her head down and making her kowtow continuously. Wang Qing’s panicked voice sounded from the phone. “Who are you? What right do you have to suppress me? No, no, no, no. I don’t want to kneel to Qiao Xi. I won’t kneel to that b*tch Qiao Xi! Ah!”","The next moment, Wang Qing’s head was slammed onto the ground.","The students in the classroom felt their hearts tremble. “Oh my God, who’s so vicious to actually force Wang Qing to kowtow?”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled when she suddenly thought of someone.","The students in the classroom were still discussing it noisily. “Which righteous person is forcing Wang Qing to kneel and apologize? Could it be someone who has a crush on Qiao Xi?”","“Hahahaha, I think it might be done by a righteous person who also thinks Wang Qing is too shameless. After all, it was Wang Qing’s fault this time.”","“Awesome, too awesome! Someone who dares to make a bet but doesn’t dare to fulfill it deserves to be taught a lesson. Let’s see if she still dares to bully Qiao Xi in the future!”","Qiao Xi thanked the surrounding students for believing in her. She quietly left the classroom and slipped out from the back door of the university. After turning around, she went to the entrance of the university and indeed, she saw a familiar figure there.","...","Ten minutes ago.","Wang Qing took advantage of Old Madam Qiao kicking up a fuss to slip away from the classroom, lest she got caught and had to kneel to Qiao Xi.","However, just as she walked away, she suddenly received a call from her father. Her father said that he had reached the gate of the university and wanted Wang Qing to quickly come out to see him. Although Wang Qing found it strange, she did not dare to question what her father was saying. She could only rush to the gate of the university.","Unexpectedly, her father slapped her hard the moment she saw him. “Traitor! Kneel down!”"]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137 - Give You A Kiss","paragraphs":["Wang Qing argued, saying, “Dad, what reason do you have to make me kneel?”","Without saying anything, Wang Qing’s father kicked her knee. “If I ask you to kneel, then kneel. Cut the crap!” He did not hold back with his kick. Wang Qing knelt on the ground with a plop. Her soft knees made contact with the gravel and stone floor, causing her face to frown from the pain. “Dad, are you crazy? Why are you asking me to kneel? Oh my God, my knee hurts. Help me up.”","At that moment, a melodious male voice sounded from behind Mr. Wang. “President Wang, it looks like your daughter doesn’t want to kneel.”","Wang Qing raised her head and met Gu Zheng’s handsome peach blossom eyes. She was stunned for a moment. She had never seen such a good-looking man. His face looked like it had been carefully sculpted and was a work of art. It made her wonder if he really existed in this world.","“No, it’s nothing like that.”","Mr. Wang wiped the cold sweat off his forehead. He had suddenly received a call just now. He was told that all of his company’s partnerships had been terminated and some of the investors had also withdrawn their investments. A good company like his was facing bankruptcy in the blink of an eye. He finally managed to ask a friend for the reason, but the friend stammered and explained that he had offended someone from the Gu family.","There was no one else but the head of the Gu family who could make his friend not even dare to say his name!","However, how did he provoke the head of the Gu family? Their family and the Gu family did not have anything to do with each other! However, regardless of the reason, he spent a lot of effort to find Gu Zheng in order to save his own company. Then, he knelt down and begged for mercy without hesitation, hoping that Gu Zheng would let him off.","Unfortunately, Gu Zheng did not even look at him. It was his special assistant who kindly reminded him, “President Wang, you’d better go to Li City University to see your daughter. She’s much bolder than you, President Wang.”","Mr. Wang gasped.","He did not expect that while he was struggling to run the company, his daughter would drag him down! At the thought of this, he hurriedly drove to Li City University, which led to what had happened earlier.","“President Gu, do you think our Wang Qing is sincere in kneeling? If you’re dissatisfied with anything, feel free to tell me. I’ll get her to adjust it... About my company...”","Wang Qing heard their conversation and gasped.","The reason her father made her kneel here was because of this man in front of her? Such a high and mighty man...","Gu Zheng looked at her as if she was an ant and said casually, “President Wang, have you not eaten yet?”","Mr. Wang steeled his heart and pressed Wang Qing’s head down again, forcing her to kowtow in the direction of the teaching building. Amid the thumping sounds, Wang Qing cried out heartbreakingly, “Dad, I’m in so much pain. Dad! Why are you making me kowtow? What have I done wrong that you have to do this to me?!","“Shut up!” Mr. Wang was afraid that Wang Qing would say something stupid and offend Gu Zheng again. He berated fiercely, “You’ve offended the head of the Gu family, so you deserve to kowtow and apologize. From today onward, get the hell to the countryside and never come back!”","Wang Qing was unwilling to give in. What right did they have to do this to her?! The countryside was where that sl*t, Qiao Xi, was from. How could a rich young miss like her go there?!","...","Qiao Xi leaned against a large tree, took out her phone, and casually typed in a few codes. Not long after, a row of characters appeared on her phone screen, and the image changed to the Wang Corporation’s database.","After seeing the tragic state of the Wang family’s company, Qiao Xi clicked her tongue. If all their partners broke their contracts at the same time, the Wang family should be very busy now. As for Wang Qing, the culprit, she would probably have to stay in the countryside for a long time.","Gu Zheng had noticed Qiao Xi’s figure a long time ago. At this moment, he looked at her indifferently. “Mrs. Gu, are you not planning to express your gratitude?”","Qiao Xi looked up. The man was half-leaning against the car door with his arms crossed. There was a nonchalant look on his handsome face.","Qiao Xi gulped and suddenly took a step forward. “Of course, I have to express my gratitude!”","Kissing him to express her gratitude would allow her to recover her taste buds. It was killing two birds with one stone! Hence, Qiao Xi walked toward him embarrassedly. “Thank you, Brother Gu Zheng, for standing up for me. I want to give you a kiss.”","“Never mind.”","Gu Zheng tilted his head slightly and avoided Qiao Xi’s red lips. He said with a smile, “I suddenly realized that both of us have benefitted from this situation, so it can’t be considered as me helping you. There’s no need to thank me.”","Mutual benefits? Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled.","Gu Zheng curled his lips slightly. “Mrs. Gu, you haven’t forgotten... what you promised me earlier, right?”"]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138 - Looks Like Youre Quite Smart, Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi frowned as she pondered. She suddenly recalled that not long ago, Gu Zheng had told her to go to the Gu family’s old residence and act like a loving couple with him in front of the Gu family.","Could it be that they would be going today?!","Seeing that she had recalled something, Gu Zheng smiled and said, “Looks like you’re quite smart, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Zheng said, “I’ve checked your schedule. You don’t have any classes today, so please go ahead, Mrs. Gu.” He opened the car door and gestured for Qiao Xi to get in.","Qiao Xi subconsciously wanted to refuse. She was not prepared at all, so how could she go to the Gu family’s old residence? However, at this moment, Gu Zheng suddenly leaned close to her and said with a hot breath, “If you perform well this time, I can promise you something. Perhaps what you most wish for...”","He pointed at his lips, the meaning evident.","It had to be said that Gu Zheng’s actions were too tempting! Gu Zheng was especially strict with his own body. Qiao Xi could not even launch a sneak attack if she wanted to. She could only eat those bitter-tasting foods every day, and it was to the point where she almost doubted her life.","Qiao Xi could not refuse such temptation and stammered, “Alright, a man must keep his word and not go back on his word. Moreover, I promised you a long time ago that I would go to the Gu family. It’s only right that I go with you now.”","She did not want to look like a pervert who only cared about Gu Zheng’s body.","Gu Zheng stared at her for a while. It was unknown whether he believed her or not, but when Qiao Xi was at a loss for what to do, he suddenly chuckled. “Right, so Mrs. Gu, can you get in the car now?”","...","The old residence of the Gu family was a little remote. The old residence covered an exceptionally large area, and the antique-looking house looked very historic.","It was said that this house used to belong to a certain king. After that, the head of the Gu family took a liking to it and spent a sky-high price to buy it. It became the old residence of the Gu family. From this, it could be seen that the Gu family was not a rich family but a family that had gone through history but was new at the same time.","This family’s heritage ran very deep.","If it were anyone else, they would be shocked to see such a house at first glance. However, Qiao Xi was different. She had been with her master and seniors since she was young. At that time, the place they lived in was not much different from the Gu family’s old residence. It was even slightly more historic than this old residence.","They arrived at the living room.","Gu Zheng glanced at Qiao Xi, who was some distance away from him. He sighed helplessly. “Mrs. Gu, could it be that in your heart, a loving couple has to walk so far away from each other?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She turned her head to look at the distance between her and Gu Zheng before silently moving a little closer together. Gu Zheng nodded in satisfaction, then reached out to her. “Give me your hand.”","Hand?","Qiao Xi was bewildered. Could it be that they had to hold hands while walking?","“There’s no need, right? I don’t think this is necessary. Think about those couples on the road. They don’t even hold hands when they walk.”","Unfortunately, her words were like the wind in Gu Zheng’s ears. Since Qiao Xi did not take the initiative to give him her hand, he would hold it himself. The man grabbed her little hand without asking any questions. The sudden scorching temperature caused Qiao Xi’s face to turn red, and she staggered a little. She was led into the living room by Gu Zheng just like that.","At this moment, there were already some people waiting in the living room. At a glance, there were about 14 to 15 people.","Unfortunately, all of their expressions were not too pleasant to look at. Qiao Xi blinked, then looked at her interlocked hand with Gu Zheng’s. She was suddenly enlightened. ‘Oh, the people of the Gu family are very dissatisfied with Gu Zheng’s sudden marriage.’","Gu Zheng brought her into the living room and glanced around. Seeing that there was no one he wanted to see, he asked in a low voice, “Where’s Grandma?”","Madam Gu was sitting in the middle. She coughed. A noblewoman in her 40s or 50s beside her received the signal and said with a smile, “Gu Zheng, you’re back. It’s been a long time since you last came back. Why don’t you greet everyone first?”","Before Gu Zheng could say anything, her gaze fell on Qiao Xi. She sized Qiao Xi up from head to toe. In the end, she said disdainfully, “You’re Gu Zheng’s wife? How did you become his wife? Gu Zheng is busy with company matters every day and doesn’t have time to keep track of many things. Don’t you know how to remind him? Also, you came empty-handed the first time you came here. You didn’t even greet your elders upon seeing them. You’re really from a small family. You have no manners at all.”","Qiao Xi: “???”","Did she have to endure a calamity?","These people were afraid of Gu Zheng and did not dare to say anything to him, so they were bullying her instead?"]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139 - Get Gu Zheng A Female Secretary","paragraphs":["What did she mean by lacking manners? Qiao Xi did not even know who they were, so how was she supposed to greet them?","The noblewoman snorted coldly as if she knew what Qiao Xi was thinking. She said directly, “Qiao Xi, don’t tell me you don’t know who I am? You’ve already married into the Gu family for so long but you don’t even know the elders of the Gu family? Aren’t you too arrogant?”","The surrounding people also looked at Qiao Xi. Even though they didn’t say anything, the disdain in their eyes was obvious.","The noblewoman said sarcastically, “You’re indeed an uneducated woman from the countryside. I wonder what Gu Zheng sees in you. He probably ended up like this because of your seductive appearance.”","Qiao Xi was so angry that her cheeks were bulging. She wanted to open her mouth to retort, but this was Gu Zheng’s family, after all. It was not appropriate for her to say anything. She could only sulk.","Just then, Gu Zheng asked, “Who are you?”","His gaze lightly landed on the noblewoman, who instantly stiffened. What was going on? Why would Gu Zheng suddenly ask her this? Did he really not know her, or did he want to stand up for Qiao Xi?","Various thoughts flashed through her mind. The noblewoman forced a smile. “Gu Zheng, you don’t have to pretend not to know me because of a woman. She’s just a woman. We’re just helping you train her. After all, your identity and status are important. The wife you marry represents you. If she embarrasses herself, it’ll be very difficult for you, right?”","The others came back to their senses and heaved a sigh of relief.","They thought that Gu Zheng really did not know this noblewoman. Gu Zheng rarely returned to the Gu family’s old residence and did not spend much time with them. Or rather, with their status, Gu Zheng did not need to take them seriously.","However... they thought about his words in their hearts. It would be too embarrassing if Gu Zheng exposed them and said that he did not know them.","They felt that Gu Zheng was definitely pretending not to know them because he did not want Qiao Xi to be embarrassed... However, this sort of method was truly unacceptable.","They were Gu Zheng’s relatives, while Qiao Xi was just a wife. No matter how important of a title she held, could she be superior to them in terms of hierarchy?","Just as the people from the Gu family were feeling dissatisfied with Gu Zheng’s actions, they heard Gu Zheng say calmly, “I really don’t know you, so who are you?”","After a pause, he continued casually, “After all, I’m busy with work and have all kinds of important matters to attend to. I don’t have to worry about unimportant people, right?”","His words were indeed harsh. The woman’s face instantly turned pale. She never expected Gu Zheng to not show her any respect in front of so many people! However, what could she do? With Gu Zheng’s status, she did not dare retort.","Gu Zheng did not even look at her. He held Qiao Xi’s hand and turned to leave. “These people aren’t important. You don’t have to remember them. I’ll bring you to look for Grandma first.”","Qiao Xi nodded vigorously. She felt that Gu Zheng was too handsome!","Was this the charm of the head of the Gu family?!","However, before they could leave the living room, they saw Madam Gu stand up abruptly. “Gu Zheng, your grandmother is still taking an afternoon nap. She knows that you’re back. We’ve been waiting here all this while but now that you’re back, you’re immediately going to look for your grandmother. If others find out about this, they’ll think that I, your mother, have been abusing you.”","Her gaze then shifted to her left side. A young and beautiful woman was sitting there obediently. The woman was about 20 years old. Her almond-shaped eyes would drift to Gu Zheng from time to time before she lowered her head shyly.","Madam Gu said, “I know you don’t like Meng Wan. Since you don’t like her, I won’t force you. Look, this is your uncle’s daughter. She just graduated from university. I think your company needs a female secretary. She just graduated from university, so let her try it out.”","The noblewoman beside Madam Gu also became more enthusiastic. She quickly said, “That’s right. This girl is good-looking, has a good temper, and is even a graduate of a famous university. She’s much better than some people!”","She glanced at Qiao Xi disdainfully, then smiled obsequiously. “Gu Zheng, she graduated from design. Isn’t Gu Corporation entering the fashion design industry and trying to create the best designs? This girl is definitely a suitable candidate for you. With her around, your company will surely do well.”","With that, she shot the young woman a look to get her to say a few words."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140 - Youre Lucky With Women","paragraphs":["The young woman stood up shyly like a little white rabbit and walked to Gu Zheng. “Hello, Brother Gu Zheng...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Damn it, sending a woman to Gu Zheng in front of her, his legitimate wife? These people were not taking her seriously at all!","Madam Gu ran over excitedly and introduced her. “Gu Zheng, our Shen Ying is a little introverted and shy but she’s different from certain bold and wild women. She’s pure and kind, so Gu Zheng, you have to take care of her when she joins the company in the future, lest she gets bullied.”","After she finished speaking, she even glanced at Qiao Xi with a warning glare. “There are also certain people... Gu Zheng, you have to be careful lest she attacks Shen Ying out of jealousy. If news of this gets out, it’ll ruin the Gu family’s reputation.”","Shen Ying tugged at Madam Gu’s sleeve and said softly, “Don’t worry, I won’t be bullied.” With that, she quickly looked at Gu Zheng again. “I’ll also stay by Brother Gu Zheng’s side and help him with the company so that he won’t be as tired as he is now.”","“Good, good. Shen Ying, you’re really too obedient. Hurry up and pack your things. When Gu Zheng leaves later, go with them.” The noblewoman patted her hand in satisfaction.","Seeing that they had already discussed it among themselves and were even mocking her sarcastically, Qiao Xi finally could not help but say, “Go back with Gu Zheng? Go back where? Are you sure you’re getting him a secretary and not a bed-warming servant?”","Shen Ying stared at Qiao Xi in disbelief. Her almond-shaped eyes were filled with tears as she bit her lip in grievances. “What do you mean, Miss Qiao? Are you scolding me?”","The noblewoman did not expect Qiao Xi to suddenly open her mouth and say such nasty words. Her expression instantly darkened. “Qiao Xi, don’t poke your nose into other people’s business. When has it been your turn to interfere in the internal affairs of our Gu family?”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes in surprise. “Why can’t I interfere in the internal affairs of the Gu family? Am I not Gu Zheng’s wife? Also, I’m very curious about your behavior. You keep saying that Miss Shen Ying is going to the company to be a secretary, so why isn’t she reporting to the company? Why do you want her to come home with us?","“Your actions reminded me of some bad things. For example, a certain madam once brought the eldest daughter of the Meng family to Longwan Residential and shamelessly wanted to place Eldest Miss Meng into Gu Zheng’s master bedroom. Aren’t you all sending women to Gu Zheng right in front of me? I don’t want my man to be tainted by another woman. What’s wrong with me saying something about this?”","“You...”","The noblewoman held back her anger and gnashed her teeth. “As expected of someone from a small household. Your heart is so dirty. Shen Ying is Gu Zheng’s personal secretary and is in charge of Gu Zheng’s basic necessities. Of course, she has to go home with Gu Zheng.”","At this moment, Shen Ying also said with tearful eyes, “Miss Qiao, don’t worry. I won’t fight with you over anything. I’m just Brother Gu Zheng’s personal secretary. I heard that Brother Gu Zheng often doesn’t eat on time. I want to take good care of him. How can his body handle not eating on time?”","These words... were words often said by a mistress.","The noblewoman continued to mock at the side, “Shen Ying, you don’t have to say much to her. Someone like Miss Qiao doesn’t have much knowledge and sees things differently from us. She’s just a stupid woman who only knows how to cling to men. I wouldn’t be surprised if someone like her is abandoned by Gu Zheng one day.","“Shen Ying, don’t worry. Just be at ease and do what you want. If Gu Zheng is really interested in you, that’s normal. After all, you’re so outstanding. You’re not someone some boorish women can compare to.”","Shen Ying lowered her head shyly.","Although she did not say anything, it was obvious from her expression that she was looking forward to having Gu Zheng take a liking to her.","Qiao Xi: “...”","These people were really powerful. They had arranged everything and even found an excuse for Gu Zheng to cheat on Qiao Xi in the future.","“You’re quite lucky with women,” Qiao Xi berated Gu Zheng.","It seemed Meng Wan was not enough as there was now Shen Ying.","Gu Zheng grabbed Qiao Xi’s hand, then turned to look at Shen Ying. “You want to be my secretary?”","Shen Ying’s heart thumped as she grabbed the corner of her shirt nervously. “Yes, Brother Gu Zheng. I’ve admired you for a long time. As long as you agree to let me be your personal secretary, I’m willing to do anything.”","Gu Zheng nodded. Before Shen Ying could be happy, she heard Gu Zheng say indifferently, “I have high requirements for my secretary. Why don’t you answer a few of my questions first?”"]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141 - As Long As Youre Good-looking And Obedient","paragraphs":["Without waiting for Shen Ying to answer, he asked, “Have you participated in the International Real-time Translation Competition? How were your results? What about your graduation results? Were any of your works during university nominated for awards?”","Shen Ying’s body trembled.","Gu Zheng asked, “What was the original fashion concept proposed by Gu Corporation? Did you participate in the previous Paris Design Competition? Do you think you can win the Paris Design Competition with your ability?”","With every word Gu Zheng said, Shen Ying’s body trembled and her face turned pale.","She had never heard of many of the things he said. She had also bought her diploma... Other than dating in university, she did nothing else!","The noblewoman was anxious. “Gu Zheng, why are you asking about this? Do you really want to use Shen Ying as your assistant? That’s too much of a waste of resources. She’s just your personal assistant who’ll be handling your personal matters. It’s fine even if she doesn’t understand what you’re saying. All she needs to do is look good and listen to you.”","She was just short of telling Gu Zheng that she had sent this woman to him for him to sleep with.","As Gu Zheng’s partner in bed, she did not need to be too talented or capable. She just needed to be good-looking, beautiful, easygoing, gentle, and considerate.","Gu Zheng looked at her with a faint smile. “Deal with my personal matters? It’s not like I don’t have arms and legs. Do I need her to help me deal with personal matters? Is she even worthy?!”","“Let’s forget about her being an assistant. I don’t think she’s even suitable to be someone else’s assistant. Any one of Gu Corporation’s assistants is a graduate of a famous university. They’re the cream of the crop after winning many major awards. It’s better if you don’t send trash like Miss Shen Ying to me as it’ll only disgust me.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","This man was either silent or furious. However, she did not know if she should say it. It felt really good to hear Gu Zheng scold them!","Gu Zheng slowly said, “Miss Shen Ying, you should put more effort into improving your ability. Without good looks, you have no ability to fall back on. Someone like you will be eliminated by society sooner or later. Alright, everything is settled now. Let’s go.”","The final sentence was directed at Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi instantly put away her focused expression of watching a show and was obediently led away by Gu Zheng.","However—","This bunch of people had waited for such a long time for a chance. How could they let it go so easily? If Shen Ying did not climb into Gu Zheng’s bed today, all their efforts would be wasted!","The noblewoman rushed forward without a care in the world, disregarding all dignity. “Gu Zheng, wait. You might not understand what I just said. Although Shen Ying isn’t qualified as an assistant, she’s especially outstanding in other aspects. She can serve you well and guarantee that you’ll have a different experience. As long as you nod, I’ll get Shen Ying to go to your house to serve you. If you’re in a rush, you can also stay in the old residence.","“Please consider it. Shen Ying is different from some people. She’s thousands of times better than the person you married. She’ll be very obedient to you and won’t disobey any of your orders...”","The living room instantly fell silent.","Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes. It was fine to deliver women to Gu Zheng. As long as one had the ability, then go ahead and do as one pleased. However, wouldn’t it be too inappropriate to trample on her in front of her?","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks. “Madam Wang, are you insulting my wife?” He glanced at Shen Ying and said in an undisguised tone of mockery, “You’re comparing this woman to my wife? Is she worthy?”","Madam Wang was Gu Zheng’s father’s fourth sister. She married into the Wang family a few years ago and became the mistress of the Wang family. The Wang family was quite powerful. Although they could not compare to the Gu family, it was still enough for Madam Wang to hold her chin up high. The Gu family was polite to her and would call her ‘Fourth Madam’ every time she returned to the Gu family, indicating that she was still a member of the Gu family.","However, the way Gu Zheng addressed her as ‘Madam Wang’ instantly widened the gap between her and the Gu family. Unfortunately, Madam Wang was used to being flattered by others all these years and did not notice the anger in Gu Zheng’s voice.","She even replied smugly, “Gu Zheng, that’s not what I meant. I didn’t deliberately insult Miss Qiao. It’s just that our Shen Ying was raised to be a rich young lady since she was young. She’s different from some ignorant people who grew up in the countryside. Gu Zheng, although you’re the head of the Gu family now, I still have to say something. You can’t just mess around with your marriage. This isn’t just being irresponsible to you but also the Gu family.","“Your wife, the mistress of the Gu family, should be a noble daughter like Shen Ying. She should be as gentle and virtuous as her. You shouldn’t get a country bumpkin to be your wife.”"]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142 - The Promise When We Were Young","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Shen Ying pretended to be shocked and covered her mouth. “So you’re not from Li City, Miss Qiao? You’re from the countryside...”","She did not continue speaking. As if she realized her mistake, she quickly apologized to Gu Zheng shyly. “I’m sorry, Master Gu. I didn’t mean to say that Miss Qiao is lacking. I was just surprised to suddenly know Miss Qiao’s background.”","Gu Zheng suddenly turned to look at her. This was the first time he looked Shen Ying in the eye after entering. The latter’s face was layered with a faint blush. She thought that her words had attracted Gu Zheng’s attention, and it also caused Gu Zheng to finally be annoyed with Qiao Xi.","Thinking about it, how could someone like Gu Zheng marry a sl*t like Qiao Xi? It was rumored that the reason they got married back then was because Qiao Xi took advantage of him and forced him to marry her at the Civil Affairs Bureau. Now that Gu Zheng knew about her unbearable past and background, he would surely disdain her, right?","“You’re right. My wife did grow up in the countryside when she was young.” Gu Zheng nodded in agreement with Shen Ying.","Qiao Xi instinctively turned her head to look at him.","Shen Ying could not conceal the excitement in her heart. Her brows moved slightly, and her eyes were gentle like water. She looked at Qiao Xi apologetically and said softly, “Is that so? So the rumors outside are actually true...”","Gu Zheng asked, “I heard that you grew up in Li City and were raised to be a young mistress of an upper class family?”","Shen Ying was stunned for a moment. She thought that Gu Zheng was interested in her past and quickly nodded. “Yes, the Shen family values their children’s education, so I’ve always been strict with myself.”","Just based on her background, she was much better than Qiao Xi!","“Oh? Really?”","Gu Zheng chuckled, but his voice did not contain any amusement. Instead, it carried a hint of cold mockery. “You have received strict family education since you were young, but you can’t even meet the standards of being an assistant in Gu Corporation. This makes me wonder if your brain isn’t working well. Of course, there are smart and stupid people in this world. For someone like my wife, although she grew up in the countryside, she worked hard to become an international designer and set a new record in the country. Countless people are proud of her.","“My wife is considered a smart woman, while you, Miss Shen, have been strictly educated since you were young but you don’t even meet the requirements to be an assistant. You’re just stupid, so stupid that your mind is filled with thoughts of climbing into a man’s bed to serve him. You reap what you sow.”","Gu Zheng’s words were a little harsh, but Qiao Xi felt very pleased!","As a woman herself, she despised women who wanted to climb into a man’s bed just because they were slightly pretty!","However, she did not expect a man like Gu Zheng, who was silent and had a bad temper, to say such things to Shen Ying. She was even prepared to stand up for herself earlier.","In any case, she would not let herself suffer, nor would she let others scold her.","Shen Ying’s tears kept flowing down the corners of her eyes. She was dealt a heavy blow by Gu Zheng’s words and was on the verge of breaking down. “Brother Gu Zheng...”","“Don’t talk to such brainless people in the future. Not only is it a waste of time but stupidity can be infectious. Let’s stay away from her.” Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand. “Let’s go see Grandma.”","Qiao Xi nodded. Before she left, she did not forget to stab Shen Ying in the chest. “I’m sorry, Miss Shen. My husband doesn’t want me to interact too much with brainless people, so we’ll be leaving first.”","Shen Ying clutched her chest as tears streamed down her face. She gasped. “Brother Gu Zheng... I... I’m not...”","Before she could finish, she collapsed to the floor.","Madam Wang pounced on her in panic. “Shen Ying, Shen Ying, don’t scare me!” Seeing that Shen Ying’s eyes were filled with tears and she was so sad she even fainted, Madam Wang could not help but roar. “Gu Zheng! Are you so heartless?! You made Shen Ying so sad. Have you forgotten the promise you made when you were young?!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows with interest. A promise from when he was young?","Madam Wang cried out loudly, “Gu Zheng, you promised to take care of Shen Ying for the rest of your life when you were young. Now that you have a new lover, you don’t want your old love anymore, right? Poor Shen Ying is always thinking about being with you. For your sake, she rejected countless outstanding men... When she heard that you had gotten married, she was so sad that she fainted from crying. After that, she didn’t want anything else but to stay by your side. However, you said such harsh words to her. Gu Zheng, are you even human?!”","Unfortunately, Gu Zheng simply strode away without turning back.","No matter how much Madam Wang cried out behind him, he pretended not to hear her."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143 - Its Tough For You","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi looked at him curiously. Gu Zheng pursed his lips and just said, “There was no such thing.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “What?”","Gu Zheng turned to look at her and said word by word, “I never promised to take care of Shen Ying.”","Qiao Xi nodded. Whether Gu Zheng had promised Shen Ying or not did not matter to her as long as the two did not disgust her.","Seeing her patronizing look, Gu Zheng frowned and asked, “You don’t believe me?”","Qiao Xi did not know why he suddenly became obsessed with this question, but she still shook her head to indicate that she was not doubting him. If someone like Gu Zheng really had feelings for Shen Ying, he would not deliberately say such things to her just because his wife was by his side. The reason he said those things was because he did not care about it, and it was also because he found Shen Ying’s chattering very annoying.","Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows in satisfaction, but he felt that Qiao Xi’s reaction was not right. Since this woman trusted him, why did she still have such a nonchalant expression? It was as if whether he and Shen Ying were involved or not had nothing to do with her.","Was this the attitude a wife should have?","“Young Master, you’re back.”","Gu Zheng still wanted to say something when an elderly servant suddenly appeared at the corner. The corners of the servant’s eyes were filled with wrinkles. When she smiled, she looked very kind and amiable. “Old Madam Gu woke up a long time ago and has been waiting for you to come over.”","Old Madam Gu? That was the grandmother Gu Zheng was talking about?","Gu Zheng nodded. “I was delayed over something in the living room, so I’m a little late.”","The servant also knew what those people from the Gu family were like. She shook her head and led the way. Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and reminded her in a low voice, “Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to care about those people in the living room, but I hope you can try your best and show me all your acting skills now.”","Qiao Xi nodded in understanding. She knew that it did not matter whether those people outside believed that they were a harmonious couple or not. It was fine as long as Grandma believed that they were a loving couple.","The two of them passed through a small garden and walked through a long corridor before arriving in front of an independent courtyard. The breeze blew over the thick smell of Chinese medicine. Qiao Xi could not help but sniffle, but Gu Zheng did not react at all. He was probably used to it.","“Old Madam is waiting for you in the greenhouse.”","With that, the servant left.","The greenhouse was filled with sunlight. Under the golden sunlight, a white-haired old woman was lying on a rocking chair with a blanket over her. When she saw Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi enter, she smiled and waved at them.","Gu Zheng’s cold eyebrows gradually relaxed. He walked in and squatted beside the old woman. He held her hand and called out softly, “Grandma.”","Qiao Xi had never seen Gu Zheng like this. He had always been cold and taciturn. When angered, he would say nasty things, and the corners of his mouth would always carry a wisp of a mocking smile as he looked down on the world. However, at this moment, he was like a wild beast that had shed its sharp edges, revealing its soft belly without any offensive power.","Old Madam Gu patted Gu Zheng’s hand. “Good child, you’ve been working hard.”","The old woman’s eyes were muddy, and her voice was very hoarse, but there was a sense of wisdom and transparency about Old Madam Gu. She raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi with a warm smile. “This is your wife, right? She looks really pretty.”","She waved her hand. Qiao Xi hesitated for a second before mimicking Gu Zheng’s behavior and squatting beside Old Madam Gu. She called out softly, “Grandma.”","“Good child.” Old Madam Gu held Qiao Xi’s hand. “It’s been hard on you to be with such a blockhead.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","“To be honest, I never thought that Gu Zheng would get married. I thought that I would never be able to see his wedding day. Luckily, you appeared.” Old Madam Gu was very emotional.","Qiao Xi remained silent.","She felt that Old Madam Gu was thinking too much. According to Gu Zheng’s appearance and status, as long as he said that he wanted to marry, countless women would rush over.","Old Madam Gu smiled very happily. “When I heard that you two were married, I quickly got someone to make a pair of jade sculptures. I wanted to give them to you when we meet, but I didn’t expect to see you so soon. The jade sculptures aren’t ready yet...”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She seemed to know where Gu Zheng’s genes for making others dumbfounded came from.","However, Qiao Xi remembered her mission. She had to pretend to be a happy couple with Gu Zheng to cheer up Old Madam Gu, so she said softly, “Thank you, Grandma. The gift isn’t important. I’m already very happy to be able to see you.”","“Such a good child. You’ve really been blinded by Gu Zheng. If he bullies you in the future, tell me. I’ll support you.”","Gu Zheng was helpless. “Grandma...”","Qiao Xi chuckled."]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144 - A Special Gift","paragraphs":["“My health hasn’t been good recently, and you guys are busy with work. I don’t even know when we’ll meet again. I don’t even know when the jade sculptures will be ready. How about I get you another gift?”","Qiao Xi was just about to say that it was alright when Old Madam Gu took out a dark object from the side and stuffed it into her hand. “Take this as a gift. I hope you’ll like it.”","Qiao Xi looked at the thing in her hand in silence for three seconds. “...”","Wasn’t this gift a little too much?","She was speechless for a long time. If it were not for the inappropriate timing and location, she really wanted to grab Gu Zheng’s collar and ask, ‘Do all Gu family members give guns as gifts?!’","The first time Gu Zheng gave her a gift, it was a beautiful silver pistol. Now, Old Madam Gu gave her a black pistol... They were indeed a family. Their tastes were all very unique.","“Alright, I’ve given you your gift. You can leave now.” Old Madam Gu suddenly chased them away.","Gu Zheng pursed his lips tightly and said in a hoarse voice, “Grandma, I’ll accompany you for a little longer.”","Old Madam Gu refused with a smile. “Alright, it’s good enough that we met. I’m tired and should rest.”","When the servant heard the voices, she hurriedly went forward. “Young Master, Old Madam Gu has fewer and fewer days to wake up. It’s time for her to sleep.”","Qiao Xi instinctively frowned. What did she mean by fewer and fewer days to wake up?","Gu Zheng left with Qiao Xi with a cold face. It could be seen that he was not in a good mood, so Qiao Xi did not look for trouble. After the servant put Old Madam Gu to bed, she deliberately took a few steps over to explain to Qiao Xi, “Young Madam, don’t take it to heart. Old Madam is sick, so she can only see people for a short period of time every day.”","Qiao Xi naturally did not take offense. If she only met the old madam for a short while, there wouldn’t be much risk of her having to actually marry Gu Zheng. She glanced in the direction of the door. Although her next question might not be too polite, she still asked it. “How long has Grandma’s situation been going on for?”","The servant was stunned as if she did not expect Qiao Xi to ask such a question, but she still answered, “More than 30 years ago.”","Qiao Xi nodded. That explained things. According to her observation, Old Madam Gu doted on Gu Zheng a lot. With Madam Gu’s status in the Gu family, she would never let Gu Zheng be abused by his biological mother. It was just that her lethargy had caused her to not have the energy to take care of Gu Zheng.","“Young Madam, you don’t have to worry. The old madam has been enduring for such a long time. Now that she knows that Young Master and you are living a happy life, the heavy stone in her heart has been lifted. Her mood and illness will also improve significantly. I heard that Young Master has been looking for a divine physician. If you can find them, the old madam might be able to recover from her illness... However, I heard that the physician has gone missing for a few years. Someone even said that they’re dead... Sigh.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her head. Divine physician?","If it was the person she was thinking of, she might be able to help!","On the way back, Qiao Xi had been thinking about this matter. However, she had not contacted the old man for a long time. Two years ago, after he sent her to Li City, there was no more news of him.","Qiao Xi lowered her head to look at the gun in her hands. Actually, she did not think she was a warm-hearted person. She had also gotten used to seeing people die, so some of her emotional fluctuations had gradually calmed down. However, why did she want to look for the old fellow to treat Old Madam Gu even though she had only seen her for a while?","Was it because of... Gu Zheng?","She thought of Gu Zheng’s reluctant look before he left and her heart tightened. For some reason, she did not want to see this man frown. She attributed all of this to her being too immersed in the act. It was Gu Zheng who asked her to act like a loving couple with him. Normal wives would definitely be worried when they saw their husbands’ worried faces, right?","However, she knew that this was all an act. She did not need to take it seriously, nor did she need to spend so much effort to find this old fellow just for the sake of pretending to be husband and wife with Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi kept finding excuses for herself. Suddenly, she heard footsteps outside the door. They were talking about Shen Ying.","“Miss Shen and Young Master are childhood sweethearts. I thought that Miss Shen would definitely be the mistress of the Gu family.”","“Sigh, it’s all because of the latecomer. If it weren’t for Young Madam, Young Master would definitely have been touched by Miss Shen. Which man can reject a woman who loves him so wholeheartedly?”","Qiao Xi inexplicably felt slightly uncomfortable when she heard this.","...","In Shen Ying’s room.","Madam Gu’s face was gloomy. Although Shen Ying was not her child, she had watched her grow up. Now that she saw Shen Ying being bullied by Qiao Xi, how could she stand it?"]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145 - Why Should I Apologize?","paragraphs":["There was a drip attached to the back of Shen Ying’s hand. She opened her eyes weakly. “It’s okay, I’m fine.”","Madam Wang was Madam Gu’s sister-in-law, while Shen Ying was the niece of Madam Wang’s husband. Shen Ying and Gu Zheng grew up together and were childhood sweethearts. Both families wanted their children to be closer when they grew up.","Madam Wang, who had no children, treated Shen Ying as her own and doted on her. Even Madam Gu doted on Shen Ying a lot. When they saw Shen Ying forcing herself to comfort them, their hearts felt like they were being stabbed by a knife.","Shen Ying bit her lip, tears streaming down her face. “Aunt, Madam Gu, I understand my body. It has nothing to do with Miss Qiao. My heart just aches for Brother Gu Zheng...”","After a pause, she seemed to have gathered her courage and said softly, “Brother Gu Zheng is such an outstanding person, but his wife is so rude and arrogant. I don’t know how much trouble she’ll bring to Brother Gu Zheng in the future. He’s already tired from work yet has to handle things for her as well... Just the thought of it makes my heart ache...”","Madam Gu was hit where it hurt. Anger surged in her eyes. “You’re right. Qiao Xi is just a country bumpkin who only knows how to cause trouble. How can she be worthy of our Gu Zheng?!”","Shen Ying coughed a few times and said weakly, “Madam Gu, I only hope that Brother Gu Zheng can be happy. No matter how Miss Qiao targets me, I won’t mind.”","Madam Wang cried out in heartache. “My silly child, why are you so silly?!”","Madam Gu abruptly stood up from her chair and sneered. “The matter of Qiao Xi bullying you can’t be settled just like that. I’ll get Qiao Xi to apologize to you right now!”","Looking at Madam Gu’s angry back view, Shen Ying sighed. “Aunt, you know that I don’t want to go against Miss Qiao. With the state of my body, what right do I have to compete with her?”","Madam Wang patted her back in heartache. “How are you unqualified? You’re most qualified!”","...","On the other side, Madam Gu ordered the servants to kick open Qiao Xi’s door.","At this moment, Qiao Xi had just finished talking to her third brother on the phone. She had asked him if he knew where the old fellow was. She also wanted to study the silver needles that her teacher had given her. She had just put away the silver needles when the door was suddenly kicked open. She raised her head and met Madam Gu’s angry eyes.","“Qiao Xi, you still have the mood to sit here? Shen Ying’s heart is not well, and you almost caused her to die, do you know that? Or did you deliberately anger her because you know about her health? You vicious little sl*t!”","Madam Gu’s heart really ached for Shen Ying, but she was mostly angry at Gu Zheng for being disobedient and embarrassing her in front of so many people. This was the reason why she was so angry.","Now that Gu Zheng had grown up, she could not torture him like she did when he was young. She could only vent all her anger on Qiao Xi, who seemed to be easy to bully.","“Go and apologize to Shen Ying now. Otherwise, don’t blame our Gu family for not recognizing you as our daughter-in-law for harming others unreasonably!”","Qiao Xi’s tone was indifferent. “I didn’t do anything wrong. Why should I apologize?”","Madam Gu shouted angrily, “You angered her to the point of fainting. Don’t you need to apologize? Is this how the Qiao family educated you?”","Qiao Xi slowly explained, “Madam Gu, if you’re not stupid, you should know that the person who made Shen Ying faint was Gu Zheng. It has nothing to do with me. If you want to apologize, it should be Gu Zheng who apologizes... But judging from your attitude, you probably don’t dare to look for trouble with Gu Zheng, so you came to me, right?”","Madam Gu’s expression froze for a moment, then she began to cry. “What sins have I committed?! I finally waited for the day Gu Zheng got married, but he ended up marrying such a woman. She doesn’t dare to admit to her mistakes and even pushes all the responsibility to Gu Zheng. She brought her bad habits from the countryside to our Gu family. How are you worthy of staying in the Gu family? You’re really dirtying the Gu family’s reputation!”","“The countryside? We won’t cry and kick up a fuss in the countryside like you do. We find it embarrassing. Of course, more importantly, the countryside is a reasonable place. We’re not like you, who convict someone with just a few words.”","Qiao Xi spoke casually, but Madam Gu was furious. She ordered the servants, “Go, get this little sl*t. If she doesn’t want to apologize, then force her to apologize!”","Qiao Xi took a few steps back and dodged the servants who were rushing up to her. She said with a mocking expression, “So you want to use force to suppress me, Madam Gu? Is this how the high society works?”","“You!” Madam Gu was flustered and exasperated. She shouted at the servants, “Useless things, can’t you handle a woman with so many of you?!”"]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146 - Lets Not Pretend To Be Innocent, Alright?","paragraphs":["The servants instantly pounced over. They grabbed Qiao Xi’s wrist and left red marks on it.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was being subdued, Madam Gu could not help but be delighted. “Drag her to Shen Ying’s room for me and get her to apologize!”","Even though she was overwhelmed, Qiao Xi’s body remained straight. She glanced indifferently at Madam Gu. When no one noticed, a silver needle as thin as a strand of hair gently penetrated Madam Gu’s wrist.","Madam Gu felt that her wrist was a little itchy, but she did not mind it too much. She glanced at the people in the room smugly. “Whoever dares to tell Gu Zheng what happened today will die.”","Qiao Xi sneered and was escorted to Shen Ying’s room by a servant.","It was really a bargain for her to be able to use the concealed weapon her teacher had given her for the first time.","...","In Shen Ying’s room.","When Madam Wang saw Qiao Xi arrive, she sneered. “And here I was thinking how stubborn you were. Didn’t you still obediently come over to apologize in the end?”","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at her and nodded. “Yes, I’m here.”","How could she drug them if she did not come?","Madam Wang felt that something was wrong. She touched her wrist and it seemed to hurt a little. She suspected that Qiao Xi was up to something, but seeing that Qiao Xi was a meter away from her, she felt that she was being paranoid.","Shen Ying heard the commotion outside and asked weakly, “Aunt, what’s going on?”","Madam Wang smiled proudly and said, “Qiao Xi has come to apologize to you.”","“Huh?” Shen Ying was surprised. “Why is Miss Qiao here? Didn’t I say that she doesn’t need to apologize?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘Gu Zheng isn’t here, so let’s not pretend to be innocent, alright?’","Madam Wang pushed Qiao Xi to Shen Ying and told Shen Ying to do as she pleased before leaving the room.","Shen Ying changed her gentle demeanor. “Miss Qiao, I really didn’t expect you to come and apologize to me. I thought that because you have someone backing you, you wouldn’t lower your head to anyone.”","Qiao Xi leaned leisurely on the chair. “What? You’re not going to pretend to be innocent anymore?”","Shen Ying’s eyes were filled with unwillingness. “Look at your behavior! You don’t even have a proper demeanor. No wonder you grew up in the countryside. You don’t have any manners at all. Brother Gu Zheng’s wife has to be an elegant eldest daughter of an aristocratic family like me. How is a boorish woman like you worthy of standing beside him?!”","She had long investigated Qiao Xi and knew everything about her. “Look, you’re clearly the Qiao family’s eldest daughter, yet you’re not acknowledged by your family. It doesn’t matter if your reputation is good or bad at all. What right does a woman who was abandoned by her family have to snatch Brother Gu Zheng from me?!”","Qiao Xi looked at her for a while.","It had to be said that although Shen Ying was beautiful, jealousy made her look completely different. What kind of magic did Gu Zheng have that made these women go crazy and vicious for him?","Shen Ying gritted her teeth. “Qiao Xi, I’m talking to you. Can’t you hear me?!”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Miss Shen, do you know what your current actions represent?”","Shen Ying frowned. “What are you trying to say?”","“From a moral standpoint, you’re the third party who is interfering in someone else’s marriage. I don’t know what Madam Gu told you, nor do I know why Madam Gu is so enthusiastic about sending women to Gu Zheng’s side. First, it was Meng Wan, then it was you... I’m guessing that it’s because Madam Gu is also a mistress, so she likes to find mistresses for her son?”","Shen Ying was so angry that her entire body was trembling. “Qiao Xi! Madam Gu is doing this for my own good! Moreover, so what if the two of you are married? I have the right to pursue true love. If Brother Gu Zheng abandons you and gets together with me, it’s because I have the ability. On that same note, you would be abandoned because you had no ability to keep a man!”","Qiao Xi smiled. Her ears were itchy from listening to these words. It was true that all the mistresses in the world liked to use true love to justify their actions, but could true love exempt everything?","“Qiao Xi, what do you have to compete with me? I’m the only heir of the Shen family. If Brother Gu Zheng marries me, it’s equivalent to marrying the entire Shen family, but what about you? You’re just a country bumpkin. If Brother Gu Zheng is with you, what else can he get besides being mocked by the outside world?”","Shen Ying’s words caused Qiao Xi to completely lose the mood to talk to her. She could not speak to such an unreasonable person.","Her fingers moved slightly, and the silver needle pierced into Shen Ying’s body in an invisible area. Qiao Xi put away the silver needles and intended to leave. The reason she came here was to take revenge. These people were all treating her as a pushover... She was really unhappy about that."]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147 - Love Is Too Scary","paragraphs":["Shen Ying had an excited expression. “Qiao Xi, you’re not allowed to leave. You haven’t given up Mrs. Gu’s position yet, so you’re not allowed to leave! Do you think you can really get Brother Gu Zheng’s heart? Look at you, you’ve been suppressed by us for so long. Has Brother Gu Zheng come to look for you? He doesn’t love you at all!”","Qiao Xi’s footsteps paused slightly, but it was only for a second before she took another step forward.","Shen Ying sneered. “Qiao Xi, not only am I asking you to apologize today, but I also want you to get the hell out of the Gu family!”","Suddenly, there was a loud bang behind Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi subconsciously turned around and saw Shen Ying lying on the floor with blood flowing from her forehead. Her clothes were quickly drenched by the blood, and she stared at Qiao Xi with a pleading gaze. “Miss Qiao, can you let me off... I was wrong. I shouldn’t have fought with you for Brother Gu Zheng. I shouldn’t have argued with you. You said I was a mistress, so I’m a mistress. Please let me live, okay?”","The servants heard the noise and quickly broke in.","“Miss Shen, are you alright?” The servants helped Shen Ying up in a panic. She was Madam Gu’s distinguished guest. If she was injured in the Gu family, wouldn’t they be implicated as well?","Madam Wang rushed in as well. “Shen Ying, are you okay?! Qiao Xi, you damned woman! Are you so jealous of Shen Ying that you hurt her? How can there be such a vicious woman like you in the world?!”","Shen Ying’s face was covered in blood, and her lips were extremely pale. “Aunt, I’m fine. Don’t blame Miss Qiao. It’s all my fault. It’s all my fault...”","One of the servants, who was afraid of implicating herself, quickly berated, “Miss Qiao, Madam asked you to come over to apologize to Miss Shen, not to hurt her. Now that Miss Shen has been injured because of you, just wait. She’ll definitely punish you!”","Qiao Xi looked at the wound on Shen Ying’s forehead. Qiao Xi knew that this woman was framing her, but she did not even show any mercy to herself. Her wound was bleeding heavily.","Was it really worth it to torture herself like this for a man?","Before she could continue thinking about it, Madam Wang was already crying. “Capture that b*tch Qiao Xi and bring her to the Gu family for punishment! I want to take revenge for our Shen Ying!”","Qiao Xi saw the proud glow in Shen Ying’s eyes, then looked at the furious Madam Wang. She had to say that Shen Ying’s actions and the way Madam Wang was standing by her side and unconditionally believing her were truly vexing.","She knew that whether she had hurt Shen Ying today or not, they would try their best to pin the blame on her. Even if she explained that she was not the one who did it, these people would never listen. They only believed what they wanted to believe.","Hence, Qiao Xi simply did not explain herself as she did not want to waste her breath on them.","Most importantly, she did not know why Shen Ying would do such a thing to hurt her own body. Both Qiao Rou and Shen Ying were willing to risk their lives to get the man they liked. They did not hesitate to hurt their bodies to frame others. Could such actions be called love?","If this behavior represented love, then wasn’t love too scary?","Qiao Xi was escorted to a dark room by the servants. When Madam Wang saw the wound on Shen Ying’s forehead, she was about to faint from heartache. She naturally did not see the proud smile on Shen Ying’s face.","In the dark room, Qiao Xi nonchalantly sized up her surroundings. A small dark room naturally could not trap her. In the dark room where she could not even see her own hands, she took out her phone and got past the blocked network signal in the dark room.","She held her phone and hesitated to contact Gu Zheng... Actually, it was fine if she did not look for Gu Zheng since she could get out of here herself. She was thinking about why she would think of Gu Zheng the moment she encountered a problem. This was a very bad habit.","Thinking about this, Qiao Xi tapped open her third brother’s profile picture. She processed a few documents that had yet to be done. She needed to work to calm her mind. She must have been too free recently and had been hanging around Gu Zheng, so she would think of him no matter what happened.","...","The news that Qiao Xi had pushed Shen Ying to the floor spread throughout the Gu family.","Song Shiyu’s breathing trembled. “President Gu, Madam has been locked in the dark room. Madam Gu wants to punish her!”","Gu Zheng abruptly raised his hand to signal for the video conference to stop. He quickly walked out. “Qiao Xi is still in the dark room?”","“Yes, after I received the news, I got someone to bring Madam out of the dark room. President Gu, you...”","“I’ll go get her myself.”","Gu Zheng did not know what was going on. When he heard that Qiao Xi was locked in the dark room, he felt as if his heart was being squeezed by a large hand and he could not breathe."]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148 - What Is Love","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu was stunned. “But your eyes...”","President Gu would go blind in such a dark environment. Needless to say, the dark room was dark...","“It’s okay.”","Gu Zheng closed his eyes. “She’ll be afraid if she’s alone there.”","Song Shiyu did not try to persuade him anymore. He thought that President Gu had already fallen for Madam and was willing to go to the dark room for Madam’s sake.","In the dark room, Qiao Xi was leisurely talking to her third brother while silently counting the time it would take for Shen Ying’s poison to take effect. Right at this moment, a ray of light came from the door of the dark room. At the same time, a man’s deep voice sounded. “Qiao Xi.”","It was Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi was shocked. Was she hallucinating? She could actually hear Gu Zheng’s voice? Didn’t he go for a meeting? It was supposed to last for a few hours.","However, a clear voice came from the other end. “Qiao Xi, are you inside?”","After not getting an answer for a long time, the person outside lost his patience and pushed the door open. Qiao Xi was stunned for a long time as she looked at the figure who sneaked into the dark room. She was suddenly a little confused.","If she remembered correctly, Gu Zheng would lose his sight in the dark. Why did he come in, then?","Gu Zheng did not receive Qiao Xi’s reply for a long time and frowned. Could it be that she was no longer here? Had she been taken away by Madam Gu to be punished?","Gu Zheng’s breathing instantly quickened. “Qiao Xi!”","When she noticed that there was something wrong with his voice, Qiao Xi no longer stared blankly. She stood up and walked toward him. “Don’t worry, I’m here...”","Before she could finish, she was suddenly hugged. The man’s hot breath was on her neck. Gu Zheng smelled the familiar scent on her body and his rapidly beating heart slowly calmed down.","Feeling that the man’s large hands were tightly wrapped around her waist, Qiao Xi wiggled her body as she was unused to this but did not struggle to break free. Helpless, she could only maintain this strange posture and ask, “Why are you here? Did you come here just to get me?”","Gu Zheng originally wanted to say, ‘Why are you so stupid to be locked in this dark room by that old woman?’ However, when he heard Qiao Xi’s words, he very rationally swallowed what he wanted to say.","At this moment, he did not want to say anything else. As long as he had confirmed that she was safe, his heart would calm down. Qiao Xi was a little embarrassed. She could sense that Gu Zheng was worried about her, but entering the dark room was part of her plan to harm Shen Ying and the others... It was just that she did not expect Gu Zheng to be so worried about her.","For a moment, she did not know what to say. Qiao Xi stuttered, “Aren’t you supposed to be in a meeting? Don’t tell me that you ran over halfway through the meeting? You don’t have to worry. I’ll be fine. Madam Gu won’t dare to lock me up for too long. It’ll only last for a few hours. She’ll definitely let me out before you come back.”","Gu Zheng was even angrier when he heard her words. “What if my meeting ended very late? Qiao Xi, you’re my wife now. If you’re in danger, as your legal husband, it’s my duty to protect you.”","Qiao Xi opened her mouth and wanted to say that it was not like that. They were just a married couple on the surface, so there was no need for them to be as loving as a real married couple. There was no need for them to support each other.","However, the current situation was too special. Qiao Xi felt that if she said anything, it would definitely anger Gu Zheng, so she swallowed these words.","She curled her fingers. For some reason, when she heard Gu Zheng’s voice and knew that he had left his meeting to look for her, she felt happy.","Qiao Xi suddenly thought of Shen Ying’s method of framing her. “Gu Zheng, for the sake of getting you, Shen Ying didn’t hesitate to hurt herself to get me out of the picture. Is this love?”","Gu Zheng scoffed and said, “No.”","“Then what is love?”","Gu Zheng slowly closed his eyes and felt the warmth from Qiao Xi’s body. His chaotic emotions gradually calmed down. “I don’t know what love is either, but Qiao Xi, remember that love isn’t something that can be obtained by hurting yourself. If I love you, I’ll protect myself better and not let myself be hurt. It’s because I know that your heart will ache if I’m hurt.","“At the same time, if you love me, then you have to protect yourself. My heart will ache even more if you’re hurt. Trying to hurt yourself to get love is not called love but selfishness.”","Gu Zheng stroked Qiao Xi’s hair and said in a low voice, “Qiao Xi, Shen Ying’s actions are not because she loves me. And I don’t love her either.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled."]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149 - Seeking Justice","paragraphs":["The environment she grew up in was different. She did not know what love was. She was a little confused when she saw Qiao Rou distorting the truth in order to get Gu Moling. Then, she saw Meng Wan destroying the banquet to frame her. This time, Shen Ying did not hesitate to hurt herself to get Gu Zheng. Hence, she was confused by all this.","If love was obtained by hurting oneself, she would rather never have love. However, Gu Zheng told her that this was not the case. When one truly loved someone, they had to protect themselves.","Gu Zheng could not see his surroundings and could only sense Qiao Xi’s body temperature. “So in the future, you must protect yourself and not be injured.”","Qiao Xi instinctively said, “No one can hurt me. I’m super powerful.”","The dark room was silent for a while. Gu Zheng chuckled and tightened his grip on Qiao Xi’s waist. “Right, you’re the most powerful.”","With that, Gu Zheng’s hand on her waist slid down to hold her hand. “It’s getting late. I’ll bring you out.”","Qiao Xi reckoned that the poison in Shen Ying’s body was about to take effect, so she nodded and left with Gu Zheng. The group of people outside the dark room were silent like cicadas in the winter. They did not dare to stop Gu Zheng from personally coming to get Qiao Xi.","Although Madam Gu had said that she would lock Qiao Xi up for a day, Gu Zheng was the head of the Gu family and their true master. Between Gu Zheng and Madam Gu, they naturally had to listen to Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng lowered his head to look at her. “Are you going to look for Shen Ying with me, or are you going back to rest first? I can go alone.”","Qiao Xi raised her head to look at him.","“I’m going to seek justice for you.”","Song Shiyu was standing at the side with a pile of documents. After hearing Gu Zheng’s words, he said, “President Gu, I’ve already gathered the evidence you wanted.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Then let’s go.”","...","Shen Ying’s head was wrapped in a thick layer of bandages, and one could vaguely see the blood seeping through. Her forehead received a heavy blow, and the wound caused her to cry. Madam Gu frowned. “The doctor said that you have to take good care of the wound on your forehead. You’ll recover if you take good care of it.”","What she meant was that the wound on her forehead might leave a scar! When Madam Wang and Shen Ying heard the news, their expressions changed instantly. Shen Ying widened her eyes in disbelief.","What? Why would she be disfigured? She just wanted to teach Qiao Xi a lesson, but she never thought that she would be disfigured!","Shen Ying was so angry that her entire body was trembling. Qiao Xi, that b*tch! If Qiao Xi did not snatch Brother Gu Zheng away, she would not have deliberately hurt herself! It was all Qiao Xi’s fault!","Madam Wang cried out in sorrow, “Qiao Xi! Damn that Qiao Xi! She’s forcing Shen Ying to her death! Which girl doesn’t want to be beautiful? Qiao Xi actually wanted to ruin Shen Ying’s face because she’s jealous of Shen Ying. How can there be such a vicious woman?!”","Shen Ying quickly composed herself. Now that she was already disfigured, she had to make Qiao Xi pay the price. She could not take this lying down!","“Aunt, I’m fine. I don’t care if I’m disfigured or not. It’s good enough that I’m still alive. It’s really good...”","When Madam Gu saw that Shen Ying was so sensible and was much better than that arrogant woman, Qiao Xi, she was aggrieved. “Shen Ying, don’t worry. I’ll definitely give you an explanation for this matter. Qiao Xi deliberately caused you to be disfigured. I’ll definitely make her pay you back a hundred or a thousand times more!”","Madam Wang’s eyes shifted as she hurriedly wiped her tears and advised, “Madam Gu, please don’t be like this. Gu Zheng is so protective of Qiao Xi. If he finds out that you’re deliberately targeting Qiao Xi for Shen Ying, he’ll definitely be very angry...”","After a pause, she sighed. “Of course, I’m not saying that we’re afraid of Gu Zheng. It’s just that Gu Zheng is no longer the Gu Zheng from back then. We can’t afford to offend him.”","Madam Gu narrowed her eyes as her anger skyrocketed. Now, even outsiders knew that she could not control Gu Zheng! How could the headstrong Madam Gu accept this?","Ever since Gu Zheng married Qiao Xi, Gu Zheng no longer took her seriously. The two of them had just gotten married. After a period of time and with Qiao Xi’s continuous urging, would Madam Gu still have a place in the family?","She had to teach Qiao Xi a lesson and let her know who in the Gu family called the shots!","At the thought of this, she suddenly slammed the table. “Don’t worry, I’ll definitely not let Qiao Xi off this time! Shen Ying, since you’ve woken up, we’ll go to the dark room and punish that b*tch, Qiao Xi!”","Shen Ying could not help but feel proud of herself, but she still pretended to gently persuade Madam Gu. “Madam Gu, although Miss Qiao pushed me, she definitely didn’t do it on purpose. Let’s not take such harsh actions...”"]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150 - What Was Wrong With Her?","paragraphs":["“Don’t say anything anymore. You’re pure and kind-hearted. I can’t tell that Qiao Xi has wild ambitions. You’ve already been disfigured by her, yet you’re still trying to speak up for her. You...”","With that, Madam Gu was about to call a servant over to help Shen Ying get up when the door was kicked open from the outside with a bang. Song Shiyu retracted his leg elegantly and smiled at the shocked crowd before standing behind Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng stood outside the door and said in a voice that sounded as though he was a demon from hell, “Madam Gu, who do you want to punish?”","His eyes were cold and merciless, like a venomous snake. Madam Gu broke out in a cold sweat.","“Gu... Gu Zheng...”","Madam Gu was shocked for a moment before realizing that the guilty party was Qiao Xi. What was she afraid of?!","Thus, she gnashed her teeth as she looked at Qiao Xi who was behind Gu Zheng. “Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi disfigured Shen Ying. You can’t protect such a vicious person anymore!”","Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on Shen Ying indifferently as he chuckled. “Disfigured?”","Shen Ying thought that Gu Zheng was concerned about her, and tears welled up in her eyes. “Brother Gu Zheng, don’t blame Miss Qiao. It’s my fault. I shouldn’t have resisted Miss Qiao. I should’ve obediently let her—”","Her words were interrupted by a cold laugh from Gu Zheng.","In just a few words, Shen Ying seemed to have told him that Qiao Xi had beaten her up for no reason. Shen Ying wanted to resist, but Qiao Xi beat her even more cruelly.","Shen Ying had fully displayed the art of speaking.","Madam Gu was flustered and exasperated. “Gu Zheng, Shen Ying is already disfigured. Why aren’t you comforting her?! Are you going to protect that woman? What kind of drug did Qiao Xi, that vixen, give you that you’re protecting her so much that you don’t even care about your relationship with Shen Ying? You’ve known each other for the past 20 years!”","Madam Wang wiped her tears. “Forget it. Our Shen Ying just isn’t blessed enough. All these years, Shen Ying has been thinking about Gu Zheng. She thought that she could be with Gu Zheng, but Miss Qiao interfered... Boo-hoo, it’s Shen Ying’s fault. She shouldn’t have liked Gu Zheng, nor should she have a deep affection for him.”","Shen Ying bit her lip. “Yes, it’s my fault. I should have hidden my love for Brother Gu Zheng deep in my heart. I shouldn’t have confessed to Brother Gu Zheng on an impulse and make Miss Qiao Xi overthink things—”","Gu Zheng interrupted her coldly. “Make Qiao Xi overthink things? So what did you tell Qiao Xi?”","Shen Ying paused for a moment. Could it be that Gu Zheng also felt that Qiao Xi is not worthy of him? Was Brother Gu Zheng also disappointed in Qiao Xi now?","At the thought of this, she sobbed softly. “Miss Qiao warned me to stay away from you, Brother Gu Zheng, but you and I are childhood sweethearts. Our friendship can’t be severed just like that. I only told the truth, but Miss Qiao suddenly got angry. She said that I’m as shameless as a mistress who is interfering in someone else’s marriage. Brother Gu Zheng, I don’t understand why Miss Qiao is targeting me like this. Although I think she’s wrong, I’m too stupid to retort—”","“She’s wrong? What’s wrong with what she said?” Gu Zheng sneered.","Shen Ying’s expression froze.","Gu Zheng looked at her coldly. “Miss Shen, you said that you’ve liked me for many years and that we’re childhood sweethearts?”","Shen Ying stammered, “Y-Yes.”","“Why don’t I know about you and me being childhood sweethearts?” Gu Zheng’s tone was neither fast nor slow. “You said that you’ve liked me for many years, so why haven’t you confessed before? Why did you have to say this in front of my wife after I got married... What’s your intention behind doing this? Is it wrong for Qiao Xi to say that you’re like a mistress?”","Shen Ying widened her eyes in disbelief.","“Miss Shen, you and I weren’t childhood sweethearts. You deliberately lied to drive a wedge between me and my wife. I know my wife’s character very well. If she really did warn you to stay away from me, then I’ll be very happy. It means that she knows how to cherish me and protect me.","“It’s a pity that my wife isn’t like that. If no one bullied her, she wouldn’t even know how to retort. It’s also because of her kindness that you guys are bullying her time and again. If she really did hit you today, I’ll set off firecrackers at the Gu family’s door to celebrate.”","The room was silent for a few seconds. Gu Zheng’s words were too shocking.","After an unknown period of time, Shen Ying’s tears and sobbing broke the silence. She cried noisily. “I-I’m sorry, Brother Gu Zheng. I didn’t know that I would cause you so much trouble. Boo-hoo... I just love you too much. I couldn’t control myself. It’s my fault. I shouldn’t be here. I shouldn’t have been in Miss Qiao’s way... I did something wrong, so I should be punished by Miss Qiao...”","Seeing Shen Ying cry so miserably, Madam Wang could not help but cry as well."]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151 - Using The Family Law","paragraphs":["Madam Gu’s gaze was sharp as she gritted her teeth. “Gu Zheng, it has already come to this point yet you’re still protecting her. Shen Ying has already been disfigured, and Qiao Xi, the initiator, is standing right here. She even said so many nasty words. You...”","Before she could finish, Gu Zheng raised his hand and interrupted Madam Gu.","Song Shiyu took out a laptop and placed it on the table with a mocking smile.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness. “My wife is kind-hearted and would not do such a thing. Even if she did, it’s Shen Ying who deserves it. She could have provoked anyone but she chose to provoke my wife. So, is Miss Shen still going to pursue the matter?”","Kind-hearted?","Shen Ying’s face turned pale as she pursed her lips.","Madam Gu and Madam Wang looked at Gu Zheng with anger. “What are you talking about? Are you saying that Shen Ying deliberately provoked Qiao Xi? She’s such an obedient child!”","“Shen Ying likes you. She’s the one who should be by your side. Unfortunately, you married such a vicious wife and are causing trouble everywhere. You’ve simply disgraced the Gu family!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Song Shiyu turned on the laptop and played a video.","Shen Ying had a bad feeling.","Gu Zheng smiled coldly and said, “The game is over. Miss Shen, are you still going to continue... acting?”","Although he spoke casually, it was like a sharp knife that stabbed into Shen Ying’s heart.","Shen Ying’s body instantly trembled as she looked at Gu Zheng in disbelief.","Could it be that Gu Zheng knew that she was pretending?","Impossible!","While Shen Ying was panicking, Song Shiyu pushed the laptop in front of everyone. The video was of Qiao Xi and Shen Ying.","After Qiao Xi entered, the two of them had a short conversation. Although the surveillance footage did not have audio, Shen Ying’s arrogant expression could not be hidden.","She pretended to be weak in front of others, but in front of Qiao Xi, she was like a snake spitting out its venom. Her face was really disgusting to look at.","Right when Qiao Xi turned around and was about to leave, a trace of resentment flashed through Shen Ying’s eyes as she fiercely slammed herself into the wall. Blood flowed down her forehead.","The surveillance camera had captured everything clearly. Qiao Xi did not even touch Shen Ying’s finger.","Immediately, there was silence. Madam Gu and Madam Wang’s faces were pale. Shen Ying’s body was trembling, and she gradually fell into a dead silence.","Clap, clap, clap!","Gu Zheng clapped lazily. “Miss Shen, you act well. Do you still have the cheek to say that my wife hurt you?”","Shen Ying panicked as tears streamed down her face. “I... I probably just lost my balance and fell. I was dizzy from the collision and mistakenly thought that Miss Qiao pushed me. I really didn’t do it on purpose, I...”","Gu Zheng smirked. Song Shiyu, who was next to him, handed him a report. “Although you hit your head, it’s just a small cut on your skin. It looks serious, but in reality, you didn’t even get a mild concussion. Shen Ying, are you qualified to trick me?”","Shen Ying gritted her teeth. She knew that the matter had been completely exposed. If she continued to pretend, she would definitely suffer an ugly end.","She cried loudly, “Brother Gu Zheng, I really like you. I only did this because I found out that you have a wife. Miss Qiao is very good, but she doesn’t suit you. I know that I shouldn’t have done that, but I did it for you!”","Madam Gu’s expression darkened. She was dissatisfied with Shen Ying’s lies and even more dissatisfied with Gu Zheng’s unwillingness to let the matter go for Qiao Xi’s sake.","Not long after locking Qiao Xi in the dark room, he so aggressively rushed in.","Seeing that the situation was out of control, Madam Wang immediately stepped forward to mediate the situation. “Gu Zheng, Shen Ying was just being silly. Actually, she’s a kind child. Since the matter has been investigated and Miss Qiao is fine, why don’t we just forget about it? It won’t be pleasant if news of this gets out.”","“Forget it?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, and everyone immediately became nervous.","“Sure.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Shen Ying immediately heaved a sigh of relief.","Gu Zheng was still considerate toward her. Moreover, Qiao Xi was safe and sound now, so he would not bear to punish her.","Just as she was fantasizing about what to do next, Gu Zheng’s cold voice was heard.","“I heard that you wanted to punish my wife, but the truth is that she was wronged. Only those who have really committed mistakes should be punished.”","Shen Ying’s face turned pale!","What?","Gu Zheng... wanted to use the family law on her?","She gasped, a chill rushing through her."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152 - Beat You Up Together","paragraphs":["The Gu family’s law was harsh. If she took a few blows, her flesh and blood would probably be ruined.","Madam Wang was stunned, then she cried out loudly, “Young Master Gu, please let Shen Ying off! She’s so delicate and fragile. If she can’t handle the family law, she’ll die!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm. “When you wanted to hit my wife, why didn’t you think about whether she could take it?”","Shen Ying burst into tears. She was filled with resentment. Why was that b*tch Qiao Xi able to marry Brother Gu Zheng and even receive his protection?","Qiao Xi was just a country bumpkin while she was the daughter of a rich family. The two of them were worlds apart.","Moreover, Qiao Xi was not injured while she had injured her head.","Madam Gu’s expression darkened. “Gu Zheng, it’s not wrong to say that Shen Ying likes you. Moreover, I was the one who locked Qiao Xi up in the dark room. Are you going to hit me, too?”","Gu Zheng chuckled and said, “You have to be punished for doing something wrong. Since you took the initiative to ask, of course, you can take a beating too.”","“You...”","Madam Gu was furious.","This was crazy!","For the sake of Qiao Xi, Gu Zheng had really gone mad. He actually wanted to hit his mother!","Gu Zheng looked at Song Shiyu indifferently. Song Shiyu immediately understood. He pushed the door open and gestured to the bodyguards outside.","The bodyguards rushed in and pressed Shen Ying down roughly.","“Madam Gu! Aunt...” Shen Ying struggled weakly and looked at Gu Zheng in a panic. “Brother Gu Zheng! Master Gu! I was wrong. Please let me off! ”","“Gu Zheng!” Madam Gu roared. She did not expect Gu Zheng to be so bold. She was burning with anger and her whole body was trembling. “Stop it!”","“Say what you want. You can’t stop me from doing what I want to do, Madam Gu!”","Gu Zheng was playing with a dart that had exquisite patterns on it. He glanced at Madam Gu and chuckled. “I don’t even take you seriously. It’s just Shen Ying. Why can’t I deal with her? Or do you want to be punished together with Shen Ying?”","Madam Gu was unable to restrain her anger. “You bastard! How dare you speak to your mother like this? You’re actually going to beat Shen Ying to death for a b*tch? How is that b*tch Qiao Xi worthy to be the daughter-in-law of the Gu family—”","Bang!","A loud bang interrupted Madam Gu.","The dart in Gu Zheng’s hand brushed past Madam Gu and pierced itself into the wall behind her.","He said casually, “Madam Gu, watch your words. If you say the word ‘b*tch’ again, I can’t guarantee that I’ll be able to hold myself back.”","With that, he turned around to leave while the bodyguards dragged the crying Shen Ying out. Madam Gu and Madam Wang were trembling all over and did not say a word.","After Qiao Xi returned to her room, she received a WeChat message from Qin An.","[Little Six, are you participating in the translation competition? I heard that the professional translator, Fan Wenyuan, is accepting a disciple. Do you want to be his disciple?]","Qiao Xi was not interested. [No.]","Qin An replied: [No problem. You’re talented, so it’s okay if you don’t like him.]","Qiao Xi tossed her phone to the side. It was not that she looked down on anyone, but she felt that it was too boring. Gu Zheng’s face was all she could think of.","Why was he so worried about her? He could ignore everything just to save her?","Qiao Xi seemed to have sensed a trace of inexplicable emotion in her heart. In the past, she was used to being strong and independent. She did not rely on anyone, but now that Gu Zheng had appeared, he would stand up for her and even protect her.","“Young Master Gu locked Miss Shen in the dark room. Madam is about to die of anger...”","At this moment, the voices of a few servants sounded, causing Qiao Xi to be slightly surprised.","Gu Zheng had really locked Shen Ying up. She thought that he would not disobey Madam Gu.","Just as she was thinking about it, her phone beeped again.","[Little Six, the fiance the old man arranged for you is in the Gu family. Do you want to hide?]","Qiao Xi was instantly petrified.","The legendary big shot who made the old man and Third Brother feel reverence was in the Gu family?","At this moment, the door suddenly opened and Gu Zheng walked in.","Qiao Xi put down her phone to avoid her messages being seen by Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng had mentioned her fiance last time and he did not look too good. If Gu Zheng found out that the man was in the Gu family, he would tear down the roof.","Gu Zheng’s eyes narrowed as he noticed Qiao Xi’s actions.","Ding!","Her phone beeped continuously.","[Little Six, let me tell you. That big shot is incredible. He has extremely few precious treasures in the world. Those things are priceless.","[He has a great reputation overseas but is very low-profile in the country. Few people have seen him, especially in the academic research community. No one can compare to him. In short, he’s indeed a big shot!]","Qiao Xi’s heart jumped. No wonder even the old man, who was so arrogant, was full of praise for him."]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153 - The Delicate Flower Takes A Beating","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This person had so many precious treasures in his hands that were coveted by many countries. However, he was still able to remain safe. This meant that his strength and wealth could already be compared to some countries.","“What do you find so fascinating, Mrs. Gu?” Gu Zheng asked calmly.","Qiao Xi was shocked and quickly put away her phone. “Gu Zheng, I heard that you locked Shen Ying up?”","The man’s eyes were indifferent as he sneered. Qiao Xi looked as if she had done something wrong.","Qiao Xi looked nervously at Gu Zheng, and she was extremely perturbed in her heart.","Actually, she was not interested in that big shot at all. She did not know who he was either. It was just that she could not let Gu Zheng know about this.","Gu Zheng nodded and said casually, “She caused you to be locked up in the dark room, so I let her have a taste of her own medicine.”","A trace of emotion surged in Qiao Xi’s heart. She opened her mouth and said softly, “Thank you.”","When she raised her head, she met Gu Zheng’s deep eyes.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. “Why are you looking at me like that?”","Was it strange for her to say thank you?","Gu Zheng’s eyes were slightly cold. “It was my negligence that gave them the opportunity to do that to you. We don’t need to thank each other in the future.”","Did they not have to say thank you to each other because they were husband and wife so it would be too polite of them or was it because he was the cause of this matter?","Qiao Xi suddenly felt slightly annoyed, a strange feeling.","Gu Zheng seemed to be too protective of her.","“Ah!","At this moment, a scream came from outside.","Qiao Xi could tell that it was Shen Ying’s voice, and the corners of her mouth instantly curled up as she pulled Gu Zheng along and charged out.","“The delicate flower is being beaten up? I want to go take a look!”","The Gu family’s butler watched as Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s hand, and his heart thumped. Young Master had never been intimate with others. It seemed that he would definitely be angry this time.","In the dark room.","Song Shiyu held the board that was full of thorns and looked calm. “Miss Shen, sorry for offending you.”","With that, he raised the board.","At this moment, Madam Gu felt a stinging pain on her face. She reached out to touch it and realized that there was a bump on her originally smooth face. There was more than one bump, and it was extremely frightening.","She thought that it was because Gu Zheng had angered her, but when she looked up, she realized that Madam Wang’s face was covered in red bumps as well.","“Ah!!!”","Shen Ying’s screams echoed throughout the dark room. “My face hurts! Assistant Song, what did you do?”","Madam Gu turned to look at Shen Ying. Her originally smooth and fair face was now full of disgusting bumps. One of them was accidentally punctured and yellow pus was flowing out.","Just then, she felt a sharp pain in her face.","Shen Ying looked at Madam Gu and Madam Wang before screaming in horror.","Song Shiyu looked helpless. “Miss Shen, I think you shouldn’t shout anymore. Why don’t we continue tomorrow? You can go back and calm down first.”","Shen Ying’s tears fell like rain. Her salty tears came into contact with her wound, and her body trembled in pain. “My face is ruined but you still want to hit me? Boo-hoo...”","Madam Gu immediately instructed the servants to bring a mirror over. When she saw her reflection, she immediately screamed in shock.","At this moment, Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s hand and walked unhurriedly to the door of the dark room. When she heard the shouting inside, she said in a low voice, “Why are the three of them shouting at the same time?”","The dark room was in a mess. The three women shouted miserably, “Call the doctors! Help!”","Qiao Xi craned her head in to take a look, and the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile. “You deserve it!”","Gu Zheng lowered his head to look at Qiao Xi and said casually, “The entire Gu family’s residence is monitored. We’ll know who attacked them in less than ten minutes.”","Qiao Xi was not nervous in the slightest and said indifferently, “Oh.”","After a while, the doctors rushed over and examined them. They soon came to a conclusion.","“The three of you have been poisoned. This is a strange herb from an African tribe. It’s not very toxic, but after the fruit and leaves are extracted, it becomes a type of poison. The extraction process is very complicated and the price is very high. The poison also has a certain incubation period, so the exact timing of when they were poisoned is unknown.”","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi. “Aren’t you afraid?”","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised. “Why should I be afraid? I wasn’t the one who poisoned them. I’m just a country bumpkin. I’ve never been to Africa at all. How could I have such a strange poison with me? Why would a weak and helpless girl like me poison them?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Never mind, even if they found out that it was Qiao Xi who did it, it was no big deal. So long as he was around, he would not let anyone touch a single strand of Qiao Xi’s hair.","The doctors did a detailed check-up on the three of them, then said with a serious expression, “Madam Gu, this poison can be spread through the air. We predict you came into contact with it about four hours ago.”","Four hours?","Madam Gu abruptly turned her head and looked at Qiao Xi with vicious eyes. She was furious. “You actually dared to poison me! I’m your mother-in-law! You’re so vicious to want me to be disfigured! You’re too vicious!”","Shen Ying and Madam Wang were sobbing."]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154 - Mrs. Gu Pretends To Be Soft","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Madam Gu gritted her teeth in hatred. Her son did not take her seriously, and her daughter-in-law even poisoned her. It was simply too embarrassing. She was so angry that her whole body was trembling. “What are you waiting for?! Tie this b*tch up. I’ll make her pay the price!”","The servants’ hearts skipped a beat as they glanced at Gu Zheng. With him around, who would dare to attack?","Madam Gu burned with anger. Of course, she understood why the servants did not dare to attack. With Gu Zheng around, who would dare to touch Qiao Xi?","If she had known earlier, she would not have kept this unfilial son with her!","Back then, she had only said that Gu Zheng was her son to avoid trouble and also to make him work for her.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng had grown up and was no longer under her control. He even became the person in charge of the entire Gu family.","Madam Gu gritted her teeth in hatred as her mind buzzed. “Fine! Since you’re unwilling to listen to me, I’ll do it myself! Qiao Xi! I’ll ruin your face...”","Gu Zheng casually blocked Madam Gu with a cold expression.","“Are you going against me because of this woman? I’m your mother. If it weren’t for me, you’d still be a little bastard. Now—”","“Madam Gu.” At this moment, Qiao Xi suddenly interrupted her. “Why are you so sure that I did it?”","Madam Gu roared, “Who else but you? B*tch...”","“But when you were poisoned, I was still in the dark room.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with grievances, and she had an innocent expression. “Madam Gu, I know you don’t like me, but you need evidence to convict me. It’s utterly impossible for me to have escaped from the dark room to poison you. I have nothing to say if you insist on wronging me, but there are so many eyes watching!”","“You...”","Madam Gu was speechless.","Everyone looked at each other and could not help but nod.","That’s right, Qiao Xi had always been in the dark room and had no chance to poison them at all!","They all knew in their hearts that Madam Gu detested her daughter-in-law, but it was not Qiao Xi who did this, yet she insisted on making her the scapegoat.","Shen Ying looked at Qiao Xi with resentment. She no longer pretended to be a delicate flower. “Qiao Xi, stop quibbling. Only you can be so vicious. You’re too heartless...”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “You were poisoned four hours ago.”","Shen Ying quickly retorted, “What the doctor says might not be true!”","Everyone looked at Shen Ying mockingly.","Qiao Xi smiled helplessly. “Miss Shen, the doctors invited by the Gu family is famous in the industry. They have saved countless lives. You can say whatever you want, but how can you slander the doctors’ innocence?!”","The servants all looked at Shen Ying with dissatisfaction.","In just a few words, Shen Ying had inexplicably offended the doctors. It was really wishful thinking for her to want to be the mistress of the Gu family in the future!","At this moment, the butler walked over with a helpless expression. “Madam, the surveillance cameras show that only the three of you were in the tearoom four hours ago. No one else appeared during that period.”","Gu Zheng was standing right in front of him. The butler did not dare to spout nonsense even if he had the guts.","Four hours ago, Qiao Xi was in the dark room and had not left.","Madam Gu, Madam Wang, and Shen Ying were all in the Gu family’s tearoom.","The tearoom was reserved for Madam Gu’s guests and even her personal servants could not enter. Who exactly was so capable as to poison the three of them?","The doctors had serious expressions. “Poisonous herbs can be inhaled through the nose, but the smell is pungent. It’s easy to notice. If it was in the water, it’d be colorless and odorless, making it difficult to discover. You should think about whether you drank something.”","Everyone was stunned for a moment before they suddenly came to a realization.","No one was allowed to enter Madam Gu’s private tearoom.","The tea they drank was tested and found to be non-toxic. However, they were all poisoned after drinking the tea.","It was obvious that the person who poisoned them was Madam Gu!]","Qiao Xi silently sighed, her face filled with grievances.","“My identity is indeed not worthy of Gu Zheng. If you don’t like me, Madam Gu, you could just chase me away. Now, in order to accuse me of poisoning others, you even implicated Miss Shen and Madam Wang.”","Qiao Xi changed the topic. “Could it be that this was your plan all along? As long as you chase me away, Miss Shen can marry Gu Zheng. I understand! I’ll leave right now! Miss Shen, I wish you happiness! Boo-hoo...”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi covered her face and cried.","Gu Zheng: “...”","Gu Zheng pulled Qiao Xi into his embrace and comforted her in a light voice. “Don’t cry anymore. No one can chase you away.”","Qiao Xi sobbed. “Boo-hoo... But your mother doesn’t like me.. She even accused me of poisoning others. If I’m really convicted, how will I continue living in this world?!”"]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155 - Beautiful And Kind Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["The doctors all frowned. They were all doctors from the Medical Association. Madam Gu still had to rely on them to come to the Gu family to treat her illness, so there were some things that they had to say.","“Madam Gu, you’re maligning others for your own benefits. This is the Gu family’s matter and we can’t interfere, but we’re very busy. We can use this time to save a few more patients. We don’t have time to waste with you!”","Another doctor was dissatisfied as well. “If you want to frame Mrs. Gu and chase her out of the Gu family, you have to do a better job at it. However, there are too many loopholes. Do you think we’re all fools?”","Seeing that the situation was not looking good, the butler said in a low voice, “Madam, you’re the one who’s in the wrong here. If you don’t explain... You know what Young Master’s temper is like. Before he gets angry, quickly apologize. No matter what, Young Master is your son. He won’t say anything. Otherwise, it won’t be so simple when the matriarch comes to handle it.”","Madam Gu gritted her teeth in anger.","They wanted her to apologize to Qiao Xi?","What was going on?!","Gu Zheng was her son. So what if she had wrongly accused Qiao Xi?","It had to be known that it was treason to attack one’s own mother!","Madam Gu knew that if she apologized now, Gu Zheng would not pursue the matter. After all, she was the madam of the Gu family.","Even if Gu Zheng was unwilling to let this matter go, as her daughter-in-law, Qiao Xi had to show her, the mother-in-law, some respect.","In the end, Madam Gu gritted her teeth. “Miss Qiao, I made a mistake.”","Qiao Xi shook her head weakly and innocently. “Forget it, Madam Gu. I know you hate me, and I’ve forgiven you. This matter is over.”","The surrounding people discussed softly and praised Qiao Xi for her beauty and kind heart.","Shen Ying gritted her teeth. Qiao Xi was beautiful but kind-hearted?","Shen Ying was in disbelief. She had been poisoned and was about to be disfigured!","How did she end up becoming the criminal who poisoned herself, while Qiao Xi became the target of everyone’s praise?","Was this not the opposite of how things should be?","“Miss Shen, what are you thinking about? Are you unable to accept it?” Qiao Xi took the opportunity to walk to Shen Ying’s side and asked in a low voice.","“I was locked in a dark room by you guys. If Gu Zheng hadn’t run back to save me, I would’ve definitely been punished by the family law. And I’d be the one disfigured!","“You tried to harm me but you got yourself disfigured in the end. This is called giving someone a taste of their own medicine!”","Shen Ying was so angry that her whole body was trembling. She roared in her heart.","“Ah!","However, she did not dare to open her mouth because no one would believe her.","In the end, she could only watch helplessly as Qiao Xi plastered a smile on her face and left the room hand in hand with Gu Zheng.","After leaving, Gu Zheng looked at her casually. “Why did the doctors say that they came in contact with the poison four hours ago?”","As Madam Gu, Madam Wang, and Shen Ying were poisoned four hours ago, they would definitely not suspect Qiao Xi.","If Qiao Xi had not been locked in the dark room at that time, even if Qiao Xi was not captured in the surveillance footage, Madam Gu would still have insisted that Qiao Xi had poisoned them.","However, it just so happened that Madam Gu was the one who had ordered Qiao Xi to be locked in the dark room. This could be considered as an overreaction.","Gu Zheng thought, ‘Actually, regardless of whether I returned or not, Qiao Xi would be fine. She deliberately waited in the dark room as part of her plan to poison the three of them and create an alibi for herself.’","This way, no one would suspect that she had poisoned their drinks.","Qiao Xi looked at him with an innocent expression. “Young Master Gu, what are you talking about? Could it be that you think I was the one who poisoned them? I’m so weak and gentle. I can’t do such a vicious thing like poisoning someone. Moreover, I was in the dark room at that time!”","“Hah!” Gu Zheng snorted and smirked. “You already poisoned them before you entered the dark room. It was when Madam Gu pulled you over to apologize to Shen Ying.”","Gu Zheng thought for a moment. This was the most likely time. Qiao Xi would have sufficient time to sprinkle the poisonous powder on Madam Gu without anyone noticing.","After they returned to Shen Ying’s room, Madam Wang ridiculed Qiao Xi, giving her the opportunity to strike.","It was even easier for Qiao Xi when she was alone with Shen Ying.","Qiao Xi’s expression froze. “...”","Damn! She had been discovered.","‘Don’t I look like I’m pretending to be weak?’","How did Gu Zheng see through her?","Qiao Xi calmed herself down and continued to look at Gu Zheng pitifully.","“Master Gu, you’ve wronged me! How could I have poisoned them? Don’t you believe me?”","Gu Zheng had a calm expression. “The toxicity of the poison powder is very weak. It won’t hurt even if it’s sprinkled on your body. However, if you drink honeysuckle tea at the same time, it’ll trigger the poison.”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face instantly vanished. “Young Master Gu, I don’t understand what you mean.”","Gu Zheng said casually, “Madam Gu’s throat wasn’t feeling well today, so she drank honeysuckle tea to soothe it. I think it was you who caused her throat to hurt.”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. This man was aware of it?"]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156 - Knew The Divine Physician","paragraphs":["She gulped. “Does Madam Gu’s sore throat have anything to do with me? I’m just an unwanted daughter-in-law! How could I harm my mother-in-law?","“Even if I was the one who poisoned her, how would I know that Madam Gu and Shen Ying would go for tea? Moreover, the doctors are all highly skilled doctors. How could they not have found out about this poison?”","Qiao Xi sighed helplessly. “Young Master Gu, it’s fine if you don’t believe me!”","Gu Zheng smiled lightly.","That’s right, there was a reason for Qiao Xi’s farce.","The doctors treating Madam Gu must be working for her.]","Firstly, they had to drink tea. Even if just one person drank it, Qiao Xi’s revenge could be considered a success.","At that time, when the doctors said that they were poisoned four hours ago, Gu Zheng found it a little strange. It was not some poisonous plant from an African tribe but just ordinary pollen.","The doctors were just playing along with Qiao Xi.","However, the people from the Medical Association had always been upright and honest. How could they possibly put on an act with Qiao Xi?","Gu Zheng sat down lazily without batting an eyelid. “There’s only one possibility. You’re also from the Medical Association, and your position is higher than theirs, so they have to listen to your orders.”","Qiao Xi was about to run when she heard Gu Zheng’s indifferent voice. She almost staggered and fell to the ground.","What was going on?","She wondered if Gu Zheng had installed surveillance cameras in her head. How did he know everything?!","She was indeed the one who got the doctors to help her put on an act. However, the pollen came from an African tribe. It was not poisonous, but when combined with honeysuckle tea, it would produce toxins. One’s face would be full of pustules, making it itchy and painful. After a few days, the toxins would naturally expel from the body.","Qiao Xi had planned it out since a long time ago. She thought in her heart that no one would suspect anything. She did not understand how Gu Zheng could have guessed it.","Gu Zheng said unhurriedly, “You knew that Madam Gu values her face the most. Furthermore, she’s arrogant. If she knows that she’s disfigured, she’ll definitely send someone to invite the people from the Medical Association.","“Moreover, the Gu family is a member of the Medical Association. Those three doctors have been waiting for a long time in the Medical Association. As long as someone from the Gu family goes over, they’ll take the initiative to follow them back here.”","Qiao Xi smiled embarrassedly and hurriedly shook her head. “Young Master Gu, you’re really funny. The doctors said that this poisonous powder has a pungent smell, but they didn’t smell it at all.","“I know they hate me, so I’ve been keeping my distance from them.”","Gu Zheng was helpless.","Well said!","This question stumped him.","Qiao Xi had time to poison them, but the poison powder had a smell and there were surveillance cameras everywhere. How could they not have noticed?","Qiao Xi smiled and revealed an aggrieved expression. “Young Master Gu, I really wasn’t the one who poisoned them. It was Madam Gu who wronged me. I’m really too aggrieved! I’m very tired now. I’m going back to rest, alright?”","Unfortunately, even if Gu Zheng racked his brains, he would never have thought that she could insert the needles laced with poison into their bodies without them knowing.","Qiao Xi swaggered off.","Although Gu Zheng would not hurt her, there were some secrets that should not be casually disclosed. After all, she had not reached this extent of honesty with Gu Zheng.","However...","Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant.","Should she tell Gu Zheng? Actually, she still wanted to tell him.","Forget it. They were going to get a divorce in a year anyway. After their agreement ended, they would be strangers.","Third Brother told her not to be too serious, or she would be the one getting hurt in the end.","...","Song Shiyu was scared witless. “Young Master, I couldn’t spot her.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. “You couldn’t spot her?”","He was sure that his deduction was correct. It was Qiao Xi who poisoned them, and she did it according to his deductions.","However, there were so many cameras but they could not capture any traces of her poisoning them.","Song Shiyu broke out in cold sweat. “Young Master, in my opinion, Young Madam was just venting her anger for you. Why do you have to prove that Madam was the one who poisoned them?”","Gu Zheng smiled.","He was not doing this to prove that Qiao Xi poisoned them. He was just curious about how many more secrets she had.","Not just anyone could enter the Medical Association. Moreover, Qiao Xi knew the divine physician.","Suddenly, Song Shiyu looked surprised. “Young Master, that man and Young Madam seem to be very intimate!”","Gu Zheng looked over.","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi was about to leave when a gentle voice sounded. “You’re Miss Qiao?”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Yes, you are?”","The person was full of smiles and looked elegant. “My surname is Lu. When I saw you, Miss Qiao, I thought you looked familiar.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","What?","Surnamed Lu? He wasn’t from the Gu family.","Those who could enter the Gu family must be either rich or powerful.","Third Brother said that the big shot’s fiancé was in the Gu family...","The man in front of her said that she looked familiar..."]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157 - Meeting The Legendary Fiance","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi hurriedly took out her phone. [Third Brother, what’s the name of the big shot?]","Qin An replied: [I’m not too sure. The old man doesn’t know either. This person is very low-profile and has never revealed his real name. However, everyone in the scientific research institute calls him ‘God Lu’.]","Lu??","When Qiao Xi saw this word, she was instantly petrified. Her face was pale, and her voice trembled. “What is Mr. Lu doing in the Gu family?”","This important figure held precious elements in his hands. 20 million USD per gram. If it were this person...","As soon as she finished speaking, Mr. Lu replied with a smile, “I’m here to discuss the precious elements business with you.”","Qiao Xi: “??”","His surname and identity seemed to be a match, and he was also in the Gu family. Qiao Xi felt a chill surge into her heart and could not help but take a few steps back. “Then I won’t disturb you anymore, Mr. Lu. I’ll be going first.”","“Miss Qiao, you’re leaving just like that?”","Mr. Lu was all smiles, but his voice was still warm and humble. “Did I offend you in any way, Miss Qiao?”","Qiao Xi’s heart seemed to have been stuffed with a rock. The feeling was slightly indescribable.","Although the man in front of her looked gentle and polite, he gave off a sinister feeling.","His eyes were as cold as a venomous snake, causing Qiao Xi to shudder and smile awkwardly.","“Mr. Lu, you’re overthinking it. I have something urgent to attend to. Besides, this is the first time I’m meeting you. Why did you say that?”","The corners of Mr. Lu’s mouth curled up slightly. “If this is our first time meeting, why would you avoid me? You should know very well that you’re already married.”","Holy sh*t!","Qiao Xi’s heart jerked as she gulped.","The engagement at that time was just a joke. The big shot probably didn’t care about it at all. Hence, Qiao Xi didn’t take it seriously either and thought that the old man was just speaking casually.","Moreover, when Qiao Xi was 18, the old man anxiously looked for that big shot and asked about the engagement. That big shot refused at that time.","Things had already happened, so why was she still pretending here?","He was the one who was unwilling back then, but he was blaming her for getting married now. Was this person crazy?!","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with anger. “Mr. Lu, I don’t understand what you mean. I’ll get going first!”","“Miss Qiao—” He was about to say something when a cold voice sounded.","“Mr. Lu, you should call her Mrs. Gu.”","Gu Zheng slowly walked over and held Qiao Xi’s hand. “I’ll have Song Shiyu bring you back to your room to rest.”","Then, he said coldly, “Mr. Lu, please.”","Lu Yan glanced at Qiao Xi before leaving with Gu Zheng.","Song Shiyu asked anxiously, “Madam, do you know Lu Yan?”","Lu Yan was pestering Young Madam just now. It seemed that he was going to snatch her away! This person was too annoying. He wanted to compete with Young Master for everything. The funny thing was that he was not Young Master’s match at all.","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless: “...”","She could not explain at all that Lu Yan was her fiance.","However, she could not tell Song Shiyu this. She raised her eyebrows. “He must be very rich!”","Song Shiyu broke out in a cold sweat. “He’s far worse than Young Master!”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. “Then he definitely holds a lot of authority!”","Song Shiyu guaranteed in a hurry, “Not as much as Young Master!”","Qiao Xi was speechless.","Since he could not compare to Gu Zheng in any way, what did the old man see in Lu Yan that he tried so hard to marry her to that man?","Qiao Xi silently sent a message to Qin An: [I saw the big shot!]","Qin An: [Is he handsome?]","Qiao Xi: [That big shot is nothing like that. He’s not as handsome as my husband, nor is he as rich and powerful as my husband. In short, he’s inferior to my husband in everything.]","Qin An was speechless.","When Qiao Xi sent another message, a red exclamation mark appeared on the screen.","Damn! She had been blacklisted!","...","Lu Yan stayed in the Gu family for only a moment before leaving. Song Shiyu was trembling with fear. “Young Master, Young Madam just asked me if Lu Yan is very rich!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Does she really need money?”","Song Shiyu gulped. “That Lu Yan must be up to no good. You have to be careful. Don’t let him snatch Young Madam away!”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and was about to leave.","Song Shiyu quickly grabbed Gu Zheng. “Young Master, Young Master, calm down.”","Gu Zheng glanced at him indifferently. Song Shiyu quickly let go and advised him softly, “Young Master, think about it. Women like gentle men. Madam must like him too, which is why she was so close to Lu Yan earlier.”","The chauffeur who came to the Gu family’s house to pick them up and bring them back to Longwan Residential was speechless.","Assistant Song had taught Young Master Gu well, huh? But he shouldn’t ever teach Young Master Gu again.","However, Young Master seemed to really believe him!","Gu Zheng’s expression was serious as he left without saying anything.","Qiao Xi was chatting happily with Qin An when she turned around and saw Gu Zheng. She was immediately shocked. “Are you done?”","“We’re going home.”","Gu Zheng was a man of few words and said without batting an eyelid, “Lu Yan is not a simple person. Stay away from him in the future.”","Qiao Xi nodded. Actually, even if Gu Zheng did not tell her, she knew that Lu Yan was not an ordinary person. It was better not to come into contact with him."]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158 - Im Richer Than Lu Yan","paragraphs":["“Qiao Xi, do you like money a lot?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","What was this?","Did she look like she was in need of money?","What was wrong with Young Master Gu today? He actually asked such a question.","“Not really.”","Qiao Xi replied truthfully that she was indeed not lacking money.","She suddenly thought of why Gu Zheng asked this question. It should be because of Lu Yan. If she were to compare herself to Lu Yan, she would of course not be considered rich.","The precious element he had in his hands was worth 20 million USD per gram. Furthermore, the output was small. Lu Yan must be extremely rich enough to have such a precious resource.","While Qiao Xi was thinking, Gu Zheng casually said, “I’m richer than Lu Yan.”","“??”","Qiao Xi was stunned, then came to a sudden understanding.","It turned out that Gu Zheng had asked her in a roundabout manner because he wanted to prove that he was richer than Lu Yan.","Gu Zheng smiled. “You like money, so you’ll definitely like me more.”","If Qiao Xi liked money, she would definitely like him more because he was richer than Lu Yan.","Qiao Xi’s heart jerked.","Everything he said before was just to lay the groundwork. What Gu Zheng said earlier was the main point.","After returning to their house’s living room, Gu Zheng’s words still echoed in Qiao Xi’s mind.","Qiao Xi wanted to ask Gu Zheng what he meant, but he went into the study after they returned and she fell asleep while waiting.","Qiao Xi was awakened by her phone ringing at seven in the morning.","Qiao Xi answered the call with sleepy eyes. Her mind was still in a mess. “Hello...”","The chancellor’s heart trembled as he trembled with fear. “Sorry, Qiao Xi, I woke you up.”","Qiao Xi gradually came back to her senses. She got up and walked to the window before clearing her throat. “Chancellor, what’s the matter?”","Seeing that she was not angry, the chancellor carefully said, “Qiao Xi, if you’re not busy, can you come to the university?”","Qiao Xi was supposed to be resting today. Something must have happened for the chancellor to call.","Before she could ask what it was, she heard an impatient voice—","“Chancellor Chen, there’s no need to be polite to a cheater. Get her to come to the university quickly. We have to investigate this matter thoroughly and seek justice for the other students.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","Cheater?","Who was this person?","Cold sweat broke out on Chancellor Chen’s forehead. “Mr. Fan, you shouldn’t come to a conclusion so soon. The matter has not been investigated yet...”","“What else do we need to investigate? The evidence is right in front of us. Even the teacher might not be able to score full marks for this paper so how did she do it?”","Before Chancellor Chen could explain, Qiao Xi said coldly, “Chancellor, I’ll be right there!”","The chancellor wanted to cry.","He knew Qiao Xi’s ability, and he felt that such a capable person would not stoop to cheating.","Moreover, would finding trouble with Qiao Xi make that young master think that they were making things difficult for Qiao Xi?","It was too difficult to be the chancellor of Li City University!","After hanging up the phone, Mr. Fan said with a serious face, “Chancellor Chen, you’re too kind. Do you have to speak so gently to a cheater? She’s immoral and deserves to be punished!”","Chancellor Chen sighed helplessly. “Mr. Fan Wenyuan, before you have concrete evidence, don’t casually insult the students of our university. If there are any adverse effects, you’ll pay the price!”","Fan Wenyuan frowned unhappily.","He was a famous translator and had translated many famous literary works.","After seeing Qiao Xi’s paper, he was convinced that she had definitely cheated.","The words and sentences were too sharp and accurate. Even Fan Wenyuan was not sure if he could achieve such accuracy.","Qiao Xi was unwilling to admit that she cheated. For the sake of the university’s reputation, Chancellor Chen was also unwilling to believe him. He knew all this.","Old Madam Qiao slammed the table and said sarcastically, “Chancellor, what else is there to investigate? Qiao Xi must have cheated! She’s just a country bumpkin who doesn’t even know what English is. How could she possibly know how to translate? If it were Qiao Rou who got this result, then that would be believable!”","After Qiao Rou returned home, she had been crying. The family could not console her, so Madam Qiao was very dissatisfied with Qiao Xi.","When Qiao Xi competed with Wang Qing, she had to take into account her younger sister’s reputation. She could not make Qiao Rou feel embarrassed.","Moreover, how could a little b*tch who had lived in the countryside since she was young know English? Who would teach her English in such a remote place?","She must have cheated!","Chancellor Chen was a little angry. “Old Madam Qiao, Qiao Rou is your granddaughter but Qiao Xi is also your granddaughter. Even before the investigation is done, you’re already sure that Qiao Xi cheated and are even blaming her with Qiao Rou. You’re...”"]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159 - Concluded That Qiao Xi Cheated","paragraphs":["Qiao Rou looked at him with an innocent face and choked. “Chancellor, I don’t blame my sister. I’m really doing this for her own good. If she really cheated, her behavior needs to be corrected in time. This is unfair to the other students.”","The chancellor was about to speak when Fan Wenyuan said angrily, “She must have cheated! If she doesn’t give me a reasonable explanation, I’ll definitely let her—”","“What do you want me to do?”","A cold female voice sounded and everyone turned around.","Qiao Xi looked at them unhurriedly. When she received the chancellor’s call, she had already seen through Qiao Rou’s thoughts.","Qiao Rou wanted to suppress her through Fan Wenyuan and ruin her reputation.","Qiao Rou had the wishful thought of snatching her shares. The Qiao Corporation’s shareholders would not agree.","However, if Qiao Xi, the heir, was useless and made a mistake like cheating in a test, it would definitely affect the company’s opinion of her. At that time, they might even agree to transfer the shares to Qiao Rou.","Killing two birds with one stone was indeed a good idea.","When Fan Wenyuan saw the woman in front of him, his eyes were instantly filled with anger. “You’re that cheater? How did you get the answer? Tell me the truth!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm as she pressed the button of the recorder in her bag. “Mr. Fan, why are you so sure that I cheated?”","Fan Wenyuan was stunned. He did not expect that Qiao Xi would not be nervous in the slightest, and her entire body emitted an arrogant aura.","He snorted. “Since you know who I am, you should know that I’m the best translator in the country. And your answer is accurate. It’s not something that someone of your standard can reach. You must have memorized it and written it down.”","Qiao Xi smiled. “Mr. Fan, you’re saying that I’m good with words, so I’ll take it as a compliment.”","Fan Wenyuan did not believe that this paper was written by a student. It was because the words used were more accurate than the words used by a top expert in this field. Hence, he concluded that she had cheated.","“Shameless!” Old Madam Qiao said sternly, “How did the Qiao family produce such a scourge? If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have brought you back from the countryside!”","Qiao Rou secretly laughed. Fan Wenyuan was obviously mocking Qiao Xi for not having the skills. However, this shameless person thought that Mr. Fan was praising her.","Qiao Xi was a country bumpkin. Even if she knew English, it was impossible for her to have mastered the language.","If she did not cheat, could it be that she really translated it herself?","How was that possible?!","Qiao Rou pretended to be sad and comforted her softly. “Sister, it’s all my fault. If I hadn’t said that you weren’t educated, Mr. Fan would not have concluded that you cheated. You... Don’t be angry!”","Everyone was silent.","Fan Wenyuan could not suppress the anger in his heart anymore. “Qiao Xi, since you cheated, you have to admit it. I heard that you did it for a bet. After you won, you forced the other party to kneel. If you had relied on your own ability, I would have nothing to say, but you copied your answer. You’re really embarrassing Li City University!”","He abruptly turned around. “Chancellor Chen, I held the test for the sake of selecting talents for the International Real-time Translation Competition. Qiao Xi cheated and her results are unreliable, so I won’t take her in as my disciple. I advise you to quickly expel her. Don’t let her ruin Li City University’s reputation!”","“Mr. Fan, calm down!”","The chancellor was anxious.","If he really expelled Qiao Xi, then Li City University would lose a genius!","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm as she said indifferently, “Mr. Fan, if you’re so sure that I cheated, why did you call me over so early in the morning?”","Fan Wenyuan snorted. “Of course, I called you here to make you admit your mistake. You ruined such an important test. Do you think it’s over just like this? You have to apologize in public. If you admit your mistake and have a good attitude, I won’t expel you!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Alright!”","The chancellor shuddered. ‘Oh my God! What are you doing?!’","Qiao Rou was overjoyed.","Qiao Xi had indeed cheated. Otherwise, she absolutely would not have agreed so readily. She was definitely afraid of being expelled.","She pretended to be weak and advised softly. “Sister, it’s good to learn from your mistakes. I’m really happy to see you admit your mistakes. I hope you won’t do anything stupid in the future.”","“Sister, you’re really kind-hearted! I’ll find a chance to thank you properly!” Qiao Xi rolled her eyes at her.","Then, she turned to look at the chancellor. “Let’s go to the broadcasting room. I’ll apologize to the entire university, alright?”","Fan Wenyuan nodded in satisfaction.","He managed to persuade a cheater to come back to her senses. He would expose this incident online. There would definitely be a group of fans worshipping him."]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160 - Requesting To Take The Test","paragraphs":["As long as Fan Wenyuan announced Qiao Xi’s name, she would definitely be exposed and expelled.","However, he would not think too much of it. Qiao Xi was the one who cheated first, so she deserved to be punished severely.","Fan Wenyuan was proud of himself and had an arrogant look on his face. “It’s all thanks to Qiao Rou. Not only did you not shield your sister, but you also took the initiative to expose her and help her admit her mistake. Only a noble person like you is worthy to be my student.”","Before Qiao Rou could say anything, Old Madam Qiao was already overjoyed.","“Mr. Fan, of course, our Rou Rou is better than that wild girl. Rou Rou has brought glory to the Qiao family. Tonight, I’ll personally cook for you. Let that little bastard stay here and apologize to the entire university!”","Qiao Rou pretended to be heartbroken. “Sister, it’s okay if you don’t know English. I can help you improve your English knowledge, but why must you cheat? It’s okay. Since you’ve apologized, it means that you’ve admitted your mistake. I can still help you in the future!”","Qiao Xi looked at her coldly with eyes full of mockery, then picked up the microphone.","It was time for class to end when the broadcast tone suddenly rang—","“Hello everyone, I’m Qiao Xi from Class 3 of the fashion design department.”","Everyone looked puzzled.","Then, Qiao Xi’s calm voice sounded. “The famous translator, Fan Wenyuan, came to our university today. My sister, Qiao Rou, said that I had never learned English, so Mr. Fan read my paper and concluded that I cheated in the test.”","The students were stunned.","Was she kidding?","Qiao Xi cheated?","The students from the English department were instantly speechless. “Who said Qiao Xi cheated? We all read the paper that she translated. Just based on the words and quality, who could she have copied? You can’t find anyone in the entire English department who’s better than her!”","The class monitor was also dumbfounded. “Yes, I’ve read Qiao Xi’s paper too. I won’t agree if they say she cheated!”","Professor Wu from the English department was one of the organizers of the translation competition. He was also confused.","“How could Teacher Qiao have cheated? Her standard is obvious, and she doesn’t look like someone who would cheat. I’d better go take a look. I can’t let Fan Wenyuan wrongly accuse her!”","In the chancellor’s office, Fan Wenyuan was delighted.","He was thinking about how to publicize this incident online to create a greater effect. He would say that this person had cheated but under his persuasion, she agreed to admit her mistake.","Then, he would encourage Qiao Xi to make everyone think that he was at the top of the industry.","He did not care about Qiao Xi’s fate. Even if she was expelled, she deserved it.","At this moment, Qiao Xi slowly said, “Mr. Fan thinks I cheated, so he and Qiao Rou asked me to apologize to the entire university!”","Qiao Rou had a smile on the corners of her mouth. Qiao Xi, this sl*t, wanted to fight her? What a joke!","As long as she cheated, she would not be qualified to be the heir of the Qiao family. In the future, no university would accept such a wicked teacher.","So what if she was the eldest daughter of the Qiao family? She would still end up with a bad reputation in the end. Only she, Qiao Rou, was worthy to be the daughter of the Qiao family!","Qiao Rou quietly waited for Qiao Xi to lose all her reputation.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi raised her voice. “But I didn’t cheat! I also don’t understand why Mr. Fan and my sister are insisting that I cheated when they don’t have any evidence. They even want to revoke my results.”","The smile on Qiao Rou and Fan Wenyuan’s faces vanished.","“Mr. Fan, you’re a professional translator. It’s easy for you to malign me, but it’ll permanently damage my reputation. I’ll be affected for the rest of my life. Just because you have a high position and power doesn’t mean that everything you say is true. If you want to accuse me of cheating, what about the evidence?”","“You!” Fan Wenyuan was burning with rage. He did not expect Qiao Xi to suddenly turn against him.","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm. “Mr. Fan, you don’t have evidence against me, but I can prove my innocence.”","She enunciated every word clearly as her cold voice sounded from the microphone, “I can take the test again!”","Qiao Rou gasped.","Fan Wenyuan was so angry that his entire body was trembling. He immediately roared in anger, “Qiao Xi! What evidence do I need to prove that you cheated? If you continue to pester me, don’t blame me for being merciless!”","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Give me the evidence.”","“You’re just a country bumpkin. How can you be so skilled in translation?”","Fan Wenyuan blurted out. The Qiao family said that she had never learned English. If she could translate so well, she would definitely be a rare genius.","Qiao Xi’s voice was calm. “That means you don’t have any evidence, but I can prove that I didn’t cheat. What right do you have to object? Or are you guilty? Mr. Fan, are you afraid that my work exceeds yours, so you don’t dare?”","The entire university heard Qiao Xi’s words and could not help but praise her—","Qiao Xi was too cool!"]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161 - Even One Point Short Proves You Cheated","paragraphs":["Fan Wenyuan was a famous professional translator. Even if Qiao Xi was a genius translator, compared to Fan Wenyuan, she was still a nobody. But she actually mocked him and said that he was afraid!","Fan Wenyuan was so angry that his face turned red. He clutched his chest while trembling. “You!”","“Sister, we didn’t malign you. If you didn’t cheat, of course, I’d be happy. But...” Qiao Rou put on a hesitant expression and pretended to be innocent.","But Qiao Xi didn’t fall for her tricks at all. “Then you won’t object if I want to take the test again, right?”","Qiao Rou immediately squeezed out a few drops of tears and choked. “Sister... Let’s forget it. When your standard improves, you can take the test again. Don’t let your emotions affect your decisions. Just take it as though I’m begging you, okay?”","“I don’t need you to beg me!” Qiao Xi interrupted coldly, then looked at Chancellor Chen. “I want to retake the test!”","Before Fan Wenyuan could object angrily, a group of people suddenly rushed into the principal’s office. “Chancellor, we support Qiao Xi!”","“Qiao Xi is brave enough to prove herself, so why not give her a chance?”","“Mr. Fan, you’re a famous translator, but that doesn’t mean that all your views are correct. You cannot accuse Qiao Xi of cheating without any evidence. If she wants to retake the test, you must agree!”","Fan Wenyuan was so angry that his chest heaved up and down. He almost couldn’t breathe.","He was a top figure in the translation world, yet he was being questioned like this.","Qiao Xi had cheated. What proof did he need?!","Even if she was wronged, she should just admit to it considering he was a famous professional translator. How could she gang up with a group of people to resist him?","Fan Wenyuan gritted his teeth in anger. “Retake the test, huh? I agree, but to prevent you from cheating again, I’ll set the questions myself!”","He had to think carefully about what kind of questions to give Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi was calm. “Sure. Mr. Fan. Set the questions and let me take the test.”","Qiao Rou secretly revealed a vicious gaze. She didn’t expect things to turn around.","Forget it, she would let Qiao Xi take a breather for now. Mr. Fan would definitely come up with the most difficult questions. If Qiao Xi failed to answer them, then it would prove she had cheated. She would end up even worse than now.","...","That afternoon, Fan Wenyuan came up with the questions. He chose some professional articles that were extremely difficult to translate. Even native speakers might not be able to translate them accurately.","Professor Wu from the English department looked at the questions and frowned. “Mr. Fan, aren’t these questions a little too difficult? Qiao Xi isn’t a student of this specialization. How will she translate these?”","Fan Wenyuan sneered. “Qiao Xi is the one who wants to retake the test. She also agreed to let me set the questions. Whether she can translate these or not has nothing to do with me. If she can’t answer, it’ll just prove she cheated!”","Professor Wu was about to retort when—","Qiao Xi walked in and indifferently swept a glance at Fan Wenyuan. “Can I take the test now?”","Fan Wenyuan raised his head and revealed a sinister smile. He knocked on the table and said, “Qiao Xi, in order to prevent you from cheating, I’ve decided to invigilate the exam with Professor Wu. Do you agree?”","Qiao Xi glanced at him, then looked at both sides of the classroom. Sure enough, she found a few cameras. “No problem.”","She smiled grimly to herself. There were cameras. It would be best if someone was watching, just in case they said she was cheating again.","She would like to see if Fan Wenyuan still dared to say that she cheated!","After the test officially commenced, Qiao Xi sat down and started to write without any hesitation.","Fan Wenyuan smiled disdainfully. “Qiao Xi, if you don’t get full marks this time, it means that you cheated in the previous exam.”","Professor Wu was furious. “Fan Wenyuan, you’re going too far. The questions this time are obviously much more difficult than the last time. It’s not fair!”","“Yes.” Qiao Xi nodded, then slowly raised her eyes and blinked. “I’ll get full marks!”","Fan Wenyuan instantly laughed out loud. This Qiao Xi was too arrogant!","Even if he answered this test himself, he wouldn’t be able to obtain full marks, let alone Qiao Xi.","He quietly watched Qiao Xi brag!","After a while, Qiao Xi stopped writing and picked up the paper to examine her answers. “I’m done. Professor Wu, Mr. Fan, please judge my paper.”","At this moment, the chancellor stood before Qiao Xi and let out a breath of turbid air.","Seeing Qiao Xi’s confident gaze, there should be no problem.","However, Fan Wenyuan did not think so. With a face full of disdain, he snorted coldly. “Qiao Xi, I’ll be blunt first. Even if you’re one point short, it still proves that you cheated last time. You finished this in half an hour. Don’t tell me you wrote it randomly!”","Qiao Xi didn’t expect the famous translator to have such a bad character. She only smiled. “Mr. Fan, how are you so sure that I wrote it randomly?”","Qiao Xi stood up and nodded at Professor Wu and the chancellor before leaving."]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162 - Because Qiao Xi Is A Genius","paragraphs":["Fan Wenyuan sneered. “Arrogant! How can someone like you who doesn’t respect your elders be able to possess such high translation skills?”","He glanced down at the paper. It was full of very neatly written words.","Fan Wenyuan’s heart was still full of ridicule, but when he picked up the paper, his eyes instantly widened.","“Impossible!” Fan Wenyuan’s voice trembled.","The questions were all difficult and uncommon. How could Qiao Xi translate them so accurately?","Even if they were English students, it was impossible for them to know such vocabulary.","Impossible!","Qiao Xi must have studied it before, which was why she could translate these so well.","Fan Wenyuan forced himself to calm down and stared at the test paper.","His eyes were filled with shock. In the end, his fingers almost couldn’t hold the papers anymore.","Professor Wu stood next to Fan Wenyuan and looked at the paper seriously. His eyes widened in surprise.","He couldn’t help but praise, “Qiao Xi is truly a genius translator. She even understands such obscure words. Not only is she fluent, but her way with words is simply beautiful! Mr. Fan, her standard is indeed higher than yours!”","Fan Wenyuan nearly vomited blood!","How could Qiao Xi’s standard be higher than his?","But looking at her test paper, he had to admit it.","Fan Wenyuan was utterly humiliated. He slammed the table and roared, “This is absolutely impossible! Even if she had learned English, with her age, she wouldn’t have surpassed me. She must have seen the questions in advance and cheated again!”","Professor Wu was furious. “Mr. Fan, it’s not embarrassing to be inferior to others, but if you don’t admit it, then you’ll be letting down your title as a professional translator! You were the one who set the questions, and I’m afraid you don’t even know the answers yourself. How would Qiao Xi know? She has proven her ability and that she did not cheat! Are you so shameless that you won’t admit it?”","Fan Wenyuan’s face turned red. He was a famous translator, how could he let a junior surpass him?","“The Qiao family said that she grew up in the countryside and never learned English. Then tell me, how did she translate such professional articles?”","Professor Wu rolled his eyes at him and retorted, “Because Qiao Xi is a genius. Mr. Fan, you can deny it, but it’s the truth!”","Fan Wenyuan’s face was pale. His lips were trembling, but he could not say a word.","At this moment, a few students from the English department rushed in.","A top student picked up Qiao Xi’s paper, and after taking a look at it, his face was instantly filled with admiration. “Qiao Xi is absolutely a genius in the translation world! Even if I study English every day and night, it’s impossible for me to have such standards. Moreover, her vocabulary is very beautiful. This is a level of work we can never dream of attaining!”","Everyone agreed and passed on Qiao Xi’s paper to the next person.","“Mr. Fan, are you afraid that Qiao Xi will surpass you, so you accused her of cheating?”","“That must be it! Qiao Xi used retook the test to prove that she didn’t cheat, yet he still intends to wrongly accuse Qiao Xi. He just can’t afford to play the game!”","“What kind of sh*tty professional translator is he? As a senior, you can’t even tolerate a junior. How shameful!”","Fan Wenyuan gnashed his teeth in anger. If it weren’t because this was Li City University, he would have kicked all the students out.","The chancellor cleared his throat. “Mr. Fan, as you can see, Qiao Xi is indeed a genius translator. She did not cheat. If this matter gets out of hand, it’ll not be good for your reputation. Why don’t we forget about it?”","Without a word, Fan Wenyuan left.","He had an urge to burn that classroom.","These people were all witnesses. If they couldn’t speak and the paper disappeared, then they wouldn’t be able to prove Qiao Xi’s innocence.","He could not tolerate such a genius in the translation world!","Would this prove that Qiao Xi was wrongly accused?","He wasn’t going to let this go so easily. He still had a big trick up his sleeve!","The chancellor watched as Fan Wenyuan left. He handed the paper to Professor Wu with a smile and told him to keep it for future reference.","Li City University had produced a genius translator!","...","After Qiao Xi left the university, she saw Gu Zheng’s car as soon as she walked out of the gates.","The car window rolled down, revealing Gu Zheng’s devilish face. His eyes were deep as he said slowly, “Mrs. Gu, have you been bullied?”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment, then she looked at Gu Zheng in surprise.","Since he asked sincerely, she had to seize the opportunity.","Qiao Xi originally didn’t care about this matter at all, but when Gu Zheng asked this question, she instantly clutched her chest and sobbed with a sorrowful expression. “Gu Zheng! They bullied me!”","It would have been fine if Gu Zheng had not asked, but now that he had asked, she felt that she should properly complain and vent her anger."]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163 - The President Cooks","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s tone was flat. “Whoever bullies you, I’ll help you deal with them!”","Qiao Xi’s heart felt slightly warm, and there was an indescribable feeling.","Gu Zheng doted on her too much!","Fan Wenyuan wanted to find trouble with her, and Gu Zheng wanted to find trouble with Fan Wenyuan.","Was it only because she was his wife?","Gu Zheng raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi, and the corners of his mouth curved up imperceptibly.","Song Shiyu was right. Women liked gentle men. If he protected her when she was bullied, she would fall for him.","Song Shiyu was right!","Longwan Residential.","The car slowly stopped. Before Qiao Xi got out of the car, she saw a delicate woman swaying in the wind.","Shen Ying was wearing a white muslin dress, and her soft hair fell over her shoulders. She only had light makeup on, making her look weak and fragile. It made one’s heart ache.","When she saw Gu Zheng’s car, she looked sad and slowly walked over. “Brother Gu Zheng, I...”","Without even looking at her, Gu Zheng sped off and almost crashed into Shen Ying.","Qiao Xi looked at Shen Ying’s terrified face and couldn’t help but shudder with fear. “Gu Zheng, you almost crashed into her!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he slowly stopped the car. “Was there anyone just now? Why didn’t I see anyone?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes opened wide. Where did this man learn to lie through his teeth?","“Shen Ying must be here to apologize. Are we just going to let her wait?”","Gu Zheng took off his jacket and frowned. “I don’t have time to listen to her apology. Besides, this is my private residence. I have the right to refuse her entry!”","Qiao Xi looked into the distance. Shen Ying was still standing where she was, wiping her tears. Her white dress was fluttering in the wind.","She rolled her eyes and smiled. “Gu Zheng, look at how pitiful she is. Don’t you feel sorry for her at all? Don’t you want to go over and comfort her?”","Gu Zheng nodded his head nonchalantly.","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless.","Wait! What was that?","She was just teasing him just now to see his attitude.","Unexpectedly, this damned man really wanted to comfort Shen Ying!","Shen Ying was shivering in the cold wind, and she was mocking Gu Zheng here. The difference was immediately apparent.","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth. If this wretched man really went to comfort Shen Ying, she would ask for a divorce!","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment, then he raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi and said lightly, “I’ve indeed forgotten something.”","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth in hatred and glared fiercely at Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng then said, “We haven’t punished her yet. Since she’s here, let’s beat her up.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Amazing!","This man was indeed a straight man. He would never fall for the tricks of that seemingly delicate woman.","Shen Ying cried pitifully. He had no sympathy at all and even wanted to hit her again.","An image appeared in Qiao Xi’s mind. Shen Ying was crying as she was beaten up. The more she fought, the harder she cried.","Qiao Xi stood up and prepared to return to her room when Gu Zheng’s voice slowly sounded.","“Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to say such boring things in the future. I can see through Shen Ying’s tricks with one look. You don’t have to test my reaction.”","Qiao Xi raised her brows.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s lips twitched. “Don’t worry, Mrs. Gu. Whether it’s Shen Ying or Meng Wan, I’ve already seen through them clearly, so I won’t be bewitched by them.”","Qiao Xi seemed to have really thought that he would go and console Shen Ying, so Gu Zheng had to explain himself clearly. He didn’t have the slightest affection for Shen Ying and was even filled with disgust.","It was indeed time to punish her using the family law. After all, she should be punished for his wrongdoings.","A trace of gratitude surged into Qiao Xi’s heart as she slowly walked over to Gu Zheng. “Gu Zheng, you’re so good to me!”","‘I’ll try not to call him a bastard anymore.’","Gu Zheng snorted. “Are you hungry?”","Qiao Xi nodded. “I wonder what delicious food the butler prepared today.”","“The servants are on holiday today. They didn’t make dinner.”","This reminded Qiao Xi that she had forgotten about the holiday today. However, she didn’t know how to cook!","Gu Zheng seemed to have understood Qiao Xi’s thoughts and said unhurriedly, “Mrs. Gu, you probably haven’t eaten the food I made.”","Could he cook?","Qiao Xi’s face was full of surprise. The president was going to personally cook for her? This was truly a rare sight!","She could actually eat Gu Zheng’s cooking!","Gu Zheng opened the fridge and turned around to look at her. “What do you want to eat?”","Qiao Xi quickly walked over and glanced at the food in the fridge. “Can I eat anything I want?”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before nodding.","Anyway, he could check the recipe if he didn’t know how to cook it.","But when Qiao Xi saw his confident look, she instantly thought that the president’s culinary skills were extraordinary, so she named a few dishes that she wanted to eat. She looked at Gu Zheng with anticipation.","“Gu Zheng, since you’re cooking for me, should I reward you with a kiss?”"]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164 - Letting Shen Ying Stay For Dinner It would be a pity if she couldnt taste it!","paragraphs":["It would be a pity if she couldn’t taste it!","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and his Adam’s apple bobbed. “Mm.”","Qiao Xi happily went upstairs to change while Gu Zheng took out ingredients from the fridge and prepared to cook.","Every day, fresh ingredients would be delivered to Longwan Residential. They were of the best quality and only needed a simple wash.","After preparing the ingredients, Gu Zheng took out his phone and found the recipes.","The dishes that Qiao Xi wanted to eat seemed a little complicated, but with the recipes, it wouldn’t be difficult anymore.","Gu Zheng was full of confidence. He was an all-powerful figure in the business world. He could see through all kinds of schemes and plots. Cooking was even easier for him.","When Qiao Xi walked down the stairs in her nightgown, her eyes instantly lit up.","The dishes on the table were simply too tempting!","“Gu Zheng! You’re amazing!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he concentrated on preparing the last dish.","Qiao Xi leaned forward and kissed the corner of his mouth. After recovering her taste buds’ ability to taste food, she hurriedly tried a piece of braised pork.","The smile on her face gradually disappeared.","She put down her chopsticks slowly and smiled awkwardly.","She widened her eyes and looked at the plate of braised pork that looked extremely good. She then looked at Gu Zheng in disbelief.","Qiao Xi even felt that Gu Zheng was pulling a prank on her!","She then picked up another piece of meat with trembling hands.","The braised pork with soy sauce that looked so appetizing actually tasted awful!","Qiao Xi hurriedly drank a glass of water to get rid of the strange taste. Then, she heard the man beside her ask slowly, “Mrs. Gu, is my food not good?”","Qiao Xi frowned. “Gu Zheng, your culinary skills...”","“This is my first time cooking for someone. Won’t you go easy on me, Mrs. Gu? If I’m unhappy, I might not allow you to kiss me anymore.”","“...” Qiao Xi was instantly speechless, and she almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","A threat!","If she insisted on saying that his food was disgusting, with Gu Zheng’s vengeful personality, he would definitely not let her kiss him anymore. Then, she would lose her sense of taste forever!","But this dish...","Qiao Xi was silent for a few seconds, then her face was filled with sincerity. “Delicious! I didn’t expect you to be able to cook so well on your first try! You’re really too awesome!”","Gu Zheng smirked and asked slowly, “Are you telling the truth?”","Qiao Xi didn’t hesitate in the slightest. “Of course, it’s true!”","“Aren’t you hungry?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","This bastard indeed had ill intentions!","Fortunately, Qiao Xi was about to lose her ability to taste again. It didn’t matter what she ate if she couldn’t taste it.","As long as it could make Gu Zheng happy, a few bites of food was no big deal.","“Mrs. Gu.”","After a moment, Gu Zheng suddenly said, “To thank you for your praise, I’ve decided to kiss you.”","He pressed his lips against hers.","It was a gentle touch, as if nothing had happened.","Qiao Xi was still chewing a mouthful of meat when she instantly recovered her sense of taste.","Damn!","Gu Zheng, this bastard!","Qiao Xi forcefully resisted the urge to vomit and forcefully swallowed the mouthful of meat. After that, she started to randomly pick at her food. When it was the right time, she extended her chopsticks to those few dishes.","“Mrs. Gu, I still want to kiss you.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","How could there be a bastard like Gu Zheng in this world?!","Qiao Xi just so happened to be completely under his control and didn’t dare refuse. If she refused even once, then with a man’s vengeful nature, he would surely not allow her to kiss him in the future.","Qiao Xi wanted to cry but had no tears.","Suddenly, the doorbell rang.","Just when she was feeling confused, Shen Ying’s weak voice sounded. “Brother Gu Zheng, it’s me.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her head. Shen Ying hadn’t left yet!","It was raining outside. Shen Ying said pitifully while standing in the cold wind and rain, “Brother Gu Zheng, it’s raining. Can you let me come in to seek cover?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and pressed the control button on his phone. The gate slowly opened.","Shen Ying’s dress was drenched. The fabric clung tightly to her body, revealing her perfect figure. One could even vaguely see the color of her undergarments.","Qiao Xi’s mouth opened wide. Gu Zheng let Shen Ying in just like that?","He asked casually, “Miss Shen, you haven’t had dinner, right?”","Shen Ying was overjoyed. “No. Can I stay for dinner?”","Gu Zheng nodded. “I cooked the food myself. Miss Shen, try it.”","Qiao Xi silently turned her face away and laughed until her entire body trembled.","Shen Ying looked at Qiao Xi arrogantly, thinking that she was crying from grief.","Brother Gu Zheng still cared about her! Otherwise, why would he let her stay for dinner?","Dinner was just the beginning. From now on, she wanted to...","Boom!","Shen Ying’s taste buds instantly exploded, and she felt disgusted.","Her face was pale, and the hand holding the chopsticks trembled slightly. She wanted to spit out the unknown food in her mouth immediately."]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165 - The Villain Complains","paragraphs":["“Miss Shen, how’s my cooking?” Gu Zheng asked gently.","Shen Ying did not dare to chew and swallowed it forcefully.","“Delicious...”","Gu Zheng raised his brows and smiled lightly. “Miss Shen, you have good taste. Unfortunately, Qiao Xi doesn’t like it.”","Shen Ying gritted her teeth and picked up her chopsticks with trembling hands.","The expression on her face was between a smile and a look of awkwardness before she finally grimaced.","“I like anything made by Brother Gu Zheng.”","She would bear with it. At least she was more sensible than Qiao Xi.","Shen Ying forced herself to take a bite, and Gu Zheng smiled. In the end, Shen Ying unknowingly became stuffed.","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened. Shen Ying looked so frail, yet she had eaten two or three plates of food.","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded. “Miss Shen seems to like my dishes a lot, so don’t waste them. We’re full, so we’ll head upstairs first.”","After he finished speaking, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and left.","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Zheng’s methods of dealing with women like Shen Ying were simply admirable!","Gu Zheng smiled calmly and sent a message to Song Shiyu: [Take care of the man who bullied my wife!]","Song Shiyu replied immediately.","He must be tired of living to dare to bully Mrs. Gu!","On the other side, Fan Wenyuan’s phone suddenly rang. His face was pale. “I’ve invested so much money and energy. Why would I suddenly cancel it?”","The man’s disdainful voice came through the phone. “Mr. Fan, you’d better think about what you’ve done wrong!”","Fan Wenyuan had taken out all his savings to host an exchange meeting on translation. He had even invited celebrities from abroad. It was set to be held in two days.","Fan Wenyuan suppressed the anger in his heart. “I don’t remember what mistake I made. Please tell me!”","The man on the other end of the line also said with some trepidation, “Young Master Gu’s assistant called to inform me. You should know better!”","Young... Young Master Gu?","Fan Wenyuan’s legs went weak and he knelt on the ground.","When did he offend Young Master Gu?","But... Young Master Gu was a board member of Li City University.","Did Young Master Gu feel that he had wronged Qiao Xi and unnecessarily made a big deal out of it, which affected the university’s reputation so he did this to deal with him?","That was it!","Qiao Xi, this scourge!","He could not let Young Master Gu hate him. He had to push the blame to Qiao Xi.","This way, not only would he be able to annihilate Qiao Xi but he would also be able to tell everyone that the one who destroyed the reputation of the university was Qiao Xi. It had nothing to do with him.","...","The next day.","Qiao Xi got up and went downstairs. She couldn’t help but ask, “Where’s Shen Ying?”","The butler answered, “Miss Shen suddenly vomited and had diarrhea last night. She might have caught a cold, so she was sent back to the Shen family.”","Qiao Xi looked up at Gu Zheng. “...”","Did she catch a cold?","She must have been poisoned!","Gu Zheng’s cooking was comparable to a biochemical weapon!","Shen Ying would probably never come to the Longwan Residential again.","She vomited and had diarrhea in Gu Zheng’s house before being sent home. This wasn’t something that should happen to a great beauty!","If word got out, where would she put her status as the daughter of the Shen family?","“Young Madam.” The butler suddenly asked, “I heard that you guys had dinner together last night. Perhaps Miss Shen ate something bad. What did you guys eat?”","Qiao Xi had an embarrassed expression and couldn’t help but look at Gu Zheng.","She couldn’t possibly say that there was something wrong with his food in front of Gu Zheng, so she organized her words. “We just ordered some takeaway. Miss Shen isn’t feeling well, so she didn’t eat much. Look, both of us are fine.”","The butler nodded. “How could you eat takeout? In the future, don’t order from that restaurant anymore. The food is so bad! It seems that just about anybody thinks that they can be a chef now. Miss Shen’s body is weak, so she got sick. Luckily, Young Madam and Young Master are fine.”","“...” Gu Zheng pursed his lips tightly. Should the butler’s salary be reduced?","Qiao Xi had just sat down and was waiting for breakfast when her phone rang.","“Third Brother?”","“Little Six, something happened! Fan Wenyuan posted something on Weibo!”","Fan Wenyuan? What was he up to again?","After Qiao Xi hung up the phone, she opened Weibo and saw countless messages.","She clicked on that Weibo post and sneered.","This Fan Wenyuan was really complaining!","[Fan Wenyuan: During the translation test held by Li City University, a student openly cheated. After I pointed it out, she apologized to the whole university. Since she admitted her mistake, I gave her a chance to retake the test. I also personally set the questions to ensure the fairness of the exam.","[However, not only did this student not repent but she stole the questions when no one was paying attention and still cheated!","[She cheated twice! Unacceptable!]","The first comment: [I’m a student of Li University. I did hear that girl apologize. It seems that she really cheated.]","[Qiao... what?]"]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166 - Things Have Blown Up","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi looked at the words on Weibo with a subtle expression.","Sure!","Fan Wenyuan really wouldn’t shed a tear until he saw the coffin!","Fan Wenyuan was very famous in the industry. This time, he publicly exposed someone for cheating, which immediately attracted a lot of attention.","A few students from Li City University directly mentioned Qiao Xi. [We heard the girl’s apology when class ended, but she doesn’t seem to admit that she cheated. How could the famous Teacher Fan wrong her? She cheated twice and still refuses to admit it. Does she really think we’re fools?! @Qiao Xi]","Someone even posted Qiao Xi’s paper in the comments.","Fan Wenyuan liked the comments.","[She scored full marks for such a difficult paper. What other explanation could there be apart from cheating?]","[She’s the teacher of the fashion design department, Gu Shan. She often collaborates with foreign brands, so it’s not surprising that she’s able to translate articles. Maybe it’s because she has read up on English for work. You’re saying that she cheated just because of these two tests? That’s too arbitrary!]","The discussions on this matter became more and more heated. The number of views on the post had already exceeded 100 million.","At this moment, Qiao Rou came online.","Qiao Rou was the school belle of Li City University, and she had a sweet image. She had been in the entertainment circle since she was 16 years old. She had a pure and sweet smile as well as a good figure. Hence, she had countless fans.","Everyone knew that Qiao Xi and Qiao Rou were sisters...","At this critical moment, Qiao Rou started her live-stream. The netizens all went to her live-stream.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she curiously tuned in as well.","At that moment, the number of people in the broadcast room kept increasing and it became the top live-stream in the entire station.","Qiao Rou had exquisite makeup on her face, and her pink collar was loose, revealing her charming collarbone. Her smooth hair fell naturally on her shoulders, and her eyes were filled with self-reproach. “I’m sorry! I apologize to Mr. Fan on behalf of my sister!”","Everyone praised her for her beauty and kindness.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. Qiao Rou’s live broadcast was to prove that she cheated.","Immediately after, Qiao Rou squeezed out a few teardrops and bit her lip. “Dad and Mom know that Sister cheated and are very ashamed, so they invited Mr. Fan as a guest to sincerely apologize. Mr. Fan has decided not to investigate this matter anymore. I hope everyone will forgive my sister on my account!","“Sister only cheated twice because she made a bet and wanted to win. She’s very competitive.”","The netizens sighed. [Rou Rou, stop crying. You don’t have to bear the responsibility for your sister’s mistake.]","[Rou Rou is so kind. Such a cute girl has to apologize for her sister. The Qiao family must have put in a lot of effort to appease Mr. Fan’s anger.]","Qiao Rou sobbed softly and wiped her tears.","Qiao Zhenguo suddenly walked over and appeared on the screen of the live-stream. He said helplessly, “Dear netizens, I’m Rou Rou and Xi Xi’s father. I’m deeply ashamed of Qiao Xi cheating. As her father, I didn’t educate her well.","“But I still hope that nobody will blame her. Qiao Xi went missing when she was young and lived in the countryside for a long time before we found her.","“She didn’t go to school. She was afraid that her family would be disappointed, so she cheated in a moment of carelessness. But she has sincerely repented now, and Mr. Fan is in our house too. He has already forgiven her.”","Fan Wenyuan also walked over and frowned unhappily. “I understand Qiao Xi’s background, but no matter what, cheating is wrong. It’s just that Mr. Qiao and Qiao Rou kept apologizing for Qiao Xi. I want to give Qiao Xi a chance to change, so let’s forget about this matter.”","The netizens were all praising Fan Wenyuan for being a great translator and having the demeanor of a great person!","Qiao Xi was the only one who understood that if they hadn’t started a live-stream and only used Weibo, the matter wouldn’t have blown up so much.","However, Qiao Rou purposely started a live-stream to explain this matter. She was only making things worse.","The so-called ‘family’ all spoke up for her, which further proved that she cheated.","Inviting Fan Wenyuan home as a guest seemed to be for her own good on the surface, but in reality, it was to ensure that she would never be able to make a comeback.","The netizens would remember Qiao Xi’s name deeply, and the reputation of having cheated would accompany her for the rest of her life.","The gentle and kind Qiao Rou and the righteous Qiao Zhenguo had grief written all over their faces in front of the camera. They looked like they were not good at expressing themselves and were filled with helplessness. In order to help her solve the issue of cheating, they had already done their best.","If she stood up to deny the allegations now, she would be despised and cursed by everyone!","At this moment, Fan Wenyuan suddenly smiled. “After this incident, I realized that Qiao Rou has a good character and is very capable. So I’ve decided to take her as my disciple. This child will definitely have some achievements in the future!”","Qiao Rou smiled in embarrassment. “You’re too kind, Master!”"]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167 - International Translation Organization","paragraphs":["Fan Wenyuan’s face was full of affection. “Rou Rou, you have to learn how to translate well in the future. When the time comes, help your sister improve her standards. Don’t let her cheat again.”","Qiao Rou immediately nodded. “I’ll definitely help my sister. I won’t let her make another mistake!”","Qiao Xi looked at the people on the screen and sneered.","Did they think that this matter would end just like that?","Qiao Rou, Qiao Zhenguo, and Fan Wenyuan. These three people were wrongly accusing her, but they could still gain a good reputation.","Did they think that she would swallow her anger and silently accept this matter?","Impossible!","Qiao Xi directly called the person in charge of the translation competition and said calmly, “I’m Qiao Xi.”","...","After Qiao Xi hung up the phone, she left with Gu Zheng.","“To the Qiao family,” Qiao Xi spoke coldly, but when she looked at Gu Zheng, she revealed an aggrieved expression. “They’re all bullying me!”","Gu Zheng said calmly, “Song Shiyu!”","Song Shiyu was trembling with fear. “Young Master, I’ll expose the dirt now and make Fan Wenyuan suffer. Let’s see if he still dares to bully Young Madam after this!”","Gu Zheng glanced at him. “Who do you think she called?”","Song Shiyu thought that the young master was jealous, so he tried to persuade him. “Young Madam must have asked a friend for help, Young Master...”","Before he could finish speaking, Gu Zheng slowly said, “Nick is the vice president of the International Translation Organization.”","Gu Zheng’s tone was cold. “Fan Wenyuan will be done for!”","Song Shiyu’s eyes widened.","The person Young Madam called earlier was actually the vice president of the International Translation Organization. However, his attitude toward Madam was extremely respectful as if he was her subordinate.","As the vice president of the International Translation Organization, why must he be so humble?","Gu Zheng smiled lightly. If he wasn’t wrong, then Qiao Xi was that mysterious figure known in the translation competition. She was the one who took first place every year yet had never revealed her identity and appearance.","The translation organization had put in a lot of effort to invite her to join them, but she rejected them each time.","Fan Wenyuan had angered Qiao Xi and also gave the translation organization an opportunity.","Gu Zheng knew that not only was Fan Wenyuan going to lose his reputation, but there would no longer be a place for him in the domestic and international scene after this.","...","In the International Translation Organization’s conference room.","After Nick hung up the phone, he roared. “We’ve all seen Miss Qiao Xi’s translation skills. Fan Wenyuan actually accused her of cheating. Miss Qiao Xi has been the champion of the translation competition for five years. Does she need to cheat?","“We’ve been inviting Miss Qiao Xi to join the organization for so many years and she finally relented. Now, it’s all ruined by that idiot Fan Wenyuan!”","“Mr. Nick, we’ll release the news right now and help Miss Qiao Xi turn the tables. Fan Wenyuan isn’t even qualified to join our organization, yet he actually looks down on Miss Qiao Xi! He must be crazy!”","Nick hurriedly stopped them. “Don’t worry. Miss Qiao Xi has her own plans. We’ll listen to her orders.”","He told everyone about Qiao Xi’s plan, and everyone expressed their admiration for her.","On the other hand, after Qiao Rou went offline, she immediately said respectfully to Fan Wenyuan, “Master, thank you for not arguing with Sister. Unfortunately, Sister’s personality is rebellious. I don’t know if she will change.”","Qiao Zhenguo immediately continued, “Mr. Fan, our Rou Rou has been gentle and kind since she was young. Seeing her sister cheat and getting scolded makes her feel uncomfortable. We’ll educate Qiao Xi well so that she won’t make such a mistake again.”","Fan Wenyuan raised his head high and cleared his throat. “Mr. Qiao, please discipline Qiao Xi well in case...”","“In case of what?”","A cold voice interrupted Fan Wenyuan.","Qiao Xi suddenly stood at the door with narrowed eyes and a cold smile on her lips. “You’re afraid that I’ll surpass you and take away your title as a master translator, right?”","...","There was complete silence.","At this moment, a few servants rushed in. “We really couldn’t stop the eldest miss from barging in!”","Qiao Zhenguo’s face darkened. “Qiao Xi, you’re too rude! You rushed in just like that, and you’re so disrespectful to Mr. Fan!”","“Do I need to inform you in advance when I return to the Qiao family? Has Mr. Qiao forgotten who owns this house?”","Qiao Zhenguo was instantly speechless, and his expression was unsightly. Qiao Rou, who was nearby, immediately walked over to calm him down. Then, she looked at Qiao Xi.","“Sister, Dad and I have already pleaded on your behalf. Mr. Fan doesn’t blame you anymore. Don’t be afraid of how this will affect you.”","Qiao Xi sneered with an icy-cold gaze.","“Mr. Fan, do you have the right to blame me?”","Because Qiao Xi’s aura was too strong, Fan Wenyuan couldn’t help but take a few steps back.","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart thumped, and he immediately roared angrily. “Qiao Xi! What do you want?”","Qiao Rou had a sad look on her face. “Sister already knows her mistake. Don’t blame her anymore.”"]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168 - Challenge","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi completely ignored the father and daughter pair who were putting on an act. Instead, she stared at Fan Wenyuan with cold eyes.","She sneered. “Mr. Fan, you said I cheated. Where’s the evidence?”","Fan Wenyuan lowered his head guiltily, not daring to meet Qiao Xi’s gaze.","He knew very well that Qiao Xi hadn’t cheated, but he wouldn’t admit it.","He could not allow anyone to surpass him. Furthermore, she was a junior. If others knew that he had been working so hard for so many years yet was inferior to a woman in her 20s, he would definitely be ridiculed by everyone.","Qiao Zhenguo glared angrily. “Bastard! How did our Qiao family produce such a scourge like you? You cheated and ruined the Qiao family’s reputation but you even came home to cause trouble!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with disdain.","Without any evidence, Qiao Zhenguo was insisting that his daughter was guilty. He simply did not deserve to be a father.","However, she had long been utterly disappointed in the Qiao family. When facing Qiao Zhenguo, she felt nothing but disdain.","Qiao Rou bit her lip. “Sister, quickly apologize to Dad and Mr. Fan. As long as you sincerely repent, we won’t blame you!”","Qiao Xi swept her gaze across everyone. On the surface, all of them seemed to be doing this for her own good, yet not a single one of them was sincere. All of them were forcing her to admit her mistake.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath, and her gaze suddenly turned cold. “Mr. Fan, during my second test, Professor Wu and the chancellor were both present. The students from the English department also spoke up about my abilities but you still insist on accusing me of cheating. It’s fine if you don’t take them seriously.","“But what about the members of the International Translation Organization? Why don’t we participate in the translation competition together? We’ll know if I cheated then. What do you think?”","Fan Wenyuan snorted. “You’re participating in the translation competition? What a joke!”","“What? Are you afraid, Mr. Fan?” Qiao Xi sneered. “Fan Wenyuan! Today, I’ll officially challenge you!","“Do you dare to compete with me in front of everyone?”","Fan Wenyuan shuddered, his eyes filled with shock.","Qiao Zhenguo roared. “Qiao Xi! You’re just a wild girl from the countryside and you’re as stubborn as your mother! You still want to challenge Mr. Fan? I think you’re really crazy! If you block Rou Rou’s way, I’ll make you disappear from the world completely!”","Then, Fan Wenyuan’s phone suddenly rang.","Fan Wenyuan quickly took out his phone and was stunned.","He was being messaged by countless netizens that the system was about to collapse.","International Translation Organization: [Our headquarters thinks that Miss Qiao Xi’s translation ability is extremely high. Since she’s being doubted of having cheated, at Miss Qiao’s request, we officially issue a challenge to Mr. Fan Wenyuan.]","Qiao Xi: [I hope Mr. Fan will not miss the translation competition two days later @ Fan Wenyuan]","Netizens: !!!","Was Qiao Xi... agitated?","In the Qiao family’s villa, Qiao Zhenguo’s face was filled with shock. He really couldn’t believe why the people from the International Translation Organization would help Qiao Xi.","This bastard must have cheated. What Rou Rou said must be true.","On the other hand, the translation organization felt that Qiao Xi had been wrongly accused. It was surely because Qiao Xi had colluded with a great figure from the translation organization that they came forward to help Qiao Xi deal with the trouble.","How embarrassing!","Qiao Xi looked at the crowd indifferently. “Mr. Fan, I’ll see you at the competition venue in two days!”","Qiao Xi walked out of the door and took out a recording pen from her bag.","The purpose of this trip to the Qiao family was to make these people reveal their ugly true colors.","Whether it was the Qiao family or Fan Wenyuan, she would not let any of them off!","Fan Wenyuan forced himself to calm down.","He tried hard to convince himself that this Qiao Xi did indeed possess some strength, but she was still too young and was surely not a match for him.","After all, he was a master translator in the country and had shown his face in the International Real-time Translation Competition. Those people had to show him some respect. As long as he stood on stage, the judges would definitely give him high marks.","He took a deep breath because he was actually terrified of Qiao Xi earlier. He couldn’t compare to Qiao Xi, so he would use some insidious methods. As long as Qiao Xi wasn’t able to participate in the competition on time, then everything would be empty talk.","Fan Wenyuan smiled proudly and left.","Qiao Zhenguo was stunned for a moment before he reacted and cursed, “Qiao Xi, that little b*tch! How dare she talk back to me? What right does she have to challenge Fan Wenyuan? If she loses, where will the Qiao family put our dignity?”","Qiao Rou looked helpless. “Sister is really muddle-headed. How can she compare to Mr. Fan? When the time comes, Mr. Fan will definitely hate the Qiao family.","“Mr. Fan has just agreed to take me in as his disciple, but I’m sure that’s ruined now. But that’s not important. I’m worried about the entire Qiao family. My sister blew her top in a fit of anger, but what about the Qiao family? I’m so afraid that you’ll be mocked, Dad.. You’ve done so much for the Qiao family. You can’t let everything be ruined in my sister’s hands!”"]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169 - B*tchy Skills Upgraded","paragraphs":["Qiao Zhenguo’s face was gloomy. “Rou Rou, it’s still you who looks at the bigger picture. Now that things have come to this, let’s see what Qiao Xi can do. We’ll go take a look at the translation competition two days later. We absolutely can’t let Qiao Xi dishonor the Qiao family!”","Qiao Rou nodded and smiled sinisterly. “Yes! Dad.”","...","10 AM the day after tomorrow.","The venue for the translation competition was already set up and everyone slowly entered.","The audience was very excited because this time, Qiao Xi was going to challenge the master translator, Fan Wenyuan.","Moreover, Qiao Xi was the cheater that Fan Wenyuan had mentioned on Weibo. This made everyone look forward to the results of this competition even more.","The netizens were also very concerned about the outcome of this competition. There were several live broadcasts of the translation competition and some reporters were even allowed to enter for interviews.","Gu Zheng’s car slowly stopped. He turned to look at Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, are you really going alone?”","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Zheng, this bastard, liked weak women. If he saw her in the arena, he would probably be shocked, so she immediately refused.","She smiled gently. “I can go myself. Wait for my good news!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Okay.”","Qiao Xi nodded and quickly got out of the car.","She had already participated in the International Real-time Translation Competition several times, and she always came in first. Fan Wenyuan was no match for her.","Qiao Xi had just entered when she saw Qiao Rou.","“Sister! I thought you weren’t coming!”","Qiao Rou wore a pink princess dress and a crystal crown as she warmly greeted Qiao Xi.","Gu Moling stood beside her and looked at Qiao Xi with disdain.","Qiao Rou asked worriedly, “Sister, it’s not too late to regret now. If we really lose, Dad will definitely lose his temper!”","The moment she said this, everyone looked at her in surprise.","“Rou Rou, who is she? Is she also a contestant?”","The participants of the translation competition were all familiar with each other, but they had never seen Qiao Xi before.","A trace of ruthlessness flashed past Qiao Rou’s eyes, and she turned to enthusiastically introduce, “This is my sister, Qiao Xi.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","“So it’s her! This is the person who challenged Mr. Fan! I heard that her first two results were fake. How did she have the dignity to come?”","“Mr. Fan already chose to let the matter rest, but she still refuses to let it go. How ungrateful!”","Qiao Rou pretended to be nervous. “D-Don’t say that anymore. My sister... She’s just...”","She intentionally acted as if she wanted to help Qiao Xi explain, yet she didn’t know how to speak. In the end, her eyes turned slightly red. “My elder sister knows how to translate, so don’t speak of her like that!”","Everyone grunted coldly and felt that Qiao Rou was too kind, which was why she was speaking up for Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi: “...”","Had Qiao Rou’s b*tchy skills upgraded? It would be a pity if she didn’t become an actress!","At this moment, the excited voices of the crowd could be heard from outside. The reporters swarmed over and Fan Wenyuan slowly walked over.","When Fan Wenyuan brushed past Qiao Xi, his face was full of pride.","The live broadcast officially began. The first match was between Fan Wenyuan and Qiao Xi.","“The contestants for the first match, Fan Wenyuan and Qiao Xi!” the host announced loudly.","Fan Wenyuan rolled his eyes at Qiao Xi in disdain. He was determined to win this competition because he had already obtained the test question and had long since come up with the most perfect answer.","It was impossible that the answer he had been preparing for the past two days wasn’t even as good as Qiao Xi’s real-time translation.","After he defeated Qiao Xi, he would make her apologize in public and announce that she would withdraw from the translation world forever.","This round, the subject of the translation was a poem from England. The vocabulary was complicated, and they had to translate it within ten minutes. They also needed the words to be accurate and beautiful.","Everyone believed that Fan Wenyuan could translate it, but Qiao Xi definitely couldn’t.","Soon, Fan Wenyuan translated the answer. Everyone applauded excitedly.","“Mr. Fan is really too awesome!”","“To be able to translate an obscure poem in such a short period of time, Mr. Fan is indeed a great translator in our country!”","“Poetry is already very difficult to understand, and this poem has never been translated by anyone before. Even so, Mr. Fan only used a few minutes!”","“That Qiao Xi is still deluding herself into thinking that she’s worthy of competing with Mr. Fan. This time, she’s definitely going to embarrass herself!”","“Look at how she’s pretending to be calm. I’m afraid she can’t understand a single word. Does she really think that she can compare to Mr. Fan just because she knows some English?”","Gu Moling frowned. “Qiao Xi, hurry up and admit defeat. Don’t embarrass Rou Rou. You’ve lived in the countryside since you were young. You’ve never learned English!","“Rou Rou can’t eat or sleep because of you. Why are you so selfish?”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and swept a glance at Fan Wenyuan.","This was what they were calling a good translator? These people were too ignorant."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170 - Slapping Fan Wenyuan In The Face","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi slowly walked up the stage, and a poem appeared on the screen.","Fan Wenyuan had translated the first stanza, while she translated the second.","The first stanza was simpler and easier to understand. The second stanza was unpopular and difficult to translate beautifully.","Based on the question alone, it was difficult for her to turn the tables unless she was much more capable than Fan Wenyuan.","Qiao Xi closed her eyes and thought for a moment. Then, she opened her eyes and looked at the poem with a calm expression.","Fan Wenyuan looked at Qiao Xi with a face full of ridicule.","Her supporters were surprised. “She’s already prepared to answer after thinking for a while. It looks like she’s giving up!”","Disappointment was written all over Fan Wenyuan’s face. He curled his lips and said, “She’s too arrogant. Not only does she refuse to admit to having cheated, she even wants to challenge me. She’s too vain!”","The supporters sighed. “She’s still so young, yet she’s courting death!”","As soon as they finished speaking, Qiao Xi’s cold voice slowly sounded out. The words that were originally so complicated and difficult to understand turned into beautiful poetry with her translation, making people intoxicated.","Qiao Xi’s translation was outstanding to begin with, and her voice made it even more beautiful. Everyone was instantly shocked.","After she read out her translation, the entire venue fell silent before thunderous applause sounded out.","Many contestants below the stage said in disbelief, “Qiao Xi is too strong! I’ve never heard Qiao Rou talk about her sister. I didn’t expect her to be so powerful!”","“There is indeed a reason why Qiao Xi dares to challenge Mr. Fan. I even think that she’s much better at translating than Mr. Fan.”","With the first person praising Qiao Xi, everyone shared the same thoughts from an objective point of view.","“Yeah, I thought I was the only one who thought so but it seems that everyone else thinks that way too. Qiao Xi’s choice of words is more accurate, and her translation is more elegant. It’s obvious she’s better than Mr. Fan. I’m fascinated by her.”","“That’s right! Someone said that no one could translate the essence of this poem, but Qiao Xi was able to accurately find those words. It makes me feel like the translation doesn’t lose out to the original.”","Qiao Rou’s face darkened as she roared in her heart.","This was impossible!","Qiao Xi had lived in the countryside since she was young, so how could she know how to translate?","Below the stage, Fan Wenyuan’s eyes were vicious and his face was pale.","The surrounding people were all immersed in the poetry that Qiao Xi translated. To him, it was simply a great humiliation!","“I can’t believe I looked down on Qiao Xi just now. I didn’t expect her to be a genius in the translation world. Even if she’s arrogant, it’s only natural!”","“The translation is beautiful and logical. It’s simply too awesome!”","At this moment, the judges had already given their scores and handed the results to the host.","The host slowly walked up to the stage and calmly said, “The judges gave Mr. Fan Wenyuan a high score of 7.9!”","The audience was silent. After hearing Qiao Xi’s translation, Fan Wenyuan’s work seemed dull.","7.9 was already a rare high score for ordinary people, but at this moment, they were paying more attention to Qiao Xi’s score.","Next, the host announced loudly, “Next, let me announce Qiao Xi’s score. The judges have unanimously given 10 points. Congratulations, Miss Qiao Xi!”","Fan Wenyuan’s body trembled violently.","It was a perfect score! Qiao Xi had obtained another perfect score!","Impossible!","Impossible!","She was only in her 20s, and it was said that she had never learned English. How did she get full marks?","He had been in the translation industry for so many years and the judges all knew him. Why would he lose to an unknown woman?","The host invited Qiao Xi on stage, and the judges started to praise Qiao Xi’s translation.","The judge’s words kept entering Fan Wenyuan’s ears, causing him to suffer a huge blow. His head was heavy and his eyes were filled with fear.","Everyone discussed animatedly. “Since Qiao Xi was able to obtain such a score in the translation competition, it means that she didn’t cheat during the English test.”","“Don’t all of you know Fan Wenyuan? He can’t stand others being stronger than him and doesn’t allow a genius like Qiao Xi to surpass him, so he framed Qiao Xi for cheating...”","“Look at how things turned out now. His translation skills are on a completely different level from Qiao Xi’s!”","Listening to the sarcasm around him, Fan Wenyuan wished he could find a hole to hide in.","Everyone said that he was selfish and had wrongly accused Qiao Xi, this genius.","Originally, his plan was to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation, yet it was the other way around now.","Qiao Xi had definitely cheated again. He had to stand up and expose her. Otherwise, he would be unable to establish himself in the translation world in the future.","At this moment, one of the judges was full of praise. “Qiao Xi, are you interested in joining the International Translation Organization? I’ll recommend—”","“No! What right does she have to join the translation organization?! She must have gotten the question beforehand!”","The angry voice interrupted the judges. Everyone turned around and saw Fan Wenyuan charging toward them with a furious expression."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171 - Translation Genius","paragraphs":["“Qiao Xi! You cheated! Where did you get the question?”","There was complete silence.","The judges’ expressions were ugly. Since Fan Wenyuan was raising his doubts, they had to pay attention to him.","But with Qiao Xi’s standard, even if she did copy, who could she have copied from?","There was a moment of silence. Fan Wenyuan roared crazily, “She stole the question! She must have cheated. I’ve been studying translation for decades. How could I be surpassed by a woman in her 20s?! This is absolutely impossible! Qiao Xi! Hurry up and admit it—”","“I can prove that Miss Qiao Xi didn’t cheat! Moreover, she doesn’t need to cheat!”","At this moment, a magnetic voice was heard.","Someone shouted in surprise, “Mr. Nick from the International Translation Organization is here!”","Mr. Nick was here!","Moreover, he was even helping Qiao Xi clear her name.","Fan Wenyuan’s expression was as gloomy as ink. On what basis should Mr. Nick help Qiao Xi? She must have used some sort of method!","He was exasperated. “Mr. Nick, you must not know that Qiao Xi came from the countryside. She has never learned English at all. How could she possibly know how to translate? If she didn’t cheat, what other explanation could there be?”","Nick glanced at him indifferently and snorted. “Can’t a country bumpkin learn to translate? How can a person like you be a master translator?”","Then, he announced loudly to the crowd, “I can prove that Miss Qiao Xi didn’t cheat.”","The moment he finished speaking, a video of the translation competition appeared on the big screen.","Nick waved his hand and the video started playing. A very young girl appeared on the screen. Her face was very similar to Qiao Xi’s.","Then, other videos were played. The girl gradually lost her immaturity and became more and more stunning. Her eyes were calm and without ripples.","Qiao Xi!","Unexpectedly, she had already participated in several translation competitions. At the end of each video played, she was seen standing on the podium and calmly holding the trophy.","Such a young girl had won every competition.","Earlier, everyone was still shocked by the poetry that Qiao Xi had translated, but now, they were completely dumbstruck.","Fan Wenyuan didn’t even have the qualifications to participate in the international competition, while Qiao Xi was invited to be a judge several times but she always refused.","Mr. Nick’s face was serious. “Everyone has finished watching it, right? Miss Qiao has won the translation competition championship several times. Why should she cheat? Such a question is not difficult for her at all, let alone Fan Wenyuan’s questions!”","In other words, Fan Wenyuan simply didn’t have the qualifications to set questions for Qiao Xi!","What a joke!","Fan Wenyuan’s mind went blank.","At this moment, Qiao Rou’s face was gloomy as she stared fixedly at Qiao Xi on the stage.","Qiao Xi... How could Qiao Xi be that genius translator?","There must be a mistake!","She should be more outstanding than Qiao Xi in everything. How could she lose to Qiao Xi in terms of translation...","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm and composed.","She looked at Fan Wenyuan coldly, only to see his body trembling violently. He almost lost his balance.","“The champion of the translation competition? Impossible! The Qiao family said that she’s a country bumpkin and has never learned English. Impossible!”","Fan Wenyuan knew that he had completely lost. He had bet his entire life.","He turned around and fled in a panic, not daring to look at anyone’s expression.","“Stop! Mr. Fan, are you leaving just like that?”","Nick ordered his subordinates to stop Fan Wenyuan. He reprimanded loudly, “Someone did cheat in today’s competition, but it wasn’t Miss Qiao Xi. It was you!”","At this moment, a video played on the screen. A sneaky person had entered the archives of the translation competition.","Fan Wenyuan’s eyes widened.","Everyone gasped.","The person in the video was Fan Wenyuan.","He entered the archives room when no one was paying attention. He found the question for the competition and left in a hurry.","However, he did not expect the surveillance cameras to capture everything.","“So he was the one who cheated! But he actually turned around and accused Qiao Xi of cheating!”","“Fan Wenyuan is still putting on airs, saying that he is a master translator. But he’s actually just a selfish and jealous old fellow!”","“Fan Wenyuan stole the question in advance and only got 7.9 points, but Qiao Xi got 10 points. This is enough to show the difference in strength between the two!”","“What right does a scum like Fan Wenyuan have to participate in the translation competition? Get lost!”","Fan Wenyuan felt his ears buzz. The surrounding curses and ridicule were about to drown him. He looked fiercely at Qiao Xi.","Then, his eyes rolled behind their sockets and he fell to the ground.","Everyone quickly moved away. No one came forward to help him. In the end, the medical staff carried him out. The competition continued.","Fan Wenyuan had cheated in the international competition. Perhaps he had cheated in previous competitions as well. That was how he had obtained such good results. That was how he became a famous translator."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172 - Love Story","paragraphs":["After Qiao Xi got off the stage, she looked meaningfully at Qiao Rou, then turned around and left.","Qiao Rou’s heart skipped a beat.","“Brother Moling, it turns out that Mr. Fan is the one who cheated. I misunderstood Sister. I hope Sister doesn’t blame me...”","A trace of surprise flashed past Gu Moling’s eyes, but he thought in his heart that Rou Rou was probably worried that Qiao Xi would go astray and this matter shouldn’t be blamed on her.","“Don’t be afraid. I’ll go tell Qiao Xi that you didn’t do it on purpose. She definitely won’t blame you.”","...","Outside the venue.","Sitting in the car, Gu Zheng’s lips curled up slightly.","Song Shiyu looked at Gu Zheng in confusion. Young Madam was performing so well. Why didn’t the president react at all?","Assistant Song felt that he should do something.","He probed, “President, Young Madam is about to come out. If you don’t say anything, you’ll seem too cold and distant. Try praising Young Madam and she’ll like you more.”","Gu Zheng looked up at him quietly.","Song Shiyu was tireless. “That Lu Yan is not as rich or as handsome as you are. Why was he able to chat with Young Madam so intimately on their first meeting? It’s because he knows how to sweet-talk. Don’t let him snatch Madam away. You must learn to be gentle!”","Lu Yan?","Gu Zheng frowned. Why did Qiao Xi want to chat with Lu Yan?","It was only her first time meeting Lu Yan, so she shouldn’t be so familiar with him.","But Song Shiyu was right. Lu Yan was indeed not to be taken lightly.","His eyes narrowed, and his aura grew cold.","At this moment, Qiao Xi came out from the entrance of the venue and walked straight toward Gu Zheng.","She quickly got into the car.","Song Shiyu cleared his throat immediately and was as anxious as an ant on a hot pan.","Gu Zheng remained calm and collected. “I heard the poetry you translated, but there’s one word that isn’t too accurate. If it was translated into ‘undying love’, it would be even more appropriate.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","Just as he was speechless, Qiao Xi suddenly said with a face full of excitement, “Gu Zheng, you’re simply too outstanding. I also felt that it was a bit inappropriate. It would be even more smooth if it was ‘until death do us part’!”","Gu Zheng repeated, “Until death do us part.”","Song Shiyu’s legs gave way and the car shook violently.","Damn!","The president’s words were so refreshing!","Qiao Xi had a surprised expression. “Gu Zheng, did I hear wrongly?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he remained silent.","Qiao Xi thought that she had misheard, so she didn’t ask further.","Song Shiyu stole a glance at Gu Zheng and noticed that his cheeks were red and his eyes were slightly evasive.","What was going on?","Was the president shy?","With his domineering personality, shouldn’t he have pulled Young Madam into his embrace and given her a French kiss?","Gu Zheng took out his phone and sent Zhou Guanjin a message. Then, he closed his eyes quietly.","A moment later, Qiao Xi’s phone rang.","Zhou Guanjin probed. [Junior, they’re about to go through casting for the script you wrote previously. You have to go and check it out!”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. [That’s too fast! Didn’t you say it would take a long time?]","Previously, when Qiao Xi had nothing better to do, she wrote a script and tossed it to a very famous film company. They were very optimistic about her script, but there were too many big-name screenwriters, so it was impossible for them to use a novice scriptwriter’s script. Hence, they said it would take three years.","But now, they suddenly announced that they would be starting the casting process?","Zhou Guanjin: “...”","The big boss had personally spoken. How could he dare to delay?","Furthermore, the script that Qiao Xi wrote was really exciting. The famous director, Director Zhang, already had his eye on it. The company decided to use this script in advance and immediately announced the casting.","There was another reason why Zhou Guanjin wanted Qiao Xi to watch the casting.","[Junior, you haven’t met Senior yet. Coincidentally, Senior will be going for the audition this time. You should meet him too.]","Zhou Guanjin had told her many times to meet Senior.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment before finally agreeing.","Why did Senior want to watch the casting? Was he also a member of the film company?","There was another possibility—Senior was a famous actor in the entertainment industry, rich and powerful.","After hanging up, Qiao Xi realized that this wasn’t the way home, so she looked at the man beside her. “Gu Zheng, where are we going?”","Gu Zheng slowly opened his eyes. “I’ll take you somewhere.”","Song Shiyu drove the car to a large shopping mall. Gu Zheng took her to a jewelry store and said casually, “Mrs. Gu, you won the competition today. As your husband, I have to celebrate your win for you.”","In front of her was a set of jewelry, a diamond necklace, ruby earrings, and a diamond ring. All of them were exquisite and expensive."]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173 - Love Token","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng took out a diamond ring from the jewelry box and put it on Qiao Xi before leading her away.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in confusion.","Shouldn’t he say something?","They were leaving after putting on the ring? Shouldn’t he be confessing his feelings?","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘Wait a minute, wasn’t there a ring for the man too?’","Why didn’t the president say that they were couple rings?","...","Two days later.","Qiao Xi didn’t tell everyone that she went to watch the casting. Only Zhou Guanjin and the director knew about this.","Just as she was about to leave, Gu Zheng walked up and held her hand.","“You forgot your ring.”","Qiao Xi looked down and saw Gu Zheng helping her put on the diamond ring.","She did not move. Why did Gu Zheng insist that she wear the ring? Was it to declare her status?","As soon as Qiao Xi stepped out of the door, Song Shiyu eagerly took another ring out. “President, your ring.”","Gu Zheng nodded and took it.","Song Shiyu looked down. “...” The president was such a flirt. He would only bring it with him if someone else brought it.","...","The casting was being held in a building in the film studio.","Gu Zheng watched as Qiao Xi got down from the car with a slightly cold expression.","“Who are the investors of this movie?” he asked coldly.","Song Shiyu did a quick check and gasped. “President, one of them is Lu Yan!”","Gu Zheng knocked on the car window as his lips curled into a cold smile. “Thinking about my woman? He’s really daring.”","Song Shiyu held his breath in fear and said cautiously, “President, I’ll deal with him!”","Gu Zheng said unhurriedly, “We’re not hoodlums, don’t be so rash. Moreover, this is Qiao Xi’s script. The matter about investors... Do you understand what you need to do?”","Song Shiyu nodded immediately.","As this was Young Madam’s first movie, everyone who stood in her way had to be dealt with!","Song Shiyu was about to get out of the car when he turned around all of a sudden and said with a grin, “President, Young Madam is so awesome! Not only does she know how to translate, but she also knows how to write scripts. Aren’t you a little shabby?”","Young Madam seemed to know everything. If President did not watch her closely, she would be snatched away one day!","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “Mm.”","Song Shiyu looked helpless. “I’m telling the truth. I’ll tell you even if you don’t like hearing it. It’s all for your own good.”","“Assistant Song, isn’t your salary a little too high?” Gu Zheng smirked.","Song Shiyu was speechless.","‘I’ll just shut up!’","...","After Qiao Xi went upstairs, she went straight to the audition venue.","On the other side, Gu Moling had a surprised expression and couldn’t help but frown. “Rou Rou, look, is that Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Rou and a few of her actress friends walked over together. When she saw the person not far away, her body instantly trembled and her face revealed a sinister expression.","Soon, Qiao Rou calmed down. As this was the audition site and there were cameras and other actors nearby, she had to maintain her pure image.","“Brother Moling, why is Sister here too? Is she here for the audition too?”","Gu Moling shook his head. “I don’t think it’s possible. She’s not an actress, and your father won’t agree.”","Qiao Rou pretended to be weak. “I didn’t expect my sister to have such bad intentions toward me. When she heard that I’m here for the audition, she unexpectedly chose to compete with me. But she has never learned acting. Brother Moling, what should I do?”","The expression of a minor celebrity beside her changed.","Many admired Qiao Xi for defeating Fan Wenyuan and wished they could ingrain the video of Qiao Xi competing in the competition in their minds. However, the entertainment industry didn’t know about Qiao Xi at all, so those who came to participate in the audition had never seen Qiao Xi.","These small celebrities had only heard rumors of Qiao Xi and Qiao Rou fighting over Gu Moling.","Seeing that Gu Moling was extremely disgusted with Qiao Xi, the small celebrity, Li Sha, suddenly had an idea.","If she could chase Qiao Xi out, Young Master Gu would definitely think highly of her.","Moreover, the Gu family was an investor in this movie!","Thus, Li Sha excused herself to use the bathroom and turned to walk toward Qiao Xi.","...","Qiao Xi walked to the audition area, but she wasn’t in a hurry to enter. She wanted to find out what role they were holding auditions for today.","She was about to call Zhou Guanjin when she heard—","“Anyone can come for the audition, huh? What a joke!”","Qiao Xi looked at the woman in front of her. When their eyes met, she realized that she was the one being ridiculed.","Li Sha’s manager’s face was full of disdain. “This is the audition venue for the character of Shen Li. What right do you have to come? You’re really overestimating yourself! Let me tell you, our Li Sha has already been internally selected for this drama!”","Li Sha said arrogantly, “That’s right! The scriptwriter said that I fit Shen Li’s character the best. Qiao Xi, get lost quickly! Your efforts are all in vain!”","Just as Li Sha finished speaking, her manager at the side chimed in, “What’s with the security guards outside? Are they just letting anyone enter? What kind of place do they think this is?”"]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174 - Audition Crisis","paragraphs":["Subsequently, Li Sha’s assistant walked over as well. “Miss Qiao, this is the audition venue. You shouldn’t be here. Don’t even think about snatching the role from Li Sha!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “You’re auditioning for Shen Li?”","Her favorite character in the script is Shen Li. She was a woman with a tragic fate. After many betrayals and getting abandoned several times, she eventually turned evil. The character was full of emotions and also a dark horse in the drama.","She only agreed with Zhou Guanjin to come to the audition because she wanted to choose a good actress to play this role.","However, Li Sha said that the character was definitely hers?","Li Sha was smug. “Qiao Xi, I have a backer, so Shen Li is definitely mine! Don’t even think about competing with me! If you don’t leave, I’ll get someone to chase you out!”","Subsequently, Li Sha’s assistant looked displeased. “Miss Qiao, if you don’t leave now, don’t blame us for falling out with you! If this gets on the news, you’ll be the one losing your reputation!”","With a wave of her hand, several bodyguards rushed up and surrounded Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi laughed lightly. “Li Sha, are you sure you want to go against me?”","After she finished speaking, Qiao Xi directly walked past everyone and left.","Li Sha cursed. Her agent and assistant hurried to reassure her.","“Why does Qiao Xi think she can be arrogant? Does she have a backing? Even if she does, she can’t be more powerful than President Liu!”","After taking a few deep breaths, Li Sha said in a low voice, “Although the Gu family is an investor, President Liu has invested 50 million. He has the right to decide on a supporting role. In order to get his investment, the director will definitely give this role to me!”","...","Qiao Xi walked around and entered the audition venue.","The director had never seen Qiao Xi before and knew that she was Zhou Guanjin’s woman. He glanced at her but didn’t say anything.","After looking at a few actresses who were auditioning for Shen Li’s role, they were all not suitable. Qiao Xi scanned through the list of names and couldn’t help but smile.","Li Sha’s name was written on it.","At this moment, when Li Sha heard her manager call her, she hurriedly took a deep breath and walked into the audition venue. When she saw Qiao Xi, the smile on her face instantly vanished.","Why was Qiao Xi here?","She actually got to know the director before she did? Damn it!","Before the director could say anything, Li Sha was furious and scolded, “Qiao Xi! How the hell did you get in? Director! You promised to give me the role of Shen Li. Why is that b*tch by your side? What tricks did she play?”","Qiao Xi remained silent. The director and the other crew members took a deep breath before saying, “Stop talking. Li Sha, hurry up and audition!”","The manager quickly tried to calm Li Sha down. She finally calmed down and auditioned messily.","“The role of Shen Li must be mine. Don’t blame me for being heartless if anyone tries to compete with me!”","The director and staff: “...”","The director lowered his voice. “What the hell? And you call yourself an actress?”","The assistant director was helpless. “President Liu invested 50 million. If we don’t let Li Sha act as Shen Li, then don’t think about getting the 50 million. We’re put in a difficult spot!”","The director thought about it for a while. “Let’s decide on Li Sha for the role of Shen Li. If she can’t act, we can use a substitute and try to change it.”","The assistant director nodded. It was just a villain role. It didn’t matter who acted in it. The key was to get the 50 million.","Seeing that the director and staff were discussing, Li Sha went up to them and said, “Director, President Liu said that he’ll treat you to dinner tonight. When the time comes, the 50 million will be transferred directly to your account.","“President Liu has already called me. He also said that if Qiao Xi participates in this movie, he will immediately withdraw his investment,” the director said.","Lisa covered her mouth and laughed. “President Liu really dotes on me. I’m not such a petty person. When the time comes, let Qiao Xi act as my subordinate.”","Ten minutes later, the director announced, “The role of Shen Li will be given to Li Sha.”","“Wait!”","Qiao Xi suddenly spoke as she looked coldly at everyone.","“Shen Li’s character is complicated. Love and hate are intertwined. The actress needs a mature actor to convey it. Everyone has seen Li Sha’s performance just now. There were no fluctuations in emotions. She can’t even remember her lines. It really doesn’t match the Shen Li in my memory at all. I don’t think she’s good enough for the role of Shen Li. Change it!”","The huge audition venue instantly fell silent.","Li Sha was stunned for a moment before she cursed, “Shut the f*ck up! Who the hell are you? The director has already agreed to let me act as Shen Li. What right do you have to object? Do you have the right?”","The assistant director cleared his throat. “Miss Qiao, we’ve already decided on Shen Li’s role. Don’t get involved. Take a step back.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm. “I can’t step back. She can’t act as Shen Li!”","Li Sha’s anger flared, and she slammed the script onto the floor.","“Qiao Xi! If you have the ability, why don’t you find a man to invest in your film? If you can’t, then shut up! President Liu likes me the most. He’s going to invest 50 million for my role! Who do you think you are?!”"]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175 - Young Master Gu Protects His Wife","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s expression was calm while her voice was indifferent. “Li Sha isn’t suitable to act as Shen Li.”","Li Sha was so angry that her whole body was trembling. She immediately called President Liu. The assistant director’s expression was ugly and displeased.","“Miss Qiao, it’s true that you’re Young Master Zhou’s woman, but you’re an outsider. You don’t have the right to interfere in our casting selection. You’re not the scriptwriter either. How do you know who’s suitable to act as Shen Li?","“President Liu is an investor in this movie. He only arranged for a supporting role. You have no right to say no!”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “President Liu is investing 50 million?”","When Li Sha heard Qiao Xi’s voice, she immediately exploded. Completely disregarding her image, she roared, “That’s right! If I can’t act as Shen Li, don’t even think about getting this 50 million!”","The manager added, “Director, you know very well what Li Sha’s identity is. That Qiao Xi is just a small character. Any smart person would know how to choose!”","Qiao Xi remained calm. “Li Sha must leave.”","The assistant director’s eyes were filled with anger. “Miss Qiao, what right do you have to speak to us in such a commanding tone? You’re just Young Master Zhou’s lover, and President Liu will pay 50 million for Li Sha. Don’t think of yourself as someone important. We will never offend President Liu because of you!”","Qiao Xi stood up slowly with an indifferent expression. “If you must use Li Sha as Shen Li, then I’ll leave.”","She took out the document and walked toward the director. “In that case, our contract will be void.”","The assistant director was about to speak, but when he took a closer look, his face turned pale—","Contract?","It clearly stated that the scriptwriter had the right to decide on the cast. If the scriptwriter did not agree, they could not use the actor. Otherwise, the contract would automatically be invalidated.","So Qiao Xi was... the scriptwriter?","The assistant director shuddered and stood up abruptly. “You... are the scriptwriter?”","She should only be Zhou Guanjin’s lover. How could she be the scriptwriter?","Li Sha’s eyes were full of surprise. Seeing the assistant director’s change in expression, she immediately shouted, “Qiao Xi is lying! She’s definitely not the scriptwriter! She had no mother since she was young and was kidnapped to the countryside. She can write scripts? Then I’m an international superstar!","“Qiao Xi! Get lost! I feel disgusted just looking at you!”","Li Sha shouted loudly without caring about her image. She took out her phone and was about to call President Liu.","At this moment, the door to the audition venue was pushed open—","A few bodyguards in black suits entered the room. Song Shiyu walked out, bent over, and did everything smoothly.","Gu Zheng walked in steadily.","Qiao Xi paused for a moment.","What was Gu Zheng doing here?","Oh no, she was here to see her senior. If Gu Zheng knew that she was here to meet another man, it would be troublesome!","Gu Zheng’s eyes were indifferent, and his entire body was filled with the aura of a king.","The director’s heart skipped a beat. He was about to step forward when Li Sha rushed over. “Y-Young Master Gu, you’re here. Did President Liu ask you to come?”","Li Sha was pleased.","Young Master Gu must be here for her.","The moment she saw Gu Zheng, Li Sha’s heart skipped a beat. Young Master Gu was rich, powerful, and handsome. He was thousands of times better than President Liu. If she could get together with this man...","Li Sha went up to him and said pretentiously, “Young Master Gu, you didn’t have to personally come. You just had to give the director a call and this matter would’ve been resolved. But I feel so wronged! Someone actually came to find trouble with me...”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Who’s looking for trouble?”","Hearing that, Li Sha was even more certain that Gu Zheng was here to help her. She instantly burst with joy.","She approached Gu Zheng while swaying her body. “Young Master Gu, it’s her! She said that she’s the scriptwriter and doesn’t want me to play the role of Shen Li. The director has already agreed, but Qiao Xi keeps finding trouble and even wants to chase me away. Such a woman is really too scary!”","Gu Zheng glanced at Li Sha with a mocking look.","However, Li Sha did not sense it at all. She said arrogantly to Qiao Xi, “Do you see this? Young Master Gu is here to help me. You...”","“Don’t be angry.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was lazy and carried a trace of helplessness. “As long as you’re happy, making her disappear is just a matter of giving out the order.”","Everyone sucked in a breath, and Li Sha was even more shocked.","Who... was Young Master Gu talking to?","Was he coaxing a woman?","Li Sha thought that Gu Zheng was talking to her and was instantly overwhelmed.","“Young Master Gu...”","Just as she approached, Gu Zheng quickly walked in front of Qiao Xi. “Did you suffer?”","Li Sha gaped, unable to believe what she was seeing.","How was that possible?","Young Master Gu was actually coaxing Qiao Xi? Was he crazy?","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment. She was only thinking that she didn’t seem to have done anything extreme before Gu Zheng entered.","Fortunately, her fierce image was not exposed in front of Gu Zheng."]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176 - Am I A Bastard?","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi frowned and looked aggrieved. “Miss Li’s acting skills are really terrible. As the scriptwriter, I have to be responsible for this movie. I just said one sentence and she scolded me. She even said that President Liu will invest 50 million yuan for her. Young Master Gu, she’s bullying me so severely!”","A smile flashed across Gu Zheng’s eyes before his expression turned cold. “Song Shiyu.”","Song Shiyu understood at once. With a wave of his hand, several bodyguards rushed over and held Li Sha down. “Miss Li, excuse us.”","Li Sha’s eyes were filled with shock. She didn’t expect that Qiao Xi’s backing was Gu Zheng.","When did this b*tch seduce Gu Zheng?","Looking at Qiao Xi acting weak and aggrieved, Li Sha gritted her teeth in anger.","Young Master Gu must like her for her face! He had no idea how dirty she was!","Li Sha yelled, “Young Master Gu! How can you like Qiao Xi? She has scandalous relationships with several men. She’s a mistress and she’s sleeping with an old man. She might even be sick. Look at the diamond ring on her finger. It must have been given to her by a bastard. Young Master Gu...”","“A bastard?”","Gu Zheng repeated those words, then slowly walked up to her.","Li Sha thought that Gu Zheng believed her words. “Young Master Gu, I’m telling the truth. That diamond ring is very expensive and Qiao Xi doesn’t have the money to buy it. I don’t know how long she slept with him before she got it...”","“In Miss Li’s eyes, I’m a bastard?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was lazy. “President Liu is already past his prime. His taste is really unique since he likes a woman like Miss Li. But I’m different. I only like Qiao Xi.”","“Miss Li, if you think you’ve lived for too long, I can inform President Liu’s wife and let her deal with you. I don’t want you to keep bullying my Qiao Xi. My heart will ache.”","Qiao Xi gulped.","Wait, did she hear wrongly?","Gu Zheng said that he only liked her?","When Li Sha heard Gu Zheng’s words, her mind went into a frenzy.","Fear filled her eyes as she looked at Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng in shock.","Was Young Master Gu sick?","He only liked Qiao Xi? This was absolutely impossible!","Qiao Xi was a cheap woman who had slept with countless men. How could Young Master Gu fall for her?","At this moment, her manager’s phone rang. President Liu’s angry voice came from the other end. “Is Li Sha crazy?! She can mess with anyone, but she actually went to provoke that man. If she offends him, then tell Li Sha to get out of my sight. I won’t spend 50 million on her. Don’t come looking for me again!”","Li Sha shuddered and sat down on the floor, her mind blank.","President Liu didn’t want her anymore, and she even offended Young Master Gu.","She... She just wanted to chase Qiao Xi away and curry favor with Gu Moling and Qiao Rou. How did she end up like this?","“Miss Li, I forgot to tell you...”","Gu Zheng suddenly opened his mouth and said slowly, “You have the smell of an old man on you. It’s really nauseating. Next time you look for a man, you have to wipe your eyes clean. President Liu can already be your father at his age.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Gu Zheng’s mouth was really vicious!","But she liked it!","Hearing Gu Zheng’s ridicule, Li Sha immediately took a deep breath.","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi. “Let’s go.”","Qiao Xi nodded. When she looked down and saw that Gu Zheng was also wearing a ring on his hand, she was instantly puzzled.","“Gu Zheng, your ring looks similar to mine, but the design is a little simple.”","Gu Zheng was stunned.","He raised his head without batting an eyelid, so Qiao Xi didn’t see his expression and blushing face.","Gu Zheng replied calmly, “Yes, this ring is not bad.”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment that Gu Zheng had bought a couple ring, but it seemed like that wasn’t the case.","It just looked very similar. A straight man like Gu Zheng would definitely not think of having matching couple rings.","Song Shiyu: “...”","He immediately choked, his face full of helplessness.","Those were couple rings. Was it so difficult to say it out loud? Why didn’t the president admit it?","He was so anxious!","Gu Zheng touched the cufflinks.","On his birthday, Qiao Xi had given him these cufflinks.","However, Qiao Xi had gifted them to him with her identity as Black Tide. She thought she was gifting them to her senior.","But so much time had passed and Qiao Xi still hadn’t guessed that he was her senior. It looked like he had to give her some hints.","Gu Zheng said calmly, “Mrs. Gu, did you come here to see your senior?”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled: “...”","How did Gu Zheng know that Senior was coming?","The bastard was so petty. He wouldn’t do anything, would he?","Qiao Xi’s expression was subtle, and her face was filled with annoyance as she forcefully squeezed out a smile.","“Young Master Gu, you must be mistaken. There’s definitely no such thing.”","Gu Zheng’s lips twitched. “Mrs. Gu, you look a little nervous when you’re lying.”","Qiao Xi’s throat choked. Why was Gu Zheng so sure? How could someone as formidable as Senior be noticed by others? It was surely that kid, Zhou Guanjin, who leaked the news!"]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177 - Recognizing The Wrong Person","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It seems like you haven’t met your senior yet?”","Gu Zheng smirked and said slowly, “Could it be that you don’t want to see your senior anymore?”","Qiao Xi: “??”","What did this bastard mean?","Qiao Xi’s countenance was ghastly pale, and she immediately said, “Of course, I want to see my senior. You don’t understand the feelings between us. Even if we don’t meet, we’ll still be thinking about each other.”","Gu Zheng smiled.","Was that so...","In Qiao Xi’s eyes, the feelings between them were purely admiration and couldn’t be concealed.","Gu Zheng could not help but laugh as his eyes sparkled.","Qiao Xi suddenly felt that something was off.","Gu Zheng was laughing!","Was he mad?","Qiao Xi felt a chill run down her spine. It just so happened that the actors had already completed the audition, so she should leave as soon as possible.","She would see Senior another time!","Qiao Xi took a list, and in the end, her gaze fixed onto a name.","Ye Qingyun, 38 years old, married. It was said that he was proficient in hacking and was handsome.","Qiao Xi immediately rushed over to look for Ye Qingyun. This person was definitely her senior.","Ye Qingyun was discussing the script. Qiao Xi waited for them to finish before carefully opening the door.","“Hello, Mr. Ye.”","Everyone turned around in surprise.","Ye Qingyun greeted indifferently, “Nice to meet you, Scriptwriter Qiao.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes lit up.","Senior knew that she was the scriptwriter! It was him!","Although Ye Qingyun was 38 years old, he looked gentle and refined. His acting skills were outstanding and he was also a popular young actor when he was young. He could be said to be an actor with both strength and looks.","Seeing how enthusiastic the scriptwriter was, he smiled and asked, “Miss Qiao, is anything the matter?”","Qiao Xi’s expression froze.","?","Why was Senior pretending? Didn’t he say that they were going to meet?","Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. She looked at Ye Qingyun’s manager and immediately understood.","“Mr. Ye, don’t you know me?”","Ye Qingyun was confused.","He thought hard. She didn’t look... familiar to him.","At this moment, Gu Zheng had already walked to the lounge and was smiling.","Qiao Xi turned around and was shocked when she saw the man.","What was this bastard doing here?","Since Senior was unwilling to acknowledge her, Gu Zheng must definitely be here to watch her make a joke out of herself!","Qiao Xi was furious. She gritted her teeth. “Mr. Ye, you know very well that I’m looking for Mo Yuan, right?”","“...” Ye Qingyun and his manager looked at each other in confusion.","There was a moment of silence.","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face gradually vanished.","Why was Senior still unwilling to acknowledge her? She had already said her name, or was it because it was not the right time? There were outsiders around, so it was not easy for him to acknowledge her?","No matter what the reason was, Qiao Xi’s heart was filled with helplessness and disappointment.","It seemed like her senior did not want to see her. They had known each other for so long, but they had never met. Perhaps to him, they were just acquaintances.","She had no idea who he was, how old he was, or what he looked like.","If she took the initiative to strike up a conversation with random men, they might think she was crazy.","Disappointment was written all over Qiao Xi’s face. She sighed and bowed toward Ye Qingyun. “I’m sorry.”","Just as she was about to leave—","“Mr. Ye, I’m sorry.”","At this moment, the man’s cold voice sounded. Gu Zheng walked in and pulled Qiao Xi over.","“My wife isn’t normal, don’t mind her.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Who was abnormal?","She puffed up her cheeks and glared at Gu Zheng angrily. She raised her hand to give him a punch, but he dodged it and the corner of her mouth twitched.","Gu Zheng was calm. “Mr. Ye, you just saw it for yourself. She gets sick from time to time.”","With that, Gu Zheng pulled Qiao Xi out of the door.","Ye Qingyun nodded thoughtfully. No wonder this woman was trying to get close to him. It turned out that she was crazy.","Qiao Xi was angered to the point her face was flushing red. She pushed Gu Zheng off her. “What nonsense are you talking about!?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “If I don’t say that, how would I explain it?”","Qiao Xi choked and was feeling unconvinced. “He was the one who refused to acknowledge me...”","Gu Zheng snorted. “If you’re not acknowledged, why don’t you think about the reason why?”","The man’s lips curled up. “Is it just because you’ve been on each other’s minds?”","Qiao Xi’s expression darkened. “What does it have to do with you...”","“Qiao Xi.” Gu Zheng spoke slowly, “Has it ever crossed your mind that you got the wrong person?”","Qiao Xi’s pupils instantly dilated.","She got the wrong person?","Zhou Guanjin had said that her senior would be here.","Moreover, Ye Qingyun was the one who matched her senior’s identity the most. Did she miss something?","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with embarrassment. “In any case, my relationship with Senior is very good.”","Gu Zheng was just about to contact Zhou Guanjin when he suddenly froze when he heard Qiao Xi’s words.","Qiao Xi wanted to cry but had no tears. Her entire body was filled with a sense of defeat. Hence, she decided to teach Gu Zheng a lesson and roared loudly, “You’ll never be able to understand the feelings between me and Senior.. We’ve known each other for ten years, and during these ten years, we’ve supported each other. When I needed help the most, it was he who gave me the motivation to persist!”"]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178 - The Bastard Is Senior","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was extremely aggrieved in her heart and wanted to make Gu Zheng unhappy, so she shouted, “If it weren’t for me marrying you, I might have married Senior instead. He’s very good to me.”","Gu Zheng smirked.","Qiao Xi instantly choked.","The damned man was actually a little happy?","Why was he not jealous? Or did he not care at all?","Qiao Xi felt that she was like a clown at this moment.","Qiao Xi sighed. “I’ve known Senior for ten years. Even though I’ve married you now, my feelings for him can’t be replaced by anyone. Don’t vainly think of taking his place in my heart.”","Gu Zheng was calm and collected. Afraid that Qiao Xi’s mouth would go dry from talking, he even handed her a glass of water.","Wait!","Qiao Xi was stunned. Not only was this man not jealous but he was also interested in this topic.","Qiao Xi gnashed her teeth. “Even if Senior doesn’t acknowledge me, he’s still in my heart. Don’t think that just because I married you, I have to keep a distance from Senior. Do... Do you hear that?”","“Mhm...” Gu Zheng dragged out his words with a hint of teasing in his voice. His eyes were filled with smiles.","“You like your senior?” It seemed to be a question, but his tone was firm.","Qiao Xi did not perceive the hidden meaning behind his words and blurted out, “Right! I like Senior. Actually, it can’t be said that I like him. I love him...”","Someone pushed the door open and walked in.","Zhou Guanjin was wearing a suit and had a smile on his face. “You’re all here!”","He sat down and suddenly felt that the atmosphere between the two of them was very strange, so he asked probingly, “What’s going on? I originally wanted to bring my junior to look for you. But you’re very busy with work, so you might not have time.”","Gu Zheng remained calm and collected.","Qiao Xi noticed something strange from Zhou Guanjin’s words.","She took a sip of water and heard Zhou Guanjin say, “Senior, I should be the one to introduce you guys today. Why did the two of you meet yourselves?”","...","Wait!","Senior?","Her hand went weak and the cup fell to the floor. Water splashed everywhere.","Qiao Xi was dumbstruck. “Who did you say he is?”","Zhou Guanjin hurriedly picked up a tissue to wipe his pants. “He’s your senior!”","Qiao Xi rubbed her ears to confirm that she had not misheard.","Her face was ashen with shock.","Her mind was blank, and she felt as though everything was a dream.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng, then recalled what she had just said. She asked in disbelief, “Are you sure he’s Mo Yuan?”","Zhou Guanjin was puzzled. “Of course, your senior is Mo Yuan. And he already knows that you’re Black Tide.”","Gu Zheng smirked, his eyes were glinting like stars. He said casually, “Junior, I heard you like me the most?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched while her expression froze. “...”","She was about to vomit blood.","Qiao Xi abruptly stood up, her face filled with horror as her voice trembled. “You’re Mo Yuan?!”","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Huh, you don’t believe me?”","Zhou Guanjin had no idea what was going on between the two of them. He said excitedly, “Black Tide, I knew that you would find it hard to believe. I was also shocked for a long time when I found out.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","It was not just a shock. It was...","Gu Zheng’s thin lips parted slightly. “Black Tide, you said that you like me a lot and love me a lot. What else?”","Qiao Xi choked.","Before Zhou Guanjin came in, she did not know that Gu Zheng was her senior, so she said a lot of shameless things.","She originally wanted to anger Gu Zheng and express her love for her senior in front of him to see if he would be angry.","No wonder Gu Zheng was not angry at all and was even a little happy. It turned out that the person she had confessed to was Gu Zheng.","Zhou Guanjin was excited. “Junior! You’ve confessed? But aren’t you already married? Your husband is so pitiful!”","Qiao Xi choked, then closed her eyes and gnashed her teeth. “I was talking nonsense. Do you think I’m crazy? I won’t say such things again! Gu Zheng, consider me blind!”","Gu Zheng snorted.","Just then, Qiao Xi’s phone rang. It was Song Shiyu’s voice. “Young Madam! Young Master has helped you solve the matter of Qiao Rou and Fan Wenyuan maligning you. The shareholders have all voted to expel Qiao Rou. Qiao Corporation won’t accept her anymore.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes lit up.","She originally wanted Qin An to slowly help her deal with Qiao Rou.","Who would have thought that Gu Zheng would have already resolved it and saved her from having to worry about it?","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Qiao Rou’s expulsion is just the beginning. Gu Corporation will continue to pressure her in the future, so what do you think you should do now?”","Her words from earlier echoed in her mind, and she smiled slightly awkwardly.","She did not care about getting humiliated. After all, he was her husband."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179 - Dont Call Her Junior, Call Her Sister-In-Law","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi immediately went up to Gu Zheng with a smile on her face. “Young Master Gu~ You’re so kind. It’s true that I like you. You’re a magnanimous person, so you shouldn’t hold grudges.”","Gu Zheng chuckled. “You change your attitude quite quickly. Very good.”","Qiao Xi forced a large smile, yet she was suppressing her anger in her heart.","Qiao Xi felt that it was reasonable for Gu Zheng to be Mo Yuan. Actually, she should have realized this a long time ago.","Even though he was a bastard, he was very good to her as he was still her senior, causing Qiao Xi to feel very conflicted.","He was both her senior and her husband. Their relationship seemed to be a little messy.","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and suddenly recalled something, causing her entire body to tremble.","After marrying Gu Zheng, she had even complained to her senior, ‘My husband is such a bastard!’","“Junior, did you think of something?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, his eyes filled with ridicule.","“I even gave you a course on how to scold people previously. How did that go?”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled, and her countenance was ghastly pale. “Heh, n-not bad.”","Zhou Guanjin, who was beside them, suddenly felt that the atmosphere was very strange. “Why do I feel that the two of you seem to know each other before this? Moreover, the two of you look very intimate.”","Gu Zheng ignored him. “If you still need to write programs, don’t hesitate to tell me. I’m the man you love the most.”","Zhou Guanjin said, “Wait, the two of you are married people. It’s not appropriate to say such things to each other, right? You’re such a scumbag!”","Qiao Xi smiled embarrassedly. “Senior, you knew my identity since a long time ago?”","Zhou Guanjin shouted, “Can both of you pay attention to me? Qiao Xi... Senior, you...”","Gu Zheng said casually, “I knew it on my birthday.”","Qiao Xi: “!!”","Back then?","Hence, the gift that she had painstakingly prepared had always been with Gu Zheng.","This bastard had been hiding it from her all this time!","Zhou Guanjin shouted in exasperation, “Are you guys not listening to me?! Senior, I was the one who introduced you...”","“Young Master Zhou.”","Gu Zheng interrupted Zhou Guanjin and said slowly, “You don’t have to call her ‘Junior’ anymore. Just call her ‘Sister-in-law’. What do you think, Mrs. Gu?”","After that, he directly held Qiao Xi’s hand and left the lounge.","Zhou Guanjin was shocked and confused.","?","What?","Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu?","Hence, they were already married while he was alone!","He watched the two of them leave and hurriedly said, “Junior, that Lu Yan seems to be...”","Before he could finish, the two of them disappeared.","If her junior was not married yet, marrying Lu Yan would indeed be a good choice.","However, her junior’s husband was Gu Zheng... Who was Lu Yan? Wasn’t he just a little rich?","Lu Yan wanted to snatch a woman from his senior? Dream on!","...","On the other side, Qiao Xi struggled weakly. “Let go!”","Gu Zheng pulled her to the garage and let go of her. “Mrs. Gu, is this how you treat the man you love?”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. She had never seen such a shameless man.","Her face turned red as she pressed his hand down. “Shameless! I didn’t say that!”","Gu Zheng withdrew his hand and grabbed her waist. His fingers moved, making her body tremble. “Mrs. Gu, you have no conscience.”","Qiao Xi’s face instantly flushed red.","It was originally a complaint, but when Gu Zheng said it, it filled the air with ambiguity. She could not help but start feeling nervous.","“W-What are you doing? Let go! Otherwise, don’t blame me!”","The man chuckled and touched her lips with his finger. “What’s there to be shy about? I’m your husband.”","Qiao Xi wished for nothing more than to find a hole in the ground and crawl into it. She was so regretful. Why did she deliberately anger Gu Zheng?","“Miss Qiao, long time no see.”","At this moment, the man’s gentle voice sounded. Qiao Xi turned her head and her body instantly trembled.","Damn! It was the big shot that Third Brother was talking about, the legendary fiancé.","Lu Yan passed Gu Zheng and handed a red velvet box to Qiao Xi. “Congratulations on winning the translation competition, Miss Qiao. This is for you.”","Qiao Xi swept a glance at the box and knew that it was a Lone Star product. It cost approximately five million.","Qiao Xi’s face was full of embarrassment. The person in front of her was her ex-fiancé, while the person beside her was her husband. The air was instantly filled with the smell of gunpowder.","“Mr. Lu, this gift is too expensive. I won’t accept it.”","Lu Yan was calm as he put away the velvet box and smiled warmly. “It’s okay. This necklace will forever belong to you, Miss Qiao. It’ll always be waiting for you.”","Gu Zheng’s face sank, and he had an arm around Qiao Xi’s waist. His icy-cold gaze swept past Lu Yan before he pulled Qiao Xi into the car.","Lu Yan’s expression was calm as he said gently, “Miss Qiao, I like you. I hope you can give me a chance.”","Before Qiao Xi could answer, the car drove away."]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180 - The Gu Familys Past","paragraphs":["Lu Yan’s assistant said, “Sir, with your status and identity, how many women are taking the initiative to pursue you? Why are you pursuing a married woman? Moreover, Qiao Xi is the wife of an illegitimate child of the Gu family.”","The smile on Lu Yan’s face gradually vanished, and his eyes narrowed. “I want to steal Gu Zheng’s woman. I’ll snatch all his things.”","The assistant nodded and said, “That’s right. If you snatch her and toss her aside later, Gu Zheng will lose all his dignity!”","Lu Yan snorted. He had never thought of dumping Qiao Xi.","After all, an interesting woman like Qiao Xi was rare. He was very interested in her.","“To Qiao Corporation.” Lu Yan got into the car and smiled. “Since I’ve decided to pursue Miss Qiao, I have to express my gratitude.”","...","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold as he said in a deep voice, “Mrs. Gu, you seem to be very familiar with Lu Yan?”","Qiao Xi straightened her back and patted her chest as she guaranteed. “We’re really not close. I only met him once at the Gu family.”","Gu Zheng nodded and the car suddenly accelerated. “You’re not allowed to see him in the future!”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she quickly took out her phone to look up on Lu Yan.","The heir of the Lu family... Lu Qingyun’s nephew.","Lu Qingyun!","Wasn’t she the old chairman’s first wife?","After that, Mrs. Gu brought Gu Zheng to the Gu family and directly dominated the top position. Lu Qingyun was so angry that she died just like that. After that, the Lu family and the Gu family became enemies and never contacted each other again.","As an illegitimate child, Gu Zheng had always been hated by the Lu family.","Lu Yan had probably approached her only to go against Gu Zheng.","If Lu Yan could successfully snatch her away, Gu Zheng would become the laughing stock of everyone.","However... Gu Zheng was just a child back then. It was not his fault!","It was because of Gu Zheng that the old chairman agreed to let Mrs. Gu in. However, Mrs. Gu had never treated Gu Zheng like her son but like an enemy.","After Lu Qingyun married the old chairman, she did not do anything. Mrs. Gu’s mother rose to power because of her son. She should cherish Gu Zheng.","She had everything because of Gu Zheng, but she always abused him instead.","In Mrs. Gu’s eyes, Gu Zheng was just a tool to rise to power. He had to endure the pursuit and abuse of Mrs. Gu and the chairman, as well as constantly be on guard against the Lu family’s schemes. Everyone wanted to kill him.","However, he was clearly the most innocent person!","Qiao Xi’s eyes darkened as she felt bitter in her heart. “I won’t see him!”","Gu Zheng’s gloomy expression softened a little like an iceberg melting.","Since the Gu family felt guilty toward the Lu family, no matter how overboard Lu Yan’s actions were, everyone thought that it was reasonable and even asked Gu Zheng to swallow his anger.","The Lu and Gu families could not wait to kill him!","Now that Lu Yan wanted to snatch Qiao Xi away, it would depend on whether he had the ability.","Qiao Xi’s expression was serious as she sent Qin An a message: [Third Brother, send me information about the Lu family.]","...","At Qiao Corporation.","In the meeting room, everyone’s expression was gloomy.","“President Qiao, the people from Gu Corporation said that if we don’t expel Miss Qiao Rou, they’ll revoke their investment immediately...”","A veteran of Qiao Corporation said earnestly, “Miss Qiao Rou, it’s really a waste of your talent for you to be in our company. If we offend the Gu family, our Qiao Corporation will face a calamity.”","Qiao Rou and Xu Mei sat together with extremely ugly expressions.","Qiao Zhenguo had long agreed to give Qiao Corporation’s shares to Qiao Rou and chase Qiao Xi out of the Qiao family.","However, after the news about Fan Wenyuan spread, someone proved that Qiao Rou was the instigator.","Qiao Rou was a celebrity with a lot of followers. The internet was instantly filled with criticisms. They said that she was jealous of her sister’s ability and wanted to malign her.","The veteran said again, “Qiao Rou has offended Gu Corporation, and Young Master Gu has already given us a chance by not destroying the Qiao family. If we don’t expel Qiao Rou, what will the Gu family do?”","Qiao Rou lowered her head and sobbed softly. “I really didn’t hurt my sister. I just wanted to help her. I don’t understand why she’s doing this to me. The entire Qiao family is being ruined by her!”","“This has nothing to do with my daughter! There are so many of you, but what are you all doing? You’re reaping the benefits from the Qiao family yet you’re helping that b*tch, Qiao Xi?”","Xu Mei immediately cursed. These people actually wanted to chase her daughter away.","“Gu Corporation won’t put pressure on us because of Qiao Xi. There must be another reason. Aren’t you guys just thinking of ways to chase my daughter away? Have you gone mad?”","The veteran’s expression darkened as he abruptly stood up.","“Xu Mei, Qiao Rou! Qiao Xi has 74% of the shares. There’s no chance of winning against her. You went out for wool but came home shorn. Qiao Rou even maligned Eldest Miss by accusing her of harming her. As Qiao Rou’s mother, you’re no good person either!”","The meeting room was silent.","Qiao Zhenguo’s face was livid."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181 - Mother And Daughter Are Exactly The Same","paragraphs":["All these years, the veterans of the company had always been very dissatisfied with Xu Mei because she was the third party.","That’s right, Qiao Corporation belonged to Qiao Xi’s mother back then.","However, that woman had been dead for so many years. The company should belong to him and Xu Mei now!","He and Qiao Xi’s mother were husband and wife previously. After she died, she should have left the money and company to him. Moreover, he was with Xu Mei because he had long hated Qiao Xi’s mother.","Qiao Xi originally owned some of these shares. However, with her stubborn character, even if he gave them to her, he would still lose the shares somehow.","Why were these senior figures of the company resisting him?","Qiao Zhenguo was burning with anger. Why would that Gu Corporation care about the Qiao family’s matters?","“Stop arguing! Who exactly has the final say in Qiao Corporation? Rou Rou is the heir! What right do you have to chase her away?”","“Qiao Xi must have played some tricks to get the Gu Corporation to pressurize us. As long as Rou Rou and Mo Ling are married, the Gu family won’t say anything. Let me put this out today—Qiao Corporation won’t be given to Qiao Xi!”","Xu Mei and Qiao Rou looked at each other, smiling in satisfaction.","The veterans were helpless.","After the death of Qiao Rou’s mother, the company was completely under Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei’s control. Business was also deteriorating by the day.","Qiao Zhenguo was determined to keep Qiao Rou. Even if he had to lose the entire company, he would not chase the daughter of the mistress away. They could only get up and leave.","At this moment—","“How lively! I happen to want to talk business with you, President Qiao.”","Everyone looked up.","Lu Yan was wearing a suit and looked gentle.","Qiao Zhenguo’s eyes instantly lit up when he saw him. “Mr. Lu!”","When everyone heard that he was Mr. Lu, their hearts jumped.","Precious elements were rare resources that countries fought for, but such resources were only in the hands of Lu Yan and another mysterious person.","They did not know the identity of that mysterious person, so when they needed such precious elements, they could only look for Lu Yan.","Now, Lu Yan actually wanted to discuss business with the Qiao family?","Qiao Rou stared at him, deeply attracted to him...","Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei could tell what Qiao Rou was thinking. They hurriedly pulled Qiao Rou along to greet Lu Yan.","“Mr. Lu, let me introduce you to my daughter, Qiao Rou. She’s the heir of Qiao Corporation. Will you let her talk to you about the upcoming collaboration?”","The veterans gasped. President Qiao must be crazy to pass such an important customer to Qiao Rou.","Qiao Rou pretended to be shy and went in front of Lu Yan. “Mr. Lu...”","Lu Yan quietly pulled away and smiled gently. “Qiao Corporation’s heir is Qiao Rou? I’ll take my leave, then.”","The smile on Qiao Rou’s face froze when she heard Lu Yan’s words.","“I didn’t hesitate to go against Gu Corporation in order to negotiate a collaboration with the Qiao family because of Qiao Xi. I think everyone knows that I’ve always hated mistresses and illegitimate children.","“Qiao Rou has always been going against Qiao Xi... I like Qiao Xi very much and plan to pursue her. Everyone and everything that makes Qiao Xi unhappy has to disappear. If Qiao Corporation belongs to Qiao Rou, then the Lu family won’t do business with the Qiao family.”","With that, Lu Yan turned around with a cold expression.","Suddenly, he stopped in her tracks. “Miss Qiao Rou.”","Qiao Rou immediately looked up with tears in her eyes, looking aggrieved.","Lu Yan’s voice was slightly cold. “I heard that you and Gu Moling are already engaged. Please take note of your limits. Don’t stick close to a man when you see him. You’re just like your mother, Xu Mei. I really hate women like you!”","!!","Qiao Rou’s body went soft as her face turned pale.","He... He was actually belittling her!","“Rou Rou! Rou Rou!” Xu Mei’s expression changed drastically. She shouted in horror, “Zhenguo, Rou Rou has fainted!”","Qiao Zhenguo was thinking about what to do when he was shocked by Xu Mei’s voice. He realized that Qiao Rou had fainted and shouted, “Hurry up and call an ambulance!”","Xu Mei gnashed her teeth with hatred. It was all Qiao Xi’s fault! She must make Qiao Xi pay the price!","...","On the other side, Qiao Xi had already received news from Qin An. [Most of the information regarding the Lu family can’t be found, but I found out what happened 20 years ago. I think you’ll be interested.","[Lu Yan is not the biological son of the Lu family but a child who was thrown into the Lu family 20 years ago. Gu Zheng was born on the same day as him.]","Qiao Xi’s expression was strange.","Qin An: [After that, the Lu family adopted Lu Yan. Rumor has it that Lu Yan is Lu Qingyun’s biological son. Previously, Miss Lu did not have a miscarriage but gave birth to this child. She just hid him.]","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng.","Could it be that Lu Yan was the biological son of Chairman Gu and Lu Qingyun?"]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182 - Dont Be Afraid, Im Here","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng needed to go to the company. Qiao Xi got out of the car halfway and went to Black Tide’s base to look up some information.","The base was in the suburbs where there were few people around. There were no surveillance cameras around, which was enough to fool people.","After getting out of the car, she turned into an alley. After she left, a few people suddenly appeared behind her.","“B*tch! It’s her!”","“Even Rou Rou fainted from anger. Let’s teach her a lesson and take revenge for Rou Rou!”","Qiao Xi was just about to turn when she was suddenly bumped by someone. She supported herself against the wall and stood still, but the ring on her finger slipped off.","Then, a slap rained down.","Qiao Xi’s figure flashed to avoid it, and her gaze was slightly cold.","This was a dead end. There was nowhere to run, and the five of them attacked from the front and back.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to sweep across everyone with her gaze, then she indifferently lowered her head to pick up the ring.","“B*tch! You’re the one who harmed Rou Rou! You deserve to die!”","“Let’s attack her together and kill her. There are no surveillance cameras here. Even if they find us, there’s no evidence!”","Qiao Xi was about to pick up the ring when someone picked up a brick and attacked her. However, the target was not her but the ring.","It was the ring Gu Zheng gave her!","The ring was covered by the debris of the brick, and they once again attacked Qiao Xi with swinging rods.","Qiao Xi’s eyes turned cold as she reached out to grab the rod and pulled it forcefully.","“Ah!","Crack!","The person holding the stick grabbed his wrist and screamed in pain.","“Damn! She still dares to fight back?! Let’s attack together!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed. Besides the rods, they also had two sabers in their hands that glinted coldly in the night.","One of the boys looked young. His eyes were fierce as he played with the knife in his hand. “No wonder Lu Yan likes you. You indeed have the ability to seduce men. However, you made Rou Rou faint from anger, so you have to pay the price!”","Only then did Qiao Xi know why Lu Yan and the Qiao family canceled their collaboration. She also found out that Qiao Rou had fainted. That was why they came to take revenge on her.","She silently pressed the button on her bag to record everything that was happening.","A young lady shouted excitedly, “It’s too easy for her to die just like this. We should think of how to torture her. Why don’t we take off all her clothes and take a few photos? Then, we can slowly torture her to death.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was composed. “Murder is against the law.”","They instantly roared with laughter when they heard Qiao Xi’s words.","“You’re too funny. So what if it’s against the law? If you make Rou Rou unhappy, we’ll kill you. You can’t escape today!”","Qiao Rou was vicious and merciless. This time, she was even using minors to kill people. She was simply crazy.","They laughed maniacally. “Before you die, I’ll destroy your face and body. Who asked you to snatch Rou Rou’s man and shares?!”","“Isn’t it a pity to just kill her? She looks pretty to me. Why don’t we have a good time together first?”","Qiao Xi endured the feeling of vomiting, and her eyes were icy cold.","These people had gone mad!","She thought that Qiao Rou was only good at pretending, but she did not expect her to come up with such a sinister plan.","Since Qiao Rou was looking for trouble, she could not blame her for being heartless.","At this moment, an older girl shouted fiercely, “Rou Rou said that no matter if it’s Qiao Corporation or outstanding men, they all belong to her. If you snatch them from her, only death awaits you!”","She took out a dagger from her waist and stabbed it toward Qiao Xi.","“Ah!","A scream sounded as the girl screamed in pain.","A tall man kicked her in the stomach, and the girl fell heavily. The knife in her hand fell to the floor with a bang, making her face twist in pain.","Gu Zheng’s footsteps were heavy, and he looked dignified. His deep eyes were filled with coldness as he scrutinized the five people.","A boy gritted his teeth and said, “He came alone. We can deal with him, so there’s no need to be afraid of him. After we kill this man, we’ll take Qiao Xi away and slowly torture her. Even if we’re captured in the end, Rou Rou will save us.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the boy unscrewed a bottle with a skull drawn on it. Qiao Xi immediately knew what it was.","Gu Zheng’s gaze was icy cold as he quickly rushed forward. He grabbed Qiao Xi’s waist before turning around to deliver a heavy blow to the boy.","The corrosive liquid spilled onto the floor with a sizzling sound.","The boy’s face was splashed with the liquid. He cried loudly and kept cursing.","Qiao Xi bent down to pick up the ring, but Gu Zheng grabbed her waist tightly.","“Gu Zheng...”","“Yeah...”","Gu Zheng’s eyes lowered as the two of them looked at each other, causing Qiao Xi’s heart to ache. She revealed an aggrieved expression. “Gu Zheng, it was fortunate that you came. Otherwise, I would have been killed by them!”","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng did not snort like usual. Instead, he hugged her waist tightly and said in a low voice, “Don’t be afraid, I’m here.”"]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183 - Giving Her Life For The Ring","paragraphs":["When Gu Zheng hugged her, he was extremely glad that Mrs. Gu was not really weak. Otherwise, facing the attacks of these five people, she might not have been able to wait for him.","If he were a moment later, she would really be injured and her face would be disfigured. What should she do then?","A terrifying chill spread out from Gu Zheng’s body. He narrowed his eyes and coldly looked at the group.","“Qiao Rou incited you to come.”","These words sounded very calm, but everyone was trembling in fear. The man in front of them was like a demon from hell.","Then, a group of bodyguards in black rushed out and quickly held the five people down.","Gu Zheng put his arm around Qiao Xi and said indifferently, “Song Shiyu, get rid of them.”","Song Shiyu had already called the police. The five of them were caught, but they were not afraid.","This was because they thought that Rou Rou would not ignore them. She would definitely use money to free them.","Qiao Xi quickly picked up the ring and wiped the dust off it. “It’s dirty now...”","Gu Zheng held her hand. “Actually, you’re capable of dealing with them, right?”","Qiao Xi choked. “I guess.”","Gu Zheng calmed his emotions, and his breathing gradually returned to normal.","These people were indeed not a match for Qiao Xi, but their methods were too vicious. It was difficult to guarantee that Qiao Xi would not be injured.","Gu Zheng kept his eyes fixed on the item in her hand. “For the ring?”","Qiao Xi was stunned and felt slightly guilty.","Gu Zheng reached out to take the ring. Looking at the dust-covered ring, the corners of his lips curled up. “You cherish my gift so much that you’re unwilling to throw it away even though you’d get hurt?”","Qiao Xi’s pupils were constricted.","When she saw the ring land on the floor, she felt like her heart was missing a piece.","Although her senior had already given her many gifts, the ring was the first gift Gu Zheng gave her.","This group of people almost destroyed it!","She concealed her thoughts and cleared her throat. “Don’t think too much. I just think this ring is very expensive and my heart aches for it.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and touched the ring. He said casually, “Then you should know what brand this ring is from?”","Qiao Xi was speechless. What did Gu Zheng mean by this? Why did he suddenly ask about the brand of the ring?","She never wore rings, so she did not know much about these things.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “You don’t know?”","She looked confused. Then, she heard the man chuckle. “You don’t even know what brand it is, yet you said it’s expensive? You were even willing to risk your life for the ring?”","Qiao Xi’s heart was instantly in a mess as she muttered softly, “I don’t know what brand this is, but I think the things you give me are definitely not cheap.”","Gu Zheng smiled.","His gaze was burning as he stared at her.","After a moment of silence, the man raised his hand and stroked her slightly cold cheek. His voice was gentle but filled with strength. “Qiao Xi, you really like me, don’t you?”","Qiao Xi instantly gaped while her entire body trembled.","At this moment, Qin An walked over. Without even thinking, Qiao Xi rushed toward him.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as the corners of his mouth curled up slightly.","Mrs. Gu was embarrassed!","...","The five people who were arrested did not admit to their crimes, but with Qiao Xi’s video as evidence, they could not defend themselves.","The news that the five hooligans were out to take revenge for the female celebrity and almost killed someone spread like wildfire on the internet. A lot of netizens were discussing it.","The netizens did not know who the mastermind was, but the news was shocking.","[I heard that those five hooligans are still minors. They think that even if they kill someone, they don’t have to take responsibility. If someone hadn’t saved her, that woman would’ve been killed by them!]","[This world is too crazy. Fans who chase after idols are really scary. I heard that woman isn’t from the entertainment circle.]","Everyone expressed their thoughts. At this moment, someone sent a crucial message.","[Although the photo is a little blurry, it looks a little like Qiao Xi. Moreover, Qiao Xi is not from the entertainment circle. Which female celebrity has a grudge against her?]","A moment later, the comment disappeared without a trace. Other comments that revealed the identity of the person in the photo were all deleted.","In the Qiao family’s house.","Swoosh!","The glass cup slammed onto the floor. Qiao Rou roared at the top of her voice, “That b*tch is so lucky! The five of them attacked her but failed to kill her. She even caused a scene.”","Xu Mei was flustered. “Rou Rou, what should we do?”","Qiao Rou forced herself to calm down and gritted her teeth. “Save them.”","Xu Mei’s expression was unsightly. “I sent someone over a long time ago but they almost killed someone, so it won’t be easy to release them. Moreover, Qiao Xi has a strong backer, so the police won’t dare let this matter go easily.”","What?","Qiao Rou’s heart skipped a beat!","Those people were all her brainless fans. Whenever she encountered trouble, she would get them to help her solve it. Even if they were caught, they would soon be released. It had never been a big deal.","However, it was different this time."]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184 - Its Terrifying To Be Uneducated","paragraphs":["Qiao Rou’s eyes were vicious. “They’re all alive?”","Xu Mei nodded. “Some were splashed with sulfuric acid, while others had their arms dislocated. In short, they’re all lightly injured and are not in life-threatening situations.”","“Why didn’t she die? How troublesome!” Qiao Rou gritted her teeth. “It’s good that they were injured. At least, they’ll have something against her. Just say that Qiao Xi harmed a few minors. Their parents will definitely look for trouble...","“Go add fuel to the fire and chat with those parents. Tell them that their children wouldn’t have attacked Qiao Xi for no reason but Qiao Xi hurt them and even caused them to be injured. We must have Qiao Xi bear the responsibility!”","Qiao Rou exhaled. “Don’t expose my identity. If anything happens, I’ll be sure to nip it in the bud. I’ll ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation and wait for the netizens to attack Qiao Xi.”","...","Although Qiao Xi was not injured, Qin An still dragged her to the hospital. He even checked her body to confirm that she had no internal injuries.","Gu Zheng was waiting outside.","After the check-up, it was already dark.","Song Shiyu said, “President, the Qiao family did try to save the group of hooligans, but they didn’t succeed. I found out that these people have done a lot of wicked things for Qiao Rou. They were always released not long after they were arrested, and no one knows that Qiao Rou is the one giving them the orders. I think the rest of their lives are doomed!”","Gu Zheng was not concerned about this. He played with the gun in his hand. “It’s already an act of kindness for me to not have them disappear from this world.”","Song Shiyu was shocked.","The president was too scary.","If those people fell into the president’s hands, the president would definitely make them wish they were dead.","Song Shiyu looked terrified. He was about to persuade him when he heard—","“We won’t go to jail! We’re minors!”","“Qiao Xi wasn’t injured, so why should we be punished? Moreover, we’re eliminating evil for the people!”","Gu Zheng felt chills all over his body.","Song Shiyu wanted to cover their mouths. If they did not stop talking, they would die!","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold as he strode toward where the voices came from.","“Gu Zheng.”","Qiao Xi walked out of the ward and held Gu Zheng’s arm. “Let’s make a visit.”","Qiao Rou used some hooligans to deal with her and now she wanted to get rid of the traces? Dream on!","In front of Gu Zheng, she pressed the video button and blinked. “Gu Zheng, I’m not a woman who can be bullied.”","She was just pretending to be weak. Of course, she would not let others bully her.","She had never been weak!","At this moment, the boy in the ward had a bandage on his head while the girl had applied medicine to her stomach. The two of them were lying on the beds and looked very miserable.","As soon as they saw Qiao Xi, they instantly roared madly.","“B*tch! I’ll kill you!”","“You caused me to be disfigured. If I get out of here, I’ll definitely kill you. You’re doomed! B*tch!”","Qiao Xi clicked her tongue.","These children were really crazy.","Some children were children, while others were demons.","Qiao Xi sat down and smiled indifferently. “I’m afraid all of you don’t have the ability.”","The atmosphere was silent for a moment before it turned noisy.","The girl screamed, “Ah! Go to hell! You even hit me. You’re abusing minors! I’m going to sue you!”","At this moment, the girl’s mother rushed in and shouted, “My daughter’s stomach is seriously injured. She can’t get pregnant in the future. There’s even a scar on her face. Her life is ruined! You have to take responsibility!”","Qiao Xi must have done something wrong for the children to team up against her.","Now that the children were all injured, Qiao Xi had to take responsibility for all of this.","As long as the children insisted that they had not hurt Qiao Xi and that Qiao Xi attacked them, they would be fine. On the other hand, Qiao Xi would be punished.","Qiao Xi swept the crowd with her gaze, then sneered. “All of you are very angry that I’m unharmed, right? You should have just rushed up to me and slashed me back then. If I had died, all of you would be successful in taking revenge for Qiao Rou... But I’m living well now while all of you are lying on hospital beds.”","They gritted their teeth in anger.","Qiao Xi said casually, “You should be able to tell that I don’t lack money, and it isn’t difficult for me to compensate for your medical fees.”","The children’s parents looked greedy.","Qiao Xi changed the topic. “But why should I take responsibility? It was you who wanted to harm me! You held rods and daggers in your hands, wanting to kill me. Fortunately, I was lucky enough to be alive and unharmed, so it serves you right that you got injured. I don’t have to pay for your medical expenses on the moral and legal levels. It’s really terrifying to be uneducated. If you have the time, study more!”"]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185 - Revenge","paragraphs":["Everyone was furious. “You’re not f*cking injured, so you can’t be considered a victim! You and Rou Rou are sisters. She’s so gentle and kind, but you’re vicious and cruel. You’ve completely embarrassed her!”","Qiao Xi snorted coldly. “Since Qiao Rou is gentle and kind, why would she incite you to kill people? Since it’s like that, then your injuries have nothing to do with me. Qiao Rou should be the one taking responsibility.”","If it were not for Qiao Rou’s instigation, these people would not have walked onto the road of no return.","As soon as he finished speaking, the few of them had ferocious expressions while their eyes almost dropped.","“Shut up! I won’t allow you to insult Rou Rou! We’re all willing to take revenge for Rou Rou!”","“You’re not worthy to be Rou Rou’s sister! Go die! As long as you die, no one will stand in Rou Rou’s way anymore!”","“We’re honored to kill someone for Rou Rou!”","The girl struggled to sit up on the bed and screamed, “Why aren’t you dead yet?! Rou Rou asked you to die, but you still dare to live!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. She had already obtained what she wanted.","She slowly stood up. “Everyone, wake up. You’re just Qiao Rou’s chess pieces. Even if you die, she won’t even blink. If you don’t believe me, pretend I didn’t say anything.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone let out mad roars.","B*tch!","Shouldn’t Qiao Xi be responsible for injuring and disfiguring them?","They even wanted to properly extort Qiao Xi and live carefree lives in the future.","Qiao Xi was clearly not injured, so what right did she have to have them arrested and go to jail?","Since the conversation was recorded, Qiao Xi was not in the mood to deal with them anymore. She stood up and left.","When she reached the door, she stopped in her tracks. “Why don’t we see if Qiao Rou will save you in the end or if she’ll break off all ties with you?”","...","Outside the door, Song Shiyu said helplessly, “President, it’s just a ring. We’ll buy a new one.”","With the president’s financial resources, he could easily buy a gold mine, much less a ring.","Gu Zheng did not even raise his head. “It’s her ring.”","It was the first time he had given Qiao Xi a present as Gu Zheng...","He was in high spirits, and his eyes were shining like stars. “Moreover, she likes the gift I gave her. She didn’t bear to throw it away even though she would get injured.”","Song Shiyu agreed. “Indeed, this is a token of love!”","He thought about it again. “President, there’s a scratch on this ring. It’s also dirty. The token of love has been damaged. Does this mean that the two of you might quarrel or even divorce?”","Gu Zheng frowned. “Song Shiyu.”","“Here, President.”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “You must not want your salary anymore.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","The president was too petty to deduct his salary at the slightest disagreement! No wonder Young Madam said he was a bastard. He was really a bastard!","At night, Qiao Xi went upstairs to take a shower. Then, she posted on Weibo: [Instigating a minor to do bad things. Such an idol is the scum of society @ Qiao Rou.]","Qiao Rou was trying her best to cover up this matter, but Qiao Xi just publicized it and let everyone see Qiao Rou’s true colors!","She would settle the old and new debts together!","Qiao Xi did not care how big of a commotion it was causing online at this moment and just went to sleep.","After she fell asleep, Mo Yuan released the news that the five people who attacked Qiao Xi were Qiao Rou’s fans on the internet.","The news released by Mo Yuan was always accurate. The netizens were sure that those five people were Qiao Rou’s diehard fans.","[Why would Mo Yuan release such news?]","[Could it be for Qiao Xi? Such a cold man like Mo Yuan would actually stand up for a woman! I’m envious!]","[Rumor has it that Mo Yuan is a handsome and rich man. Ah, I’m dead!]","Countless girls expressed their love for Mo Yuan.","That night, the news that Qiao Rou’s fans had attacked her sister, Qiao Xi, on the streets spread throughout the internet. It was extremely hot news.","Immediately after, all the major companies canceled their collaboration with the Qiao family and Gu Moling.","Qiao Rou also received several termination contracts overnight.","...","Qiao Xi woke up feeling refreshed, but Qiao Rou had experienced a night of torture. Her eyes were blood red, and her face was pale. She looked neither human nor like a ghost.","“Rou Rou, you need to take care of your body!” Xu Mei’s heart ached.","Qiao Rou’s eyes almost dropped as she gnashed her teeth. “Qiao Xi, that sl*t!","“Why would she expose it?”","“Now that all the contracts have been canceled and the company is implicated, she wants to ruin me? I want to kill her!","“I wasn’t the one who went to kill her. It was clearly the fans who were too rash. Could it be that the behavior of fans reflects the idols as well?”","B*tch! B*tch!","Last night, she kept receiving news that her contracts were canceled because of Qiao Xi.","If she knew earlier, she would have dealt with Qiao Xi as soon as possible. She shouldn’t have left this scourge alive to block her way.","That b*tch should go to hell and join her mother!"]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186 - Young Madam Is Too Kind","paragraphs":["“Rou Rou, Mo Ling is here. His company has also been implicated. He doesn’t look too good,” Xu Mei reminded her in a low voice.","Qiao Rou looked ferocious and forced herself to calm down. She said hatefully, “Okay, I know what to do.”","After that, Gu Moling walked in dejectedly. “Rou Rou, what exactly is going on? Why would your fans try to kill Qiao Xi? I heard that they brought daggers and Qiao Xi almost died!”","Qiao Rou’s gaze was vicious, but in front of Gu Moling, she had to pretend to be weak and aggrieved.","She said with an innocent look, “I don’t understand why my fans would want to kill my sister either. They’re simply too crazy. Fortunately, my sister is fine.”","Gu Moling looked at Qiao Rou suspiciously. Seeing that she was full of worry, he heaved a sigh of relief.","“Even if Qiao Xi is in the wrong, we can’t harm her. These fans are too arrogant!”","Qiao Rou bit her lip. “Previously, my sister tried to harm me multiple times but I didn’t blame her. Of course, I won’t blame her this time, nor will I let my fans kill her.","“I didn’t expect my fans to be so scary... Brother Mo Ling, I’m so scared. If my sister is really injured, I can only apologize with my life...”","“Rou Rou, you’re too kind. Why are you worried about that rebellious daughter?!” Old Madam Qiao walked over with her walking stick.","“Mo Ling, you still don’t understand that woman, Qiao Xi. She must have deliberately framed Rou Rou. Those fans were probably just trying to scare her. How could they really hurt her? Qiao Xi set her up on purpose! You must believe in Rou Rou!”","The news of Qiao Rou’s fans attempting to kill her biological sister spread like wildfire on the internet. Netizens were all denouncing Qiao Rou.","If she did not instigate it, why would those fans want to hurt Qiao Xi?","Apart from Qiao Rou, Qiao Corporation and Gu Moling’s companies were all boycotted by the industry.","Gu Moling returned to the company and had a splitting headache when he saw the termination contract. He said helplessly, “Rou Rou said that she doesn’t know anything.”","Mr. Gu frowned. “How could Qiao Rou not know anything? She even teamed up with Fan Wenyuan to accuse Qiao Xi of cheating. In the end, Qiao Xi proved herself with her strength!","“Now, such a thing has happened. Everyone knows about it and the company has been affected. But she just said that she doesn’t know? If it were Qiao Xi, she wouldn’t have done this. She...”","Mrs. Gu’s expression darkened. “Stop talking. Mo Ling and Rou Rou are already engaged, so we should share our joys and sorrows. Besides, Qiao Xi isn’t a good person either. If it weren’t for her, would we have ended up like this?”","Mr. Gu was not too satisfied with Gu Moling and Qiao Rou being together. He snorted. “Qiao Rou only knows how to create trouble while Qiao Xi previously helped us negotiate so many deals!”","Mrs. Gu choked. After a moment of silence, she shouted loudly, “Qiao Xi is a jinx! Qiao Rou is obedient and sensible. She’s the better choice! Qiao Xi is jealous of Rou Rou, so she came up with this method to deal with her. Don’t be deceived by her!","“Rou Rou is in trouble now. It’s all because of that jinx, Qiao Xi!”","Mr. Gu frowned. “Gu Moling, I don’t care what the outcome of this matter is. It can’t affect the company. As the son of the Gu family, you have to minimize the losses. Immediately go to the public relations department and salvage the company’s reputation! As for Qiao Xi, go persuade her not to make things too ugly.”","Gu Moling agreed helplessly and rubbed his furrowed eyebrows.","Rou Rou would not incite her fans to kill people!","She was so gentle and kind-hearted...","He had been with Rou Rou for so long. He knew very well what kind of person Rou Rou was. He could not misunderstand Rou Rou because of Qiao Xi.","...","Song Shiyu had also seen the news online.","Countless netizens were cursing Qiao Rou and Gu Moling. Song Shiyu asked in confusion, “President, doesn’t Young Madam have a recording? Why didn’t she post it?”","As long as she played the recording, Qiao Rou would be known for instigating her fans to kill people.","Qiao Rou instigated minors to kill someone for her. It was simply a heinous crime.","However, Young Madam did not upload the recording. Could it be that she still cared about their relationship as sisters?","Gu Zheng smirked.","Qiao Xi did not post the recording and just sent a warning instead.","In this way, the Qiao family would think that Qiao Xi did not have any substantial evidence and was just accusing Qiao Rou without any evidence.","The Qiao family would take the opportunity to clear their names and even bite back, saying that Qiao Xi slandered them.","Qiao Xi did not need to argue. She just needed to release the recording after they tried their best to explain themselves so that the Qiao family would not have any chance to retort.","By then, no matter what Qiao Rou said, the truth would be out in front of everyone.","Gu Zheng said casually, “She’s doing a good job...”","Song Shiyu was suddenly agitated. “Young Madam is too kind. Qiao Rou did this to her, but she’s not taking her down!”"]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187 - Gu Zheng Was Poisoned","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu continued, “She didn’t release the recording because she wants to give Qiao Rou a chance to correct herself so that she can be a good person again. After all, she’s a public figure. If such a scandal is exposed, her future will be ruined! They’re really close!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Had water entered this person’s brain?! Gu Zheng should consider changing assistants.","Just then, the butler knocked on the door. “President, Young Madam says she’s going to look for Young Master Qin. She won’t be coming back tonight.”","Swoosh!","Gu Zheng’s expression darkened, and the cup in his hand shattered into countless pieces.","She actually dared to stay out all night?","Furthermore, she was with Qin An?","Gu Zheng’s face darkened. Song Shiyu rolled his eyes and tried to please the president in order to raise his salary.","“President, I think...”","...","Qin An frowned. “Who has night blindness? Is it necessary for you to come looking for me in such a rush?”","Qiao Xi was slightly guilty. “Just tell me if it can be treated.”","Qin An held his chin and pondered. He had stopped working with the Qiao family and got the company’s founding members to pressure Qiao Zhenguo. He thought that Little Six was here to thank him, but who knew that she rushed over in a hurry to ask why a person would lose his eyesight at night?","Qin An looked at her in confusion. “Little Six, from what you described, I don’t think that person has ordinary night-blindness. Although night-blindness reduces one’s vision at night, it doesn’t mean that one is completely blind.”","“Perhaps this isn’t an illness but the effects of a poison.”","Qiao Xi’s expression changed. Was this really the case?","She immediately asked, “Could it be a psychological illness? Because he was always locked in a small dark room when he was young, could it be that the trauma of his childhood caused him to lose his eyesight?”","Qin An fell into deep thought. “That’s also possible, but I don’t think the possibility of a psychological illness causing him to completely lose his eyesight is high. This is because I’ve heard of someone who has the same symptoms as your friend.”","Qin An’s expression turned serious. “She’ll lose her eyesight at night but she’ll recover if it’s light out, so even when she sleeps, she has to switch on the lights. However, she couldn’t take the torture and died.”","Qiao Xi asked, “Who is she?”","“Lu Qingyun,” Qin An said word by word.","Qiao Xi’s heart skipped a beat!","If that was the case, it meant that Gu Zheng and Lu Qingyun were both poisoned by the same poison!","“Miss Lu was poisoned for many years, so even the old man was helpless about it.”","Qin An frowned. The old man was a divine doctor who could save the dying.","However, he could not save Lu Qingyun. He could only watch as she took her last breath.","“After Miss Lu passed away, the old man started researching the antidote to this poison. Perhaps he has already found a way to cure it. Your friend may still be saved.”","Qiao Xi’s head was heavy. She remembered Grandpa saying he had saved many people in his life, but there was one who could not be saved even after he tried his best.","Was Gu Zheng incurable as well?","Just then, her phone rang, interrupting her thoughts.","Song Shiyu’s trembling voice was heard. “Young Madam, President, he...”","Qiao Xi instantly became nervous. “What’s wrong with Gu Zheng?”","Song Shiyu sobbed and said helplessly, “When the president saved you, his arm was injured and his wound is now infected. Sob...”","Qiao Xi’s pupils constricted. “Quickly send him to the hospital!”","“Young Madam, he refuses to go. Why don’t you persuade him?” Song Shiyu sounded sad as he continued acting. “The president refuses to go to the hospital or take medication. I can’t do anything about it. Only you can control him...”","Qiao Xi hurriedly stood up and left.","Qin An was stunned.","Could it be that the friend Little Six was talking about was Gu Zheng?","He had to admit that Gu Zheng was a good man who was very good to Little Six.","However...","The old man might not agree. After all, Miss Lu...","Little Six respected the old man the most. It would be difficult for him to make a decision.","...","Longwan Residential.","Song Shiyu beamed. “President, Young Madam will be back soon!”","Gu Zheng replied indifferently with a trace of fatigue in his eyes.","It was almost evening and the sun had not set. However, he felt a stinging pain in his eyes.","When he opened his eyes again, they were extremely dull.","He could only see Song Shiyu’s outline but not his expression.","Gu Zheng closed his eyes. It seemed to have gotten worse.","Qiao Xi hurriedly returned to Longwan Residential. The sun had set. Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa with his eyes closed and his brows furrowed. The lights in the living room were all switched on, but Song Shiyu and the butler were not around.","Qiao Xi’s footsteps were light as she walked over to Gu Zheng.","Although he was injured, there were no wounds on Gu Zheng’s body.","However, he looked tired and weak...","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled Qin An’s words and her heart trembled. Could it be that the poison in Gu Zheng’s body was acting up?"]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188 - Such A Self-Defying Man","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi hurriedly tugged on Gu Zheng, her face filled with worry. “Gu Zheng, are you injured?”","The man said slowly, “Mrs. Gu, you’re back. I heard you weren’t coming home tonight?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘Damn man! What are you talking about?’","Gu Zheng slowly opened his eyes. They were cold. He did not seem to be sleeping earlier.","He rubbed his eyes and frowned.","Gu Zheng’s eyes looked a little lost. Even though the living room was bright, he could not see clearly.","He lowered his eyes and did not show anything in front of Qiao Xi. He said in a low voice, “Pass me the phone.”","He had to call the doctor, but he could not see his phone clearly. Song Shiyu and the butler were not around either, so he could only ask Qiao Xi to help him.","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression.","The phone was beside Gu Zheng. He could get it as long as he stretched out his hand.","After waiting for a moment, Qiao Xi remained silent. Gu Zheng’s eyes grew deeper as he slowly closed his eyes as if this was the only way to relieve the pain. “Where’s my phone?”","“Gu Zheng, what’s wrong? Are you...” Qiao Xi asked softly.","She stroked Gu Zheng’s cheek and finally met his eyes. “Gu Zheng, your eyes...”","“I’m not blind. Can’t I ask you to help me get my phone?” Gu Zheng said nonchalantly. He did not want Qiao Xi to know that his illness was serious.","Qiao Xi was helpless. “The phone is right beside your hand, yet you’re insisting that I give it to you.”","The atmosphere instantly fell into embarrassment, and Qiao Xi stared fixedly at him.","Gu Zheng opened his eyes and said with a trace of grievance, “Qiao Xi, didn’t you say that you like me the most? You won’t even do such a small thing for me?”","“...?”","It’s happening again! She could not move on from the words she uttered last time!","Qiao Xi’s face flushed red as she tossed the phone to him and distanced herself from him. She said with a trembling voice, “That was a misunderstanding the last time. I was just joking. Besides, our marriage is only an agreement. We don’t really have any feelings for each other!”","He held his phone and found the doctor’s number. He did not call it.","He raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. “It’s late, go rest.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","There was something wrong with this bastard today!","When Song Shiyu called, he said that he was injured and would not go to the hospital. However, he was not injured at all.","Only then did Qiao Xi understand that Song Shiyu had lied to her. Furthermore, Gu Zheng had not been kind to her since she came back home. She was angry. “I won’t care about you anymore! Have fun by yourself!”","‘I can’t be bothered with you!’","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. After Qiao Xi left, he hesitated for a moment before calling Song Shiyu.","“Stop the power in the villa.”","Song Shiyu was confused, but he knew that there was a reason for everything the president did. “Huh? Okay. President, about that...”","As someone who shipped President and Young Madam, he was a little excited.","“When did Young Madam say that she likes you the most? Why didn’t I know about this?”","Gu Zheng said impatiently, “She liked me before we got married. Otherwise, how could we have gotten married? Does this have to do with you?”","Song Shiyu: “...”","Perhaps, the president was too narcissistic.","How could Song Shiyu not know that Young Madam and President’s marriage was an agreement? Moreover, Young Madam had never said such things.","The president was probably thinking too much!","Unexpectedly, the president, who had always been cold, was also a big boaster!","...","Song Shiyu turned off the power switch, and the bright Longwan Residential fell into darkness.","Qiao Xi had just returned to her room when the lights in the bedroom suddenly went out. It turned out that the power supply had been cut.","Fortunately, her phone and laptop were both charged, so it did not affect her, but...","The blackout would make Gu Zheng blind!","He would not be able to see anything!","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she hurriedly rushed out the door, wanting to find Gu Zheng.","The butler and Song Shiyu were not by his side. The electricity had suddenly stopped working and Gu Zheng could not see. As his wife, she had to take care of him.","Qiao Xi had just left the bedroom when she suddenly stopped in her tracks.","Gu Zheng was the one who chased her away just now. It was too embarrassing for her to run over as soon as the power went out!","Qiao Xi stood at the staircase and was slightly hesitant.","Screw it!","However, it was too dark. Gu Zheng could not see anything. He should be very helpless, right?","What if it did come back on soon?","Gu Zheng was blind. He was alone... Gu Zheng...","Her heart was filled with Gu Zheng and she could not be indifferent!","At this moment, her heart was in a mess. She was worried that he would be afraid and think of those unhappy memories from his childhood.","Just then, there was a sudden bang downstairs as if someone had fallen. There was also a man’s voice.","Gu Zheng fell?","Her heart jumped. Without thinking, she hurriedly rushed out.","Gu Zheng, this bastard, really made one worry!"]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189 - Youre Finally Here","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The moment the lights were switched off, Gu Zheng heaved a sigh of relief and sat quietly on the sofa.","The surroundings were deathly silent as he waited for Qiao Xi.","However, even after a long time, he did not hear Qiao Xi’s footsteps.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes, revealing a trace of disappointment in the darkness.","Qiao Xi’s words still echoed in his ears. In her eyes, their marriage was an agreement. They were only pretending to be husband and wife in front of others. When no one was around, they were just strangers.","“Heh.”","Gu Zheng smirked, realizing that he was thinking too much. He was about to call Song Shiyu to ask him to switch on the lights when he heard footsteps...","“Gu Zheng, are you there?”","Gu Zheng’s heart trembled, and his phone fell to the floor.","His eyes were completely dark, but he still looked over in the direction of Qiao Xi’s voice.","Qiao Xi’s footsteps were slightly chaotic, and her voice trembled slightly. “Don’t move around. I’m here.”","The man’s lips curled up slightly.","If she really did not care about him, then their marriage would just really be based on an agreement.","However, she appeared at this moment...","She had him in her heart, so she could forget about escaping.","...","Qiao Xi turned on the flashlight and only relaxed when she saw Gu Zheng sitting quietly on the sofa. She hurriedly walked over. “Gu Zheng, you...”","Gu Zheng reached out to hug her waist and pulled her into his arms.","Earlier, he was unable to see anything and accidentally touched something. He did not expect that Qiao Xi would really come down.","Qiao Xi was tightly embraced by him, and their bodies were pressed together.","Even if Gu Zheng was blind, he could still pull her into his arms.","“You’re finally here.”","Qiao Xi’s face flushed red as she struggled to leave.","Gu Zheng gasped slightly. His voice carried boundless delight as he said in a low voice, “Qiao Xi, since you came, then you can’t escape!”","He then pressed his cold and soft lips against hers, finding her lips precisely.","Qiao Xi’s entire body was tense while her hands grabbed tightly onto his clothes.","Thump! Thump!","Her heart was pounding furiously.","Whenever she kissed Gu Zheng before this, it was to recover her taste buds, so there were no emotions involved.","However, the kiss this time caused Qiao Xi to indulge in it as if she had forgotten about the time.","Seizing the opportunity, Qiao Xi hurriedly said, “Gu Zheng, don’t...”","Before she could finish, her voice vanished due to the deep kiss. Qiao Xi’s head felt heavy.","“This is... the living room. Let’s go... Go upstairs!”","Gu Zheng let go of her and curled his lips. His voice was soft and tempting as he said, “Mrs. Gu, I can’t go back.”","His voice was hoarse, causing Qiao Xi’s entire body to tremble as she stammered, “Don’t you still have me?! I’ll lead you back.”","Gu Zheng chuckled.","In the darkness, Qiao Xi’s face was dyed red and even her ears were slightly pink.","...","Qiao Xi carefully helped Gu Zheng to the bedroom and covered him with the blanket before turning to leave.","When night fell, he would not be able to see anything. The poison might have already seeped into his body.","Furthermore, Gu Zheng had many enemies outside. If others were to know about this, they would definitely take advantage of the nighttime to attack him.","Back then, although Grandpa did not save Miss Lu, more than 20 years had passed. Maybe he could cure the poison now.","Moreover, Gu Zheng’s situation was not as serious as Miss Lu’s.","If she were to perform acupuncture on Gu Zheng daily, she might be able to expel the toxin.","She could only take a gamble.","As long as the poison had yet to fully flare up, everything would be fine.","Qiao Xi returned to the room to think of a way to cure the poison while Gu Zheng stayed up the entire night.","...","At dawn, Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes. After washing up, she took her tool bag and went to look for Gu Zheng.","The man’s eyes were clear as he stared at the tool bag in her hand.","Qiao Xi went straight to the point. “Gu Zheng, take off your clothes!”","Song Shiyu had just reached the door when he heard such shocking words.","Damn! The president and Young Madam made rapid progress last night. She wanted to take his clothes off so early in the morning?","Gu Zheng was wearing black pajamas. His hair was slightly messy, but he looked even more handsome like this. He also exuded an invisible pressure.","Qiao Xi opened the tool bag, revealing silver needles and some bottles. The man smirked. “Take off my clothes?”","“Yes, I need to give you acupuncture.”","Qiao Xi looked up and met his thin lips. Her mind instantly exploded as the sentimental scene from the night before appeared in front of her eyes.","Gu Zheng’s kiss was too aggressive and possessive. Even though she was struggling, he did not care...","“Mrs. Gu.”","After a few seconds of silence, Gu Zheng said slowly, “You have a malicious look in your eyes?”","Wait! What did he mean by ‘malicious’?","Qiao Xi glared fiercely at him. She instantly understood.","“...”","This bastard was thinking astray!","However, the scene could not be erased from her mind and always appeared in Qiao Xi’s eyes."]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190 - Treatment With Acupuncture","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s ears were red, and she looked embarrassed. She could only hide her thoughts with a smile. “President, don’t think too much. I’m here to treat your illness.”","Gu Zheng chuckled and lowered his eyes. “Mrs. Gu, there’s no need.”","Qiao Xi’s face instantly sank. “Gu Zheng, you go blind at night because you were poisoned!”","Gu Zheng had a calm expression and was not surprised at all. “I know.”","Qiao Xi was surprised. “You actually know? Then you...”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold. “This poison is incurable, so acupuncture is useless.”","He looked at the needles with a dark expression. “So there’s no need.”","When he knew that he was poisoned, he had already foreseen the future. Hence, he did not even struggle anymore.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. She seemed to find Gu Zheng a little unfamiliar at this moment. His eyes were filled with desolation and indifference as if his blindness had nothing to do with him.","She was silent for a moment, then sighed helplessly.","The man turned around, and his gaze landed on her.","Qiao Xi pouted. “Gu Zheng, we’re married now. If you lose your eyesight, it’ll be too much trouble for me!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Qiao Xi had an aggrieved expression. “I’m such a weak woman, so you won’t be able to protect me anymore after that. You still have so many enemies. At that time, they’ll definitely make a move on me!”","“...”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked away. His voice carried a hint of helplessness as he said, “... I’ll take my clothes off. You can treat me.”","Qiao Xi only pretended to be weak in order to treat his illness. Although her treatment would most likely be useless, he could not bear to see Qiao Xi sad.","It was just acupuncture. She could do it as long as she was happy.","Qiao Xi took off Gu Zheng’s pajamas, causing her pupils to constrict. It was because his back was full of injuries, ranging from old to new.","There were whip marks and traces of acupuncture, causing Qiao Xi’s heart to ache.","He must have already sought treatment but it was useless. That was why he had given up.","Her heart constricted, and Qiao Xi felt the pain sweep through her entire body.","Gu Zheng...","It turned out that the all-powerful Gu Zheng, the head of the Gu family who was admired by countless people, and the man who stood at the top of the pyramid had experienced endless pain. Perhaps no one knew about this.","Qiao Xi forced herself to calm down. She held the silver needle in her hand and slowly stabbed it into his skin.","An hour later, the acupuncture session ended. Gu Zheng’s forehead was covered in sweat, and his eyes were closed. His breathing was heavy.","Qiao Xi put away the acupuncture bag and said with a gentle tone, “I studied the medical books yesterday and planted medicinal herbs in the backyard. In the future, you’ll have to drink medicine every day. It’ll be helpful.”","Those were not ordinary herbs but wondrous herbs left to her by Grandpa. Although they could not completely cure the poison, they could at least suppress the effects of the poison. They were also very effective on the eyes.","Gu Zheng had seen her plant something in the courtyard before. It turned out to be herbs for treating illnesses. He nodded. “I’ll tell the butler.”","“Young Madam! Young Madam!”","The butler’s footsteps were messy as he rushed in while looking anxious. “Madam Meng and Miss Meng are here. Their car drove straight into the backyard. Those herbs are all...”","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm as she indifferently put away the acupuncture bag, but she still held a needle in her hand.","Her expression was cold. Meng Wan ruined the herbs she used to treat Gu Zheng’s illness?","Medicines were hard to come by. She finally managed to keep some seeds and they were about to be used as medicine. However, the herbs were all destroyed by Meng Wan?","“Where’s Meng Wan?” asked Qiao Xi.","“I saw them destroy your herbs, so I sent someone to stop them and hurried over to report to you. They’re still in the backyard, but those herbs are probably destroyed...”","The butler’s heart trembled when he saw Qiao Xi’s expression turning colder and colder. “Young Madam, calm down. You can replant the herbs but it’s against the law to kill!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly. “Did I say I wanted to kill someone?”","The butler: “...” ‘Your gaze tells me that you want to kill someone right now.’","Qiao Xi handed the acupuncture bag to the butler. “I’ll go take a look. Gu Zheng, go rest.”","After she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and left. The butler instructed the servants to put away the things and hurriedly followed Qiao Xi to the backyard.","The bedroom was silent.","Song Shiyu walked in, looking worried. “President, you don’t look too good. Why didn’t you tell Young Madam?”","The poison in the president’s body was no ordinary poison. Acupuncture could not treat this, and it would only speed up the relapse.","Only the divine physician or his descendants could suppress the relapse of the poison with their unique acupuncture technique.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he slowly put on his pajamas. “It doesn’t matter if I’m treated or not. The poison will flare up sooner or later.”","Song Shiyu frowned. “But...”","“Don’t let her know.” Gu Zheng closed his eyes tiredly. “She thinks there’s still hope. At least, she can be happier this way.”","Qiao Xi was worried for him, and he was already very satisfied with her acupuncture treatment. In any case, he could not keep his eyes anymore."]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191 - Smashing People Or Cars?","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold. “The herbs that Qiao Xi spent so much effort to plant were destroyed by the Meng family.”","Ignoring the fact that the herbs were useless, they were something Qiao Xi spent a lot of effort to grow. She was hoping to use the herbs to detoxify the poison in his body, but everything was ruined now.","Song Shiyu gulped and advised in a low voice, “President, you have to calm down.”","At this moment, Song Shiyu could not help but mourn for the Meng family. At the very least, the president had not gone to the backyard yet but Young Madam had already gone there. If she really killed Meng Wan, things would get out of hand.","...","When Qiao Xi came to the backyard, she saw Meng Wan and Madam Meng complaining loudly.","Meng Wan was holding an umbrella and looked impatient. “The sun is scorching! Let us in. This is how Longwan Residential treats guests, huh? I’m Brother Gu Zheng’s childhood sweetheart. Are you crazy?!”","“Miss Meng, you destroyed the herbs that Young Madam planted, so you can’t leave for the time being. You have to wait for Young Madam to come and make a decision.”","Song Shijing was Song Shiyu’s elder brother and Gu Zheng’s subordinate. He was calm, composed, and steady.","His words were equivalent to Gu Zheng’s.","Hence, Meng Wan did not dare to offend him, much less throw a tantrum.","She raised her foot and crushed another herb, her face filled with viciousness.","Meanwhile, Qiao Xi slowly walked over.","There was an herb under Meng Wan’s feet. Madam Meng quickly pulled her back and pretended to scold her. “Wan Wan! Quickly apologize to Miss Qiao. Although it’s just some grass, it was planted by Miss Qiao. Quickly apologize!”","Qiao Xi sneered.","Madam Meng was really a good person. If her daughter destroyed the herbs, she told her to just apologize. If her daughter were to kill someone, would she also just tell her to apologize?","Meng Wan walked in front of Qiao Xi and said arrogantly, “It’s just a few stalks of grass, not gold or silver treasure. Do you want me to compensate you? Besides, Brother Gu Zheng doesn’t like these plants. If I help you settle them, it’ll save you trouble.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and looked at the crushed herbs on the ground.","The herbs that Meng Wan crushed could heal the dead and restore their bones. They were herbs that she wanted to use to treat Gu Zheng’s illness, but Meng Wan did not seem to care.","Qiao Xi remained calm. “Miss Meng, you should pay the price for destroying my things. Pay up!”","Meng Wan instantly widened her eyes. “Qiao Xi, you’re so funny. You want to ask me for money for just a few stalks of grass? Fine! I’ll give it to you. Is 200 yuan enough? How about 1,000? You’re really crazy poor, right? Brother Gu Zheng is so rich. You’re not worthy of him at all. You’d better get out of the Gu family!”","Qiao Xi sneered.","1,000 yuan?","According to the market price, these herbs would cost at least ten million yuan.","Furthermore, they were something that could not be bought with money. Back then, Old Master Meng spent a fortune on medicine. He offered 500,000 yuan to get herbs like these but no one sold it to him.","Although the herbs that Meng Wan had destroyed had yet to mature, they could still be sold for 100,000 yuan per stalk.","Qiao Xi said coldly, “Song Shijing.”","Song Shijing was well-trained. He immediately straightened his back and replied loudly, “Yes, Young Madam!”","Qiao Xi’s tone was calm. “Miss Meng destroyed my herbs and doesn’t want to compensate. What should we do now?”","Song Shijing glanced at Meng Wan indifferently. “Everything will be decided by you, Young Madam.”","His words represented Gu Zheng. Since he said so, Qiao Xi was sure that the entire Longwan Residential could be controlled by her. Hence, she said slowly, “In that case, it’s not too much to smash her car, right?”","Song Shijing waved his hand without hesitation.","A group of bodyguards rushed over, scaring Meng Wan until her face was pale. “Qiao Xi, you’re crazy! I only crushed a few stalks of grass! You want to smash my car? This is a limited edition sports car. It’s worth more than five million!”","“Miss Meng, can’t I?”","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised. “Your car crushed the grass, so I’m smashing your car. Isn’t this very fair?”","Song Shijing: “...”","Song Shiyu had said that Young Madam was very weak. What was going on?","Meng Wan was so angry that her whole body was trembling. This b*tch was saying that if she did not compensate, her car would be smashed?","How arrogant!","After a loud bang, the limited edition sports car was in a terrible state. Meng Wan shouted, “Stop it, all of you! I’m a guest of the Gu family! You can’t do this to me! Brother Gu Zheng won’t agree!”","The Gu family’s bodyguards were well-trained. They smashed the car into pieces in no time at all. A good limited edition sports car had been turned into a pile of scrap metal.","Meng Wan watched as the car broke into pieces. Her face was pale and her body was trembling."]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192 - Cant Break Her Weak Persona","paragraphs":["“Qiao Xi! It was Grandpa Gu who asked me to look for Brother Gu Zheng. You actually smashed my sports car for a few stalks of grass. I absolutely won’t let this go! If Brother Gu Zheng knows about this, he definitely won’t let you off!”","Madam Meng suddenly realized that there was a man standing not far away.","She took a deep breath and hurriedly stopped Meng Wan. Then, she advised her with a gentle expression, “Wan Wan, it was our fault. We destroyed Miss Qiao’s flowers and plants. It’s understandable that she smashed the car.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng strode over with a serious expression.","“Although these flowers and plants are not worth much, they were personally planted by Miss Qiao. It’s a pity since this car was originally meant to be given to Old Master Gu. But Wan Wan has indeed done something wrong. I hope you won’t blame her.","“Wan Wan, hurry up and apologize to Miss Qiao!”","Madam Meng shot a glance at Meng Wan. At this moment, Meng Wan retracted her vicious gaze and revealed an aggrieved expression. She had also seen Gu Zheng behind Qiao Xi.","She squeezed out a few tears and pretended to be weak. “Miss Qiao, I’m sorry. I really didn’t do it on purpose. It’s my fault. I didn’t see the flowers and plants on the ground. Boo-hoo...”","Qiao Xi sneered.","This woman was still pretending to be innocent and fragile at a time like this. Who was she acting for?!","Her words were clearly an accusation against her for smashing Meng Wan’s sports car that cost five million yuan for a bunch of worthless flowers and plants. Hence, she demanded Meng Wan apologize.","Not only did Meng Wan not blame Qiao Xi but she even begged for her forgiveness pitifully, making Qiao Xi look even more vicious.","Madam Meng sighed. “Miss Qiao, Wan Wan was Gu Zheng’s fiancee in the past, so she often came to Longwan Residential. There were no such flowers in the backyard before, so she drove in. She didn’t mean to crush the flowers you planted.”","With that, Madam Meng lowered her head and wiped her tears.","“Wan Wanused to stay here as well. Who knew that there were flowers and plants in the backyard now? Now that things have come to this, I hope you can forgive her and not hold it against her!”","Qiao Xi sneered. This mother and daughter pair were really two-faced b*tches!","On the surface, they were asking for her forgiveness, but in reality, they were showing off that Meng Wan was Gu Zheng’s former fiancee. Furthermore, she often came to Longwan Residential for a short stay as the two of them were childhood sweethearts.","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. Perhaps it was because she usually pretended to be weak, so the Meng mother and daughter thought she was a pushover who could be trampled on by just about anyone?","Seeing that she was silent, Meng Wan glanced at Gu Zheng, who was behind her, and sobbed aggrievedly.","“Qiao Xi, you’ve already smashed my car yet you’re still unwilling to forgive me? I only destroyed a few of your weeds, but you smashed my car that’s worth five million dollars. Could it be that you’ll only be satisfied if you kill me?”","Qiao Xi was just about to speak when Meng Wan spoke out in an aggrieved tone. Her voice was trembling, and she sounded extremely humble.","“I’ve known Gu Zheng for so many years. I won’t hold it against you, but if you provoke someone else and smash their car, it’ll be a disgrace to the Gu family. It’ll also implicate Brother Gu Zheng.","“Brother Gu Zheng is such an excellent person. Why would he marry such an unreasonable wife like you? Miss Qiao, what else do you want? Are you not satisfied after smashing my car? Brother Gu Zheng won’t allow you to continue fooling around!”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. Meng Wan’s words were more pleasant to the ears than any other song. Everything was for the sake of Gu Zheng. She put Gu Zheng on the pedestal while stepping on her.","Qiao Xi was about to retort when a cold voice sounded—","“Who said I won’t allow it?”","Gu Zheng walked over slowly. His voice was cold and he exuded the dignity of a king.","Qiao Xi was stunned.","? When did Gu Zheng arrive?","She suddenly came to a realization. No wonder the mother and daughter pair suddenly pretended to be aggrieved and cried. It was because of Gu Zheng!","Meng Wan walked up to him pitifully and said in a delicate voice, “Brother Gu Zheng, I...”","Gu Zheng ignored her and walked past her to Qiao Xi’s side.","Song Shiyu looked at the sports car that was destroyed and heaved a sigh of relief.","Fortunately, Young Madam only smashed the car and did not kill anyone. She was already very calm.","Song Shiyu thought that it was time to show off. “President, our young madam is so gentle but she smashed their car this time. They must have angered her!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he shot Qiao Xi a look. “Young Madam is such a weak woman. How could you all bear to bully her?!”","Qiao Xi was just about to retort when she saw Gu Zheng. Since he was here, she had to continue acting like a weakling.","Hence, Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly turned red as she looked pitifully at Gu Zheng. “Gu Zheng, they bullied me. I’m so angry that my heart hurts.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold.","Even though he knew that she was pretending to be weak, he still could not help but feel affected."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193 - Taking The Way Of A B*tch","paragraphs":["Seeing Qiao Xi pretend to be weak, Meng Wan instantly became dumbfounded. She immediately sobbed. “Brother Gu Zheng, listen to me. It’s Qiao Xi...”","Madam Meng also chimed in, “Gu Zheng, Miss Qiao has gone too far. She’s so arrogant and domineering. She’ll definitely harm you in the future. You have to deal with her!”","“Are you pointing your finger at me, Madam Meng?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was slightly cold as he looked at the mother and daughter disdainfully. “This is Longwan Residential. I didn’t realize Madam Meng had the right to give orders here.","“And I agree with whatever my wife wants to do. If anything happens, I’ll take responsibility.”","Meng Wan widened her eyes in disbelief. “Brother Gu Zheng... Sob...”","Gu Zheng ignored the two of them and asked gently, “Mrs. Gu, are you still angry?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","What did this bastard mean?","She looked at the pile of scrap metal on the floor, then at Meng Wan. Suddenly, she smiled slyly and looked aggrieved. “Gu Zheng, I still don’t feel good about it. The herbs that I spent so much effort to plant were destroyed by them. I only smashed their car.”","She would take the path of a b*tch and leave these b*tches with nowhere to go!","Gu Zheng looked pensive. “Song Shiyu, investigate the cars under the Meng family’s name.”","Song Shiyu said, “Yes, President!”","A moment later, he replied, “President, the Meng family has a total of ten cars worth more than five million yuan each. There are also five cars worth about one million yuan each.”","Gu Zheng nodded and said slowly, “Get all the cars to Longwan Residential.”","Then, he said word by word, “Since my wife is still angry, let’s smash all the cars in the Meng family’s villa!”","Small it all?","Everyone gasped and was instantly dumbfounded.","Soon, Song Shiyu and a group of bodyguards drove all the Meng family’s cars to Longwan Residential.","The bodyguards held all kinds of weapons in their hands and were ready. Soon, these cars would also become scrap metal.","Tears welled up in Meng Wan’s eyes as she clutched her chest with a look of sorrow. “Brother Gu Zheng, why are you doing this to me? Even if we weren’t able to get married, the Gu family and the Meng family have always been on good terms. Are you willing to break off all ties with the Meng family because of Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Xi waved her hand to stop the bodyguards, then she looked at Meng Wan.","Meng Wan choked on her tears. “These cars are all limited edition. We bought them at a high price. Just for the sake of appeasing Qiao Xi, you’re going to destroy all the cars? Boo-hoo...”","Madam Meng quickly tried to persuade him. “Gu Zheng, the Meng family once saved Old Master Gu. You can’t do this to us...”","“Are you threatening me, Madam Meng?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “You saved Old Master Gu, not Gu Zheng. I remember that Gu Zheng has already given the Meng family a company and 1% of the shares of Gu Corporation. Are you still not satisfied? Isn’t Madam Meng a little too greedy?”","“Miss Qiao, I’m talking to Gu Zheng. You...”","“I’m Gu Zheng’s wife. This is my home. Why can’t I speak? On the other hand, Madam Meng and Miss Meng are outsiders. Just because you said your family once saved Old Master Gu, does that allow you to come here and commit crimes?”","Moreover, Old Master Gu could not be considered Gu Zheng’s grandfather. He abused Gu Zheng like Madam Gu. Why should Gu Zheng repay the Meng family’s kindness on behalf of Old Master Gu?","Madam Meng paused for a moment and continued, “Miss Qiao, you smashed our car. Wan Wan has already apologized. Let’s call it a day. If you smash the remaining cars, it won’t be good for your reputation.”","“Reputation?”","Qiao Xi sneered and said firmly, “I remember that there’s a signboard in the backyard that the herbs growing here are important and can’t be trampled on. Meng Wan still drove into the backyard and crushed the herbs I planted.","“The marks on the ground also indicate that this wasn’t a one-time destruction but a result of repeated aggression!","“Miss Meng, you already knew that I planted these herbs, but you still rushed in and destroyed them. You wanted to show off to me and chase me out of Longwan Residential. Then, you aim to become a mistress of Longwan Residential. Am I right?”","Madam Meng’s expression darkened, and her finger trembled as she pointed at Qiao Xi. “Y-You, shut up! Nonsense!”","Her heart jerked because everything Qiao Xi said was true.","Meng Wan had deliberately crushed the herbs. It was just a few stalks, so why did Qiao Xi have to be so unforgiving? She had already smashed a car but was still dissatisfied?","Qiao Xi waved her hand. “I’m done speaking. Smash them!”","Bang!","The bodyguards held their weapons and slammed them into the cars.","The loud bangs from the smashing made Meng Wan’s face turn pale. She shouted, “Qiao Xi! So what if I did it on purpose? It’s just a few stalks of grass. You’ve already smashed my car that’s worth five million dollars, yet you’re still unwilling to let me off?”","“Pay for my cars, you b*tch! I’m going to kill you! B*tch—”","Suddenly, Meng Wan stopped talking. Her face was pale, and her eyes were filled with horror."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194 - Expensive Jinchuan Grass","paragraphs":["The cold muzzle of the pistol was pressed against Meng Wan’s head, making her tremble.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep, and he exuded the domineering aura of a king. His voice was cold as he said, “Miss Meng, I don’t want to hear you say the word b*tch again.”","He... was actually pointing a pistol at her?","Madam Meng screamed in shock. Had Gu Zheng gone mad?","Gu Zheng was calm as he said slowly, “Miss Meng, if you continue to insult my wife, don’t blame me for being nasty.”","Meng Wan’s face was pale. She was so scared that she knelt on the ground.","Madam Meng quickly pulled Meng Wan up and said in a trembling voice, “Young Master Gu, Wan Wan doesn’t know how to keep her mouth shut. You must not blame her...”","Right now, Gu Zheng was in a fit of anger. Madam Meng immediately changed her way of addressing him and addressed him as ‘Young Master Gu’ because Gu Zheng was capable of doing anything. It was very likely that he would beat Meng Wan to death in a fit of anger.","Even if he really killed Meng Wan, the Meng family would not dare to pursue the matter. They could only grit their teeth and swallow it.","Madam Meng pulled Meng Wan along. “Wan Wan, I’ll bring you home now. Let’s go!”","Gu Zheng was simply too scary!","If it were not for the fact that she coveted the Gu family’s business and wealth, how could she bear to let Wan Wan marry such a vicious lunatic?!","It was his honor that Wan Wan had taken a liking to him, but he actually despised Wan Wan and even pointed a pistol at her?","Gu Zheng put away his pistol, his eyes cold. “Song Shijing, drive the two back and tell Old Master Meng what happened today.”","Song Shijing agreed. “Yes.”","Meng Wan and Madam Meng were escorted out. Gu Zheng felt his eyes sting, then his vision turned blurry.","At this moment, the woman’s slightly cold fingers touched his forehead as she massaged it gently.","Qiao Xi frowned. “Are your eyes feeling uncomfortable?”","He slowly opened his eyes, and the scene in front of him became clearer. His gaze also became a little gentler. “Mrs. Gu, don’t be angry anymore. Those herbs...”","Gu Zheng did not know what kind of medicinal herb she had planted, but judging from how she took care of them every day, even if they were weeds, it was something that Mrs. Gu spent a lot of time on.","Qiao Xi blinked. “I won’t let Meng Wan off so easily!”","“Many people can’t buy these herbs with money, yet Meng Wan destroyed more than 100 of my herbs in one go. How can I let her off so easily?”","Soon, the Meng family would take the initiative to visit her. At that time, the Meng family would definitely kneel down and beg her.","Over the years, the Meng family had plundered countless amounts of money from the Gu family. Gu Zheng did not hold it against them, but she had always been petty. Of course, she would not let the Meng family bully her husband.","Old Master Meng looked kind on the surface, but the Meng family had done a lot of evil deeds in the dark. His hands were stained with blood.","It was said that Old Master Meng was sick and could only be treated with Jinchuan Grass. Hence, the Meng family was looking for that herb everywhere. Just now, Meng Wan destroyed more than 100 Jinchuan Grass.","Unfortunately, without Jinchuan Grass, how was she going to catch Gu Zhengzhi’s eye?","Qiao Xi was filled with rage. She looked at the herbs that had yet to mature and picked up her phone to send a message to someone.","Gu Zheng kept his eyes fixed on the herbs on the ground. He picked one up and sniffed it.","Mrs. Gu... was really not simple!","...","In the Meng family.","When Meng Wan returned home, she cried and screamed. Madam Meng’s heart ached so much that she kept crying.","Old Master Meng’s expression was calm as he asked kindly, “Assistant Song, what did Wan Wan do wrong? The Meng family’s cars...”","“The Meng family’s cars have been destroyed.” Song Shijing’s voice was cold. “Miss Meng deliberately destroyed the herbs our young madam planted and even insulted her. She even threatened to kill her. On account of our past relationship with the Meng family, our young master spared Miss Meng this time. If this happens again, be prepared to bear the consequences!”","Old Master Meng’s expression changed drastically.","Song Shijing’s words made Old Master Meng’s heart tremble. He knew Gu Zheng very well. Letting Meng Wan off this time meant that he had returned the Meng family’s former act of kindness.","From today onward, the Gu and Meng families would no longer have any ties!","Old Master Meng looked exhausted. Song Shijing had just left when he raised his hand and slapped Meng Wan.","“Dad!” Master Meng cried out in surprise.","Meng Wan’s face was filled with shock, then she burst into tears. “Grandpa! Why did you hit me? I was angry with Qiao Xi, yet you still hit me when I got home? I don’t want to live anymore!”","“Qiao Xi! Your mind is always filled with Qiao Xi!” Old Master Meng’s expression was gloomy.","“Grow a brain! After what you did today, you’ve completely exhausted the Gu family’s gratitude toward us. From today onward, the Meng family will no longer be able to get any benefits from Gu Zheng. Did you think that our Gu family was able to become a first-rate family because of our own efforts?”","It was because of the Gu family!","If it were not for the fact that he had saved Old Master Gu back then, how could the Meng family live such grand lives?"]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195 - Killing Two Birds With One Stone!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Back then, in order to get Gu Zheng to agree to repay the Meng family, Old Master Gu had given up something important.","Now, because of a few words from Meng Wan, Gu Zheng’s patience was completely exhausted. He directly cut off all contact with the Meng family.","Most importantly...","Old Master Meng’s eyes were red as he coughed violently. “My illness is getting worse and worse. I spent a lot of money to get a doctor to treat me. Only Jinchuan Grass can treat me, but it’s impossible to buy it in the world. But I heard that Gu Zheng has more than 100 stalks of Jinchuan Grass. If I don’t get those herbs, I won’t be able to keep my life.”","Meng Wan shuddered.","Madam Meng also knew that they had caused huge trouble.","The old master had done too many bad things. He would always dream of his enemies coming to seek revenge on him. His body was getting worse by the day. Only Jinchuan Grass could treat his illness.","They spent a lot of effort to find out where they could get Jinchuan Grass, but Gu Zheng had already cut off all contact with them.","Old Master Meng rubbed his brows. “Wan Wan, I don’t care what happened today. You have to follow me to apologize. Even if you don’t like Qiao Xi and think she’s a b*tch, you can’t express it. Moreover, Gu Zheng seems to like her very much. You have to beg for their forgiveness.","“So long as we obtain Jinchuan Grass, we’ll slowly deal with Qiao Xi! I’ll have to trouble you to do this first.”","Madam Meng advised softly, “Wan Wan, your grandfather is right. We have to obtain Jinchuan Grass before dealing with Qiao Xi. After that, your grandfather will definitely help you.”","Master Meng agreed. “That’s right! Wan Wan, lower your head and apologize to Young Master Gu and Qiao Xi. When Young Master Gu is tired of playing around, he’ll chase Qiao Xi out. At that time, he’ll definitely welcome you in!”","Meng Wan wiped her tears. It was not difficult for her to apologize to Gu Zheng, but asking her to bow her head to Qiao Xi was simply a great humiliation!","Why was that b*tch so lucky to have Young Master Gu’s protection? Even though it was only temporary, Meng Wan still felt jealous.","Old Master Meng had a helpless expression. “Young Master Gu only got married to Qiao Xi on an impulse. You should be the one marrying him. Grandpa knows that you’re unhappy about it, but as long as you get Jinchuan Grass, I’ll personally kill Qiao Xi. Moreover, Gu Zheng won’t suspect us. We have to swallow our anger for now, understand?”","Meng Wan took a deep breath, and her eyes were vicious. “Alright! After this matter is done, I’ll make Qiao Xi wish she were dead!”","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi gathered the destroyed Jinchuan Grass.","Song Shiyu looked confused. “Young Madam, is the grass that important?”","This was the first time Song Shijing saw Qiao Xi, the legendary Mrs. Gu, after returning from a mission.","He looked at the herbs on the ground. He did not expect them to be Jinchuan Grass. In order to suppress the poison in Gu Zheng’s body, he had searched everywhere for it.","Previously, he had investigated the appearance of Jinchuan Grass in medical books, so he could tell that the herb Madam planted was Jinchuan Grass that had yet to mature.","This patch of Jinchuan Grass had been destroyed by Meng Wan. No matter how good Qiao Xi’s temper was, she could not help but flare up. Moreover, Qiao Xi was not someone to be provoked.","Song Shijing was about to say, “This is Jinchuan...”","“Huh?”","Song Shiyu suddenly shouted, “Young Madam, you’re so smart! The president hates the Meng family, but on account of the past, he couldn’t find a reason to get rid of them. This was a good opportunity to sever ties with the Meng family!","“Killing two birds with one stone! Not only did you slap Meng Wan’s face but you also solved a big problem for the president! Young Madam, you’re indeed a genius!”","Song Shijing: “...”","When he was overseas, Song Shiyu always called to say that Young Madam was brave and resourceful. She was not even worthy of the president.","However, why did he feel that the young madam in Song Shiyu’s eyes carried a halo?","Qiao Xi’s phone rang as she picked up the ruined Jinchuan Grass.","Qin An’s shocked voice sounded. “Holy sh*t! Why was the Jinchuan Grass destroyed?”","Qiao Xi’s voice was cold. “Meng Wan did it.”","Qin An curled his lips. “I heard that Old Master Meng has been looking for Jinchuan Grass. Meng Wan crushed and destroyed more than a hundred stalks?”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Now that the Meng family already knows that the Gu family has Jinchuan Grass, they’ll definitely visit and apologize before forcing us to hand it over.”","Qin An scoffed. “Where’s the Jinchuan Grass?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Third Brother, spread the news. Tell everyone that Gu Zheng has a large amount of Jinchuan Grass, and it has to be made known to the Gu family as well.”","In her opinion, the Meng family would first make a trip to the Gu family’s old mansion. They would ask Madam Gu to take action. At that time, Madam Gu would force her to forgive Meng Wan.","Then...","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully, her eyes filled with coldness."]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196 - A Visit To Apologize","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi asked, “Third Brother, do you have Jinchuan Grass?”","Qin An looked puzzled. “How could I have Jinchuan Grass? This has always been a precious item. Besides, why do you want so much Jinchuan Grass?”","Qiao Xi was slightly disappointed.","Qin An was full of curiosity. “Is it because of Gu Zheng? Little Six, this is the first time I’ve seen you so interested in a man.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze appeared panicked as she immediately denied it. “You’re thinking too much.”","After hanging up the phone, Qiao Xi ceaselessly wondered if she had fallen for Gu Zheng too deeply.","...","At this moment, Gu Zheng was lazily leaning against the sofa with his eyes closed. He asked casually, “The Meng family is spreading rumors online and slandering my wife?”","Song Shiyu said carefully, “They said that you abandoned Miss Meng and got married to Young Madam. Now, for grass, you even cut ties with the Meng family. In short, it’s all Young Madam’s fault...”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he nodded. “Alright.”","Then, he pointed at the contract on the table. “In that case, let’s cancel the contract altogether.”","Song Shiyu gasped. The Meng family must have angered the president after slandering Young Madam online.","“Where’s Young Madam?”","Song Shiyu replied immediately, “She’s still cleaning up the grass in the backyard. Why does Young Madam care so much about the grass? Even if it’s crushed, she can always grow it again. Could it be that the grass is really precious...”","Gu Zheng abruptly stood up and went to the backyard to look for Qiao Xi.","At this moment, she had placed the crushed herbs neatly on the floor. Gu Zheng asked, “Do you really care so much about these herbs?”","Qiao Xi remained silent. Ever since she found out that there was something wrong with Gu Zheng’s eyes, she had started growing Jinchuan Grass.","She took out the seeds that she treasured and took good care of the seedlings every day. They finally grew, and she wanted to help Gu Zheng detoxify the poison. However, they were all ruined by Meng Wan!","“The servants guarding the backyard have already been punished...” He suddenly choked and felt a little flustered. He comforted her gently, saying, “Don’t be sad. ”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Forget it, it’s not the servants’ fault. Meng Wan drove in. It’s not like they could stop her with their bodies.”","In short, Meng Wan had to pay the price for this!","...","From that day onward, the Meng family’s business was extremely poor. Their partners canceled their contracts one after another, and the company was filled with anxiety.","Old Master Meng frowned deeply and slammed the table. “Let’s go! To Longwan Residential!”","Originally, he wanted to bring Meng Wan there to apologize, but after thinking about it, he still felt that it was inappropriate. With Qiao Xi’s identity, she was utterly unworthy of their Meng family’s apology. As long as Gu Zheng’s anger subsided, this matter would be easily resolved.","Gu Zheng could not completely cut ties with the Meng family because of a woman.","It was just that everything was out of their control now, and no one dared to offend Gu Zheng. Hence, everyone was cutting ties with the Meng family.","Most importantly, his illness had gotten worse. He often dreamed of his enemies coming to seek revenge on him, and he would be rudely awoken every night.","He had indeed done many bad things for the sake of the Meng family, but anyone who accomplished great things had to be unscrupulous. Therefore, he did not regret it.","However, he could not continue waiting. He had to obtain the Jinchuan Grass first, even if it was just one stalk.","Moreover, Gu Zheng had more than 100 stalks...","Old Master Meng said helplessly, “Wan Wan, follow me to Longwan Residential.”","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi heard some noise outside and saw the Meng family the moment she came out.","The butler said in a low voice, “Young Madam, the president said that he wouldn’t let the Meng family come, but they insisted on breaking in. I really couldn’t stop them. They even came with Old Master Gu, saying that the president had allowed them to enter.”","Qiao Xi nodded, and the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile.","Old Master Meng finally could not take it anymore. He wanted to look for Gu Zheng to get Jinchuan Grass.","However... Meng Wan had stepped on the accelerator and destroyed more than a hundred stalks. Now, not a single stalk was left.","If Old Master Meng found out that the instigator was his granddaughter, what would his expression be like?","Gu Zheng knew that the Meng family would be paying him a visit. His expression was calm as he ignored everyone and continued sitting there lazily.","Old Master Meng was all smiles as he said kindly, “Gu Zheng, we’re here today because...”","“Isn’t it inappropriate for you to bring your family to barge in?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Old Master Meng was embarrassed. Then, he forced a smile.","“Gu Zheng, there was a misunderstanding about what happened before. I brought Wan Wan here to apologize. The friendly relationship between our two families can’t be severed just like that.”","Gu Zheng slowly walked in front of him. “Old Master Meng, it’s useless to say all this. It’s your Meng family who wants to cut ties with the Gu family. You even used this to threaten me.”","The faces of the Meng family members instantly turned pale."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197 - Old Master Passed Out","paragraphs":["Old Master Meng kept wiping his sweat and said with a flattering smile, “You must have heard wrong. Our two families have always been very close, and the Gu family has always been supporting the Meng family. How could we possibly want to cut ties with you? Where did you hear the rumors?”","Madam Meng also explained with a smile, “Gu Zheng, Wan Wan destroyed Miss Qiao’s flowers and plants. She already knows her mistake and came to apologize today. Wan Wan!”","Madam Meng waved her hand, and Meng Wan walked over shyly.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he lazily sat on the sofa with his long legs crossed. His eyes were cold. “I’m not the one you should apologize to. Don’t the Meng family understand?”","Meng Wan looked aggrieved as she suppressed the anger in her heart.","Why should she apologize to Qiao Xi? Did Brother Gu Zheng have to be so vicious?","That b*tch was not worthy at all! If Qiao Xi had not interfered, she would have married Brother Gu Zheng long ago!","Meng Wan bit her lip and remained silent. Madam Meng quickly explained with a smile.","“Gu Zheng, Wan Wan was indeed in the wrong, but her car was also ruined. Let’s make things even. Don’t force her to apologize. She did it because she likes you too much.”","Madam Meng’s voice echoed in the living room, causing pin-drop silence.","Gu Zheng swept his gaze across the crowd and said casually, “Since that’s the case, then please leave.”","Everyone broke out in a cold sweat.","Meng Wan’s face was pale. Her lips were about to bleed.","She had taken the initiative to visit and apologize, but Gu Zheng was actually chasing her away? She had never been so wronged...","It was all because of that b*tch, Qiao Xi!","Meng Wan was burning with rage as she raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi who was not far away. She then shouted madly, “Qiao Xi! It was definitely your idea! I’ve already lowered my head and paid a visit to apologize, so what else do you want? You’re really too much!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. Then, she pretended to be weak and asked, “I don’t think I heard you apologize, Miss Meng. Or did I not hear you? Why don’t you say it again, Miss Meng?”","Meng Wan’s entire body trembled, and her eyes were bloodshot. Qiao Xi was actually so shameless and even dared to ask for her apology?","She had already spared Qiao Xi enough dignity by coming to Longwan Residential. How could she still not let matters go?","Old Master Meng frowned and glared at her. “Miss Qiao, you know about the relationship between our two families, but ever since you married into the Gu family, the Gu family has gradually distanced itself from the Meng family. This time, you’ve even smashed more than ten cars of the Meng family for a few stalks of grass. Do you still want Wan Wan to kneel before you? Aren’t you being too willful?”","Qiao Xi sneered.","“Stalks of grass? Old Master Meng, do you think they were just a few stalks of grass?”","“I heard that the Meng family values upbringing very much. Then, may I ask if you don’t care that Meng Wan ignored the signboard and rushed into the backyard, deliberately damaging the herbs there? Are Meng Wan’s actions a reflection of the Meng family’s upbringing? Shouldn’t you be apologizing here?”","Old Master Meng was instantly speechless, and even his beard was quivering. “Miss Qiao, the Meng and Gu families are very close. Whether it’s in business or in private, we have deep connections with each other. You can’t influence Gu Zheng because of jealousy...”","“Influence Gu Zheng? In business, the Meng family has always relied on the Gu family. He was the one who gave the Meng family a company to raise you, a bunch of parasites. You should be the one lowering your heads. Why is it the other way round? It’s as if the Meng family has done a lot for the Gu family. Moreover, Old Master Meng, you’re not Gu Zheng’s elderly. Stop acting like it!”","After she said this, everyone from the Meng family glared at Qiao Xi angrily.","Qiao Xi was too detestable! What right did she have to represent Gu Zheng?","Wan Wan only did something wrong because she liked Gu Zheng. Why could Qiao Xi not let her off this time?","Old Master Meng’s face was livid as he clutched his chest. “You...”","“Butler, see the guests out,” Gu Zheng said coldly, his eyes filled with impatience.","“Yes.” The butler immediately gestured for everyone to leave.","Gu Zheng said unhurriedly, “This is my private residence. Don’t let just anyone in. If someone disregards your reminder and barges into my private residence, do what you can to stop them. I’ll bear the consequences!”","The people from the Meng family widened their eyes. Was Gu Zheng going to cut off all ties with them?","When had Old Master Meng ever suffered such humiliation? He clutched his chest with trembling hands and fainted.","“Dad!”","“Grandpa!”","The people from the Meng family hurriedly supported him while Meng Wan cried out, “Qiao Xi! You’re so vicious! You’ve angered my grandfather to the ground. What else do you want?”","Madam Meng looked sad. “I told you long ago not to let Old Master come. His body is weak and he can’t be agitated. Gu Zheng, are you really going to give up our years of relationship for Miss Qiao?”","Master Meng looked helpless. “Gu Zheng, the old master is an elder, after all. You can’t just treat him like this...”"]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198 - Never Seen Such Shameless People","paragraphs":["Soon, the doctor rushed over and gave Old Master Meng a shot. The old master then slowly woke up.","Old Master Meng was panting slightly, his eyes filled with fatigue.","“Gu Zheng, are you really going to ruin our years of relationship for her?”","“Miss Qiao is unwilling to forgive Wan Wan, and I can’t force it either. It’s fine if you don’t want to work with us, but...”","Old Master Meng paused for a moment and said weakly, “Gu Zheng, I heard that you have more than 100 stalks of Jinchuan Grass. I’m very sick now and I need that herb. If it weren’t for the fact that I don’t have long to live, I wouldn’t be asking you. I know you can’t bear to see me die.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully.","After a lot of nonsense, they finally got to the main topic, which was playing the emotional card?","On the surface, the Meng family had come to apologize, but in reality, their target was Jinchuan Grass.","Gu Zheng remained calm. He knew that there had been rumors recently that he had a large amount of Jinchuan Grass.","Of course, he knew about Jinchuan Grass. It was a wondrous medicine that could not be bought with money. It was said that he had over a hundred stalks, but he did not know why.","Old Master Meng looked at Gu Zheng with anticipation in his eyes. He then cleared his throat and said, “Gu Zheng, Jinchuan Grass is indeed precious, but you have more than a hundred stalks in your hands. Of course, you don’t lack this little bit. I need Jinchuan Grass to save my life! On the account of our past, just give it to me...”","Qiao Xi shook her head. The members of the Meng family were really shameless.","They were always taking advantage of others. Gu Zheng had already given the Meng family a lot, yet he still wanted Jinchuan Grass. Where did this old man get his thick skin from?","Gu Zheng’s indifferent gaze landed on Old Master Meng’s face. He finally knew why Qiao Xi was unwilling to forgive Meng Wan after she ruined those herbs.","These were not ordinary herbs but Jinchuan Grass.","Master Meng advised, “Gu Zheng, in terms of seniority, you have to address the old master as ‘Grandpa Meng’. Even if we don’t keep in contact in the future, you can’t bear to see the old master die like this, right? On the account of your grandfather, Jinchuan Grass...","“Besides, you have more than a hundred stalks. We just need one. You can’t be so heartless to the Meng family because of Miss Qiao. It’ll affect you negatively if news of this gets out.","“Everyone will think that you’re heartless. You watched as Old Master Meng endured his illness and was unwilling to save him. Even if it’s for your own sake, you have to give us Jinchuan Grass.”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless.","How could there be such shameless people? They clearly came over to take advantage of them and even said that they were doing Gu Zheng a favor?","Just then, Gu Zheng said nonchalantly, “I don’t have it.”","Master Meng’s expression darkened. “Gu Zheng, you won’t give us even one stalk? You’re rich, powerful, and have everything you want. Can’t you just treat it as charity? Old Master doesn’t have long to live...”","“Master Meng, Gu Zheng has already said that he doesn’t have it.”","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Gu Zheng is indeed not lacking in money. It doesn’t matter if he really has Jinchuan Grass, but what can you do if he doesn’t? Besides, Old Master Meng and Gu Zheng are not related, so he has no responsibility to save Old Master Meng.”","Master Meng was infuriated.","Impossible!","It was surely Qiao Xi who had interfered, so Gu Zheng said no. To put it bluntly, he did not want to give it to them.","No matter what, Old Master Meng had once saved Old Master Gu. Why was he not willing to give them a stalk of Jinchuan Grass?","Gu Zheng said impatiently, “Butler.”","The butler walked in front of the Meng family and said calmly, “Master Meng, I don’t know where you heard the rumors, but our president doesn’t have any Jinchuan Grass, so you don’t have to speak anymore. Even if he does, you don’t have the right to ask the president to give it to you.","“Everyone, please leave as soon as possible. Otherwise, the Meng family will lose their dignity here.”","Old Master Meng was so angry that his beard trembled. His eyes were filled with anger.","It was all because of that b*tch... If it were not for her, Gu Zheng would definitely have given them Jinchuan Grass.","Meng Wan wished for nothing more than to tear her into pieces. Her face was filled with ruthlessness. “Qiao Xi! We’ll see! I’ll definitely not let this matter go!”","Master Meng frowned. “Gu Zheng, think about it carefully. If things get out of hand, it won’t be good for you either. Don’t let others think that you’re heartless and ungrateful!”","“Miss Qiao, don’t be too willful. If anything happens to my father, you’ll be the culprit!”","The members of the Meng family supported the old master and left in anger.","Qiao Xi had a disdainful expression.","The Meng family must be seriously ill!","What kind of words were those? It was as if they could defeat Gu Zheng. Moreover, it was true that Gu Zheng could not give them Jinchuan Grass because everything had long been destroyed by Meng Wan.","Old Master Meng had done too many bad things. Now that he was sick, it was heaven’s punishment for him. Why did it seem like she was the one who caused it?","What a messed-up way of thinking!","The Meng family thought that everyone should think about them and give them what they wanted."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199 - Gu Zheng Has Something Thats Difficult To Say","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s face was filled with anger. “The Meng family has always made unreasonable requests because they saved the old master’s life once. Why are you still enduring it?”","She really did not understand. With Gu Zheng’s domineering character, why would he let the Meng family create trouble in his territory?","If it were anyone else, Gu Zheng would have long made them disappear from this world!","Gu Zheng’s eyes were slightly cold, and his voice was a little hoarse. “There are some things that can’t be explained clearly.”","Qiao Xi looked confused. Then, she remembered that Song Shiyu had said that the president only tolerated the Meng family’s coercion and allowed them to spread the news that Meng Wan was Mrs. Gu because Old Master Meng was threatening Gu Zheng to marry Meng Wan with someone’s belongings.","That day, he appeared at the Civil Affairs Bureau not because he really wanted to marry Meng Wan but because he wanted to get the relics.","What kind of relics could make the always decisive Gu Zheng endure this silently? What kind of relics could make the Meng family take advantage of him?","“You don’t have to worry. Everything is under my control,” Gu Zheng said casually.","Qiao Xi was filled with doubts and wanted to know what difficulties Gu Zheng had.","However, at the thought that they were not a true couple and would get a divorce when the time was right, it would not be good for her to know too many of his secrets. It was fine if he did not want to tell her.","Moreover, he clearly did not want her to know.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and turned around to leave helplessly.","As soon as she left, Song Shiyu ran out, looking confused. “President, why didn’t you tell the truth? Haven’t you been tolerating them because of Young Madam’s belongings? You went to the Civil Affairs Bureau because you wanted to meet her...”","Gu Zheng said in a self-deprecating manner, “Should I let her know that I didn’t go to the Civil Affairs Bureau to marry Meng Wan but it was premeditated?”","Song Shiyu nodded.","Previously, President Gu had been hiding it from Young Madam because the timing was not right. Now that their relationship was getting more intimate, it was time to tell her. This way, Young Madam would know the president’s intentions and not always scold him for being a bastard.","Song Shiyu thought that he was already worried sick about the president’s love life.","However, Gu Zheng remained calm. “Let’s not tell her first. I’m afraid she’ll be too happy if she finds out.”","The smile on Song Shiyu’s face froze as he rubbed his ears .”...” Happy?","‘My dear president, what is wrong with you?’","Young Madam had always thought that the president went to the Civil Affairs Bureau to marry Meng Wan and that marrying her was just an accident.","She would never have thought that this was a secret plan by the president. If she found out, it was hard to tell whether she would be happy or angry.","Song Shiyu looked serious. “President, I think you...”","Gu Zheng looked up indifferently. “Song Shiyu, you won’t be able to keep your salary if you say another word.”","The corners of Song Shiyu’s mouth twitched. The thought of his salary being deducted to zero made him say nonchalantly, “If you tell Young Madam, she won’t be happy at all because she doesn’t like you. You and she are just husband and wife in name...”","Gu Zheng glared at him. “We were only husband and wife in name in the past. Now, Qiao Xi already likes me very much. If I tell her that I’ve been wanting to marry her for a long time, she’ll definitely be very happy. Moreover, it’s a fact that Mrs. Gu likes me. I don’t have to tell her such boring things.”","Song Shiyu: “??”","The president was too narcissistic!","Why didn’t he know that Young Madam liked the president? The president was too good at making things up!","Song Shiyu said earnestly, “President, one has to face the truth. Since when does Young Madam like you? You’re just a bastard in her eyes. You have to change yourself, or at least get rid of your title as a bastard!","“If you tell Young Madam the truth, although she might not be happy, at least she’ll know how you feel. She’ll definitely think highly of you. Don’t keep living in your dreams and thinking too much. You can never change your image in Young Madam’s eyes... Huh? President! I’m not done talking yet!”","Song Shiyu stomped his feet. Why couldn’t the president just tell the truth?!","After Gu Zheng left, Song Shijing walked over with a frown. “You and the president... talk like this?”","Song Shiyu said that the president was delusional and that he was a bastard. He indeed deserved to have his salary deducted!","Song Shiyu, on the other hand, nodded confidently. “I’m doing this for the president’s own good. Young Madam keeps calling him a bastard. I think the president is a bastard too. Don’t you think so?”","Song Shijing: “...”","Actually, Song Shiyu should not be getting paid at all.","How did Song Shiyu, who had always been obedient to the president, become so arrogant?","Could it be that Qiao Xi had really changed them?","Young Madam often said that the president was a bastard. Even so, the president never got angry and Song Shiyu even learned from this.","What had the president been through in the past few months?","...","In the bedroom.","Qin An sent a message: [The news that Gu Zheng has Jinchuan Grass has already spread, but he doesn’t have any at all. Isn’t it inappropriate for you to be doing this?]"]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200 - The Gu Familys Resentment Against Qiao Xi","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi smiled lightly and replied: [Who says he doesn’t? He had in the past, but not anymore.]","Qin An looked puzzled.","Although he did not understand what she meant, he trusted Little Six.","Now that everyone outside knew that Gu Zheng had Jinchuan Grass, they would definitely think of a way to get it from him. However, Gu Zheng himself could not take it out.","What could Qiao Xi do to make everyone transfer their anger to the Meng family?","...","After Old Master Meng left the Gu family, he was sent to the hospital. Meng Wan gritted her teeth in anger and rushed to the Gu family’s old mansion.","Tears welled up in her eyes, making her look aggrieved. “Grandpa Gu...”","Old Master Gu looked at her affectionately. “Wan Wan, you said that your grandfather is sick? What exactly is going on?”","Meng Wan sobbed. “That day, I went to Longwan Residential to look for Brother Gu Zheng and accidentally drove over a few of Qiao Xi’s flowers. She refused to let the matter go and insisted that Brother Gu Zheng cut off all ties with the Meng family. After that, Grandpa brought me to apologize, but Qiao Xi still didn’t forgive me!","“My grandpa thought of just letting things be, but he’s seriously ill and needs Jinchuan Grass. Brother Gu Zheng happens to have it, but...","“That Qiao Xi caused trouble again. Not only did she not give us Jinchuan Grass but she also angered my grandpa. Grandpa is in the hospital now and his survival is still uncertain. I can only look for you, Grandfather Gu. Sob, sob, sob...”","Meng Wan cried and shouted, “Grandpa Gu, I’ve already apologized. I only crushed a few stalks of grass, but Qiao Xi smashed all of the Meng family’s cars. However, she’s still dissatisfied!","“Ever since she married Brother Gu Zheng, our families have been growing more distant from each other. Now, we have to cut off all ties between our families. Grandpa Gu, if this goes on, the Gu family will be ruined by her!”","Old Master Gu frowned.","Back then when he asked Gu Zheng to marry Meng Wan, that lad did not agree. However, he married such a woman.","What was worse was that he allowed that woman to do as she pleased, including severing all ties with the Meng family.","Old Master Gu advised softly, “Wan Wan, I know that you like Gu Zheng. If he had married you, there wouldn’t be so many problems. But since he married that woman, it has brought a negative impact on the Gu family.”","Tears trickled down Meng Wan’s face. “I just hope that Brother Gu Zheng can be happy. It doesn’t matter if I can’t marry him, but Miss Qiao is too willful. She doesn’t care about Brother Gu Zheng’s future at all.”","When Old Master GU heard that Gu Zheng had over a hundred stalks of Jinchuan Grass, even his eyes could not help but light up.","All these years, he had actually been secretly looking for Jinchuan Grass. It turned out that Gu Zheng had so many. He actually hid them from everyone?","Old Master Gu’s expression darkened. “Old Wu, call Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi over!”","“He actually disregarded the life and death of his elder and refused to hand over Jinchuan Grass? Could it be that he’s willing to cut ties with everyone for that woman?”","...","Qiao Xi had just gotten off work when a luxury car appeared in front of her. The butler of the Gu family’s old residence slowly walked out.","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. She had long expected that Meng Wan would look for Old Master Gu. If the old man knew that Gu Zheng had Jinchuan Grass, he would definitely be jealous and want to take this opportunity to get Gu Zheng to divorce her.","He wanted her to go to the Gu family’s old mansion just to argue with her. If she did not blow this matter up, how would she deal with the Meng family?","At this moment, a group of people was sitting in the living room of the old mansion. They were all the Gu family’s relatives and friends.","As soon as Qiao Xi entered, Madam Gu said coldly, “Qiao Xi, we were against you marrying Gu Zheng in the beginning, but as long as you truly cared about Gu Zheng and the Gu family, we wouldn’t be able to do anything about it. However, you’ve gone too far now!","“Wan Wan only destroyed a few flowers and plants. It was an accident, but you made Gu Zheng cut off all ties with the Meng family. You’re too willful!”","Madam Gu put on the posture of an evil mother-in-law. “You smashed the Meng family’s cars, so you have to apologize to Wan Wan. If she forgives you, then we can forget about this matter. If she doesn’t agree, then you and Gu Zheng will divorce immediately!”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with gazes of ridicule and even disdain.","Qiao Xi had a composed expression as she slowly said, “Madam Gu, Meng Wan was the one who made the mistake first. Why should I apologize to her?”","Madam Gu blurted out, “Wan Wan is a rich missy. Are you qualified to compare yourself to her? You relied on seducing Gu Zheng to get to where you are today. It’s fine if you had behaved yourself, but you even caused trouble and caused the Meng and Gu families to be separated. As your mother-in-law, I have to discipline you. Are you going to apologize or not?”","Everyone nodded in agreement and said sarcastically, “Miss Qiao, the Gu and Meng families have been friends for many years. It’s because of you that the two families ended up in the current state.”","“That’s right. Back then, Gu Zheng had just casually married you. Are you qualified to compare yourself to Miss Meng? You’ve already angered Old Master Meng to the point of falling ill. Shouldn’t you apologize?”"]}]);
